('rowid-10205','GHBC-REQ-010205','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.16','11.17.2.1','GHBC-C-002960','The building is equipped throughout with an automatic sprinkler system in accordance with Clause 10.3.3.1.1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 7315"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','de1c77e0b4f7670edb654a99bcb02467969d3a52f53397664d01d438306808eb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10206','GHBC-REQ-010206','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.16','11.17.3','GHBC-C-002961','Exit access travel distance shall be measured from the most remote point of each room, area or space along the natural and unobstructed path of horizontal and vertical escape travel to the entrance to an exit.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In open parking garages, exit access travel distance is permitted to be measured to the closest riser of an exit access stairway or the closest slope of an exit access ramp."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc73b2c75a8c25b71df370cb89fa93ed0f25bdf216f0adaecffa71d26c13638b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10207','GHBC-REQ-010207','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.16','11.17.3','GHBC-C-002961','EXCEPTIONS: In open parking garages, exit access travel distance is permitted to be measured to the closest riser of an exit access stairway or the closest slope of an exit access ramp.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In open parking garages, exit access travel distance is permitted to be measured to the closest riser of an exit access stairway or the closest slope of an exit access ramp."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0844cc4c9553316b8e74c330d7325da230f9e15b36625fac35c5a55d8ed97cf4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10208','GHBC-REQ-010208','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.16','11.17.3.1','GHBC-C-002962','Travel distance on exit access stairways or ramps shall be included in the exit access travel distance measurement.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dbc772641b3a1eea031b9da09d0898f45479b695428f5d87e5bfe0e74d2d1efd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10209','GHBC-REQ-010209','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.16','11.17.3.1','GHBC-C-002962','The measurement along stairways shall be made on a plane parallel and tangent to the stair tread nosings in the center of the stair and landings.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','977448500d6b9812963f48d2e1d727ea9f2152f5ec225690a4bf323f37847aa3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10210','GHBC-REQ-010210','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.16','11.17.3.1','GHBC-C-002962','The measurement along ramps shall be made on the walking surface in the center of the ramp and landings.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','066b2deb33de408e727e924a88ffe9c72474e8340f9d48a8ab4654d2b3fa5b6f','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
