('rowid-10308','GHBC-REQ-010308','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.20','11.20.6','GHBC-C-002979','Enclosed elevator lobbies as permitted by Item 1 of Clause 11.16.2 shall not be construed as intervening rooms.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":16.2,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"mitted by Item 1 of Clause 11.16.2 shall not be construed as inter"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d507e006ef6c4a1519810a57a67f9d056f90aa0b02dec52fad0270fd8ac427a7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10309','GHBC-REQ-010309','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.21','11.21.1','GHBC-C-002980','Balconies used for escape purposes shall conform to the same requirements as corridors for minimum width, required capacity, headroom, dead ends and projections.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e45d2dcaf41aa6d517bec34f9a15b548117e92934b18e9a6e33d9a948a63c2bf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10310','GHBC-REQ-010310','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.21','11.21.2','GHBC-C-002981','Exterior escape balconies shall be separated from the interior of the building by walls and opening protectives as required for corridors.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Separation is not required where the exterior escape balcony is served by not less than two stairways and a dead-end travel condition does not require travel past an unprotected opening to reach a stairway."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','762497ee873faeab49121fa48c9c48b5f5d5474c18a20cfb73e7d7851370da03','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
