('rowid-10323','GHBC-REQ-010323','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.22','11.22.1','GHBC-C-002984','Once a given level of exit protection is achieved, such level of protection shall not be reduced until arrival at the exit discharge.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1658c1e0bffc8528ff6cce39d5706ffed91e32d75a8e35aace907430555e410a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
