('rowid-10437','GHBC-REQ-010437','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.24','11.24.5','GHBC-C-003008','Where an interior exit stairway or ramp is extended to an exit discharge or a public way by an exit passageway, the exit passageway shall comply with Clause 11.23.3.1.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f14c6c65369ec52b6ee35a62e8d0750d569b642fc027e688c5259bf01d01fa81','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
