('rowid-10467','GHBC-REQ-010467','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.25','11.25.1','GHBC-C-003012','EXCEPTIONS: Luminous escape path markings shall not be required on the level of exit discharge in lobbies that serve as part of the exit path in accordance with Clause 11.28.1, Exception 1.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Luminous escape path markings shall not be required on the level of exit discharge in lobbies that serve as part of the exit path in accordance with Clause 11.28.1, Exception 1."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','06d2b181f5a78adfa5cc03966c9cfd43a0b4934fe91ab793a623d0f70260ad69','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
