('rowid-10512','GHBC-REQ-010512','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.1','GHBC-C-003028','Horizontal exits serving as an exit in a means of escape system shall comply with the requirements of this Clause.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a2e6c9261a2cc34f632f45c2ea1e150c8fb955cbc575e0aa2c98ce4b9e29a259','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10513','GHBC-REQ-010513','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.26','11.26.1','GHBC-C-003028','A horizontal exit shall not serve as the only exit from a portion of a building, and where two or more exits are required, not more than one-half of the total number of exits or total exit minimum width or required capacity shall be horizontal exits.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9502371b5689d310bbc2bfa2da4f16099cf21a5ecf50e53b9454d3d193776348','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
