('rowid-10798','GHBC-REQ-010798','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.13.1','GHBC-C-003085','Where seating is located at a table or counter and is adjacent to an aisle or aisle accessway, the measurement of required clear width of the aisle or aisle accessway shall be made to a line 483 mm (19 inches) away from and parallel to the edge of the table or counter.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where tables or counters are served by fixed seats, the width of the aisle or aisle accessway shall be measured from the back of the seat."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":483,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ssway shall be made to a line 483 mm (19 inches) away from and par"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":19,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"all be made to a line 483 mm (19 inches) away from and parallel t"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec3f3275fe2d5c2a664162546495fc7ec692aed142b75163654cce5547e8db1c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10799','GHBC-REQ-010799','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.13.1','GHBC-C-003085','The 483 mm (19-inch) distance shall be measured perpendicular to the side of the table or counter.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where tables or counters are served by fixed seats, the width of the aisle or aisle accessway shall be measured from the back of the seat."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":483,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"The 483 mm (19-inch) distance shall be m"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a6dccf66694408135946b2a3b1db89553babc77059febf93792b63bd80e03afa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10800','GHBC-REQ-010800','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.13.1','GHBC-C-003085','In the case of other side boundaries for aisles or aisle accessways, the clear width shall be measured to walls, edges of seating and tread edges.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where tables or counters are served by fixed seats, the width of the aisle or aisle accessway shall be measured from the back of the seat."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6a1bc6e7f61b9d45d041bb182db294ebc2f5ec1272dda6bdeb6b12caff501f3e','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
