('rowid-10826','GHBC-REQ-010826','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.14.1.2','GHBC-C-003093','Ramped aisles shall have landings in accordance with Clauses 11.12.6 through 11.12.6.5.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e8cea06be36b34302ccc119f6df0431336400259a4a5092753d42563723ff451','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10827','GHBC-REQ-010827','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.14.1.2','GHBC-C-003093','Landings for ramped aisles shall be permitted to overlap required aisles or cross aisles.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','05c7458f1f2cbb30ee21b74ff166cf8625990e8f939c70a29a0f586533788c9e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10828','GHBC-REQ-010828','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.14.1.3','GHBC-C-003094','Ramped aisles shall have edge protection in accordance with Clauses 11.12.10 and 11.12.10.1.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In assembly spaces with fixed seating, edge protection is not required on the sides of ramped aisles where the ramped aisles provide access to the adjacent seating and aisle accessways."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8a15d0235bbdade4d1d65311a454a6504622e386b51eb57771a65efda4bb0429','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10829','GHBC-REQ-010829','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.14.1.3','GHBC-C-003094','EXCEPTIONS: In assembly spaces with fixed seating, edge protection is not required on the sides of ramped aisles where the ramped aisles provide access to the adjacent seating and aisle accessways.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In assembly spaces with fixed seating, edge protection is not required on the sides of ramped aisles where the ramped aisles provide access to the adjacent seating and aisle accessways."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','83a0694c383e31746856495d6b9d96aed018957739b3a54c78bcea21c1a01298','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10830','GHBC-REQ-010830','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.14.2','GHBC-C-003095','Aisles with a slope exceeding one unit vertical in eight units horizontal (12.5-percent slope) shall consist of a series of risers and treads that extends across the full width of aisles and complies with Clauses 11.29.14.2.1 through 11.29.14.2.4.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8d1e799aad0b5baa1de45047fc1ef1423d4a2e6154f494b6537f9a229d4bdcfb','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
