('rowid-10847','GHBC-REQ-010847','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.14.2.2.1','GHBC-C-003098','EXCEPTIONS: The contrasting marking stripe is permitted to be omitted where tread surfaces are such that the location of each tread is readily apparent when viewed in descent.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The contrasting marking stripe is permitted to be omitted where tread surfaces are such that the location of each tread is readily apparent when viewed in descent."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','95864a45c6f4b203e8fd44364b317283d29a89337c1543a3c625d734825fa18b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
