('rowid-10862','GHBC-REQ-010862','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.15','GHBC-C-003100','Groups of seats within a building, room or space used for assembly purposes separated from other seating by railings, guards, partial height walls or similar barriers with level floors and having not more than 14 seats per group shall not be required to be fastened to the floor.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":14,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":" with level floors and having not more than 14 seats per group shall not be "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":14,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"oors and having not more than 14 seats per group shall not be re"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cb6a11d1bf86e0d66b3305c0a251687a41e3a88913a129c045ca55730569a0f6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10863','GHBC-REQ-010863','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.15','GHBC-C-003100','6.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','21100025f8373350725e1d8e20d8f143ab7b6f933e63bb76ff540b04359696d0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10864','GHBC-REQ-010864','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.15','GHBC-C-003100','Seats intended for musicians or other performers and separated by railings, guards, partial height walls or similar barriers shall not be required to be fastened to the floor.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cf3987beef2882928c8f3454d773bf165f962305fe132fbe05fa8f7428887ec8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10865','GHBC-REQ-010865','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.16','GHBC-C-003101','Ramped aisles having a slope exceeding one unit vertical in 15 units horizontal (6.7-percent slope) and stepped aisles shall be provided with handrails in compliance with Clause 11.14 located either at one or both sides of the aisle or within the aisle width.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":11.14,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"ils in compliance with Clause 11.14 located either at one or both s"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','06b33f1215a70f99885ec1f62859c980875d889d57c9ed98c4a2e6b6104c2abf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
