('rowid-10870','GHBC-REQ-010870','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.16','GHBC-C-003101','Handrails are not required where, at the side of the aisle, there is a guard with a top surface that complies with the graspability requirements of handrails in accordance with Clause 11.14.3.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f8915ed25d08083b12fe37a68acf3d2b3b4bddd0b7adb5d9de82a4702313beed','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
