('rowid-10882','GHBC-REQ-010882','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.29','11.29.17','GHBC-C-003106','At bleachers, grandstands and folding and telescopic seating, guards must be provided where required by this Code and Clause 11.29.17.1.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fec199baa7d64553c69f0208777273e7a5bc00ef1be3c89c6acc088c5941c0fc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
