('rowid-10934','GHBC-REQ-010934','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.30','11.30.4.2','GHBC-C-003116','Ladders or rungs shall have an inside width of not less than 305 mm (12 inches), shall project not less than 76 mm (3 inches) from the wall and shall be spaced not more than 457 mm (18 inches) on center (o.c.) vertically for the full height of the window well.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":305,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"shall have an inside width of not less than 305 mm (12 inches), shall project"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":76,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"mm (12 inches), shall project not less than 76 mm (3 inches) from the wall a"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":457,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":" the wall and shall be spaced not more than 457 mm (18 inches) on center (o.c"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":305,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"inside width of not less than 305 mm (12 inches), shall project no"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":12,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"idth of not less than 305 mm (12 inches), shall project not less "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":76,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":", shall project not less than 76 mm (3 inches) from the wall and "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" project not less than 76 mm (3 inches) from the wall and shall "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":457,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"shall be spaced not more than 457 mm (18 inches) on center (o.c.) "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":18,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" spaced not more than 457 mm (18 inches) on center (o.c.) vertica"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','663e653ceeda0833d8dbf7665f0cdfab7c46ecb03759b6527b1f8ed93297221b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10935','GHBC-REQ-010935','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.30','11.30.4.2','GHBC-C-003116','The ladder or steps shall not encroach into the required dimensions of the window well by more than 152 mm (6 inches).','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":152,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"ensions of the window well by more than 152 mm (6 inches)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":152,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" the window well by more than 152 mm (6 inches)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"dow well by more than 152 mm (6 inches)."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b538a9878e8c97c63a2f86970f382a1dd8a1c269a442a7806be650f41f08fa4c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10936','GHBC-REQ-010936','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.30','11.30.4.2','GHBC-C-003116','The ladder or steps shall not be obstructed by the emergency escape and rescue opening.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a9714e37a53c03227eb09137dda8fd8d5fcf88f1fc277ef86010c6f038d93a71','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10937','GHBC-REQ-010937','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.30','11.30.4.2','GHBC-C-003116','Ladders or steps required by this Clause are exempt from the stairway requirements of Clause 11.11.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','024e7a056f9b65a62697af2b7d19be1c473af700a19a78423018d892c3bf227f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10938','GHBC-REQ-010938','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.30','11.30.5','GHBC-C-003117','Bars, grilles, covers, screens or similar devices are permitted to be placed over emergency escape and rescue openings, bulkhead enclosures or window wells that serve such openings, provided that the minimum net clear opening size complies with Clauses 11.30.1.1 through 11.30.4.2 and such devices shall be releasable or removable from the inside without the use of a key, tool or force greater than that which is required for normal operation of the emergency escape and rescue opening.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','97774be0dc8c9ed54070dcc2983b0c99124632991b3fb0988216e1fd08048341','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10939','GHBC-REQ-010939','GS 1207:2018',11,'11.30','11.30.5','GHBC-C-003117','Where such bars, grilles, covers, screens or similar devices are installed in existing buildings, they shall not reduce the net clear opening of the emergency escape and rescue opening and smoke alarms shall be installed in accordance with Clause 10.7.2.10 regardless of the valuation of the alteration.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','57de47d00575650ef31e588429a23c791c6468ae6bfa0722ac475517894c15ac','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10940','GHBC-REQ-010940','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.1','13.1.1','GHBC-C-003118','The provisions of this part shall govern ventilation, temperature control, lighting, yards and courts, sound transmission, room dimensions, surrounding materials and rodentproofing associated with the interior spaces of buildings.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a3e921d2008ce7aa5cdb4600f73d5642fb58f1f97fa958365f2698a46a4aa479','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
