('rowid-10942','GHBC-REQ-010942','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.1','13.1.2','GHBC-C-003119','An indoor air quality management plan shall be developed.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7caec3f5e42e7cf06fbced9bd23e3a194c0c6e175adf2978c47617feec07c6c3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10943','GHBC-REQ-010943','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.1','13.1.2','GHBC-C-003119','Such plan shall address the methods and procedures to be used during design and construction to obtain compliance with Clauses 13.2 through 13.5.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f779477a880994a09d6caa9d47f1ee0cfe6ead7f0f707aa842035670b2d458f6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10944','GHBC-REQ-010944','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.2','13.2.1','GHBC-C-003120','To facilitate the operation and maintenance of the completed building, the building and its systems shall comply with the requirements of Clauses 13.2.2 and 13.2.3.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec89f16cd175b8757bf25d6671793f717fc1a472e50071fa73a93887a8e1822b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10945','GHBC-REQ-010945','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.2','13.2.2','GHBC-C-003121','The arrangement and location of air-handling system components including, but not limited to, ducts, air handler units, fans, coils and condensate pans, shall allow access for cleaning and repair of the air-handling surfaces of such components.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cbb075790420e2c442a74588a01e051053a38f0d45b103a46987556eba505e33','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10946','GHBC-REQ-010946','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.2','13.2.2','GHBC-C-003121','Access ports shall be installed in the air-handling system to permit such cleaning and repairs.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4fb866ef6ef3eb5523413683c39eb207e82cb9122bd3836096c5e4bdb1bae947','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-10947','GHBC-REQ-010947','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.2','13.2.2','GHBC-C-003121','Piping, conduits, and other building components shall not be located so as to obstruct the required access ports.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6c1d619fba6b87ecaa02a27a643011888ce9f2f7ec4b9c139221a865c34c47d7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
