('rowid-10949','GHBC-REQ-010949','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.2','13.2.3','GHBC-C-003122','Air-handling equipment and HVAC equipment shall be designed and installed to limit the amount of airflow that bypasses the air filters and shall comply with the following: 1.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','efdcbcf9508d772a8b7be45761bcf55692d2ad8cc13e14b537cd2fdadaf19929','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
