('rowid-11008','GHBC-REQ-011008','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.4','13.4.1.3','GHBC-C-003136','Where this clause is indicated to be applicable in this Code, and after all interior finishes are installed, the building shall be tested for indoor air quality and the testing results shall indicate that the levels of VOCs meet the levels detailed in this code using testing protocols in accordance with ASTM D5197, ASTM D5466, ASTM D6196, ASTM D6345, and ISO 7708.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["ISO 7708"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7b8e27342efe84576db854751cb406e8fa94dfe90e9e74e861073f7ebb20a397','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
