('rowid-11138','GHBC-REQ-011138','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.7','13.7.4','GHBC-C-003149','Floor and ceiling assemblies separating sleeping units or dwelling units from public or service areas within the structure in occupancies classified as Group A1, A2, A3, B, E, I, M or R, or sleeping units or dwelling units from adjacent sleeping units or dwelling units in Group R occupancies, shall have an impact insulation classification (IIC) rating of not less than 50 where laboratory tested, and 45 where field tested, when tested in accordance with ASTM E492.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"lassification (IIC) rating of not less than 50 where laboratory tested, and "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ea612162e0588409635d641256e3256a37dcde80f9820ae6c08e0db6ca8a637d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
