('rowid-11396','GHBC-REQ-011396','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.13','13.13.1','GHBC-C-003197','This clause shall apply to common interior walls, partitions and floor/ceiling assemblies between adjacent dwelling units and sleeping units or between dwelling units and sleeping units and adjacent public areas such as halls, corridors, stairways or service areas.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','103973c7b6840646a085e7c5da9adbeaa183978bca162adbdbddfb0ffda54764','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-11397','GHBC-REQ-011397','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.13','13.13.2','GHBC-C-003198','Walls, partitions and floor-ceiling assemblies separating dwelling units and sleeping units from each other or from public or service areas shall have a sound transmission class of not less than 50, or not less than 45 if field tested, for airborne noise where tested in accordance with ASTM E90.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"a sound transmission class of not less than 50, or not less than 45 if field "},{"parameter":"comparison","value":45,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"class of not less than 50, or not less than 45 if field tested, for airborne"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eec38b7e7ed21b98399fdb6044066f468cf33849f253fa0f5ac768d0044a811f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-11398','GHBC-REQ-011398','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.13','13.13.2','GHBC-C-003198','Alternatively, the sound transmission class of walls, partitions and floorceiling assemblies shall be established by engineering analysis based on a comparison of walls, partitions and floor-ceiling assemblies having sound transmission class ratings as determined by the test procedures set forth in ASTM E90.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aff517e1cd66ee3a14d7f7adc2ebb3e8429981996b86a2cd9de0c040a2fa3e6e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-11399','GHBC-REQ-011399','GS 1207:2018',13,'13.13','13.13.2','GHBC-C-003198','Penetrations or openings in construction assemblies for piping; electrical devices; recessed cabinets; bathtubs; soffits; or heating, ventilating or exhaust ducts shall be sealed, lined, insulated or otherwise treated to maintain the required ratings.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1cc916f49ce07249958486c3780121d226640dd68fd6e1c2864637f9082a811b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
