('rowid-11534','GHBC-REQ-011534','GS 1207:2018',14,'14.3','14.4.6','GHBC-C-003227','1 Newly installed combustion devices should be operated by the installer under conditions simulating those of actual operation and a combustion analysis, and the device adjusted to demonstrate the actual on-site steadystate efficiency of the equipment.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e5f2180c6b3e48620272f591dbd6cdc9a6a2829d9274e2b2b03972af4e4b5858','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
