('rowid-11536','GHBC-REQ-011536','GS 1207:2018',14,'14.5',NULL,'GHBC-C-003228','For Energy Efficiency information relating to lighting and electrical appliances, refer to Parts 13 and 28 of this Code.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2e6fbcceb20f076eda8ca997e23bbb3bd58e0e0fae9ee053abeffa99345f28d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
