('rowid-11722','GHBC-REQ-011722','GS 1207:2018',15,'15.4','15.4.11.1','GHBC-C-003288','Such attachments and their supports shall be designed and constructed to resist the wind loads as specified in Clause 1609 for components and cladding.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93ca0dcbe67867feb8768443dd3abb7ca3c4e686cb0e3572c921951d7f457c86','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
