('rowid-11732','GHBC-REQ-011732','GS 1207:2018',15,'15.4','15.4.12.3','GHBC-C-003295','Thin exterior structural glass veneer shall be set only after backing is thoroughly dry and after application of an approved bond coat uniformly over the entire surface of the backing so as to effectively seal the surface.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8dd5cb3ec7f701a992d19791a279e9abfe6f850d3d6e674f7b4cc96f77eaa2aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
