('rowid-12387','GHBC-REQ-012387','GS 1207:2018',16,'16.10','16.10.2.4','GHBC-C-003531','On buildings of Type II, III or IV construction, the exterior walls of penthouses with a fire separation distance of 20 feet (6096 mm) or greater shall be permitted to be of heavy timber construction complying with Clauses 7.2.4 and 24.4.11 or noncombustible construction or fire-retardant-treated wood and shall not be required to have a fireresistance rating.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"a fire separation distance of 20 feet (6096 mm) or greater shall be"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6096,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"paration distance of 20 feet (6096 mm) or greater shall be permitte"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e03db6b638cddcf019d504d92bab15c5e52fa77e1f1fa09605e58fa4e311f1b3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12388','GHBC-REQ-012388','GS 1207:2018',16,'16.10','16.10.3','GHBC-C-003532','Tanks having a capacity of more than 500 gallons (1893 L) located on the roof deck of a building shall be supported on masonry, reinforced concrete, steel or heavy timber construction complying with Clause 24.4.11 provided that, where such supports are located in the building above the lowest storey, the support shall be fire-resistance rated as required for Type IA construction.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":500,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"Tanks having a capacity of more than 500 gallons (1893 L) located on t"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1893,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"ity of more than 500 gallons (1893 L) located on the roof deck of "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e55e00b2075552fca87c4f70a46a2014114edebb6c62bb24d2bdcfaef132fd2b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12389','GHBC-REQ-012389','GS 1207:2018',16,'16.10','16.10.3.1','GHBC-C-003533','In the bottom or on the side near the bottom of the tank, a pipe or outlet, fitted with a suitable quick-opening valve for discharging the contents into a drain in an emergency shall be provided.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bdb1abb7b944fc4b7e44b4fddf76c047199efd80343b4812eb7e79340178f95d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12390','GHBC-REQ-012390','GS 1207:2018',16,'16.10','16.10.3.2','GHBC-C-003534','Tanks shall not be placed over or near a stairway or an elevator shaft, unless there is a solid roof or floor underneath the tank.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c1720f284b95ef0071c0a5983d313f514b61f3a766518c2b8d8e02802715e3df','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
