('rowid-12414','GHBC-REQ-012414','GS 1207:2018',16,'16.10','16.10.6.2','GHBC-C-003541','Where exterior wall covering panels are used, the panels shall have a flame spread index of 25 or less when tested in the minimum and maximum thicknesses intended for use, with each face tested independently in accordance with ASTM E84.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4d4fca890722a5eeb1a469230cf5b3d4c95277bea0bfc4b032be25fc0d53dccd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
