('rowid-12417','GHBC-REQ-012417','GS 1207:2018',16,'16.10','16.10.6.3','GHBC-C-003542','The height of mechanical equipment screens located on the roof decks of buildings of Type IV construction, as measured from grade plane to the highest point on the mechanical equipment screen, shall be permitted to exceed the maximum building height allowed for the building by other provisions of this Code where complying with any one of the following limitations, provided that the fire separation distance is greater than 1524 mm (5 feet):','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1524,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"tion distance is greater than 1524 mm (5 feet):"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"ance is greater than 1524 mm (5 feet):"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fb16ac502092036c7528c9dacda9f2716d62b1db923a139dc993304dac5b351b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
