('rowid-12538','GHBC-REQ-012538','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.1','GHBC-C-003575','This makes allowances for sub-standard materials or for the deterioration of materials during the life of the structure.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','260596d54601096026830e727490fca557974098406fc8567470d35482428480','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12539','GHBC-REQ-012539','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.1','GHBC-C-003575','(5) Action combination factor, ψ, which for imposed (variable) loads, are used in multiplying characteristic values to obtain representative values.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c5f1b01215cd49b19eea7aa0dc14c7eeb96b3f13703f281d6f91b7a9d8a13666','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
