('rowid-12543','GHBC-REQ-012543','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.1.1','GHBC-C-003578','Limit State (1) The required strength R provided to resist dead load GK and imposed load QK shall be at least equal to: R = 1.4GK + 1.6QK ……… (17-1)','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a033a177b347ab4f6e0b18913a799894dbb89b5cb42d7e4622a1f24b5e1c9d1a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12544','GHBC-REQ-012544','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.1.1','GHBC-C-003578','(2) In the design of a structure or member, if resistance to the structural effects of a specified wind load WK, must be included in the design the following combinations of GK, QK and WK shall be investigated in determining the greatest required strength R.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3e2180512d7f5aa39e3033b2ed5cf69d18770b632851708764bea23d89783deb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12545','GHBC-REQ-012545','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.1.1','GHBC-C-003578','R = 1.2GK + 1.2QK + 1.2WK  ……… (17-2)','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8c284d717f8e8b944b7178e11ac64c322bcf61d07e021fd1e279ab40390ba8e6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12546','GHBC-REQ-012546','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.1.1','GHBC-C-003578','Where the cases of QK having its full value or being completely absent shall both be checked to determine the most severe condition using R = 0.9GK + 1.4WK    ……… (17-3) In any case, the strength of the member or structure shall not be less than required by Eq.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','12ad4ff68c75cbec18137dcfe1d7456782b6ba0a444d54bf67270cd799b2196f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12547','GHBC-REQ-012547','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.1.1','GHBC-C-003578','(17-1).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b13ab0490596184e12f2ca54fc18130d9d384a6b8eeefba96167c73139cba9b7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12548','GHBC-REQ-012548','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.1.1','GHBC-C-003578','(3) If resistance to specified earthquake loads or forces E must be included in the design, refer to Clause 17.10 of this Part on Effects of Earthquake.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7505e29ab3f13e430d3041c2e80bf110c5dae9a35cd13e863c74693d1fee576d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12549','GHBC-REQ-012549','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.1.1','GHBC-C-003578','(4) If lateral earth pressure H must be included in design the strength R shall be at least equal to 1.4GK + 1.6QK + 1.6H but where GK or QK reduce the effect of H (i.e. favourable), the corresponding coefficients shall be taken as','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.6,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"east equal to 1.4GK + 1.6QK + 1.6H but where GK or QK reduce the"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','37a7e2101d4d36614ce0acd41e4993e7c815bcc17543c4fb0fe25610c7a0f64e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12550','GHBC-REQ-012550','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','0.90','GHBC-C-003579','equations are: R = 1.4GK + 1.6QK + 1.6H R = 0.9GK + 1.6H R = 1.4GK + 1.6QK (5) For lateral loads F due to liquids, the provisions for Clause 17.5.2.1(4) shall apply, except that 1.4F shall be substituted for 1.6H.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.6,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"ions are: R = 1.4GK + 1.6QK + 1.6H R = 0.9GK + 1.6H R = 1.4GK + "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.6,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"GK + 1.6QK + 1.6H R = 0.9GK + 1.6H R = 1.4GK + 1.6QK (5) For lat"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.6,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"1.4F shall be substituted for 1.6H."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9229b928471279564dbeadb0b4e4da73a50b7a073106b7747e1f6da1a9974a80','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-12551','GHBC-REQ-012551','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','0.90','GHBC-C-003579','The vertical pressure of liquids shall be considered as dead load, with due regard to variation in liquid depth.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b221fd6cda82dbdcab2ea18dd08248ba7ebad29a10286aea7a8954175d517117','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12552','GHBC-REQ-012552','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','0.90','GHBC-C-003579','(6) Where the structural effects of differential settlement, creep, shrinkage or temperature T may be significant the governing equation shall be R = 1.2GK + 1.2QK + 1.2T The above actions are summarized in Table 17.1','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1035a2a93373e18dc76179b59817b0d3fcd5792ef52b5561ead59d6d05f01815','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12553','GHBC-REQ-012553','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-003580','State A building and its structural components shall be checked for serviceability limit states as defined in Clause 17.5.1(b).','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9ea1b4f5b960b73dfbdd855de5a9e55a2b66683d08045487c6ad2ce57a1dd0f5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12554','GHBC-REQ-012554','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-003580','Where more than one load contributes to the stress in the member the combination of loads shall be assumed to be:','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','58f258e8cf3c821a77b74f8887fb118439d6082650bd1680ed274dc3734ea84a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12555','GHBC-REQ-012555','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-003580','GK + ψ ((QK + (E or WK) + T)) Where ψ shall be equal to: (a) 1.0 when only one of the loads QK, (E or WK) and T act; (b) 0.70 when two of the loads QK, (E or WK) and T act; (c) 0.60 when all of the loads QK, (E or WK) and T act.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa570da6a42d054a8d4ec8e36f1f10d4b02457ebb72ed6da0f2a40a1e92a6e66','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12556','GHBC-REQ-012556','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.2','GHBC-C-003581','BS EN 1991, BS EN 1992) One of the main differences between the EuroCodes and the British/Ghanaian system is the use of different partial safety factors and the option to refine/reduce load factors when different load cases are combined.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 1990","EN 1991","EN 1992"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f7eb0653ffc0443e38e3d27494856b00e55d1b25201b1b98d6061f831c41d35f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12557','GHBC-REQ-012557','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.2.1','GHBC-C-003582','Limit State The design loads are obtained by multiplying the characteristic loads by the appropriate partial safety factor, γf, from Table 17.2.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 1990"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c5f7299d6bb7d014b8dfd5bcd5299ca8a52b20616ac432bc5da26c8d0c5037e6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12558','GHBC-REQ-012558','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.2.1','GHBC-C-003582','When more than one imposed load (variable action) is present, the secondary imposed load may be reduced by the application of a combination factor, ψ0 (see Table 17.4).','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 1990"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ac1a69b15186feb88f1c880a09d8b93362455370bf0c599e5220ad16de513af9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12559','GHBC-REQ-012559','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.2.1','GHBC-C-003582','The basic load combination for the required strength at ultimate limit state for a typical building is: R = γGGK + γQQK1 + ΣγQψ0QKi where: QK1, QK2, QK3 etc. are the actions due to vertical imposed loads, wind load, snow etc., QK1 being the leading action for the situation considered.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 1990"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0f20a526b2324f20f7aca674e77fce3998eaef72f0a260f6775f8fff8169cf0c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12560','GHBC-REQ-012560','GS 1207:2018',17,'17.5','17.5.2.2.1','GHBC-C-003582','The ‗unfavourable‘ and ‗favourable‘ factors should be used so as to produce the most onerous condition.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 1990"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','938c1867826a388065df32eb45faa5355581d02b1cb054f3b7243d82527d2d0f','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
