('rowid-12624','GHBC-REQ-012624','GS 1207:2018',17,'10',NULL,'GHBC-C-003599','(3) Sloping Roofs up to angle of 65o to the horizontal shall withstand an imposed load of 0.25kN/m2 measured on plan or a vertical load of 0.9kN concentrated on a square with 300mm side whichever produces the greater stress.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.25,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":" withstand an imposed load of 0.25kN/m2 measured on plan or a vert"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"nd an imposed load of 0.25kN/m2 measured on plan or a vertical "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.9,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":"on plan or a vertical load of 0.9kN concentrated on a square with"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"concentrated on a square with 300mm side whichever produces the g"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a42c5960ca87532fddbc13699e749eff20077095bdb3ca47619471b72682e3e8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12625','GHBC-REQ-012625','GS 1207:2018',17,'10',NULL,'GHBC-C-003599','(4) Curved Roofs The imposed load on a curved roof shall be calculated by dividing the roof into not less than five equal segments and then by calculating the load on each, appropriate to its mean slope in accordance with 17.7.4(1) to 17.7.4(3).','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','11e8b4bccaed9a137bf03c217440cda6fdcd0ba94e84a9bfa555443a806a9091','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12626','GHBC-REQ-012626','GS 1207:2018',17,'10',NULL,'GHBC-C-003599','(5) Roof coverings and purlins at a slope of less than 450 shall be capable of carrying a load of 0.9kN concentrated on any square with 125mm side.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":450,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"ngs and purlins at a slope of less than 450 shall be capable of carrying "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":450,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"rlins at a slope of less than 450 shall be capable of carrying a "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.9,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":"capable of carrying a load of 0.9kN concentrated on any square wi"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":125,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ncentrated on any square with 125mm side."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f660a37798935df94bc85dec325361e816730099284291870a5fb46e5c4328e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12627','GHBC-REQ-012627','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.8.1','GHBC-C-003600','runways, cranes and other plant producing dynamic effects are supported by or communicated to the framework, allowance shall be made for these dynamic effects, including impact, by increasing the dead-weight values by an adequate amount.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1b2464d2b0136321cb71b94586132e561ee6e03306019b354b82b0130143fb6f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12628','GHBC-REQ-012628','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.8.1','GHBC-C-003600','In order to ensure economy in design, the appropriate dynamic increase for all members affected shall be ascertained as accurately as possible.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','df6616993fe15ebe5d315167c2540503986f93857bbe48d29c7a3ca56f0e9327','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12629','GHBC-REQ-012629','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.8.2','GHBC-C-003601','The minimum design load due to equipment, machinery on other objects or persons that may produce impact, is the total weight of equipment or machinery plus its maximum lifting capacity, or appropriate live load, multiplied by an appropriate factor listed in','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1c26a07c993f3845ed394a0a0ac41436cdcea128f7785485e06d750a345c1078','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12630','GHBC-REQ-012630','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.8.2','GHBC-C-003601','multiplying factor has been supplied by the','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7f0aabf2f7f060448dc0838714d3ec827360b8ac65487de0cc5dee81933dc2b4','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
