('rowid-12632','GHBC-REQ-012632','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.8.2','GHBC-C-003601','Where dynamic effects such as resonance and fatigue are likely to be important as a result of vibration of equipment or machinery, a dynamic analysis shall be carried out.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db2e8143e579dbd1511bf53a5498f0e6acedee97dc7c2ecf8955ae338763e949','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12633','GHBC-REQ-012633','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.8.3','GHBC-C-003602','The minimum horizontal design loads on cranes runway rails are: (a)  Lateral force which shall be: (i) for power operated crane trolleys, 20% and for hand operated trolleys, 10% of the sum of the weights of the lifted loads and of the crane trolley excluding other parts of the crane; (ii) applied at the top of the rail, one-half in each side of the runway, and (iii) considered acting in either direction normal to the runway rail.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":"ower operated crane trolleys, 20% and for hand operated trolley"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":"d for hand operated trolleys, 10% of the sum of the weights of "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f6b9172a27f709c0176c8b6d4c8c6fb7e494b259e5ce3da07678b67450133b98','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12634','GHBC-REQ-012634','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.8.3','GHBC-C-003602','(b)  Longitudinal force which shall be: (i) 10 percent of the maximum wheel loads of the crane, and (ii) applied at the top of the rail.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"nal force which shall be: (i) 10 percent of the maximum wheel loads of"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0bf860ca89bd362995b99be4aba85faaac78267276b0dc7902a93516fa3aac37','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12635','GHBC-REQ-012635','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.8.4','GHBC-C-003603','The minimum design load applied horizontally at the top of a railing which guards a drop of more than 460mm shall be: (a) 5.8kN/m for exterior balconies of individual residential units and a concentrated load of 0.9kN applied concurrently; for industrial catwalks and other areas where crowding by many people is very improbable.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":460,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"ailing which guards a drop of more than 460mm shall be: (a) 5.8kN/m for e"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":460,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ch guards a drop of more than 460mm shall be: (a) 5.8kN/m for ext"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":5.8,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":"more than 460mm shall be: (a) 5.8kN/m for exterior balconies of i"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.9,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":"ts and a concentrated load of 0.9kN applied concurrently; for ind"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','88d0eaa53771ad007ddbef438e8b7a186b273c77e1bb2a129d1ae77441136c03','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
