('rowid-12719','GHBC-REQ-012719','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.9.4','GHBC-C-003607','It is recommended that the graphs of Fig.5.6 should not be extrapolated for periods less than two years.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5.6,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"mended that the graphs of Fig.5.6 should not be extrapolated for "}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0b82ee2d4cfe1320071f87814274475925103f1a5ef1718c21c79f16856a30c6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12720','GHBC-REQ-012720','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.9.4','GHBC-C-003607','(3) The assessment of wind load should be made as follows: a) The basic wind speed V appropriate to the area where the structure is to be erected is determined as specified in 5.9.5(2) b) The basic wind speed is multiplied by factors S1, S2 and S3 to give the design wind speed Vs (see 5.9.5(3)).','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"eed is multiplied by factors S1, S2 and S3 to give the design wi"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3c8979cd98622bb3fb5baf3b4bc7c182d77c8759db2d2266a8e3df4fbfa359a2','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
