('rowid-12722','GHBC-REQ-012722','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.9.4','GHBC-C-003607','q and Vs d) The design external pressure or suction at any point on the surface of the building is given by: p = Cpq','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7091647309974ebb62dad0a888dcca7261e59b61339c035fa27f194b1e8febde','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12723','GHBC-REQ-012723','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.9.4','GHBC-C-003607','A negative value of Cp indicates suction.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2fd4470a03b9a95cf88322f9b86c14033711b9d89e6b800774695f3387d3de95','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12724','GHBC-REQ-012724','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.9.4','GHBC-C-003607','The resultant load on an element or cladding depends on the algebraic difference of the external pressure or suction and the internal pressure or suction may be calculated from: F = (Cpe – Cpi)qA A negative value of F indicates that the resultant force is outwards.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2ef467d01cad0003e7a4e94be4d49778d75adcb4e0a2abeeec647fe06b372804','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12725','GHBC-REQ-012725','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.9.4','GHBC-C-003607','The total wind load on a structure may be obtained by a vectorial summation of the loads on all the surfaces. e) Where a value of force coefficient, Cf, is available, the total wind load on the building as a whole is more conveniently obtained from:','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','990e4b7d721abdabb4d415c798a1d64695bde92bb8bd51ba36a186facf008b22','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12726','GHBC-REQ-012726','GS 1207:2018',17,'10','17.9.4','GHBC-C-003607','F = CfqAe Pressure coefficients are given in Tables 17.14 and 17.20 for a range of building shapes.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f5d472c4cfea0ddc7e8fb69b5aaf75279803f46b5a0a2976b64b1f86f1520146','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
