('rowid-12819','GHBC-REQ-012819','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-003611','Note on Fig. 17.6 For example, using the graph for probability level 0.63 for a period of exposure equal to 100 years say, S3 = 1.05 i.e. there is the probability level of 0.63 that a speed which is 1.05 times the once in 50 years wind speed obtained from  Fig. 5.1 will be exceeded at least once in 100 years.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 1.05"]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','357c896ebf30398d95262ad97401ac7c4a2792d584fa4ace245a73f097644189','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
