('rowid-12837','GHBC-REQ-012837','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'5.16','GHBC-C-003614','(3)  Internal Pressure Coefficient:  It is normally difficult to estimate the internal pressure coefficient for a building as the coefficient depends on permeability through windows, ventilation louvres, leakage gaps around doors and windows and cladding.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b557028ddec9460df439e29dfa4c54514427b9c0e58a814e7c55100dc925f9e9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
