('rowid-12858','GHBC-REQ-012858','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-003616','They apply only in supercritical flow (i.e. they should only be used where D > 0.3m).','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"should only be used where D > 0.3m)."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5ab44590d7a920fa327566618c68eeb451924c80ae8e8bb66766fadaa101b5d3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12859','GHBC-REQ-012859','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-003616','They may be used for wind blowing normal to the axis of cylinders having their axis normal to the ground plane (i.e. chimneys, silos) and to cylinders having their axis parallel with the ground plane (i.e. horizontal tanks) provided the clearance between the tank and the ground is not less than D. h is the height of a vertical cylinder or length of a horizontal cylinder.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f49d148fbf60136e2ec97a4004e617d3e1a664fe3cb6999ea347a93938fb0340','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12860','GHBC-REQ-012860','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-003616','Where there is a free flow of air around both ends, h is to be taken as half the length when calculating h/D.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2967ceb764b3a6dff1fa52a54f59b401e297494d0aea01a7b354dd39b556f880','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
