('rowid-12868','GHBC-REQ-012868','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-003616','17.9.8(3) (a) Flat–sided members:  The force coefficient in Table 17.24 are given for two mutually-perpendicular directions relative to a reference axis on the structural member.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','703a8ee10f3b34a2594354efd2a7565fee3cb860c5675e3c2a729cab0133d00f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
