('rowid-12877','GHBC-REQ-012877','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-003616','Transverse force:    F = Cft qklj (b) Circular clauses: For circular clauses, the force coefficients Cf, which are dependent upon values of DVs, are given in Table 17.25.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2d1890549fe55ddc57291afb2d714e25465ae7f319c09cce82299e53666fe696','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
