('rowid-12904','GHBC-REQ-012904','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','(b) Since it is only in very few cases with lattice towers composed of members of circular clause that all the members of a lattice tower are entirely in either subcritical or supercritical flow, wind force calculations should be carried out as described in 5.9.8(4) for single frames, due account being taken of the shielding factors in 5.9.8(5).','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','431eb9b35928d7ddc185c1254fed6655d0a5df803d2d3a1f77b2056e2d70f5df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12905','GHBC-REQ-012905','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','When it can be shown that all the members of the tower are wholly in the same flow regime the overall force coefficients Cf  given in Tables 5.29 and 5.30 may be used.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5.3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" Cf  given in Tables 5.29 and 5.30 may be used."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a76622bae238a0b05f95a8bde5e3ca531c89cf64289f561fb383f234464e6227','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12906','GHBC-REQ-012906','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','Solidity ratio of a frame = Ø.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3a75cf4756f23aa69a2591d8bc317b29c2ff94c8ec8ea4eb11e6ee669c3f6e2a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12907','GHBC-REQ-012907','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','For lattice steel towers, Ø typically varies between about 0.1 and 0.3','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','441ea2a7014ac093f831a8c4880709c9087dc20c819a1e222c09d98d4c4b492b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12908','GHBC-REQ-012908','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','Equilateral Triangular Towers composed of Rounded members','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3d9a74f6ef2b662afb74b39462a9eb31509911de7be44a02fc9e665d551d81e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12909','GHBC-REQ-012909','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','vertical loads and lateral forces are resisted by space frames.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7e3ffed719eba537d62cc8462f714b0058e14025c36413c3c653ed5605c2400c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12910','GHBC-REQ-012910','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','(b) Wall System: A system in which both vertical loads and lateral forces are resisted by structural walls either single or coupled.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','71cd45976a359d286bbe2a6b3e138e8afefdcf6e30af1c2eaf6ff58aebb6409b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
