('rowid-12912','GHBC-REQ-012912','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','Edge openings within walls and','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ba713df4c5cfd91d1f13de64bb9ee9a0f2ba4260dde2cea167df18269313f029','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12913','GHBC-REQ-012913','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','diaphragms may also have to be provided with boundary elements.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','65a1349456d83eeecd3db5cf6702693adf8b5dea406ba7bef6d9bc6c1bf81eab','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12914','GHBC-REQ-012914','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','Notations A         = peak ground acceleration Ac        = confined area measured to outside peripheral transverse reinforcement.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a278fc3eb456617bc773d9d8b2ba9647cc255282532ae6e08ea937762f7ea1fc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12915','GHBC-REQ-012915','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','Ag        = gross clauseal area of concrete Cd        =    design seismic coefficient Cg =    centre of mass Ck =    centre of stiffness E =    design seismic action (symbolic) I =    importance factor Mu,d      = ultimate moment of a concrete clause, evaluated with factored values of concrete and steel strengths M+ u,d   = ultimate moment of a concrete clause, evaluated with characteristic values of concrete and steel strengths.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9a5ed8c1ccde25d1b7bd91c3e4edc8394d670e6e6639d25a22414f0e8ae443f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12916','GHBC-REQ-012916','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','Nd        = design axial force under the most unfavourable load combination including the seismic action.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a9ad61b2648274adee1ef6db32f4e8fbc47d3927c218d5d37d22893e62590b4b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12917','GHBC-REQ-012917','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','K =    behaviour factor S =    site coefficient Si =    soil type index Vcd =    shear force carried by concrete in beam or column clauses a       = plan dimension of the building in the direction orthogonal to that of seismic action bw =   web width of a concrete clause h,b =   height and width of beams,  major and minor sides in columns h’, b’  =   distance between reinforcement bars located at the ends of sides in and b, respectively, measured to outside the peripheral bars','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b883c282163864b370dd2bc239d0a16cf4baf3f7bdacf992c2a245a0edac2f58','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12918','GHBC-REQ-012918','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620','d     =   distance from centre of stiffness and centre of gravity of the generic floor Sh       =    spacing of transverse reinforcement in beams, columns and walls. fcd       =    design concrete strength h         =    height of a floor lw        =    horizontal wall length hw = total height of a wall hn = vertical distance between floors in walls  = spectral amplification factor  = parameter of the elastic response spectrum i = distribution factor n = over-capacity factor el = elastic interstorey drift under the seismic actions  = ratio between maximum and minimum shear force at a beam end','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','318d5857e1e2ae4b752ae9a5c85af4ff50b2239ae9b3fa30be6d380f53e22400','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12919','GHBC-REQ-012919','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.5','GHBC-C-003620',' = deformability index  = amplification factor for torsional effects w = dynamic magnification factor Rd = shear design stress of concrete','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','babc1311bcc06481c16d23bdfeee541f173fbfe19e22ed0f0c5098d6be4e073a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12920','GHBC-REQ-012920','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.3.1','GHBC-C-003622','Structures shall be classified under the following reliability levels: (1) Class I: Buildings that are required to remain functional and to suffer reduced         damage after a strong seismic attack (e.g. essential rescue facilities such as hospitals, fire and police stations, electricity stations etc. buildings with likely large number of occupants such as schools, audience or spectacle halls, etc).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7d2c41cde387e635f03ac64b7368f91a017cf5a24cc3313a7694434184794d6a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-12921','GHBC-REQ-012921','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.3.1','GHBC-C-003622','(3) The different reliability levels proper to each Class shall be obtained by amplifying the design action with a factor I, called importance factor.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa0285cf74ae16760d15a044e459845359420f314eb6688cd1e1a656026f4143','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12922','GHBC-REQ-012922','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.3.2','GHBC-C-003623','Structural systems covered by the Code may be designed to possess different ‗ductility‘ levels according to the following classification: (1) Ductility Level I (DL I) - is that proper to structures proportioned in accordance to BS 8110 (1985) with additional requirements on detailing contained in 17.10.8.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 8110"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','57591f8765a212946ff7ed9478264655c9fd79f85da08d76d327a55ba6741a0c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12923','GHBC-REQ-012923','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.3.2','GHBC-C-003623','This ductility level, I is suitable for low rise buildings.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 8110"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ff80e6a877a0b8b2a2fba3f6476aa5a502bd435137c15a7943189ed3cdf894a3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12924','GHBC-REQ-012924','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.3.2','GHBC-C-003623','(2) Ductility Level II (DL II)- for this level seismic provisions are to be adopted, enabling the structure to enter the inelastic range of response under repeated reversed loading, while avoiding premature brittle-type failures.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 8110"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5a023078d5c6b8ba6c5a54584aea57c14c6e9c28f0ede59d99af797e070fa455','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12925','GHBC-REQ-012925','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.3.2','GHBC-C-003623','(3) Ductility Level III (DL III) - special procedures for the evaluation of design action and for the proportioning and detailing of the elements are to be adopted to ensure the development of selected stable mechanisms associated with large energy dissipation capacities.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 8110"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b499f622c6424f628d76f7622d9bede018f5f78ee38771bea7910576c8f3c26a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12926','GHBC-REQ-012926','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.3.2','GHBC-C-003623','DL III structures should be preferred whenever large uncertainties exist (e.g. Local amplification effects of difficult evaluation etc)','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 8110"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','362806413dd004318f5b98bcc4ef1c851823c6a6bc61a807f7069ed02d6b7680','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12927','GHBC-REQ-012927','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1','GHBC-C-003625','m','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','81d4c947edb166a100c835ec08309745376077645aed47286c2c24cbd78a199a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12928','GHBC-REQ-012928','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.1','GHBC-C-003627','Normal concrete grades shall satisfy the following requirements (Table 17.10.4.1)','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0632928877d6ee1aa7d7d18f6e2b96d0111e5fe856d567127c684ef113b2ee5f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12929','GHBC-REQ-012929','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.1','GHBC-C-003627','17.10.4.1.1(2) Steel (a) DL I and DL II Structures The reinforcing steel is defined by its characteristic strength.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2bbef0131f377d869e8303e185a18547c4c94eb599611e4237cbfd22dd1c965b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12930','GHBC-REQ-012930','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.1','GHBC-C-003627','(b) DL III Structures The following additional requirements shall be satisfied.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f9cb41c4b678c488d66b1dfb76f2b95006fca00870eaf9c9e8fb83f8ddce6bd1','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-12931','GHBC-REQ-012931','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.1','GHBC-C-003627','(i) It must be proven the steel used possesses adequate ductility under repeated reversed deformations.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','94460272ae507c7b6d89f1f6eda282cddfee8374658fb38f0feff58328fa3c33','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12932','GHBC-REQ-012932','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.1','GHBC-C-003627','(ii) Steel grades with characteristic strengths higher than S400 (400N/mm2) shall not be used, unless it is demonstrated that the use of higher grades in special clause arrangements does not affect unfavourably the ductility.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":400,"unit":"n/mm2","operator":null,"context":"c strengths higher than S400 (400N/mm2) shall not be used, unless it"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','56a95e57eb1a96bd04f726f9bdda92bd721b0c576458e477e17d6e035a84fb24','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12933','GHBC-REQ-012933','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.1','GHBC-C-003627','(iii) The actual yield stress shall not exceed its normal values by more than 15%.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":15,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"t exceed its normal values by more than 15%."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":"ts normal values by more than 15%."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','82ad535116e7a8518be0225a1f3920682f32acd7cae8dcdd1aadfc160c75200e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12934','GHBC-REQ-012934','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.1','GHBC-C-003627','(iv) The ratio of the mean value of the ultimate strength to actual yield stress shall not be less than 1.25 for S220 and 1.15 for S400 (v) Only high bond steel shall be used for flexural reinforcement, unless adequate provisions are taken to ensure bond and anchorage.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1.25,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"ual yield stress shall not be less than 1.25 for S220 and 1.15 for S400 (v"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','51f358052de8c6dbef7ede60228f2fbfbe92e49c37494afd04b807f26e958ee2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12935','GHBC-REQ-012935','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.2','GHBC-C-003628','Design values of strength for concrete and steel shall be obtained from their respective characteristic values by using the factors: Concrete c = 1.5 Steel s = 1.15','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.5,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"ng the factors: Concrete c = 1.5 Steel s = 1.15"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6361b9e27e69561971b6b9bcc1030ce197a7b4aab1042f58518820a1934a029c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12936','GHBC-REQ-012936','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.2','GHBC-C-003628','17.10.5.3) as a function of the structural type and of the selected ductility level, are given in','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f050399a36d68eb2190e6002996fb216aa761c2482581c8a4785bbed86adbb37','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12937','GHBC-REQ-012937','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.2','GHBC-C-003628','FACTORS K values for wall and dual structures shall be reduced by a factor of 0.7.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1abcb851ba067a561cade1572f9d1d49e455213490b4990098891e8bb853c1d1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12938','GHBC-REQ-012938','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.2','GHBC-C-003628','(4) Ductility Level I is permitted only for Class II structures in areas of moderate seismicity.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2ea196038fb9085c141054dec785d23662c62429df223dff98270c9a1e36b7bb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12939','GHBC-REQ-012939','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.2','GHBC-C-003628','(5) Class I structures to be built in high seismicity areas shall be preferably designed for ductility level III.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5f078fb158a147e611b584254c571bf8ded27254e6e3776965cf107cf6c1d3f2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12940','GHBC-REQ-012940','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.2','GHBC-C-003628','If appropriate, K values relative to DL II could be used in this case.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e3594c75bef199f365af22543fb55b5d66c6da35cf623d9bb9f55ee3e4ee7b88','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-12941','GHBC-REQ-012941','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.4','GHBC-C-003629','The fundamental combination of load effects to be used for limit states verification (Clause 17.10.7.4) is Sd = S (G + P + E + ∑ψi Qik) ...','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d57d08b44064770044648845a903249a5d321704cd387fcf89cf3be513068666','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12942','GHBC-REQ-012942','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.4','GHBC-C-003629','5.10.4.1.1 where G   = all permanent loads at their normal value P   = the long-term prestressing force E   = the design seismic action as defined in Sect .17.10.5.3.4 Qik = fractile values of extreme distributions of all live loads whose duration of application is long enough for the probability of their joint occurrences with earthquake action to be considered.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c84cc80e36d5886561a2fe02273f264bde3d5b3afcdbc182249f8697ae219137','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12943','GHBC-REQ-012943','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.1.4','GHBC-C-003629',' I  = factors required to change the fractile values Qik to the average values of Qik in their instantaneous distribution (See Table 17.10.4.3) S   =    Site Co-efficient','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','14ee696e3eea37997a83207a6f553868f46c08fd5d8006fa1b2e4da4edff084d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12944','GHBC-REQ-012944','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.2.1','GHBC-C-003631','A building shall be classified as regular when the following conditions are satisfied, regarding both plan and vertical configuration.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9b57f33fca29d2f67c4f05492df2ef11cd77482cd19f90b03102707afa8c73e3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12945','GHBC-REQ-012945','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.2.1','GHBC-C-003631','(a) Plan Configuration (i) The building has an approximately symmetrical plan configuration with respect to, at least two orthogonal directions along which the earthquake resisting elements are oriented.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0d6761c58413bd73919dbf6d1eb431ee490066e2ab7bc0e9aa132ebfc14233f7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12946','GHBC-REQ-012946','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.2.1','GHBC-C-003631','When re-entrant corners are present, they do not exceed 25 percent of the building external dimension.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"e present, they do not exceed 25 percent of the building external dime"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e7b07fbbe0ba781ea04c5d2a3194bf34775d5651b7fc6e65ef462337df5c0a48','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-12947','GHBC-REQ-012947','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.4.2.1','GHBC-C-003631','(ii) At any storey the distance (measured in the direction orthogonal to that of the seismic action) between the centre of mass and that of the stiffness does not exceed l5% of the ‗resistance radius‘ defined as the square root of the ratio of storey torsional and translation stiffnesses.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":"he stiffness does not exceed l5% of the ‗resistance radius‘ de"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','357dc7d58274dc515700e2676c837413cc25ea1fbd296ee06510d49c694a96f3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
