('rowid-13046','GHBC-REQ-013046','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.3','GHBC-C-003643','N A g ( ) cd (a) Bending moments: The design bending moments shall be those obtained from linear analysis of the structure for the load combination given by equation 17.10.4.1.1.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','da63544af6d39552d18ba354b535105071f7ee4c57963865d40f7fe8ff259e4c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
