('rowid-13048','GHBC-REQ-013048','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.3','GHBC-C-003643','(b) Shear Forces: (i) The design shear forces shall be determined from the condition of static equilibrium of the element subjected to the relevant transverse load, if any, and a rational combination of the end moments.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0a4ea9dbd1e9e9430f46e2c003b00f3ef661e4548e402966a74cc69198dbbc78','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13049','GHBC-REQ-013049','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.3','GHBC-C-003643','(ii) The end moments shall correspond to the design flexural strengths of the end actions based on actual reinforcement provided.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f3fe1039866fb0497fb154709bd8ee56e46b733163bb0e10c03cc365c213f429','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
