('rowid-13064','GHBC-REQ-013064','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.3','GHBC-C-003643','(ii) The values of the dynamic factor w given in 17.10.6.3(2)(a)(i) are applicable to storeys within the upper two-thirds of the building height.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9ed2913ea8b0739d351c761e949c32e6aac664623d1b4964f01383f6501ea576','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13065','GHBC-REQ-013065','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.3','GHBC-C-003643','Below this level a linear variation of w should be assumed: the value at first floor level should be taken as 1.3 and 1.5 for planar and spatial frame respectively (Fig 17.10.6.2).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','89d5b33c6040941e06afff99741605609316986bc5ef0efd9b03d2fd95822d9c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
