('rowid-13067','GHBC-REQ-013067','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.3','GHBC-C-003643','(b) Shear Forces (i) In evaluating the design shear forces from the condition of static equilibrium the design end moments shall be those producing maximum shear force obtained from analysis, modified if appropriate by the dynamic magnification factor.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2046fb74f6298f36ce46f508c2e1b757d7df37d78220ec94438cb09c9554f6fa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13068','GHBC-REQ-013068','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.3','GHBC-C-003643','(3) Structural Walls (a) The design actions shall be those obtained from a linear analysis of the building modified as appropriate in accordance with Clauses 17.10.6.3(1)(b) to 17.10.6.3(3)(c).','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6d4d03c73eb4a258ced76a2ba495d339fb7588e63003c83b828f73f1b15ce777','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13069','GHBC-REQ-013069','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.3','GHBC-C-003643','(b) Redistribution (i) The distribution of the total force to the various walls, as obtained from the elastic analysis may be modified provided the global equilibrium is maintained and the maximum value of the action in any wall is not reduced by more than 30% (ii) In a coupled wall, the elastic shear force in the coupling beams can also be modified with a maximum reduction of 20% provided that corresponding increases in the shear capacities of beams at other floors are made.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":30,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"in any wall is not reduced by more than 30% (ii) In a coupled wall, the "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":"l is not reduced by more than 30% (ii) In a coupled wall, the e"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":"d with a maximum reduction of 20% provided that corresponding i"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a08f4b69d33cdd04ec15b91c6f9bb6d40eaa1d6ce09d5697be5e726fdf00b886','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13070','GHBC-REQ-013070','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.3','GHBC-C-003643','(c) Bending Moment Design Envelope The design moments along the height of the wall shall be those given by a linear envelope of the calculated moment diagram, vertically displaced','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9627c3677ac3c8770464550dc15d96d197777e356b2ab48317524974b047953e','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
