('rowid-13117','GHBC-REQ-013117','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.4','GHBC-C-003644','N A g d force ( ) cd (a) Axial forces and bending moments (i) The axial forces and bending moments to be used for column design shall be determined from a linear analysis of structures, eventually redistributed according to BS 8110 (1985).','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 8110","BS 8110"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5df79520999a8a57b3570fea7212ab31ff881a763cbd9cead5e7901ddb3afe80','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
