('rowid-13122','GHBC-REQ-013122','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.4','GHBC-C-003644','Below this level a linear variation of, w, should be assumed; the value at first floor level should be taken as 1.3 and 1.5 for planar and spatial frames respectively.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 8110","BS 8110"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','713bc2ce76a7c46416e5d2b72bc7b315301613c4aefbc475e3bcdcbddc493bc2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
