('rowid-13125','GHBC-REQ-013125','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.6.4','GHBC-C-003644','(ii) The end moments as calculated above shall be further amplified, if appropriate by the dynamic magnification factors, and by the n  1.10','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 8110","BS 8110"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa0a9ad7f4f0059d35717f2c6adb23e09a38c8013ae5bb3a9bea872c537e60cb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
