('rowid-13326','GHBC-REQ-013326','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003654','(Fig  17.10.8.3b) (iii) At exterior columns where a transverse beam of similar dimensions frames into column and where the beam reinforcement is to be anchored all reinforcement within that part of the slab which extends a distance of twice the slab thickness from each side of the column.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','42aa68bc4424f01b59ad4bed29d03d1df764156ad351e3903f141661613f2e27','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
