('rowid-13357','GHBC-REQ-013357','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.8.3.3','GHBC-C-003658','(1) General (a) The reinforcement ratio shall not be less than 0.01 or larger than 0.06 including the region of lap splices.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.01,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"nforcement ratio shall not be less than 0.01 or larger than 0.06 including"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.06,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"less than 0.01 or larger than 0.06 including the region of lap spli"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','dcadb019b2d510fa63940ad76f2aad5938f181dfe450729f0e16ab50ece8f2d2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13358','GHBC-REQ-013358','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.8.3.3','GHBC-C-003658','(b) For S400 steel, the reinforcement ratio outside the splices shall not be greater than 0.045.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":400,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"(b) For S400 steel, the reinforcement ratio "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e867f465555a6fdc3afbce5ed361152724a465c583bdd10dfc0aa32d6c281023','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
