('rowid-13405','GHBC-REQ-013405','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.8.4.1','GHBC-C-003661','(1) DL I and DL II Structures The horizontal transverse confinement reinforcement in beam - column joints shall not be less than that required for the columns.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','36840745466e8bccc549e0ad2c130b4086eff95dcc6042b30bf03511acb7a55f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13406','GHBC-REQ-013406','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.8.4.1','GHBC-C-003661','(2) DL III Structures (a) The horizontal transverse confinement reinforcement in beam - column joints shall not be less than that required for the columns with the exception of joints connecting beams at all four column faces that are designed according to Clause 17.10.7.2(1)(b)(ii) or (iii) in which case the transverse joint reinforcement may be reduced to one half of that required for the columns, but in no case  shall the stirrup tie spacing in the joint core exceed ten  times the diameter of the column bar, or 200 mm, whichever is less.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":200,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"iameter of the column bar, or 200 mm, whichever is less."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cc8b2e3f8bf4b0f087bad7286345751584924795b457857f76ba09ce8a30f006','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13407','GHBC-REQ-013407','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.8.4.1','GHBC-C-003661','(b) When the width of the column is larger than the effective joint width specified in in Clause 17.10.7.2(1)(a), all flexural reinforcement in the column that is required to interact with the narrow beam shall be placed within the effective joint area, bj.hc.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b9c494f3dcd7b801a0687b9a95d2388c5845113934f5350434cbf80813566709','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13408','GHBC-REQ-013408','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.8.4.1','GHBC-C-003661','Additional longitudinal column reinforcement shall be placed outside this effective area','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','276fd8118c939a3e08ebab2acce7f73bb26661cecc4e41d4f667e14e725c6afe','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13409','GHBC-REQ-013409','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.8.5.1','GHBC-C-003663','(1) General (i) Wall thickness shall not be less than 150 mm.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":150,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":") Wall thickness shall not be less than 150 mm."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ckness shall not be less than 150 mm."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c774018c685c3b4e18ad1ddf11d2cad6d4a2b6cd1c260d7c7a7f7a91bb8a128a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13410','GHBC-REQ-013410','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.8.5.1','GHBC-C-003663','(ii) Openings in the walls not regularly arranged to form coupled walls shall be preferably avoided, unless their influence on the behaviour, of the wall under seismic action is either insignificant or accounted for by rational analysis (2) DL III Structures In addition to the requirements in 17.10.8.5.1 (1) - DL III structures shall also satisfy the following.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c4799efa3fe6cd9e9bf72d21dccc0b79375461f5902c8af89624e9b93aec78a1','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
