('rowid-13412','GHBC-REQ-013412','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'17.10.8.5.1','GHBC-C-003663','(b) the local thickness of a wall shall not be less than hn/10 (hn is storey height) wherever the maximum compressive strain exceeds the value εcu /3, unless (i) the distance of the critical fibre (ie where εcu = εcu /3 ) from the wall edge is smaller than 2b or','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a59d048269f2cd2896947ede10103350f58f75687ca67813eaf76f119c5e4321','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13413','GHBC-REQ-013413','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'0.2','GHBC-C-003664','(ii) the distance of the critical fibre from a transverse wall, or from a flange the width of which is at least hn/5 is smaller than 3b (see Figs.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9d673614f7b95ef8da89c2ffa1fc42712b490eb2db80c046509c709cf83d6356','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
