('rowid-13417','GHBC-REQ-013417','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'1.7.5.1','GHBC-C-003665','(b) At least two orthogonal grids of reinforcement shall be used one near each side of the wall (c) The diameter of the bars used in any part of a wall shall not exceed b/10 (d) The maximum spacing between bars shall be 300mm except where the clause is required to be confined, in which case the spacing shall not exceed 200 mm.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"spacing between bars shall be 300mm except where the clause is re"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":200,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" the spacing shall not exceed 200 mm."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b3ccdb91542312d0d2cceefac8a0aeed88148d472aae674c445e4cd83f78db24','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13418','GHBC-REQ-013418','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'1.7.5.1','GHBC-C-003665','(e) Curtailing: Vertical flexural reinforcement shall be curtailed in accordance with the bending moment envelope, allowing for the development lengths of the curtailed bars.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93dfccfb46701061d2bf1cb7a4b5da2f3fb0cd6ba5d48cd2db109c08fb1a83ad','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13419','GHBC-REQ-013419','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'1.7.5.1','GHBC-C-003665','(f) Splicing: Splicing of the vertical reinforcement in potential areas of yielding (See 17.10.8.5.3(1)) shall be avoided whenever possible.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e868d6024ee103352691429406eed99f9b522b4747ad9fbc54ee76699eaf5728','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-13420','GHBC-REQ-013420','GS 1207:2018',17,NULL,'1.7.5.1','GHBC-C-003665','In no case shall more than one third of such reinforcement be spliced in those areas.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a32474fe92d671c72f0ee2049d1fe88d54a26c2ff40c479589185b03cb7c1f10','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
