('rowid-13725','GHBC-REQ-013725','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.4','18.4.5','GHBC-C-003695','Unless such fill is placed, compacted and sloped to minimize shifting, slumping and erosion during the rise and fall of flood water and, as applicable, wave action.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ead388d43bbc17bc6cedb2d5f0ea0454035958c3f62c6a0a5c69f9cb5cf4a1dc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
