('rowid-13825','GHBC-REQ-013825','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.7','18.7.1.6.2','GHBC-C-003729','Vertical reinforcement, where required, shall be placed nearest the inside face of the wall a distance, d, from the outside face (soil face) of the wall.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','09b04540b09556bc08f72038f397e2e6553b1dd3450f79ef8a1308ab3f3fb3f1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
