('rowid-13939','GHBC-REQ-013939','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.7','18.7.3.1','GHBC-C-003738','Posts embedded in earth shall not be used to provide lateral support for structural or nonstructural materials such as plaster, masonry or concrete unless bracing is provided that develops the limited deflection required.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','74ef25ae6625278c376c3b773a5b824b65e3c7c879f64611316cbeb5d1e9d3d5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
