('rowid-13989','GHBC-REQ-013989','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.8','18.8.6.1','GHBC-C-003752','Foundations placed on or within the active zone of expansive soils shall be designed to resist differential volume changes and to prevent structural damage to the supported structure.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','10e9724cf2e1895a24a06d80495853b6e6ebd1c9d623d4b256e5f11b21901752','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
