('rowid-14008','GHBC-REQ-014008','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.8','18.8.7.1','GHBC-C-003757','Where the existing slope is steeper than one unit vertical in one unit horizontal (100percent slope), the toe of the slope shall be assumed to be at the interclause of a horizontal plane drawn from the top of the foundation and a plane drawn tangent to the slope at an angle of 45 degrees (0.79 rad) to the horizontal.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":100,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"tical in one unit horizontal (100percent slope), the toe of the slope "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','091da94e11031636fc6966ccea7225c209d6d81959fd396e71b98cd38d6fe586','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
