('rowid-14153','GHBC-REQ-014153','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.2.4.1','GHBC-C-003788','Cast-in-place deep foundation elements with a minimum longitudinal reinforcement ratio of 0.005 extending the full length of the element and detailed in accordance with Clauses 18.7.5.2, 18.7.5.3 and 18.7.5.4 of ACI 318 as required by Clause 18.10.3.9.4.2.2.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Deep foundation elements that satisfy the following additional detailing requirements shall be deemed to comply with the curvature capacity requirements of this clause."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fd9b0034159c54254291d1b29393cd3c04664dc46fdd0d81c12a36e488509340','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14154','GHBC-REQ-014154','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.2.4.1','GHBC-C-003788','EXCEPTIONS: Deep foundation elements that satisfy the following additional detailing requirements shall be deemed to comply with the curvature capacity requirements of this clause.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Deep foundation elements that satisfy the following additional detailing requirements shall be deemed to comply with the curvature capacity requirements of this clause."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9e222e99156e5ad97f8273719f7727ef1454bc4424d8ff73c81f9ae5da12ab9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14155','GHBC-REQ-014155','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.2.5','GHBC-C-003789','The analysis shall include group effects on lateral behaviour where the centre-to-centre spacing of deep foundation elements in the','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','53ce28b20a09c0f83cfeb67f6872e04d2e6c7de1aaba0522a8acc0a700d69435','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14156','GHBC-REQ-014156','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.2.5','GHBC-C-003789','direction of lateral force is less than eight times the least horizontal dimension of an element.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3b2f33a231e2105f4ef8cb238dd8f2409ac9adac6a0d20efce02acc08105d5da','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14157','GHBC-REQ-014157','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.2.5','GHBC-C-003789','The analysis shall include group effects on axial behaviour where the centre-to-centre spacing of deep foundation elements is less than three times the least horizontal dimension of an element.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d5b129627cece8eb91ad181299c823a2d50660e8e384f7c5907ca0dd57c1e92e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14158','GHBC-REQ-014158','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.2.5','GHBC-C-003789','Group effects shall be evaluated using a generally accepted method of analysis; the analysis for uplift of grouped elements with centre-to-centre spacing less than three times the least horizontal dimension of an element shall be evaluated in accordance with Clause 18.10.3.3.1.6.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db10459ac2ecafe43e945a6b425d2b65abbe10a13439d0e7aa7d0de1b40c0384','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14159','GHBC-REQ-014159','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3','GHBC-C-003790','Deep foundations shall be designed and detailed in accordance with Clauses 18.10.3.1 through 18.10.3.13.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93695e5328f59b641a610abc87d178ef32787b2d9c71d5c96350dc22bdc3e3e0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14160','GHBC-REQ-014160','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.1','GHBC-C-003791','Design of deep foundations shall include the design conditions specified in Clauses 18.10.3.1.1 through 18.10.3.1.6, as applicable.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a6adedfb6ab1e33e3c4aa6f9afc5eaf97795eb70bb5235a9bcdcce4d4d4cc297','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
