('rowid-14162','GHBC-REQ-014162','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.1.1','GHBC-C-003792','Where concrete deep foundations are laterally supported in accordance with Clause 18.10.2.1 for the entire height and applied forces cause bending moments not greater than those resulting from accidental eccentricities, structural design of the element using the load combinations of this Code and the allowable stresses specified in this part shall be permitted.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','25a7f2f317ee243290becd398d367cda4a6134822b3d547cce9d71ca5062e363','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14163','GHBC-REQ-014163','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.1.1','GHBC-C-003792','Otherwise, the structural design of concrete deep foundation elements shall use the load combinations of this Code and approved strength design methods.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc7e86644d0c3696c0d9bcf5069a0561405bb481a0f257251671e3e8911cff2b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14164','GHBC-REQ-014164','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.1.2','GHBC-C-003793','Where a single deep foundation element comprises two or more clauses of different materials or different types spliced together, each clause of the composite assembly shall satisfy the applicable requirements of this Code, and the maximum allowable load in each clause','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e96a206c06b769db6c709869839ab32e6ab234d643aaa53fd06f2d9d5a24768','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14165','GHBC-REQ-014165','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.1.2','GHBC-C-003793','shall be limited by the structural capacity of that clause.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ead8422a35d94595fbd9f8b50848b804fdb70f31fa37275dc9d0982bb63939df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14166','GHBC-REQ-014166','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.1.3','GHBC-C-003794','The foundation or superstructure shall be designed to resist the effects of the mislocation of any deep foundation element by not less than 76 mm (3 inches).','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":76,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"ny deep foundation element by not less than 76 mm (3 inches)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":76,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"tion element by not less than 76 mm (3 inches)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"ement by not less than 76 mm (3 inches)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','096eca319587a7ed3fd94d89cd6b849366f6eebfafab82a7be68035645ff3b40','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14167','GHBC-REQ-014167','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.1.3','GHBC-C-003794','To resist the effects of mislocation, compressive overload of deep foundation elements to 110 percent of the allowable design load shall be permitted.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":110,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"f deep foundation elements to 110 percent of the allowable design load "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8ae9caec2106261109e4a958759cbd7efe321a82ffcd5e68b4dee0c9f72c0074','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14168','GHBC-REQ-014168','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.1.4','GHBC-C-003795','Driven piles shall be designed and manufactured in accordance with accepted engineering practice to resist all stresses induced by handling, driving and service loads.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','028a7f398b0dccc0039cf290e02b6457211ec22b7a372cbb05779084b404a5a4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14169','GHBC-REQ-014169','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.1.5','GHBC-C-003796','Helical piles shall be designed and manufactured in accordance with accepted engineering practice to resist all stresses induced by installation into the ground and service loads.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','baf9e1eceafdcf6c34c01e68d4615880476f61ab6a43357cbe47e7d4495ce778','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14170','GHBC-REQ-014170','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.1.6','GHBC-C-003797','Temporary and permanent casings shall be of steel and shall be sufficiently strong to resist collapse and sufficiently water tight to exclude any foreign materials during the placing of concrete.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','529c4ad68478f4dbd467e64e6ef781ab50b1c69c072e62eefd20cc447d94eb5d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
