('rowid-14324','GHBC-REQ-014324','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.6','GHBC-C-003834','Splices shall be constructed so as to provide and maintain true alignment and position of the component parts of the deep foundation element during installation and subsequent thereto and shall be designed to resist the axial and shear forces and moments occurring at the location of the splice during driving and for design load combinations.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d1a00f3280bd89dcc4ebf8a5183ecff6b4ae54a1d5be5d2f6b02daae4c493351','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
