('rowid-14515','GHBC-REQ-014515','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.9.6','GHBC-C-003852','Socketed drilled shafts shall have reinforcement or a structural steel core for the length as indicated by an approved method of analysis.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','985fa4a093add94dadfa39bc66b4b79a87b3af2de8190a7b88398b460a72493b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14516','GHBC-REQ-014516','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.9.6','GHBC-C-003852','The depth of the rock socket shall be sufficient to develop the full load-bearing capacity of the element with a minimum safety factor of two, but the depth shall be not less than the outside diameter of the pipe or tube casing.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b8cbc34a3b34090ee4371a40195d9aafc3e7c8a5de525dce3a5483cfe5d479bb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14517','GHBC-REQ-014517','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.9.6','GHBC-C-003852','The design of the rock socket is permitted to be predicated on the sum of the allowable load-bearing pressure on the bottom of the socket plus bond along the sides of the socket.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9ee9ebc47e3af2647cd8a3ccc9421587a3c2dbffad36b59a72a79ee1df3e132d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14518','GHBC-REQ-014518','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.9.6','GHBC-C-003852','Where a structural steel core is used, the gross cross-clauseal area of the core shall not exceed 25 percent of the gross area of the drilled shaft.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":" of the core shall not exceed 25 percent of the gross area of the dril"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fdb55447f06cf352d06fee73856dcc4407a0e3ee20bf376e0b5c5a2bfc0712c3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14519','GHBC-REQ-014519','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10','GHBC-C-003853','Micropiles shall be designed and detailed in accordance with Clauses 18.10.3.10.1 through 18.10.3.10.4.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','167455b2855cc96f09178c877a8b084bb82c32bd9ee88f4b282d9bba10d28ef1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14520','GHBC-REQ-014520','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.1','GHBC-C-003854','Micropiles shall develop their load-carrying capacity by means of a bond zone in soil, bedrock or a combination of soil and bedrock.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','23cd59ad0b164f343cb8759b2edad9fb5d2dbab25d86597363ce4603ff842f3b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-14521','GHBC-REQ-014521','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.1','GHBC-C-003854','Micropiles shall be grouted and have either a steel pipe or tube or steel reinforcement at every clause along the length.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2d13fa04aceb3763400a7bd6d5af24691dada813149b2749ed74c0918934196','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14522','GHBC-REQ-014522','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.1','GHBC-C-003854','It shall be permitted to transition from deformed reinforcing bars to steel pipe or tube reinforcement by extending the bars into the pipe or tube clause by not less than their development length in tension in accordance with ACI 3.18.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','495eabf296e168a86752705b53277f11883425c6d0ecc0f4455a7542e41fc5b9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14523','GHBC-REQ-014523','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.2','GHBC-C-003855','Reinforcement shall consist of deformed reinforcing bars in accordance with ASTM A615 Grade 60 or 75 or ASTM A722 Grade 150.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9405b02e4c082f2b2c07fc7a79b0cdb27e6dc3e87d2dcaf7ced8dae7f99dd5a4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14524','GHBC-REQ-014524','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.2','GHBC-C-003855','The steel pipe or tube shall have a minimum wall thickness of 4.8 mm (3/16 inch).','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4.8,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"e a minimum wall thickness of 4.8 mm (3/16 inch)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":16,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"m wall thickness of 4.8 mm (3/16 inch)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ac533e0b9d5b0640d5125bafb86235c627bb4625b3c5fd716c6a7aadf2fc946d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14525','GHBC-REQ-014525','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.2','GHBC-C-003855','Splices shall comply with Clause 18.10.3.6.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b81f64598440ba720e58a4f472f5707c19bea4101e69bb9c73534a40366df7e6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14526','GHBC-REQ-014526','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.2','GHBC-C-003855','The steel pipe or tube shall have a minimum yield strength of 310 MPa (45,000 psi) and a minimum elongation of 15 percent as shown by mill certifications or two coupon test samples per 18 160 kg (40,000 pounds) of pipe or tube.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":310,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"e a minimum yield strength of 310 MPa (45,000 psi) and a minimum "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":") and a minimum elongation of 15 percent as shown by mill certificatio"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":160,"unit":"kg","operator":null,"context":"wo coupon test samples per 18 160 kg (40,000 pounds) of pipe or tu"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','390383c46675c583b21b98c0aff52845e5b5baeea9ecd7bd1b519de7d29eb76d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14527','GHBC-REQ-014527','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.3','GHBC-C-003856','For micropiles or portions thereof grouted inside a temporary or permanent casing or inside a hole drilled into bedrock or a hole drilled with grout, the steel pipe or tube or steel reinforcement shall be designed to carry not less than 40 percent of the design compression load.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":40,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"nt shall be designed to carry not less than 40 percent of the design compres"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":40,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"signed to carry not less than 40 percent of the design compression loa"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7e8585d4a9fef6a69d9ac8ba1843e9aa41a8dc6c925db2cd107cb3726b596b73','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14528','GHBC-REQ-014528','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.3','GHBC-C-003856','Micropiles or portions thereof grouted in an open hole in soil without temporary or permanent casing and without suitable means of verifying','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b98be1f0f2547a18744575a461fb1c0c8f676675d2fd0127b4e847beb5d2044e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14529','GHBC-REQ-014529','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.3','GHBC-C-003856','the hole diameter during grouting shall be designed to carry the entire compression load in the reinforcing steel.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d129253e7beee8c0eb00fb55e3987afd7eff828769c3a8882acfe9a271df15c3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14530','GHBC-REQ-014530','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.3','GHBC-C-003856','Where a steel pipe or tube is used for reinforcement, the portion of the grout enclosed within the pipe is permitted to be included in the determination of the allowable stress in the grout.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8cbd902514cb0858021c52500665e296408b77e3b3579265d02d1ed67dd83cbd','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-14531','GHBC-REQ-014531','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.4','GHBC-C-003857','For structures assigned to Seismic Design Category C, a permanent steel casing shall be provided from the top of the micropile down to the point of zero curvature.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a349679ad179381f2c1793e91304ae9cdcdecafde76737419244448702afb69e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14532','GHBC-REQ-014532','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.4','GHBC-C-003857','For structures assigned to Seismic Design Category D, E or F, the micropile shall be considered as an alternative system in accordance with this Code.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5266377e12f536b7e1124940671b212ff5ad416aa9986eddee8c7bc2c3846fb5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14533','GHBC-REQ-014533','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.10.4','GHBC-C-003857','The alternative system design, supporting documentation and test data shall be submitted to the building official for review and approval.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','df33da2506dc4324eb988c0f4c316673518b3b105122fe665a469ffb8e00f201','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14534','GHBC-REQ-014534','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11','GHBC-C-003858','Pile caps shall be of reinforced concrete, and shall include all elements to which vertical deep foundation elements are connected, including grade beams and mats.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7806174f7bb5789a7c73dc46d8944db0fd2c00e21f97c707b4b3527fc6714c64','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14535','GHBC-REQ-014535','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11','GHBC-C-003858','The soil immediately below the pile cap shall not be considered as carrying any vertical load, with the exception of a combined pile raft.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8e96b9a1faaa0c205af46e3012f57e9bd764996a8d278b6340d61eef16e47ac5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14536','GHBC-REQ-014536','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11','GHBC-C-003858','The tops of vertical deep foundation elements shall be embedded not less than 76 mm (3 inches) into pile caps and the caps shall extend not less than 102 mm (4 inches) beyond the edges of the elements.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":76,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"on elements shall be embedded not less than 76 mm (3 inches) into pile caps "},{"parameter":"comparison","value":102,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"aps and the caps shall extend not less than 102 mm (4 inches) beyond the edge"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":76,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"all be embedded not less than 76 mm (3 inches) into pile caps and"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"embedded not less than 76 mm (3 inches) into pile caps and the c"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":102,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ps shall extend not less than 102 mm (4 inches) beyond the edges o"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" extend not less than 102 mm (4 inches) beyond the edges of the "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a32e8413756e170cee98b015b6d2f99e945105dd3d18ed51119ced00e7a94e4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14537','GHBC-REQ-014537','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11','GHBC-C-003858','The tops of elements shall be cut or chipped back to sound material before capping.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','604990252e3cf7ab72707414663b09987b0e53d7747cbf93079ef6659001e795','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14538','GHBC-REQ-014538','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.1','GHBC-C-003859','through F.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','859bda174e906e6defb3ecf4952e874aa6e53b8190d074387353ce5ea990d411','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14539','GHBC-REQ-014539','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.1','GHBC-C-003859','For structures assigned to Seismic Design Category C, D, E or F, concrete deep foundation elements shall be connected to the pile cap by embedding the element reinforcement or fieldplaced dowels anchored in the element into the pile cap for a distance equal to their development length in accordance with ACI 318.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','141b301285568847e8dad2e21bd15468b49969aba1381aaf758d05ecb16e60ed','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14540','GHBC-REQ-014540','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.1','GHBC-C-003859','It shall be permitted to connect precast prestressed piles to the pile cap by developing the element prestressing strands into the pile cap provided that the connection is ductile.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c412447c01e9cba5288b3a4e20bde22644c96c04e77eb7f26316440c03626cce','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-14541','GHBC-REQ-014541','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.1','GHBC-C-003859','For deformed bars, the development length is the full development length for compression, or','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ecd00e0c0d4310c8b73ca9be5f56036c2106b91d1002937f19889262b3c037fc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14542','GHBC-REQ-014542','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.1','GHBC-C-003859','tension in the case of uplift, without reduction for excess reinforcement in accordance with Clause 25.4.10 of ACI 318.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be834c71892cba090522df3eaf7bf29621f10143109cd424425022f967c4a3af','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14543','GHBC-REQ-014543','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.1','GHBC-C-003859','Alternative measures for laterally confining concrete and maintaining toughness and ductile-like behavior at the top of the element shall be permitted provided that the design is such that any hinging occurs in the confined region.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e584b59616307053059f669814810e87066fcb3f17f65a24fef26f41b6ab80a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
