('rowid-14545','GHBC-REQ-014545','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.1','GHBC-C-003859','For resistance to uplift forces, anchorage of steel pipes, tubes or H-piles to the pile cap shall be made by means other than concrete bond to the bare steel clause.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','03af5e53e5babd3419d87e257094c5301d8db52d5474565dde10514075664842','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14546','GHBC-REQ-014546','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.1','GHBC-C-003859','Concrete-filled steel pipes or tubes shall have reinforcement of not less than 0.01 times the cross-clauseal area of the concrete fill developed into the cap and extending into the fill a length equal to two times the required cap embedment, but not less than the development length in tension of the reinforcement.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.01,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"s shall have reinforcement of not less than 0.01 times the cross-clauseal area"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7e952b36f45245ccfbdc96f1218d47a563b5cad00abe72606c3c6e2e4e49359f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14547','GHBC-REQ-014547','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.2','GHBC-C-003860','through F.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The anchorage is permitted to be designed to resist the axial tension force resulting from the seismic load effects including overstrength factor in accordance with Clause 2.3.6 or 2.4.5 of ASCE 7."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ffa2c596432a2f1d3109eac448d6951e27ba9217139b29ee0acc8a22afce387','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14548','GHBC-REQ-014548','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.2','GHBC-C-003860','For structures assigned to Seismic Design Category D, E or F, deep foundation element resistance to uplift forces or rotational restraint shall be provided by anchorage into the pile cap, designed considering the combined effect of axial forces due to uplift and bending moments due to fixity to the pile cap.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The anchorage is permitted to be designed to resist the axial tension force resulting from the seismic load effects including overstrength factor in accordance with Clause 2.3.6 or 2.4.5 of ASCE 7."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','58da0fddbdc2eb2ef244d75d2c10ce355c2efb876a7b990cd9182d3c5ab64d30','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14549','GHBC-REQ-014549','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.2','GHBC-C-003860','Anchorage shall develop not less than 25 percent of the strength of the element in tension.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The anchorage is permitted to be designed to resist the axial tension force resulting from the seismic load effects including overstrength factor in accordance with Clause 2.3.6 or 2.4.5 of ASCE 7."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":25,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"Anchorage shall develop not less than 25 percent of the strength of th"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"e shall develop not less than 25 percent of the strength of the elemen"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be81384befbde4d50c6d07670c49ea196c8567ee99c7d4a6fc1044d56b57d7e7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14550','GHBC-REQ-014550','GS 1207:2018',18,'18.10','18.10.3.11.2','GHBC-C-003860','Anchorage into the pile cap shall comply with the following:','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The anchorage is permitted to be designed to resist the axial tension force resulting from the seismic load effects including overstrength factor in accordance with Clause 2.3.6 or 2.4.5 of ASCE 7."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','35b33c7ca9fcab09b5841de4f5f6bfb60e0e25a837bf3710c7a97f45fad0419a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
