('rowid-14639','GHBC-REQ-014639','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.1.1','GHBC-C-003883','The agency shall disclose to the Head of the works department and the registered design professional in responsible charge possible conflicts of interest so that objectivity can be confirmed.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7d1c8e699fc3ee200a857c173df234107704f936278bf3e2b1bd59554495c824','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14640','GHBC-REQ-014640','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.1.2','GHBC-C-003884','An approved agency shall have adequate equipment to perform required tests.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2a0e66462d61728f686781e2a4739ed37eacd2ab7a3504cfdf41955c38e84e1b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-14641','GHBC-REQ-014641','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.1.2','GHBC-C-003884','The equipment shall be periodically calibrated by an approved agency.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1d1ced2cc42800ff916d7ed990b69a7866ec0c3ff3761b5e1e5e117f8a532222','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14642','GHBC-REQ-014642','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.1.3','GHBC-C-003885','An approved agency shall employ experienced personnel educated in conducting, supervising and evaluating tests and special inspections.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b885a51612280b47b89d52877fa031455c462b84ff8f6fbbb7fe3fac96be5096','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14643','GHBC-REQ-014643','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.2','GHBC-C-003886','Any material, appliance, equipment, system or method of construction meeting the requirements of this Code shall be approved in writing after satisfactory completion of the required tests and submission of required test reports.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0bb58a16f1246084dd76613ab9bc7ac3725c5206c558e72212d5fa17fbac9c6f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14644','GHBC-REQ-014644','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.3','GHBC-C-003887','For any material, appliance, equipment, system or method of construction that has been approved, a record of such approval, including the conditions and limitations of the approval, shall be kept on file in the Head of the works department‘s office and shall be available for public review at appropriate times.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5c38d2bf56a8d91b32d801aa58ae330fa09302f47f28ec89acac43fb6f3f7c06','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14645','GHBC-REQ-014645','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.4','GHBC-C-003888','Specific information consisting of test reports conducted by an approved agency in accordance with the appropriate referenced standards, or other such information as necessary, shall be provided for the Head of the works department to determine that the product, material or assembly meets the applicable Code requirements.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9e96e5c78c7d976fda23a4b5aae20dbdab50cebc2c01f18c37cd5885547b394b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14646','GHBC-REQ-014646','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.4.1','GHBC-C-003889','Sufficient technical data shall be submitted to the Head of the works department to substantiate the proposed use of any product, material or assembly.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5ad452f5e19c6e84a02ee99892aad41e07a93279443e6f31aa074d17783a0ea0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14647','GHBC-REQ-014647','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.4.1','GHBC-C-003889','If it is determined that the evidence submitted is satisfactory proof of performance for the use intended, the Head of the works department shall approve the use of the product, material or assembly subject to the requirements of this Code.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4cbef49d52358b4c47dc271d94991acbdb76509c922c22a9a567a5477d57163c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14648','GHBC-REQ-014648','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.4.1','GHBC-C-003889','The costs, reports and investigations required under these provisions shall be paid by the owner or the owner‘s authorized agent.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6124000cfc74725ecefcb8a69f5edc9961fc6e132a781fc023f7b9e7b71f9a30','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14649','GHBC-REQ-014649','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.4.2','GHBC-C-003890','Supporting data, where necessary to assist in the approval of products, materials or assemblies not specifically provided for in this Code, shall consist of valid research reports from approved sources.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b959778539108e458fd7483aa2881e42710c9d4317e782eb6f8c70492dc6d856','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14650','GHBC-REQ-014650','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.5','GHBC-C-003891','Products, materials or assemblies required to be labelled shall be labelled in accordance with the procedures set forth in Clauses 19.3.5.1 through 19.3.5.4 and in the provision of LI 1541 (Ghana Standard General labelling rules).','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f4e5b15ee78a2b64501231771864132d37177bbae3d6ff8491506cc7f53a0007','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-14651','GHBC-REQ-014651','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.5.1','GHBC-C-003892','An approved agency shall test a representative sample of the product, material or assembly being labelled to the relevant standard or standards.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d79dd5ec9eb215aa00c9003a69fac80af1ba2c343c05f81739728414662edae8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14652','GHBC-REQ-014652','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.5.1','GHBC-C-003892','The approved agency shall maintain a record of the tests performed.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4cc7d128a33e901095ea64a9d626c574ec14f9434a2f14c7f7984cedc13093b6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14653','GHBC-REQ-014653','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.5.1','GHBC-C-003892','The record shall provide sufficient detail to verify compliance with the test standard.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2e73aad75e35a82ee5acb3fc6eb9f508134b8c4147a9489967359adf43a3f317','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14654','GHBC-REQ-014654','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.5.2','GHBC-C-003893','The approved agency shall periodically perform an inspection, which shall be in-plant if necessary, of the product or material that is to be labelled.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d56ff650f7856e7e2ba4a3b9f170e056ad35fd6d1e6740765a07a3f967c57a0d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14655','GHBC-REQ-014655','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.5.2','GHBC-C-003893','The inspection shall verify that the labelled product, material or assembly is representative of the product, material or assembly tested.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db88971cae5067ad385d31c7117bbff83d580e8582f84383f06232408e0e7e13','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14656','GHBC-REQ-014656','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.5.3','GHBC-C-003894','The label shall contain the manufacturer‘s identification, model number, serial number or definitive information describing the performance characteristics of the product, material or assembly and the approved agency‘s identification.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','36727025e38ff747fb3ec48d6d7eab662700dd67ab79503fecf8e175d9052bda','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14657','GHBC-REQ-014657','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.5.4','GHBC-C-003895','Information required to be permanently identified on the product, material or assembly shall be acid etched, sand blasted, ceramic fired, laser etched, embossed or of a type that, once applied, cannot be removed without being destroyed.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eec00698109e8111138fe131846e05c730626d8a004e4a3300a94632ce5340e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14658','GHBC-REQ-014658','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.6','GHBC-C-003896','services.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c501863801fab66a99d7a4288d3f7fc580b90150410855d9809d6ff570293f55','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14659','GHBC-REQ-014659','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.6','GHBC-C-003896','Where structural components or other items regulated by this Code are not visible for inspection after completion of a prefabricated assembly, the owner or the owner‘s authorized agent shall submit a report of each prefabricated assembly.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c53f8a4ce67f03cad72e2a8eb84c43b32157dabf4644b1fda783dfaf9a289c89','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14660','GHBC-REQ-014660','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.3','19.3.6','GHBC-C-003896','The report shall indicate the complete details of the assembly, including a description of the assembly and its components, the basis upon which the assembly is being evaluated, test results and similar information and other data as necessary for the Head of the works department to determine conformance to this Code.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f424cd4d3011755b3976935ff29aeda25b0097b48ab762153855b05b0eb68b6d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
