('rowid-14665','GHBC-REQ-014665','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.4','19.4.2','GHBC-C-003900','Where application is made to the Head of Works for construction as specified in this Code, the owner or the owner‘s authorized agent, other than the contractor, shall employ one or more approved agencies to provide special inspections and tests during construction on the types of work specified in Clause 19.5 and identify the approved agencies to the Head of Works.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1443c67daffd0ac4846c2431bab27b219a670071c27326c4f0eee3d93700aa2f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14666','GHBC-REQ-014666','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.4','19.4.2','GHBC-C-003900','These special inspections and tests are in addition to the inspections by the Head of Works that are identified in this Code','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f18fbc5af180fe336bdf3a9be6e196b12e5c6a7853568fdc46e2815f2fc0ca08','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
