('rowid-14672','GHBC-REQ-014672','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.4','19.4.2','GHBC-C-003900','construction provisions of Clause 23.11.1.2 or the conventional light-frame construction provisions of Clause 24.8.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','081dbd5ae01cd25faa9e3c76f79c6d92b7a4693723776481408452c26eb84e98','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14673','GHBC-REQ-014673','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.4','19.4.2','GHBC-C-003900','3.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8704bedfa757009e5ad562739f3462b6ceae2af75df46498a30ab17b82eb7821','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14674','GHBC-REQ-014674','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.4','19.4.2','GHBC-C-003900','The contractor shall employ the approved agencies where the contractor is also the owner.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4bb312b2f0db1604ab56de836286629a2ef1b838a2528a464ccec76092ad5d4f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14675','GHBC-REQ-014675','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.4','19.4.2.1','GHBC-C-003901','Prior to the start of the construction, the approved agencies shall provide written documentation to the Head of Works demonstrating the competence and relevant experience or training of the special inspectors who will perform the special inspections and tests during construction.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fb1f488e61b4d4847772be16c70daa1cdad254cce9d7344d9f2a1f8eeabdbd2e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
