('rowid-14678','GHBC-REQ-014678','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.4','19.4.2.1','GHBC-C-003901','The registered design professional in responsible charge and engineers of record involved in the design of the project are permitted to act as the approved agency and their personnel are permitted to act as special inspectors for the work designed by them, provided they qualify as special inspectors.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','944743ea16295072b600603faf19ad18bdf855cb27bfaaf3df6d73d16fad3c17','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-14679','GHBC-REQ-014679','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.4','19.4.2.2','GHBC-C-003902','The construction or work for which special inspection or testing is required shall remain accessible and exposed for special inspection or testing purposes until completion of the required special inspections or tests.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9cf321232e27686f81ad69307c678e16a9c912a964aadd5d9e7adafab38e577','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
