('rowid-14689','GHBC-REQ-014689','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.4','19.4.2.4','GHBC-C-003904','A final report documenting required special inspections and tests, and correction of any discrepancies noted in the inspections or tests, shall be submitted at a point in time agreed upon prior to the start of work by the owner or the owner‘s authorized agent to the Head of the works department.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d6392f42bda1a7f494f50626b14c784676c819eb8d86171af75d91b8535d5faf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
