('rowid-14696','GHBC-REQ-014696','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.4','19.4.3','GHBC-C-003907','Where special inspections or tests are required by Clause 19.5, the registered design professional in responsible charge shall prepare a statement of special inspections in accordance with Clause 19.4.3.1 for Submission by the applicant in accordance with Clause 19.4.2.3.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The statement of special inspections is permitted to be prepared by a qualified person approved by the Head of the works department for construction not designed by a registered design professional."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','14f5d39438cc3a469f537e4abe0d5fb86025e62a0f65cedc817612cfd9ba814e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
