('rowid-14825','GHBC-REQ-014825','GS 1207:2018',19,NULL,'19.5.6','GHBC-C-003931','Special inspections and tests of existing site soil conditions, fill placement and load-bearing requirements shall be performed in accordance with this clause and Table 19.5.6.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where Clause 18.3 does not require reporting of materials and procedures for fill placement, the special inspector shall verify that the in-place dry density of the compacted fill is not less than 90 percent of the maximum dry density at optimum moisture content determined in accordance with ASTM D1557."]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8df6d80aee92ceb10d5a8d51a39c2508114520e4b1effe048a4554544f591ff6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
