('rowid-15033','GHBC-REQ-015033','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.1','GHBC-C-003985','Where a referenced material standard contains an applicable load test procedure and acceptance criteria, the test procedure and acceptance criteria in the standard shall apply.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','520087df027f81ae55c5fe9adcbdf92d2ca15ccf3b2a5d1fb332d5c2407fb19b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15034','GHBC-REQ-015034','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.1','GHBC-C-003985','In the absence of specific load factors or acceptance criteria, the load factors and acceptance criteria in Clause 19.8.2.2 shall apply.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.2,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"tance criteria in Clause 19.8.2.2 shall apply."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9477e5f2129739144c8ba555e956b6013f8957cfebc59a2a0ea9041bfeafe628','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15035','GHBC-REQ-015035','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','In the absence of applicable load test procedures contained within a material standard referenced by this Code or acceptance criteria for a specific material or method of construction, such existing structure shall be subjected to an approved test procedure developed by a registered design professional that simulates applicable loading and deformation conditions.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ac4b4d1a66027f0f311e38518b03a9a25f5f1a62b94924594446d3c88792e600','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15036','GHBC-REQ-015036','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','For components that are not a part of the seismic force-resisting system, at a minimum the test load shall be equal to the specified factored design loads.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','80ae23b286b2c62cc93b100caa271127f2a8a7b8b470843f9e689d8c041d9e80','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15037','GHBC-REQ-015037','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','For materials such as wood that have strengths that are dependent on load duration, the test load shall be adjusted to account for the difference in load duration of the test compared to the expected duration of the design loads being considered.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bc52e6945549cb930113d516d913493a36044ce672aa5803e3e6e13239aa0c16','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15038','GHBC-REQ-015038','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','For statically loaded components, the test load shall be left in place for a period of 24 hours.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":24,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"left in place for a period of 24 hours."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7791c719f837bcffed5ae52226cda88ae94569f85f4d32f023d7b917a384c718','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15039','GHBC-REQ-015039','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','For components that carry dynamic loads (for example, machine supports or fall arrest anchors), the load shall be left in place for a period consistent with the component‘s actual function.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8ffa6fa01cac6c0162dc722b3f791aa1955576fd37bbd01c6aed980e240b4f2b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15040','GHBC-REQ-015040','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','The structure shall be considered to have successfully met the test requirements where the following criteria are satisfied:','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d75bf72e9e177df6d1d00ff0c88393be74ddeac139d1821e1074b1572c70c316','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
