('rowid-15042','GHBC-REQ-015042','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','Under the design load, the deflection shall not exceed the limitations specified in this Code.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','bde7ba6854d6febd6b07a067cd99ee72b70f69798e59068e6bf33b4f0498109d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15043','GHBC-REQ-015043','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d150288a6de52ae8e1184ad24a455dd02f7d847aab4f928b9f242b9e0ba50fe6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15044','GHBC-REQ-015044','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','Within 24 hours after removal of the test load, the structure shall have recovered not less than 75 percent of the maximum deflection.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":75,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"tructure shall have recovered not less than 75 percent of the maximum deflec"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":24,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"Within 24 hours after removal of the test"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":75,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":" have recovered not less than 75 percent of the maximum deflection."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','741f8781a99d6947f250ebdefd2d5b463fdf7a5c5815254a7f0657e7131f34f7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15045','GHBC-REQ-015045','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','3.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8048e371d3a63bc21b7aa5174de35a90fe04c28a42dc27d2a2612e6092056fb1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15046','GHBC-REQ-015046','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.8','19.8.2.2','GHBC-C-003986','During and immediately after the test, the structure shall not show evidence of failure.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','833caeccf0227c1526bd70466980bbae2132ad146d3ac0e3e1137f12d361b372','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15047','GHBC-REQ-015047','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.1','GHBC-C-003987','Where proposed construction is not capable of being designed by approved engineering analysis, or where proposed construction design method does not comply with the applicable material design standard, the system of construction or the structural unit and the connections shall be subjected to the tests prescribed in Clause 19.9.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d060a5bb76f660d81b450b5bb2101ef7b1e3f5e3f0bc38ab49d772bafba469db','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15048','GHBC-REQ-015048','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.1','GHBC-C-003987','The Head of the works department shall accept certified reports of such tests conducted by an approved testing agency, provided that such tests meet the requirements of this Code and approved procedures.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0a79add4d4d0a2760452609bbfb69f8a2325e4bb40807e716e7bfb31c52b163e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15049','GHBC-REQ-015049','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.2','GHBC-C-003988','Where specific load test procedures, load factors and acceptance criteria are included in the applicable referenced standards, such test procedures, load factors and acceptance criteria shall apply.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f4e8da06d8a57ef34a04acf1d4a17002bdf3b5d559eaab9f35109703ba622862','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15050','GHBC-REQ-015050','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.2','GHBC-C-003988','In the absence of specific test procedures, load factors or acceptance criteria, the corresponding provisions in Clause 19.9.3 shall apply.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":9.3,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"nding provisions in Clause 19.9.3 shall apply."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7c7fdbed02886008081b56b0c29c978f35bad9f9c356d111f053f09a203b499e','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-15051','GHBC-REQ-015051','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.3','GHBC-C-003989','Where load test procedures are not specified in the applicable referenced standards, the loadbearing and deformation capacity of structural components and assemblies shall be determined on the basis of a test procedure developed by a registered design professional that simulates applicable loading and deformation conditions.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','651b01729ec20852e8fce99a344fe6d60ebb94f5deb8bbf234c21a0c96471cc0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15052','GHBC-REQ-015052','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.3','GHBC-C-003989','For components and assemblies that are not a part of the seismic force-resisting system, the test shall be as specified in Clause 19.9.3.1.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','90e1c7958cabcd026b68471fc491d07945e115a58f01eb47c83a150396735a4b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15053','GHBC-REQ-015053','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.3','GHBC-C-003989','Load tests shall simulate the applicable loading conditions specified in this Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4e72fe6c5a405423011058957cdad107a01b62b90b915adb69bbb583042f7aef','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15054','GHBC-REQ-015054','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.3.1','GHBC-C-003990','The test assembly shall be subjected to an increasing superimposed load equal to not less than two times the superimposed design load.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9afd7dc3c911119318414fe3bf6858acc3198891077644a7a3c17a0b2278edb2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15055','GHBC-REQ-015055','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.3.1','GHBC-C-003990','The test load shall be left in place for a period of 24 hours.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":24,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"left in place for a period of 24 hours."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','79d7ee536a0e536938986de9c21dd9d1fdb98d624bcaef4ff2f6891775d18161','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15056','GHBC-REQ-015056','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.3.1','GHBC-C-003990','The tested assembly shall be considered to have successfully met the test requirements if the assembly recovers not less than 75 percent of the maximum deflection within 24 hours after the removal of the test load.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":75,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"ents if the assembly recovers not less than 75 percent of the maximum deflec"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":75,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"sembly recovers not less than 75 percent of the maximum deflection wit"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":24,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"the maximum deflection within 24 hours after the removal of the "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7f46eecf5216eba18c89935b61448fa6a6c89d8f9b093277d330d97c75065226','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15057','GHBC-REQ-015057','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.3.1','GHBC-C-003990','The test assembly shall then be reloaded and subjected to an increasing superimposed load until either structural failure occurs or the superimposed load is equal to two and one-half times the load at which the deflection limitations specified in Clause 19.9.3.2 were reached, or the load is equal to two and one-half times the superimposed design load.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6c57d06b352f2baa210304b9782f0dafb57bfaeb106e2ce0a3d318f77f82f6ea','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15058','GHBC-REQ-015058','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.3.1','GHBC-C-003990','In the case of structural components and assemblies for which deflection limitations are not specified in Clause 19.9.3.2, the test specimen shall be subjected to an increasing superimposed load until structural failure occurs or the load is equal to two and one-half times the desired superimposed design load.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8242a16c132352c317e9dd2ca6e777ed3f33093619e6fba6e7e78b4b4a62377d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15059','GHBC-REQ-015059','GS 1207:2018',19,'19.9','19.9.3.1','GHBC-C-003990','The allowable superimposed design load shall be taken as the lesser of:','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae1dd394657f8cbb68a6f58f0e9eaa1f5c1b66b508e9f2276718a0d05fb717cd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
