('rowid-15193','GHBC-REQ-015193','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','For particular uses, it may be necessary to specify the compressive strength at ages earlier or later than 28 days (e.g. for massive structural elements) or after storage under special conditions (e.g. heat treatment).','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":28,"unit":"days","operator":null,"context":"at ages earlier or later than 28 days (e.g. for massive structural "}]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4c71351ef6de4017791dc2e7a9dbb6c27b459575eaf1c823915037a833243ef6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
