('rowid-15195','GHBC-REQ-015195','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','(i) The aggregate portion shall be well graded from the nominal maximum size of stone down to the 125 micron size.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":125,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"mum size of stone down to the 125 micron size."}]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3934ddc68e4ad51c24348aa6c009854e71e8755e302d9a62ab84bcc06e451e58','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15196','GHBC-REQ-015196','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','(ii) The cement content shall be such as to achieve the strengths required but in any case not less than the minimum necessary for impermeability and durability shown in Table 20.3.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dae657220400ca51c6015997dd91a82261d47eff9fedfa99e46ea247f8c4d63e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15197','GHBC-REQ-015197','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','(iii) The workability shall be consistent with ease of placing and proper compaction having regard to the presence of reinforcement and other obstructions.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','267a47a061e2c4ef850a2586ef6e57e8500439edc2fbff82e2512ad87e0f8dad','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15198','GHBC-REQ-015198','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','(iv) The water/cement ratio shall be the minimum consistent with adequate workability but in any case not greater than that shown in Table 20.3 taking due account of any water contained in the aggregates.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b9c96e92ea3a2b8eaa49aa13b7a908a5296e2b3af454530d8a0a5b9ff43c1147','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15199','GHBC-REQ-015199','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','The Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent shall take into account that this requirement may in certain cases require the inclusion of a For each mix of concrete for which the Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent has proposed a design, he shall prepare three separate batches of concrete using the materials that have been approved for use in the Works and the mixing plant that he proposes to use for the Works.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3b6eae105d5eb8d59599dde096c7600df339818fe926fc5fe5c9368db791f17a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15200','GHBC-REQ-015200','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','The volume of each batch shall be the capacity of the concrete mixer proposed for full production.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d5231094a524dc38c56c33babec23d1d72b196484e5f2be43896f047440056d3','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
