('rowid-15205','GHBC-REQ-015205','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','(ii) Six test cubes or cylinders shall be cast for each age of concrete.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6a64291d71e6a60d59d440c47e1483fecd3ef125b70a48d4a87be4f4aa0c951f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15206','GHBC-REQ-015206','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','In the case of concrete having a maximum aggregate size of 40 mm or less, 150 mm cubes or 150 diameter by 300 mm high cylinders shall be used.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":40,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"g a maximum aggregate size of 40 mm or less, 150 mm cubes or 150 "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"regate size of 40 mm or less, 150 mm cubes or 150 diameter by 300 "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"0 mm cubes or 150 diameter by 300 mm high cylinders shall be used."}]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','06d6357fecd574124f0b41ef50d2f2682c21bc4cbaa8ad3a11d8efe107226f5c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15207','GHBC-REQ-015207','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','In the case of concrete containing 75 mm or larger aggregate, 200 mm cubes shall be used and aggregates larger than 63 mm shall be removed from the mixed concrete before casting the cubes.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":75,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"e case of concrete containing 75 mm or larger aggregate, 200 mm c"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":200,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ng 75 mm or larger aggregate, 200 mm cubes shall be used and aggre"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":63,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ed and aggregates larger than 63 mm shall be removed from the mix"}]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5a9f843af0966268b7b30a1fa836bfbab98ec9ae12edd8670e696ff3afdd688e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15208','GHBC-REQ-015208','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','(iii) Test samples shall be demoulded 24 hours after casting and cured in water at 27 ±2°C up to the time of testing.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":24,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"st samples shall be demoulded 24 hours after casting and cured i"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"°c","operator":null,"context":"ing and cured in water at 27 ±2°C up to the time of testing."}]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dd53f03062c156ca9b402a3356f1a32f7bdb1e71f1e5a2254adda25693e04d01','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15209','GHBC-REQ-015209','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','(iv) Three samples from each batch shall be tested for compressive strength at seven days and the remaining three at 28 days.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":28,"unit":"days","operator":null,"context":"ys and the remaining three at 28 days."}]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3415456ad8943da14faa90c1a13062eedfd56eedc0d85f590dfd5b6fdcb16e14','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15210','GHBC-REQ-015210','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.2','GHBC-C-004008','(v) The density of all the samples shall be determined before the strength tests are','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["EN 12390-3","EN 12350-2"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ea4b22f969df6a9e03c5dc45bf13764f2bed52b315e9a78dc1ba92f8fabb096b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
