('rowid-15235','GHBC-REQ-015235','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.7','GHBC-C-004012','Where pumping of concrete is approved by the Head of works, the concrete shall be so designed that suitable graded aggregate and admixtures are used to improve the pumpability of the mix.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ee2e19971058eb3ced793d903ed0dd1141d2ce950af19fec0f9ba22bcd3beb92','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15236','GHBC-REQ-015236','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.4.7','GHBC-C-004012','The shrinkage capacity of the concrete to be pumped shall not be higher than that of ordinary concrete mixes.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f53d651755c24d7738ae3ec37fbc6ca32fba836a4df72c21664c33a4dbe168b5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15237','GHBC-REQ-015237','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.5','GHBC-C-004013','OPERATIONS The Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent shall submit to the Head of works full details, including drawings, of all the plant that he proposes to use and the arrangements and procedures he proposes to follow, for batching, mixing, transporting, placing, compacting and finishing concrete, before such plant is ordered or delivered to Site.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 1305"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d59fa6d429674d42b23d47b218d64208001341ee1edac19d1957aedd5ff79877','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15238','GHBC-REQ-015238','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.5','GHBC-C-004013','Batching and mixing plants shall be modern and efficient equipment complying with the requirements of BS 1305 and capable of producing a uniform distribution of the','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 1305"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','695fca7c5b34fc43f3b8d72101683acd8df9c07b009f26e45b7e577651850087','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15239','GHBC-REQ-015239','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.5','GHBC-C-004013','Immersion vibrators shall operate at a frequency of between 7 000 and 10 000 cycles per minute.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 1305"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','67f221065c0c9a762f96f8010a9e5db8e336e6024abedbffb0dde42c79defc43','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15240','GHBC-REQ-015240','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.4','20.5','GHBC-C-004013','The Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent shall ensure that vibrators are operated at pressures and voltages not less then those recommended by the manufacturer in order that the compactive effort is not reduced.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["BS 1305"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','069089baf1d192f96f1aadc6f80c0d81378f5ae40423881fcc5c0d02b1944197','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-15241','GHBC-REQ-015241','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.6','20.6.1','GHBC-C-004014','The weighing and water dispensing mechanisms shall be maintained in good order.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c3475c12334a3f1e5e8b424bd158e20185d6d029a77578a4684750087fa9ecfb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15242','GHBC-REQ-015242','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.6','20.6.1','GHBC-C-004014','Their accuracy shall be maintained within the required tolerance and checked against accurate masses and volumes when required by the Head of works.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3fc3a1ef01b6b49350810f2fdbb7fea6f047f52461b6756b039b92ae0bdf5ad9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15243','GHBC-REQ-015243','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.6','20.6.1','GHBC-C-004014','The masses of cement and of each size of aggregate as indicated by the mechanisms employed shall be within a tolerance of plus or minus 2% of the respective masses per batch approved by the Head of works.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":" a tolerance of plus or minus 2% of the respective masses per "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e7fac27ef397ba4bcb83e0f3ae3bc54fbb0139c98c483fb63b6b3baa931ac57d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15244','GHBC-REQ-015244','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.6','20.6.1','GHBC-C-004014','The Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent shall provide standard test masses at least equivalent to the maximum working load used on the most heavily loaded scale and other auxiliary equipment required for checking the satisfactory operation of each scale or other measuring device.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6319928d1fe20cf676e3ea5946f66648e6ce268a7e63089973d7cb200256e882','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15245','GHBC-REQ-015245','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.6','20.6.1','GHBC-C-004014','Tests shall be made by the Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent at least once a week or at intervals to be determined by the Head of works and shall be carried out in his presence.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','60082c5653fa563bc2d73a71ee79bbb3e3226c593c9cce6115e8d9592e4fbfce','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15246','GHBC-REQ-015246','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.6','20.6.1','GHBC-C-004014','For the purpose of carrying out these tests, there shall be easy access for personnel to the weigh hoppers.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8db3083f9af1b5c1776eead68306c0fce66a87b8c53fc2cd791544de0f569dc4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15247','GHBC-REQ-015247','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.6','20.6.1','GHBC-C-004014','The Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent shall furnish the Head of works with copies of the complete results of all check tests and shall make any adjustments, repairs or replacements necessary to ensure satisfactory performance.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','184488972e19dc4ee4c08f8c11361696d8f8ac4d93a6481adb29ecaf0805d0b2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15248','GHBC-REQ-015248','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.6','20.6.2','GHBC-C-004015','Where cement is supplied in standard bags, the bag shall be assumed to contain 50 kg.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"kg","operator":null,"context":"g shall be assumed to contain 50 kg."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','da165906c7ef41b25fac6766b3fa9eb60a8689cdb23cac800c360147416cdf82','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15249','GHBC-REQ-015249','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.6','20.6.2','GHBC-C-004015','All cement taken from bulk containers or partly used bags shall be batched by mass, accurate to within 2% of the required mass.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":"d by mass, accurate to within 2% of the required mass."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','54a3d262d8f26ce9e6675f993fe59e502fc721066b489f68dcabd398f1016fd4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15250','GHBC-REQ-015250','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.6','20.6.2','GHBC-C-004015','The batching of cement in gauge boxes shall not be permitted.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6567430e749c22eb260748649781e1096f9dc843a7497ad10038b2df31f04dde','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
