('rowid-15448','GHBC-REQ-015448','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.16',NULL,'GHBC-C-004044','The mass of cement mixed with 0.3 m3 of aggregate shall not be less than 50 kg.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":" m3 of aggregate shall not be less than 50 kg."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.3,"unit":"m3","operator":null,"context":"The mass of cement mixed with 0.3 m3 of aggregate shall not be les"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"kg","operator":null,"context":"regate shall not be less than 50 kg."}]','["GS 22","EN 197","EN 12620"]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','aebdcab2d8443ade90e9cbe10e2a4bb2ea06d464670bcb5ca94e00efaa24c3cd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15449','GHBC-REQ-015449','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.16',NULL,'GHBC-C-004044','The quantity of water shall','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["GS 22","EN 197","EN 12620"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','701d87b85d75e80e6284d4057e80c3851522e9c74e51c963cafbb3f76a3df577','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15450','GHBC-REQ-015450','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.16',NULL,'GHBC-C-004044','not exceed that required to produce a smooth cement paste that will evenly coat the whole of the aggregate.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["GS 22","EN 197","EN 12620"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c06dbc08d03a600e09a1fdae9e331753f9092dff5052b00b7be3c8356a751f28','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-15451','GHBC-REQ-015451','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.17',NULL,'GHBC-C-004045','Records, in a form approved by the Head of works, shall be kept by the Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent of the details of every pour of concrete placed.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc38253ee16267137380ded7b0a47c1ab2759eacb30c8ab2e1e6063541a1152a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15452','GHBC-REQ-015452','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.17',NULL,'GHBC-C-004045','These records shall include class of concrete, location of pour, date of pour, ambient temperature and concrete temperature at time of placing, moisture contents of aggregates, details of mixes, batch numbers, cement batch number, results of all tests undertaken, location of test cube sample points and details of any cores taken and any spillages in water courses.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6a298226d18c6bf8a5439c463a62538385c68623d29bc21663d54d961fe76576','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15453','GHBC-REQ-015453','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.17',NULL,'GHBC-C-004045','The Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent shall supply to the Head of works two copies of these records each week covering work carried out the preceding week.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','acd1b7e7647f9a67194fe514142aa72ae7b085302fe1c57d40b2d5a4872bd7b2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15454','GHBC-REQ-015454','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.17',NULL,'GHBC-C-004045','In addition he shall supply to the Head of works monthly histograms of all 28 day cube strengths together with accumulative and monthly standard deviations and any other information that the Head of works may require concerning the concrete placed in the Works.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2c31cc11c58fcf3d1ca84bd622f4325a6647832ac8943014779dbab38389341b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15455','GHBC-REQ-015455','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.1','GHBC-C-004046','Where a concrete element has to be constructed in more than one concreting operation, the surface of contact between the clauses shall be deemed a construction joint.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','036b8876563b5b717111d071af1c15edb5c1ac98d05c20cc3062f725c2390758','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15456','GHBC-REQ-015456','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.1','GHBC-C-004046','Construction joints shall be formed at the positions shown on the Drawings, or, approved by the Head of works.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5e32259a0582687486bf04f473c4b4342f4728dec2cb85388cab124157381753','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15457','GHBC-REQ-015457','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.1','GHBC-C-004046','Where, in an emergency (such as a breakdown in the mixing or placing plant, or the occurrence of unsuitable weather), concreting has to be interrupted, a construction joint shall be formed at the place of stoppage, in a manner that will least impair the appearance,','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','997e17c7ab9ebae5ab63251a4d9f74d5ed97af4804b896d1eec9cbaa051c8558','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15458','GHBC-REQ-015458','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.1','GHBC-C-004046','durability, and proper functioning of the concrete.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ef9ec9e23b7c45fccb2c81e30fac67c6208b8d81b8de3abfb9b3ded9414f4f4b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15459','GHBC-REQ-015459','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.1','GHBC-C-004046','Unless otherwise indicated, construction joints shall be in horizontal or vertical planes, except in inclined members, where they shall be perpendicular to the line or plane of the member.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c87948930f6000f82ec5f88996f004ff0cf8c4b71be8f493f25b8be2a751a52c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15460','GHBC-REQ-015460','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.1','GHBC-C-004046','Where additional joints are required by the Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent to suit his method of construction, they shall be so arranged as to reduce to a minimum the effects of shrinkage in the concrete after placing, and shall be placed in the most advantageous positions with regard to stresses in the structures and the desirability of staggering joints.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','08cef7d3933959da047257a15d230f929e64bc335f7b62718602002768272eed','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-15461','GHBC-REQ-015461','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.1','GHBC-C-004046','All joints additional to those shown on the Drawings, shall be subject to the Head of works‘s approval.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','31454c4b8ffccb6fa1d0d11601b886fa7249df7c651c78aadb0ba87e470a8050','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15462','GHBC-REQ-015462','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.1','GHBC-C-004046','Feather edges of concrete at joints shall be avoided and any feather edges that may have formed where reinforcing bars project through a joint shall be cut back until sound concrete has been reached.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7ca124e3dce080de6cb1b0061d03e954c17f1f8f508252b1bef98c8db0176ec4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15463','GHBC-REQ-015463','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.1','GHBC-C-004046','The interclauses of horizontal or near horizontal joints and exposed faces of concrete shall appear as straight lines produced by use of a guide strip fixed to the formwork at the top of the concrete lift, or by other means acceptable to the Head of works.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','24d3a71a73214b9f26e6abdd9919ba45454f342d08c05a856e56dbb69e642614','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15464','GHBC-REQ-015464','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.1','GHBC-C-004046','Construction joints formed as free surfaces shall not exceed a slope of 20% from the horizontal.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":"s shall not exceed a slope of 20% from the horizontal."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1b5f6e64049ef1970e1edd4101acae474090fcad29b486b1847162e4f744dab7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15465','GHBC-REQ-015465','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.2','GHBC-C-004047','In horizontal joints, when the concrete has set but not yet hardened, the joint surface shall be thoroughly cleaned and roughened by means of a water jet, assisted by light brushing, to expose the aggregate without disturbing it, and to leave a sound irregular surface.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ba692bd11f31dd4a7f02bd252d47a59cf2fed75ea3a26d1e1e8d52bdbd5020e4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15466','GHBC-REQ-015466','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.2','GHBC-C-004047','Vertical or near vertical joints shall be similarly treated if circumstances permit the removal of formwork at a suitable time.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','91377bfc702d6a663c5a4e550c4325effac6a494c45e64805f5eddad795eeaaf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15467','GHBC-REQ-015467','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.2','GHBC-C-004047','Where concrete has become too hard for the above treatment to be successful, the joint surface, whether formed or free, shall be roughened by sand blasting, or by applying a scaling hammer or other mechanical means','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b6f24d0fb25ded510b49e5ab0b8dc8d0f0c70be822db994eacc0d3ffa87b7b21','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15468','GHBC-REQ-015468','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.2','GHBC-C-004047','appropriate to the degree of hardness of the concrete, so as to expose the aggregate and leave a sound irregular surface.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ee50be52cb3b476da08581b60b6f6a84c65013d35ad336185d2895f00513208e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15469','GHBC-REQ-015469','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.2','GHBC-C-004047','The roughened surface shall be thoroughly washed with clean water to remove all dirt and loose particles.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','87d52d81660ccae8d9b27bf8dd0327d25ed32c5b49132f7dde54bb546c90b29a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15470','GHBC-REQ-015470','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.2','GHBC-C-004047','The indentations produced by roughening shall not be less than 10 mm deep and shall not extend closer than 40 mm to a finished face.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":10,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"ed by roughening shall not be less than 10 mm deep and shall not extend "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"hening shall not be less than 10 mm deep and shall not extend clo"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":40,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" shall not extend closer than 40 mm to a finished face."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','705857ec7281eb3ad0a738589641e60bc4c5a771493aaeda9ca1e683a607a781','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-15471','GHBC-REQ-015471','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.2','GHBC-C-004047','Surface retarding agents shall not be used at construction joints without the Head of works‘s approval.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7095d2689d4dd34cb454b411f24bdb928b02f7d5ec5ef136a0aabee56cf19259','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15472','GHBC-REQ-015472','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.3','GHBC-C-004048','Where fresh concrete is placed on the same day as the formation of the construction joint, the fresh concrete shall be cast directly against the prepared face of the construction joint.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8a1cf06801477537c5312f6a57fe4fb4874785679554f2d9a8eece6a8d49bb05','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15473','GHBC-REQ-015473','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.3','GHBC-C-004048','Where fresh concrete is placed a day or more after formation of the construction joint, the joint surface shall be kept continuously wet for at least six hours before concreting commences.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9e9702ec77a5b3f4893328cdb6e3b93e7be723db68fb241b2f83b812d7d5358','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15474','GHBC-REQ-015474','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.3','GHBC-C-004048','The surface shall be in a saturated, surface-dry condition when the concrete is placed.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6f50bba5238e918d0254ec774c785449438460fc3043a6b5c7814e979505fdf3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15475','GHBC-REQ-015475','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.3','GHBC-C-004048','If instructed by the Head of works, the surface of the concrete shall be thoroughly brushed with a thin layer of mortar composed of one part of cement to two parts of sand by mass and complying with this code immediately prior to the deposition of fresh concrete.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f783864049924e0afb0c2aa5be3bac72293a2b0b97827730c91d924fe6fd1751','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15476','GHBC-REQ-015476','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.3','GHBC-C-004048','The mortar shall be kept just ahead of the fresh concrete being placed and the fresh layer of concrete shall be thoroughly and systematically vibrated to full depth to ensure complete bond with the adjacent layer.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','628c575ca92ffa87f24c7e3417c3f726f3851f9e994fd264ea204f2cbbfc6d43','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15477','GHBC-REQ-015477','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.3','GHBC-C-004048','No mortar or concrete may be placed in position on or against a construction joint until the joint has been inspected and passed by the Head of works.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','587680a15d1f462a03e36a4cfdd81893de7bcb24cba214971187448c39c0c2b2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15478','GHBC-REQ-015478','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.3','GHBC-C-004048','Where specified, bonding agents, designed for joining new concrete to old, shall be used in construction joints.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7edae3ee4ba7ea3d642f9e0d092f7bb11f84a948c0bc900891c6553811ec68bd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15479','GHBC-REQ-015479','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.3','GHBC-C-004048','The type and proprietary brand of bonding agent used shall be subject to the Head of works‘s approval.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2af7ad2545aadbc2c4907a961445fca7b42b0f20875a472c69df067d71e4fc6c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15480','GHBC-REQ-015480','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.18','20.18.3','GHBC-C-004048','The preparation of the concrete surface and the application of the bonding agent shall be strictly in accordance with the manufacturer‘s recommendations.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','74f8c1c00125cd8762cc193f1314e36c210c0ed5e3123c63bd18a332a1e2d508','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-15481','GHBC-REQ-015481','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.19',NULL,'GHBC-C-004049','Expansion and contraction joints are discontinuities in concrete designed to allow for thermal or other movements in the concrete.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4452356f9ef09e859f270bf22bdd4dc5104f3289010c82aea681b1b4717362de','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15482','GHBC-REQ-015482','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.19',NULL,'GHBC-C-004049','Expansion joints are formed with a gap between the concrete faces to permit subsequent expansion of the concrete.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a75cf05d91f36f860738fb1629dc4248d3ed0f91d97d4261f434d225acea54bf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15483','GHBC-REQ-015483','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.19',NULL,'GHBC-C-004049','Contraction joints are formed to permit initial contraction of the concrete and may include provision for subsequent filling.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','98c745420e004a4b36a1ea4942d00fc573a9ea83e596097f4cab3983575f0b9c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15484','GHBC-REQ-015484','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.19',NULL,'GHBC-C-004049','Expansion and contraction joints shall be formed in the positions and in accordance with the details shown on the Drawings or elsewhere in the Specifications.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','99d451271f98681abb571cae33edd3ba39ada5d7c7014fec949ea9cb1eb6cb0d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15485','GHBC-REQ-015485','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.1','GHBC-C-004050','This clause covers all precast reinforced and prestressed concrete units, whether detailed in the original design, or proposed by the Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent, but excludes precast concrete piles, pipes and culverts, in so far as they are covered separately elsewhere in the Specification.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','38a0f1b9959c8133dada961dbf49a9a97e5f7ed6d45c05344f305e2d897d7954','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15486','GHBC-REQ-015486','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.2','GHBC-C-004051','Precast units shall be manufactured in accordance with all relevant requirements specified for cast in-situ members, except as specified differently hereinunder.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','67b07a6fd1a5197de1a3f8edeca49bafcd1019d112a581baf665ecdf7d5b999d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15487','GHBC-REQ-015487','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.2','GHBC-C-004051','All units shall be permanently marked with the reference number, location, orientation and date of casting.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b1be9191020421c48dbdf6b945dda085b455ab7e4d12b25c4eb5470742dc0200','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15488','GHBC-REQ-015488','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.2','GHBC-C-004051','These markings shall be positioned such that they will not be visible in the completed structure.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2e8f747c4b21f75c5c9d1f6ed221a96040bce3749315643cc672b357326af360','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15489','GHBC-REQ-015489','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.2','GHBC-C-004051','The area in which units are cast shall be adequately protected from the weather so that the process is not affected by rain, sun or drying winds.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a118e63d6eb0dbba6c1331e0a06bb7a9906e4b34e35930d330a97db1a1cf8d05','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15490','GHBC-REQ-015490','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.3','GHBC-C-004052','If curing of precast units at elevated temperatures is proposed, the method shall be subject to the Head of works‘s approval, and shall include means whereby units are heated and subsequently cooled evenly, without sudden changes of temperature.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c02899f5c1d11e246997659d81494444dc71ba5aa65ea62763a2762fc1e06b7d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-15491','GHBC-REQ-015491','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.3','GHBC-C-004052','It shall furthermore, not cause staining, contamination or marring of the concrete surface.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6eb9789bc8785e4e9588b9de06032713cf8bca44c7f62095d4163a68af685072','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15492','GHBC-REQ-015492','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.4','GHBC-C-004053','of Precast Units','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ee5bc08379c588982e5d0298ac6862a14108590c9a69cb44abcc9856fbf19d4b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15493','GHBC-REQ-015493','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.4','GHBC-C-004053','Unformed surfaces shall be finished to Class UF2 unless another class of finish is specified on the Drawings.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bf88dd7e4f93d2d9cbb05558dbbc7363ae78c364ee5fd84fd0291c68213554c2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15494','GHBC-REQ-015494','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.4','GHBC-C-004053','Those parts of the unit that are to be joined to other units or to in situ concrete shall be brushed with a stiff brush before the concrete has fully hardened.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','04656ebed264f44bf2d61eeac101d20a9ce493c4ebbf5f7953093a370ae8421b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15495','GHBC-REQ-015495','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.4','GHBC-C-004053','Alternatively, if the concrete has been allowed to harden, the surfaces shall be roughened by sand blasting or by the use of a needle gun.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','69c5e7970c4336bc6853a0ec99b919961730b4e16b878b34e6b4f01a10054767','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15496','GHBC-REQ-015496','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.5','GHBC-C-004054','Units','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c17538956d1268602ea71c4af3c8046f646c3a2cffbcb67df1d23bf6c00bc5eb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15497','GHBC-REQ-015497','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.5','GHBC-C-004054','Precast units shall be handled in a manner that will not cause damage of any kind and shall be stored on a hard impermeable base.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','beca231801b6277dc099de61cc84e7a7b262d7ab3207c70e173091bf52b444d2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15498','GHBC-REQ-015498','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.5','GHBC-C-004054','Prestressed units and large precast normally reinforced units shall be handled and stored so that no stresses will be induced in excess of those which they will incur in their final positions in the Works unless they have been designed to resist such stresses.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','80205f110dba79e8c89be5ecb31bc2d9785d070af75b465ca83a2dd276fc6fd2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15499','GHBC-REQ-015499','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.5','GHBC-C-004054','Units shall be marked indelibly with the reference number and date of casting and shall be stacked on suitable supports, which will not damage the concrete or stain the surfaces.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b47169adfa0925370d6c7cc48f9ca680083e19859966896da15fecbbc10965e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15500','GHBC-REQ-015500','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.20','20.20.5','GHBC-C-004054','Not more than two supports shall be placed under each unit and these shall be located either at the positions of the permanent support points or in positions such that the induced stresses in the unit will be a minimum.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7f049ea95f7fa80cd0d00e0fac73371fa3ac9051413c6399ff571e491b5807f6','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-15501','GHBC-REQ-015501','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.21',NULL,'GHBC-C-004055','Precast units shall be capable of safely sustaining the loads that they have been designed to carry.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed8da867ca9a5bb16011bc9f053057dde31bc86e8193b5442f41c99ba3e7d233','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15502','GHBC-REQ-015502','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.21',NULL,'GHBC-C-004055','The Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent shall subject units selected by the Head of works to load tests simulating the working conditions.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0bfcf339da2f87e7b13d9eee07feac5148ef5fdec0cdf949dc9fc81531aa5154','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15503','GHBC-REQ-015503','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.21',NULL,'GHBC-C-004055','Details of such tests shall be agreed between the Head of works and the Owner or Owner‘s Authorised Agent.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','63907069347e516a95584554776a7150ac85e69970f63e76fe6b54b14a562b40','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15504','GHBC-REQ-015504','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.21',NULL,'GHBC-C-004055','In the case of units subject to bending loads the test piece shall be supported at full span and a loading equivalent to 1.25 times the sum of the live and dead loads, which were assumed in the design shall be maintained for one hour without the appearance of any signs of distress.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','580372e0fc195c1e5cb08b29dc375575d685b5b2d7865c890ea3b81c492abbfc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15505','GHBC-REQ-015505','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.21',NULL,'GHBC-C-004055','The recovery one hour after the removal of load shall be not less than 75% of the full load deflection.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":75,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" the removal of load shall be not less than 75% of the full load deflection."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":75,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":"f load shall be not less than 75% of the full load deflection."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8480d4f3b18ad2b9f551e87c5d7282c05bad028301e752551d3ecc4e00011a20','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15506','GHBC-REQ-015506','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.21',NULL,'GHBC-C-004055','If the unit fails to meet the above requirements, further tests shall be carried out on two more units.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5df3d78e935fb1e9b7398b497c34543d714ff2d3ead2324bd3e297ebe907c205','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15507','GHBC-REQ-015507','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.21',NULL,'GHBC-C-004055','If either of these fails, the whole batch of units will be rejected.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fbb965ce5d3b60b3fcfe2812f4214b4b106572428bbfb21864047c805e92ad32','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15508','GHBC-REQ-015508','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.21',NULL,'GHBC-C-004055','If the Head of works so requires, a test to destruction shall also be carried out, which on units subject to bending shall be as follows:','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','499ad8ab4836bb8a8c1110e1a4fe96e4e421fc729cd2ce7dd6b8b9dd0e45f99d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15509','GHBC-REQ-015509','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.21',NULL,'GHBC-C-004055','The units shall be supported at full span and a load applied in increments instructed by the Head of works up to 95% of the designed ultimate load.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":95,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"structed by the Head of works up to 95% of the designed ultimate loa"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":95,"unit":"%","operator":null,"context":"ed by the Head of works up to 95% of the designed ultimate load"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7fb6c41cdbe00ec2f9fcf3b5bdd46003f6a2433b4e4b663393e895b6bbffbaca','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15510','GHBC-REQ-015510','GS 1207:2018',20,'20.21',NULL,'GHBC-C-004055','This load shall be held for 15 minutes without failure of the unit.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"This load shall be held for 15 minutes without failure of the "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','da59785f81876fb6b617f036b54f1c4929b1f3da35dec67318b8a547afaa2d95','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
