('rowid-15792','GHBC-REQ-015792','GS 1207:2018',22,'22.11','22.11.14.2','GHBC-C-004148','Listed combustion air ducts for masonry fireplaces shall be installed according to the terms of their listing and manufacturer‘s instructions.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','64546f14d62a5cd2df940ece01319d0e4128485e726eebf18186db60db7a724b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15793','GHBC-REQ-015793','GS 1207:2018',22,'22.11','22.11.14.3','GHBC-C-004149','The exterior air intake shall be capable of providing all combustion air from the exterior of the dwelling.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a7256d11044bc88dfce88ba90b5e279b75d108161844b6f6d256385bdf80f6f1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
