('rowid-15908','GHBC-REQ-015908','GS 1207:2018',22,'22.13','22.13.13.2','GHBC-C-004194','The space surrounding a chimney lining system or vent installed within a masonry chimney shall not be used to vent any other appliance.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["This shall not prevent the installation of a separate flue lining in accordance with the manufacturer‘s instructions."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9daacf60bc1620954c1bdb3762152c850814986bdecd847afe4ca096e106d94f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15909','GHBC-REQ-015909','GS 1207:2018',22,'22.13','22.13.13.2','GHBC-C-004194','EXCEPTIONS: This shall not prevent the installation of a separate flue lining in accordance with the manufacturer‘s instructions.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["This shall not prevent the installation of a separate flue lining in accordance with the manufacturer‘s instructions."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','652efb66b94410abbc5ae4dae15b2ec4fa4cd39f7394bc79c46767e8aa09e076','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-15910','GHBC-REQ-015910','GS 1207:2018',22,'22.13','22.13.14','GHBC-C-004195','Where two or more flues are located in the same chimney, masonry wythes shall be built between adjacent flue linings.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where venting only one appliance, two flues are permitted to adjoin each other in the same chimney with only the flue lining separation between them. The joints of the adjacent flue linings shall be staggered not less than 102 mm (4 inches)."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','85f77acec25f67280f0b613dda583243ecb3999c4544824b57dc48ba5e4cd690','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
