('rowid-16116','GHBC-REQ-016116','GS 1207:2018',24,'24.3','24.3.1','GHBC-C-004250','Structural sawn timber; end-jointed timber; prefabricated wood I-joists; structural gluedlaminated timber; wood structural panels; fibreboard sheathing (where used structurally); hardboard siding (where used structurally); particleboard; preservative-treated wood; structural log members; structural composite timber; round timber poles and piles; fireretardant-treated wood; hardwood plywood; wood trusses; joist hangers; nails; and staples shall conform to the applicable provisions of this clause.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec283321ba4015af65f0e94fc9c2b90e894a44df0c5fef637299c598e7fcf2ef','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
