('rowid-16178','GHBC-REQ-016178','GS 1207:2018',24,'24.3','24.3.2.1','GHBC-C-004274','For wood products impregnated with chemicals by a pressure process, the process shall be performed in closed vessels under pressures not less than 50 pounds per square inch gauge (psig) (345 kPa).','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"losed vessels under pressures not less than 50 pounds per square inch gauge "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":345,"unit":"kpa","operator":null,"context":"per square inch gauge (psig) (345 kPa)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','70bced455bc6bd49c3196b84bbfcc5fc36b26d08e822104be5d6470693d85b30','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-16179','GHBC-REQ-016179','GS 1207:2018',24,'24.3','24.3.2.2','GHBC-C-004275','For wood products impregnated with chemicals by other means during manufacture, the treatment shall be an integral part of the manufacturing process of the wood product.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c27f20f85b5cec6aa910d11dff36ab09d02dee17389814a4a677996c6362789e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
