('rowid-16285','GHBC-REQ-016285','GS 1207:2018',24,'24.3','24.3.4.1.4.1','GHBC-C-004292','Where a cover sheet and a truss index sheet are separately provided and attached to the set of truss design drawings, the cover sheet and the truss index sheet are the only documents required to be signed and sealed by the truss designer.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ab4fcd14389dc63e29cbf3ea8391b8086f88f716a128332a2253c9666bfe69d1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-16286','GHBC-REQ-016286','GS 1207:2018',24,'24.3','24.3.4.2','GHBC-C-004293','The truss manufacturer shall provide a truss placement diagram that identifies the proposed location for each individually designated truss and references the corresponding truss design drawing.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ca13e518d048b019f57955c4877d20ab242ada94bb1daf18c7b9fae940c72a76','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-16287','GHBC-REQ-016287','GS 1207:2018',24,'24.3','24.3.4.2','GHBC-C-004293','The truss placement diagram shall be provided as part of the truss Submission package, and with the shipment of trusses delivered to the job site.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ca7b2c03913ba99fc9b6fc9543d94aa0fe29e49351526a75f9bb6c1dbffa69a8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-16288','GHBC-REQ-016288','GS 1207:2018',24,'24.3','24.3.4.2','GHBC-C-004293','Truss placement diagrams that serve only as a guide for installation and do not deviate from the permit Submission drawings shall not be required to bear the seal or signature of the truss designer.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6c3fc5a98026ea1f45b0078eb85f9f4ca50f4447694427a286557cdb76d6953c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-16289','GHBC-REQ-016289','GS 1207:2018',24,'24.3','24.3.4.3','GHBC-C-004294','The truss Submission package provided by the truss manufacturer shall consist of each individual truss design drawing, the truss placement diagram, the permanent individual truss member restraint/bracing method and','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e35beff65f0d8475f001c421b887f4fd851958578b28181bdd060445f10a03e2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-16290','GHBC-REQ-016290','GS 1207:2018',24,'24.3','24.3.4.3','GHBC-C-004294','details and any other structural details germane to the trusses; and, as applicable, the cover/truss index sheet.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be910dfb4d1f2059f39f83930fbc6670883ed0218350d6f2a9eee0868cd607e9','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
