('rowid-16296','GHBC-REQ-016296','GS 1207:2018',24,'24.3','24.3.4.7','GHBC-C-004298','Trusses not part of a manufacturing process in accordance with either Clause 24.3.4.6 or a referenced standard, which provides requirements for quality control done under the supervision of a third-party quality control agency, shall be manufactured in compliance with Clauses 19.4.2.5 and 19.5.5, as applicable.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','405cdfc53a577fed78d95500b3552f7e6ed192ff489681dcf94c9449c9bca784','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
