('rowid-16564','GHBC-REQ-016564','GS 1207:2018',24,NULL,'24.4.12.2.2','GHBC-C-004367','Posts or columns supporting permanent structures and supported by a concrete or masonry slab or footing that is in direct contact with the earth shall be of naturally durable or preservative-treated wood.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Posts or columns that meet all of the following: 1. Are not exposed to the weather, or are protected by a roof, eave, overhang, or other covering if exposed to the weather."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','48e80259806a1e333f44d016cee5f1796aa9b3b0404bde1db2d5fc32253ffc4c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
