('rowid-16570','GHBC-REQ-016570','GS 1207:2018',24,NULL,'24.4.12.2.2','GHBC-C-004367','Naturally durable or preservative-treated wood shall be utilized for those portions of wood members that form the structural supports of buildings, balconies, porches or similar permanent building appurtenances where such members are exposed to the weather without adequate protection from a roof, eave, overhang or other covering to prevent moisture or water accumulation on the surface or at joints between members.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Posts or columns that meet all of the following: 1. Are not exposed to the weather, or are protected by a roof, eave, overhang, or other covering if exposed to the weather."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a60cdda0e48bf4d8856af91611d791ed93906f296ba388389caeef671f90526e','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
