('rowid-16999','GHBC-REQ-016999','GS 1207:2018',24,NULL,'24.8.6.6.2','GHBC-C-004449','Where the cripple wall sheathing type used is Method WSP or DWB and this additional length of bracing cannot be provided, the capacity of WSP or DWB sheathing shall be increased by reducing the spacing of fasteners along the perimeter of each piece of sheathing to 102 mm (4 inches) on center.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":102,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"of each piece of sheathing to 102 mm (4 inches) on center."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"piece of sheathing to 102 mm (4 inches) on center."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9d7cbb0edc9ad432b5c5c2de9c3b767ccf6b9fa831361ac26bcc018f642fa337','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
