('rowid-17003','GHBC-REQ-017003','GS 1207:2018',24,NULL,'24.8.6.7.1','GHBC-C-004451','Braced wall line bottom plates shall be connected to joists or full-depth blocking below in accordance with Table 24.4.10.1, or to foundations in accordance with Clause 24.8.6.7.3.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12c17edcc4174a41ee23207b962065245fe60c9c5ca0cb2ebad96efa968555ae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-17004','GHBC-REQ-017004','GS 1207:2018',24,NULL,'24.8.6.7.2','GHBC-C-004452','Where joists or rafters are used, braced wall line top plates shall be fastened over the full length of the braced wall line to joists, rafters, rim boards or full-depth blocking above in accordance with Table 24.4.10.1, as applicable, based on the orientation of the joists or rafters to the braced wall line.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the roof sheathing is greater than 235 mm (91 / inches) above the top plate, solid blocking is not required where the framing4 members are connected using one of the following methods:"]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3343a07d7533fc8bc87271fc0fb5825abf08a54f3ef57cb27615e0d4ba8fc32a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-17005','GHBC-REQ-017005','GS 1207:2018',24,NULL,'24.8.6.7.2','GHBC-C-004452','Blocking shall be not less than 51 mm (2 inches) in nominal thickness and shall be fastened to the braced wall line top plate as specified in Table 24.4.10.1.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the roof sheathing is greater than 235 mm (91 / inches) above the top plate, solid blocking is not required where the framing4 members are connected using one of the following methods:"]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":51,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"Blocking shall be not less than 51 mm (2 inches) in nominal thic"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":51,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ocking shall be not less than 51 mm (2 inches) in nominal thickne"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"shall be not less than 51 mm (2 inches) in nominal thickness and"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fd5c56f631e98f4c9b68ab1df1368a64f379187020c7f294b93ba870672ec600','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-17006','GHBC-REQ-017006','GS 1207:2018',24,NULL,'24.8.6.7.2','GHBC-C-004452','Notching or drilling of holes in blocking in accordance with the requirements of Clause 24.8.4.2.4 or 24.8.7.4 shall be permitted.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the roof sheathing is greater than 235 mm (91 / inches) above the top plate, solid blocking is not required where the framing4 members are connected using one of the following methods:"]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":7.4,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":" of Clause 24.8.4.2.4 or 24.8.7.4 shall be permitted."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a98958857b5ed1e208b0ebbbac42b925a98748e2c794a2742e6b3d276b0de265','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
