('rowid-17010','GHBC-REQ-017010','GS 1207:2018',24,NULL,'24.8.6.7.2','GHBC-C-004452','the truss at the wall line and shall be fastened to the braced wall line top plate as specified in','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Where the roof sheathing is greater than 235 mm (91 / inches) above the top plate, solid blocking is not required where the framing4 members are connected using one of the following methods:"]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','09f00c271365c59458ee59444b4b15a02cefe585e56d59b9da54836c6588ae7b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
