('rowid-17472','GHBC-REQ-017472','GS 1207:2018',25,'25.4','25.5.3','GHBC-C-004526','EXCEPTIONS: In monolithic and multiple-layer sloped glazing systems, the following applies:','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["In monolithic and multiple-layer sloped glazing systems, the following applies:"]','[]','["is 1.5","is 3658","is 4.8","is 1.5","is 3658"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','aab1fa09676d7cf97483ffb7f116d321fc6a546d6e28e17363c63871262489c9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-17473','GHBC-REQ-017473','GS 1207:2018',25,'25.4','25.5.4','GHBC-C-004527','In Type I construction, sloped glazing and skylight frames shall be constructed of noncombustible materials.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Installation of a skylight without a curb shall be permitted on roofs with a minimum slope of 14 degrees (three units vertical in 12 units horizontal) in Group R-3 occupancies. Unit skylights installed in a roof with a pitch flatter than 14 degrees (0.25 rad) shall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of the roof on a curb constructed as required for the frame unless otherwise specified in the manufacturer‘s installation instructions."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dc3aec7fdf9b9e4044397a36d66c7aa18dafa357e6863cb3da406d63df0bb9a4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-17474','GHBC-REQ-017474','GS 1207:2018',25,'25.4','25.5.4','GHBC-C-004527','In structures where acid fumes deleterious to metal are incidental to the use of the buildings, approved pressuretreated wood or other approved noncorrosive materials are permitted to be used for sash and frames.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Installation of a skylight without a curb shall be permitted on roofs with a minimum slope of 14 degrees (three units vertical in 12 units horizontal) in Group R-3 occupancies. Unit skylights installed in a roof with a pitch flatter than 14 degrees (0.25 rad) shall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of the roof on a curb constructed as required for the frame unless otherwise specified in the manufacturer‘s installation instructions."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','28faa61efa1ca4320b807e5ac2fd1fd5e44eb9d5a65630b9bea440d75187dd55','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-17475','GHBC-REQ-017475','GS 1207:2018',25,'25.4','25.5.4','GHBC-C-004527','Framing supporting sloped glazing and skylights shall be designed to resist the tributary roof loads in Part 17.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Installation of a skylight without a curb shall be permitted on roofs with a minimum slope of 14 degrees (three units vertical in 12 units horizontal) in Group R-3 occupancies. Unit skylights installed in a roof with a pitch flatter than 14 degrees (0.25 rad) shall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of the roof on a curb constructed as required for the frame unless otherwise specified in the manufacturer‘s installation instructions."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','41d8e8c7f3d6efbec85e305a695576ca064a8864357eacd176fcb437bcedaf25','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-17476','GHBC-REQ-017476','GS 1207:2018',25,'25.4','25.5.4','GHBC-C-004527','Skylights set at an angle of less than 45 degrees (0.79 rad) from the horizontal plane shall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of the roof on a curb constructed as required for the frame.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Installation of a skylight without a curb shall be permitted on roofs with a minimum slope of 14 degrees (three units vertical in 12 units horizontal) in Group R-3 occupancies. Unit skylights installed in a roof with a pitch flatter than 14 degrees (0.25 rad) shall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of the roof on a curb constructed as required for the frame unless otherwise specified in the manufacturer‘s installation instructions."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":45,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"Skylights set at an angle of less than 45 degrees (0.79 rad) from the h"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":102,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"zontal plane shall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":102,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"hall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of the r"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','17704097b828575bb2f982d3569cfb4b699e10d232ae94199d23e663e72c10fd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-17477','GHBC-REQ-017477','GS 1207:2018',25,'25.4','25.5.4','GHBC-C-004527','Skylights shall not be installed in the plane of the roof where the roof pitch is less than 45 degrees (0.79 rad) from the horizontal.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Installation of a skylight without a curb shall be permitted on roofs with a minimum slope of 14 degrees (three units vertical in 12 units horizontal) in Group R-3 occupancies. Unit skylights installed in a roof with a pitch flatter than 14 degrees (0.25 rad) shall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of the roof on a curb constructed as required for the frame unless otherwise specified in the manufacturer‘s installation instructions."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":45,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":" roof where the roof pitch is less than 45 degrees (0.79 rad) from the h"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ec681c781b719a03c1fe7cb271be8122611147efa7b7b41e6529e0d806973d7e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-17478','GHBC-REQ-017478','GS 1207:2018',25,'25.4','25.5.4','GHBC-C-004527','EXCEPTIONS: Installation of a skylight without a curb shall be permitted on roofs with a minimum slope of 14 degrees (three units vertical in 12 units horizontal) in Group R-3 occupancies. Unit skylights installed in a roof with a pitch flatter than 14 degrees (0.25 rad) shall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of the roof on a curb constructed as required for the frame unless otherwise specified in the manufacturer‘s installation instructions.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Installation of a skylight without a curb shall be permitted on roofs with a minimum slope of 14 degrees (three units vertical in 12 units horizontal) in Group R-3 occupancies. Unit skylights installed in a roof with a pitch flatter than 14 degrees (0.25 rad) shall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of the roof on a curb constructed as required for the frame unless otherwise specified in the manufacturer‘s installation instructions."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":102,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"s (0.25 rad) shall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":102,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"hall be mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"mounted not less than 102 mm (4 inches) above the plane of the r"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0cd9de1e8af5c4e55ef13bbbba47233f0dfbc89ac0a5d05d26ae474cde776fb8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
