('rowid-17905','GHBC-REQ-017905','GS 1207:2018',27,'27.3','27.3.6','GHBC-C-004651','Foam plastic insulation meeting the requirements of Clauses 27.3.2, 27.3.3 and 27.3.4 shall be permitted as part of a roofcovering assembly, provided that the assembly with the foam plastic insulation is a Class A, B or C roofing assembly where tested in accordance with ASTM E108.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":3.4,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"Clauses 27.3.2, 27.3.3 and 27.3.4 shall be permitted as part of a"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93f80ebb343cbb2a201826bc6398e21b666257f28eceebb9a00f5e81375479c2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
