('rowid-17910','GHBC-REQ-017910','GS 1207:2018',27,'27.3','27.3.7','GHBC-C-004652','Foam plastic in plenums used as interior wall or ceiling finish, or interior trim, shall exhibit a flame spread index of 75 or less and a smoke-developed index of 450 or less when tested in accordance with ASTM E84 at the maximum thickness and density intended for use, where it is separated from the airflow in the plenum by a thermal barrier complying with Clause 27.3.4.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','248028fecc919ae5a68cb6f531f791445b9adccb2775eb316570b6343b66fb07','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
