('rowid-18227','GHBC-REQ-018227','GS 1207:2018',27,'27.13','27.14.2','GHBC-C-004732','Packages and containers of reflective plastic core insulation delivered to the job site shall show the manufacturer‘s or supplier‘s name, product identification and information sufficient to determine that the end use will comply with the Code requirements.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eb1bad2732947736fea2fe4dce2b8b684805a5b1bbadb7863f6c7d143eaba8fe','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18228','GHBC-REQ-018228','GS 1207:2018',27,'27.13','27.14.3','GHBC-C-004733','Reflective plastic core insulation shall have a flame spread index of not more than 25 and a smoke-developed index of not more than 450 when tested in accordance with ASTM E84.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":25,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":" have a flame spread index of not more than 25 and a smoke-developed index o"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":450,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"nd a smoke-developed index of not more than 450 when tested in accordance wit"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d1a04d502cdcd94c140e400461c53760b56d355195e7534e7e8f09ce7af58f2e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18229','GHBC-REQ-018229','GS 1207:2018',27,'27.13','27.14.3','GHBC-C-004733','The reflective plastic core insulation shall be tested at the maximum thickness intended for use.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','28ad72811e96bbfddfa74907b01570b8fb3c1f02a824524e071e4c019acd2c00','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
