('rowid-18363','GHBC-REQ-018363','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.3','28.3.3','GHBC-C-004740','Allowance should be made for about 15 percent to 20 percent for extension in near future and the design circuit is calculated for each circuit and submain.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"ance should be made for about 15 percent to 20 percent for extension i"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":" made for about 15 percent to 20 percent for extension in near future "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d85efb9016bc3f2933642a8d2485d0c52cfb0ac9190e61a14e35f5da99a9a390','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18364','GHBC-REQ-018364','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.3','28.3.3','GHBC-C-004740','The wiring system to be adopted should also be decided in accordance with the environmental requirements.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','72c37aad73035781b0f1642e885f48b9d15ee7ab2ead17f8476df2cdfa9fdb92','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18365','GHBC-REQ-018365','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.3','28.3.3','GHBC-C-004740','The sizes of wiring cables are decided not merely to carry the load currents, but also to withstand thermal effects of','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dcd0b515afe26d23d99020d3266d4941db22260ec53bca37f2417b0d8a640f0a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18366','GHBC-REQ-018366','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.3','28.3.3','GHBC-C-004740','likely over currents and also ensure acceptance level of voltage drop.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','51e306e40404faa8c2a4488d6662749f44c633347344d50cd2383e82c175cb29','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18367','GHBC-REQ-018367','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.3','28.3.4','GHBC-C-004741','Factor Improvement in Consumers‘ Installation','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed783af26bf1277634a8f6728412d44c7527504ec29f3c04917cf7f0ceb010bd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18368','GHBC-REQ-018368','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.3','28.3.4.1','GHBC-C-004742','boards or licensees stipulate the lower-limit of power factor which is generally 0.85.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','001811189e567818ee336e57eb20b643f387c315e4d89beca023263f4492ea36','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18369','GHBC-REQ-018369','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.3','28.3.4.2','GHBC-C-004743','many.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d71feefc9e0893962ad31dbb3bea790ab5e62ac35a894df95622124ce681e4e2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18370','GHBC-REQ-018370','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.3','28.3.4.2','GHBC-C-004743','For guidance to the consumers of electric energy who take supply at low and medium voltages for improvement of power factor, reference shall be made in accordance with good practice.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3c6c09a8676b000731f18412a757b85ac8b64543317a1dabd62c07f3965ba47a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18371','GHBC-REQ-018371','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.3','28.3.5','GHBC-C-004744','Unless otherwise exempted under the appropriate rule of the Electricity Company of Ghana work of electrical installations shall be carried out by a licensed electrical contractor and under the direct supervision of a person holding a certificate of competency and by persons holding a valid permit issued and recognized by any State government.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8d2a489cb81379745aea3943e1f521ea224982a56f2adf4c16caac99ff6d7e01','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18372','GHBC-REQ-018372','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.3','28.3.6','GHBC-C-004745','Safety procedures and practices shall be kept in view during execution of the work in accordance with good practice.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','40d2b991611508768c9a5ac6969e039a21d7436f03790675ad2f1bf7065aa468','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18373','GHBC-REQ-018373','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1','GHBC-C-004746','The design and planning of an electrical wiring installation involve consideration of all prevailing conditions, and is usually influenced by the type and requirement of the consumer.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','45ebe86adacb0c6743a4daa5f656ed4df262f3b08949c7c3d8515dddcc53e1c9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18374','GHBC-REQ-018374','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1','GHBC-C-004746','A competent electrical design engineer should be involved at the planning stage with a view to providing for an installation that will prove adequate for its intended purpose, and safe and efficient in its use.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3943515c5073a98f5c0707c64f36f1441898f1061f8c1b421b68958ceea1405c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18375','GHBC-REQ-018375','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1','GHBC-C-004746','The information given in 3 shall also be kept in view.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"The information given in 3 shall also be kept in view."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fc1a83f9795e19f942422da48470eb3ed85aa3e5ec9a894c4347dbd5256e4142','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18376','GHBC-REQ-018376','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1.1','GHBC-C-004747','wiring installation shall take into consideration, some or all of the following: a) the type of supply, occupancy, envisaged load and the earthing arrangement available;','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4bfb59909769f488270c7c0331fec3420c555c7b380c5081c82cce558295ddc9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18377','GHBC-REQ-018377','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1.1','GHBC-C-004747','b)  the atmospheric condition, such as cooling air temperature, moisture or such other conditions which are likely to affect the installation adversely; c)  the possible presence of inflammable or explosive dust, vapour or gas; d) the degree of electrical and mechanical protection necessary; e) the importance of continuity of service including the possible need for standy supply; f) the probability of need for modification or future extension; g) the probable operation and maintenance cost taking into account the electricity supply tariffs available; h) the relative sot of various alternative methods; j) the need for radio and telecommunication interference suppression; k) case of maintenance; m) safety aspects; n) energy conservation; and p) the importance of proper discrimination between protective devices for continuity of supply and limited isolation of only the affected portion.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','32e21edbccaa21ef88257e26eb7851dade8f76fcad153fff4b8280af0c5ed325','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18378','GHBC-REQ-018378','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1.2','GHBC-C-004748','All electrical apparatus shall be suitable for the services these are intended for:','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e3214dfeca7926decafea16651a5ab6b5e42fc64ce67a56b020e660180274875','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18379','GHBC-REQ-018379','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1.3','GHBC-C-004749','Proper co-ordination and collaboration between the architect, civil engineer and the electrical and mechanical engineer shall be effected from the planning stage of the installation.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c59a9b82f4f1e7651418b90fa816e462bcf150166b013ca91b7bf9236e4fda8b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18380','GHBC-REQ-018380','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1.3','GHBC-C-004749','The provisions that will be needed for the accommodation of substation, transformer, switch rooms, service cable ducts, rising mains and distribution cables, sub-distribution boards, openings and chases in floors and walls for all','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','15b8ac4de2fedb4eb7bf664b61b98d6c097ba631b97b58d5ac0de47fbfb32675','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18381','GHBC-REQ-018381','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1.3','GHBC-C-004749','required electrical installations, etc. shall be specified in advance.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e03ccf61941507024d134470207dec4fda3f4e8db445458ad87d85ec78d78cce','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18382','GHBC-REQ-018382','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1.4','GHBC-C-004750','Before starting wiring and installation of fittings and accessories, information should be exchanged between the owner of the building/architect/electrical contractor and the local supply authority in respect of tariffs applicable, types of apparatus that may be connected under each tariff, requirement of space for installing meters, switches, etc. and for total load requirements of lights, fans and power.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','321860e84de415cd7863190adcd511128d920d4bbaec39f59b5f6fb834236334','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18383','GHBC-REQ-018383','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.1.4','GHBC-C-004750','28.4.1.5 While planning an installation, consideration should be taken of the anticipated increase in the use of electricity for lighting, general purpose socket-outlet, kitchen hearting, etc. It is essential that adequate provision should be made for all the services which may be required immediately and during the intended useful life of the building, for the householder may otherwise be tempted to carry out extension of the installation himself or to rely upon use of multi-plug adopters and long flexible cords, both of which are not recommended.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','abdb27bdfdfb7cdac1f9aa89921a7710f4a4eb50972b371f28b336206425add7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18384','GHBC-REQ-018384','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2','GHBC-C-004751','and Requirement of Substation Information on location and requirements of a substation should cover the following:','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8e3aa988b3a765aec8b08468cc868fcfb640d1a4e30e13bb75321dba696b71a8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18385','GHBC-REQ-018385','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','a) The substation should preferably be located in separate building and could be adjacent to the generator room.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','141de37b321b9a54b5ae894b8370079d50d3e9770adc5fedac1e3ebebb2f16ba','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18386','GHBC-REQ-018386','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','If any.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','008f3dfdbda70067775b89e05e1144a1bbca86ff4bf34fded992d4c43bc8778b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18387','GHBC-REQ-018387','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','Location of substation in the basement floors should be avoided, as far as possible. b) The ideal location for an electrical substation for a group of buildings would be at the electrical load centre on the ground floor. c) The floor level of the substation or switch room shall be above the highest flood level of the locality. d) Generally the load centre would be somewhere between the geometrical centre and the air conditioning plant room, as air conditioning plant room would normally be','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9804e7f48bcaef78a300e92d04517944a5ff9b1f2d9014e725846fb8a84eaea3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18388','GHBC-REQ-018388','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','the largest chunk of load, if the building is air conditioned. e) Substations with oil filled equipment will require great consideration for the fire detection, protection and suppression.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','33b8943535b0e3570023c28d0ef4a73b54c0248ffc1e6dd4f2753ac98d921e52','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18389','GHBC-REQ-018389','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','Oil cooled transformers require a suitable soak pit with gravity flow to contain the oil in the event of the possibility of oil spillage from the transformer on its failure.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7c89611d536d82ee1050fffbd909c6031612182c216c7e6b4f265ffb0c126d14','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18390','GHBC-REQ-018390','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','Substations with oil filled equipment shall not be located in any floor other than the ground floor or a semi-basement.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d9c5afc62b0433ba5e517b7ca1d68069ead541d13609af6eab4bba26bf9b7c82','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18391','GHBC-REQ-018391','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','Such substations with high oil content may be housed in a separate service building or a substation building, which is not the part of a multistoreyed building. f) In case electric substation has to be located within the main multi-storeyed building itself for unavoidable reasons, then it should be located on the floor close to ground level, but shall have direct access from the street for operation of the equipments.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','feded01e2116d5447359432b21513bebbf7589f4ee93ad6d35c73665dca7ddbb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18392','GHBC-REQ-018392','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','The provision for installation and removal of substation equipments may be provided from inside the building. g) Substations located within a multi-storeyed building shall not have oil filed transformers, even if it is at the ground level.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cdb2d0d81b1cc17d949167e72ac36e5f45f2f38f1fd14571f849d04ca2c605ad','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18393','GHBC-REQ-018393','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','Substations with very little combustible material, such as a dry type transformer, with Vacuum (or SF6) HT switchgear and ACB or MCCB for MV can be located in the basement as well as upper floors in a building with high load density in the upper floors.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d7d17f749a9570c5a8ac4706960764f9b1eae695bc12d825291648dd88d7acc4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18394','GHBC-REQ-018394','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','(Some functional buildings such as hospitals, air traffic control towers, computer centres are likely to have high loading in a few upper floors and in such cases, it may be preferable to provide oil-free substations at upper levels.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','64d3b122a0924437dedc9a9ca058cf3eaed2de3ad622b514ada455851aa4b54a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18395','GHBC-REQ-018395','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','This measure will decrease the current flow at various points, thereby contributing to reduction of vulnerability to fire). h) The power supply control to any such substation or transformer (located at basement levels or upper floors) shall be from a location on ground floor/first basement level having direct access from outside so that in case of fire, the electricity supply can be easily disconnected.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a6558c7e88102ac077fc1e899a2856a2ad2cd35ef01de4ae44d2332c15df34be','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18396','GHBC-REQ-018396','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','j) Oil filled transformers may be used only in substations located in separate single or two storeyed service buildings outside the main building structure and there shall at least 6 meter clear distance between the adjoining buildings and substation such that fire tender is able to pass between the two structures. k) If dry type transformer is used, it may be located adjacent to medium voltage switchgear in the form of unit type substation.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":6,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"ing structure and there shall at least 6 meter clear distance between "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ture and there shall at least 6 meter clear distance between th"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','281e3e47fea823f85d811ae3defb33dfe44d0ee7d9a198bb516f918640cd9f6d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18397','GHBC-REQ-018397','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','No separate room or fire barrier for the transformer is required, in a substation with oil free equipment.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d6c2f86483ef65443dd0bc0fd91f8e1f6535cc3976f8d618f0f75602af9323d1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18398','GHBC-REQ-018398','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','In such a case the room size will decrease.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','14af3aa1c59abdb196fa71a0e56de0054335d8217e2ded9ca079b707e2c0a8e9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18399','GHBC-REQ-018399','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','Layout of equipment has to keep the requirement that any one piece of equipment or subassembly can be taken out of service and out of the installed location, while keeping the remaining system in service. m) The emergency power supply (such as generating sets) should not be allowed to be installed above ground floor or below first basement level of building.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c8da1d139f79f610e31a8461e8f350c3ba9df9d6afaa75058252c1b0ae59b7ca','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18400','GHBC-REQ-018400','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','There shall be provision of separate direct escape and entry into these areas from outside so that in case of fire, electrical supplies can be disconnected to avoid additional loses which may be caused due to electrical supply, present at the time of fire. n) For transformers having large oil content (more than 2,000 litres).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2000,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"ers having large oil content (more than 2,000 litres)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2000,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":" large oil content (more than 2,000 litres)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b4bbc8ca8ffb08af708dcad3acf71138af61c52d9ccc4793245e188745e7f9bc','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18401','GHBC-REQ-018401','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','Rules of the Electricity Company of Ghana (ECG) as amended from time to time shall apply. p) Facility for connections from substation to adjoining building to feed essential emergency load in that building, such as escape route lighting, fire or sprinkler pumps, emergency communication systems shall be provided.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4efad5f457f631b09242e0a3a010cbf826d09d91751871f01262d19c2c0b0827','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18402','GHBC-REQ-018402','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','Similarly, the essential emergency load switchboard of this building or building complex should be so as to be capable of receiving power for such loads from the adjoin building or building complex, with adjoining building or building complex, with its own substation/DG sets shut off due to crisis conditions such as fire. q) The availability of power lines nearby may also be kept in view while deciding the location of the substation.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','47d07a7b79fe94011bd667eb4ea6e43ac770a78d0d60635725191d7b9b6103c5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18403','GHBC-REQ-018403','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.1','GHBC-C-004752','r) For detailed information regarding location of transformers reference may be made to good practice, s) All door openings from substation, electrical rooms, etc. should open towards outside. t) For acoustical enclosures/treatment reference may be made to: ‗Building Services- Acoustics, Sound Insulation and Noise Control‘.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','636c7900a17bf1e096a082e68e79156ff48e77501b1b0899501b31593b135873','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18404','GHBC-REQ-018404','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.2','GHBC-C-004753','The substations enclosure that is, walls, floor, ceiling, openings, doors, etc. shall have a 2 hour fire rating.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"ngs, doors, etc. shall have a 2 hour fire rating."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4c05a914d49d859f862226ca82190264406f128ca13250bc9a78788eca50edd4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18405','GHBC-REQ-018405','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.3','GHBC-C-004754','In allocating the area of substation, it is to be noted that the flow of electric power is from supply company‘s room to HV room, then to transformer and finally to the medium voltage switchgear room.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ac5ae2ace9a73f29aa2d24b51766417abe50dd56bcd4ccdd0b81eec58abdf819','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18406','GHBC-REQ-018406','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.4','28.4.2.3','GHBC-C-004754','The layout of the room shall be in accordance with this flow, so as to optimize the cables, bus-trunking etc. Visibility of equipment controlled from the operating point of the controlling switchgear is also a desirable feature, though it may not be achievable in case of large substations.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','19bea818800cab33ce34c093dbc34969bcb81f0f98290f13efc3e9e63633aebe','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
