('rowid-18423','GHBC-REQ-018423','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','For the purpose of the table an instantaneous water heater is deemed to be a water heater of any loading which heats water only while the tap is turned on and therefore uses electricity intermittently.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','faf4250526efbc4e4d4bff657472cbc2a298c1ac7e29f660f4f0b636713e5627','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
