('rowid-18442','GHBC-REQ-018442','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','g) Facilities including space at appropriate positions, relative to the location of the installed equipment has to be kept in the layout design for removal of equipment or sub-assemblies for repair or maintenance.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2c6ded04eaaf6b8388766e4d21c1f19f072e7a1ff98e359bcc22677e3a05f99f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18443','GHBC-REQ-018443','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','When it is located, other than the ground level with direct equipment access, a hatch or ramp shall be required.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','100dad2f52dc02e97fe4b8616ee9a07adda47f25371b863d609013a0086caef5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18444','GHBC-REQ-018444','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','h) Other environmental requirements under the provisions of Environment Protection Rules, 1986 as amended time-to-time shall be taken into account form the aspect of engine emissions including regarding the height of exhaust pipe and permitted noise levels/noise control.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','069096caeefdb50f624d19fdd973369421642b76bf7b1fc0cbbae85f0499efa7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18445','GHBC-REQ-018445','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','j) The capacity of standby generating set shall be chosen on the basis of essential light load, essential air conditioning load, essential equipment load and essential services load, such as one lift out of the bank of lifts, one or all water pumps, etc. Having chosen the capacity and number of generating sets, required space may be provided for their installation (See Annex D for general guidance).','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2228256b6e5f150028a96a29d1438d13b08d0d3114a7d160f096a7e478b9c48a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18446','GHBC-REQ-018446','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','k) The generating set should preferably be housed adjacent to MV switchgear in the substation building to enable transfer of electrical load quickly as well as to avoid transfer of vibration and noise to the main building.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b82d6cd8d11282d198c6abf01f3545a91812478ed3535d4170a0da53ce6a15f5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18447','GHBC-REQ-018447','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','Acoustics lining of the room shall be in line with the requirements of central Pollution Control Board (CPCB).','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dc7c027505e42351210c143c0c96b5f7f52f9067a914d251d008040509bf1f1a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18448','GHBC-REQ-018448','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','If DG Set is located outdoor, it shall be housed in acoustics enclosure.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2c9fce8a75f4b9a4e3afdd896adb66a92a85a5c4403bc94f06f1bf43f34d4dce','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18449','GHBC-REQ-018449','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','The generator house should have proper ventilation, fire fighting equipment, etc. l) Requirements of room 1)  The areas given above in respect of the different categories of rooms holds good if they are provided with windows and','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4d07fb49cb2a4c3d3dbff8072a8d899b9abd158c4114eb5b38196f89c7501415','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18450','GHBC-REQ-018450','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','independent access doors in accordance with local regulations.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dd303cd349f32b397fd2b9d16e2e08c175562d1b2ed88211323b93c0cf97af5c','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18451','GHBC-REQ-018451','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','2) All the rooms shall be provided with partitions up to the ceiling and shall have proper ventilation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','43dcdd6fdeb789fc4d6250f9352852b171553da29445c233015a66ee6997feae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18452','GHBC-REQ-018452','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','Special care should be taken to ventilate the transformer rooms and where necessary louvers at lower level and exhaust fans at higher level shall be provided at suitable locations.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f6d3824d7e2ef2f5fc388c555588bc061e8a4e0c2d46b965af436057b6297074','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18453','GHBC-REQ-018453','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','3) In order to prevent storm water entering the transformer and switch rooms through the soak-pits, the floor level, the substation shall be at least 15 cm above the highest flood water level that may be anticipated in the locality.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":15,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"evel, the substation shall be at least 15 cm above the highest flood wa"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3b8ff2692e882ba74d2979bb12e39cc54958fcd223dd1e95946462db02a91da6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18454','GHBC-REQ-018454','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','Also, facility shall be provided for automatic removal of water.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','00b31e67beedc1f0d2b3af9f4b4e9a8d18bee31a6dd9c3c118a1d76201500a48','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18455','GHBC-REQ-018455','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','4) The minimum height of high voltage switchgear room shall be 3.6m below the soffit of the beam. m) Fire compartmentation – It is advisable to provide fire compartmentation of buildings and segregation of associated wiring.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":3.6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"tage switchgear room shall be 3.6m below the soffit of the beam."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','97baa10bf84407e9fc51fc80a4f5e5e66632d860ded30b6fae1ecc1a6fc4cd0c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18456','GHBC-REQ-018456','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-004764','Busbar trunking of horizontal and vertical distribution type in place of cable based distribution system shall be used.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7c5239bea6a67dc8e81a8c645150b3c9f9500f9613101775f921761a739f3058','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18457','GHBC-REQ-018457','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.3','GHBC-C-004765','In large installations other than where a substation is provided, a separate switch room shall be provided; this shall be located as closely as possible to the electrical load centre preferably near the entrance of the building on the ground floor or on the first basement level, and suitable ducts shall be laid with minimum number of bends from the points of entry of the main supply cable to the position of the main switchgear.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f0128ccdeda6b0aadbfa825c6382a94669eb96161510434042e4e70b21fd0854','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18458','GHBC-REQ-018458','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.3','GHBC-C-004765','The switch room shall also be placed in such a position that rising ducts may readily be provided therefrom to the upper floors of the building in one straight vertical run.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4930411154e7dabcab7b8f2a503038777834b1a1629156470549dfb9d8d5585f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18459','GHBC-REQ-018459','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.3','GHBC-C-004765','In larger buildings, more than one rising duct may be required and then horizontal ducts may also be required for running cables from the switch room to the foot of each rising main.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fea3a0311792531492c75913616cb738e8580e0d0a6dfc6e9ed925e3839ef284','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18460','GHBC-REQ-018460','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.3','GHBC-C-004765','Such cable ducts shall be either be reserved for the electrical services only or provided with a means of segregation for medium and low voltage installations, such as call-bell systems; telephone installations, fire detection and alarm system, announcement or public address system.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6510e6289b62af3cb70cceee4f989103d41d447b740d98e6c2a0943c75df8b08','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18461','GHBC-REQ-018461','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.3','GHBC-C-004765','Cables for essential emergency','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d252ac1a7e26523b1868e007d1f2de71f736c026293888b485b7647476a97e3f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18462','GHBC-REQ-018462','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.3','GHBC-C-004765','services such as those related to fire detection, alarm and announcement should use either metal conduit in addition to physical segregation room power cables or use fire survival cables, so that the service is maintained even in the event of a fire at least for a period of about 20 min.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"t least for a period of about 20 min."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7d6f308becf7c86f074b8e1819dbdd427a14dc533acb99d64014fd7aae0cc452','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18463','GHBC-REQ-018463','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.4','GHBC-C-004766','and requirements of distribution panels The electrical control gear distribution panels and other apparatus, which are required on each floor may conveniently be mounted adjacent to the rising mains, and adequate space should be provided at each floor for this purpose.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b5ea85631cdb4c09a3c2bdee94329dd2d1effb3c7443f8060ca3db4b30084d60','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18464','GHBC-REQ-018464','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.5','GHBC-C-004767','The owner or the operator of any substation shall be collectively and severally be responsible for any lapse or neglect leading to an accident or an incidence of an avoidable abnormality and shall take care of the safety requirements as follows: a) Enclose the substations where necessary to prevent, so far as is reasonably practicable, danger or unauthorized access; b) Enclose any part of the substation, which is open to the air and contains live equipment which is not encased, with a fence or wall not less than 2.4m in height to prevent, so far as is reasonably practicable, danger or unauthorized access; c) Ensure that, so far as is reasonably practicable, there are at all times displayed:','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2.4,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"encased, with a fence or wall not less than 2.4m in height to prevent, so far"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.4,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"a fence or wall not less than 2.4m in height to prevent, so far "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5ce0676c1b3ac52ad1d7069241fd497e27c37df7006981ff7245fe40d723bfeb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18465','GHBC-REQ-018465','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.5','GHBC-C-004767','1) Sufficient safety signs of such size and placed in such positions as are necessary to give due warning of such danger as is reasonably foreseeable in the circumstances;','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a97ca848f2a2ef55ebff42282368d25e9d5fe4bb0189cb9e33d44ea179a8ad03','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18466','GHBC-REQ-018466','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.5','GHBC-C-004767','2) A notice which is placed in a conspicuous position and which gives the location or identification of the substation, the name of each generator or','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9b2a8f763fad7ff82465c8084468f80ffb29db709152dabc6653fdf8e386b69f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18467','GHBC-REQ-018467','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.5','GHBC-C-004767','distributor who owns or operates the substation equipment making up the substation and the telephone number where a suitably qualified person appointed for this purpose by the generator or distributor will be inconstant attendance; and','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2ad0e1fb92f54ffc4eee5eeacca1096635dd6bc0a8f1bfb44c2a5897b3fc6086','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18468','GHBC-REQ-018468','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.5','GHBC-C-004767','3) Such other signs, which are of such size and placed in such positions, as are necessary to give due warning of danger having regard to the siting of, the nature of, and the measures taken to ensure the physical security of, the substation equipment; and','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29b293cd8448be322336c120b778e6f98966ea972256a00d97d56d6de5eea0dc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18469','GHBC-REQ-018469','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.5','GHBC-C-004767','d) Take all reasonable precautions to minimize the risk of fire associated with the equipment.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cf9eab24bd3d2dc2e81dea8a6e98b4fc79bc377d5be1c89b543c66ea1fd5637f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18470','GHBC-REQ-018470','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.1','GHBC-C-004769','While overhead lines may not be relevant within buildings, regulations related to overhead lines are of concern from two different angles. a) Overhead liens may be required in building complexes, though use of underground cables is the preferred alternative.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','23346fdf620fc62db270359d28154e8a480931fe1879916b9896fc18e2621906','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18471','GHBC-REQ-018471','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.1','GHBC-C-004769','b) Overhead lines may be passing through the site of a building.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','659124db870f7825609c535b6bcd3fab8a3fd31cc3521ee15b88ae5a8fc28a30','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18472','GHBC-REQ-018472','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.1','GHBC-C-004769','In such a case the safety aspects are important for the construction activity in the vicinity of the overhead line as well as portions of low height buildings that may have to be constructed below the overhead lines.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fe4ae1e14cf01bb56542bd88db84336fabfc045c4d37ef68c384c1be29b7bcb4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18473','GHBC-REQ-018473','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.1','GHBC-C-004769','For minimum distance (vertical and horizontal) of electric liens/wires/cables from buildings, reference may be made to Part 3 ‗Development Control Rules and General Requirements‘. c) Any person responsible for erecting an overhead line will keep informed the authority(s) responsible for services in','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b82d773fd35e0c1d9bea806de72bbff0cd1db99e3207fb3417fb9159ccea79ba','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18474','GHBC-REQ-018474','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.1','GHBC-C-004769','that area for telecommunication, gas distribution, water and sewerage network, roads so as to have proper co-ordination to ensure safety.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e76534abcb53094153fcc259c270f1523adbc4f16825443fb90b106826e7ed04','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18475','GHBC-REQ-018475','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.1','GHBC-C-004769','He shall also publish the testing, energizing programme for the line in the interests of safety.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','321db8e343f32d5961bb6dbeda70ada431584bc48ac737dbbe744af382c388e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18476','GHBC-REQ-018476','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.2','GHBC-C-004770','Position, insulation and protection of overhead lines Any part of an overhead line which is not connected with earth and which is not ordinarily accessible shall be supported on insulators or surrounded by insulation.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7d7b381b69ca156a6065bd6e811bd2615b81252ab743152989b073ad38dfc1d7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18477','GHBC-REQ-018477','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.2','GHBC-C-004770','Any part of an overhead line which is not connected with earth and which is ordinarily accessible shall be: a) Made dead; or b) So insulated that it is protected, so far it is reasonably practicable, against mechanical damage or interference; or c) Adequately protected to prevent danger.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','20592856a7a61860fe53d579efcc67e3ae58641e654fd03dc6788c64c6546fd2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18478','GHBC-REQ-018478','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.2','GHBC-C-004770','Any person responsible for erecting a building or structure which will cause any part of an overhead line which is not connected with earth to become ordinarily accessible shall give reasonable notice to the generator or distributor who owns or operates the overhead line of his intention to erect that building or structure.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c806c1496914e88655f220a02702d64ca019a1a3ed4922e1ec8c29ac6325874c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18479','GHBC-REQ-018479','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.2','GHBC-C-004770','Any bare conductor not connected with earth, which is part of a low voltage overhead line, shall be situated throughout its length directly above a bare conductor which is connected with earth.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a1cf5b489a7918099b534a3d145fed4e97ad86687364aa37004703d9c0e7b79e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18480','GHBC-REQ-018480','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.2','GHBC-C-004770','No overhead line shall, so far as is reasonably practicable, come so close to any building,tree or structure as to cause danger.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','75cacc1a3cebd14d576c7b9f95d2dffe7b28de94558ce9b7d186bea1d2fb7dc5','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18481','GHBC-REQ-018481','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.2','GHBC-C-004770','In this regulation the expression ―ordinarily accessible‖ means the overhead line could be reached by hand if any scaffolding, ladder or other construction was erected or placed on/in, against or near to a building or structure.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','90d69628e23b731d9e826a56c1f539abf37b2f1478dd8d98084b7a546c72750e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18482','GHBC-REQ-018482','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.3','GHBC-C-004771','Precautions against access and warnings of dangers Every support carrying a high voltage overhead line shall, if the circumstances reasonably','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7a57a8e5ecb00e6a3307e12516986ef57c8c17a1ca41b356ebba1b3116b4ad15','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18483','GHBC-REQ-018483','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.3','GHBC-C-004771','require, be fitted with devices to prevent, so far it is reasonably practicable, any unauthorized person from reaching a position at which any such line would be a source of danger.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','477c65c3271b805c708ca5009f20ffa1df54206a4cfef53d6d8ea73f684b3a5f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18484','GHBC-REQ-018484','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.3','GHBC-C-004771','Every support carrying a high voltage overhead line, and every support carrying a low voltage line incorporating bare phase conductors, shall have attached to it sufficient safety signs and placed in such positions as are necessary to give due warning of such danger as is reasonably foreseeable in the circumstances.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c2f1cb3e924daabc8278e712777f1f3f047fc6c32518de75ee360268207918b9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18485','GHBC-REQ-018485','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.3','GHBC-C-004771','Poles supporting overhead lines near the road junctions and turnings shall be protected by a masonry or earth fill structure or metal barricade, to prevent a vehicle from directly hitting the pole, so that the vehicle, if out of control, is restrained from causing total damage to the live conductor system, likely to lead to a hazardous condition on the road or foot path or building.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9b32ede3572500a4e65f18e8161ac6363ff9fc48071e33c2f6722a89aef0fb16','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18486','GHBC-REQ-018486','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.6.4','GHBC-C-004772','Every stay wire which forms part of, or is attached to, any support carrying an overhead line incorporating bare phase conductors 9except where the support is a lattice steel structure or other structure entirely of metal and connected to earth) shall be fitted with an insulator no part of which shall be less than 3m above ground or above the normal height of any such line attached to that support.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":3,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"tor no part of which shall be less than 3m above ground or above the no"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"t of which shall be less than 3m above ground or above the nor"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8331c46b28fdde36026212e87ba7902e99c990b3d8f6f47f06e72a8c38fea0c9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18487','GHBC-REQ-018487','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.7.1','GHBC-C-004774','laying cables shall contact authority in charge of that area and find out the layout of: a)  water distribution pipe lines in the area; b)  sewage distribution network; c)  telecommunication network, and d)  gas pipeline network and plan the cable network in such a manner that the system is compatible, safe and noninterfering either during its installation or during its operation and maintenance.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7e2e25f41bf22c4b8c894b63420531eff4851d5f57bfbcc1f575e955cc312b88','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18488','GHBC-REQ-018488','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.7.1','GHBC-C-004774','Plan of the proposed cable installation shall be brought to the notice of the other authorities referred above.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f19514fe036539595595cbb794926dfacee0ff9734ffe9980b0ad038fdca641f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18489','GHBC-REQ-018489','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.7.2','GHBC-C-004775','as would be appropriate for the safety of the workmen of any of the systems shall be installed along with the cable installation.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2ac31ab02d247441d2660331cefee7b8cd98beaf35803aee022cf66e75de6815','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18490','GHBC-REQ-018490','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.7.2','GHBC-C-004775','Notification of testing and energization of the system shall also be suitably published for ensuring safety.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','18c3df9945470d3382dcec3e00812242c2abe9c8873359c0820aa3411ef951e4','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18491','GHBC-REQ-018491','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.7.3','GHBC-C-004776','laying cables shall have and, so far it is reasonably practicable, keep up to date, a map or series of maps indicating the position and depth below surface level of all networks or parts there for which the owns or operates.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ac54980bd57ea7458e7733717f0233740a5c5d24b611321567bc48b982e81df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18492','GHBC-REQ-018492','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.4.7.3','GHBC-C-004776','Any map prepared or kept shall be available for inspection by any of the municipal authority, other service providers, general public provided they have a reasonable cause for requiring to inspect any part of the map.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f3239db629b73c7b01e3dfdab5b617b421ee21c0fe0932eec2858453cbcb1558','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18493','GHBC-REQ-018493','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.1','GHBC-C-004778','Good lighting is necessary for all buildings and has three primary aims.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','26a2cd762048998be309e6d848ad0787acd9dfbf38ac115d41a3f3f2a218038c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18494','GHBC-REQ-018494','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.1','GHBC-C-004778','The first aim is to promote work and other activities carried out within the building; the second aim is to promote the safety of the people using the building; and the third aim is to create, in conjunction with the structure and decoration, a pleasing environment conducive to interest of the occupants and a sense of their well-being.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','64d7ff5e3220e9a55adcf07b1adb85a30371ece5fc25a664b5b759023c6d770e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18495','GHBC-REQ-018495','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.1.1','GHBC-C-004779','a)  careful planning of the brightness and colour pattern within both the working areas and the surroundings so that attention is drawn naturally to the important areas, detail is seen quickly and accurately and the room is free from any sense of gloom or monotony (see 9.4.1.3);','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fc8d8320c70e61339abd4f2b04589a2cd99b64ec3588a5a9fdf0d9936dce7cd2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18496','GHBC-REQ-018496','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.1.1','GHBC-C-004779','b)  using directional lighting where appropriate to assist perception of task detail and to give good modeling;','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','25ffd41f8df8e265eb3d9a7b0f55e6671e3510139b45048c19d2143b2367891b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18497','GHBC-REQ-018497','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.1.1','GHBC-C-004779','c)  controlling direct and reflected glare from light sources to eliminate visual discomfort;','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','46f496b452e303f3043582ab75a47aed1f12d3e402d0d6ead7c6dcee745a9747','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18498','GHBC-REQ-018498','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.1.1','GHBC-C-004779','d)  in artificial lighting installations, minimizing flicker from certain types of lamps and paying attention to the colour rendering properties of the light;','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93ec42bcdd201c9c107e0cdc6e3fc2e120c56700b63496ca078fc67cdbce07ed','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18499','GHBC-REQ-018499','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.1.1','GHBC-C-004779','e)  correlating lighting throughout the building to prevent excessive differences between adjacent areas so as to reduce the risk of accidents; and','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','712fe1a387a6be1c4bd3534781a9de1a5d5ecbf054a2ef28b97125aeaa84b370','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18500','GHBC-REQ-018500','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.1.1','GHBC-C-004779','f)  installation of emergency lighting systems, where necessary.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1dc4a076c2529c641ee2aba49b9f36beee6d7ac51c65c9aef3898a61d6a17e94','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18501','GHBC-REQ-018501','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2','GHBC-C-004780','The brightness pattern seen within an interior maybe considered as composed of three main parts — the task itself, immediate background of the task and the general surroundings of walls, ceiling, floor, equipment and furnishings.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3a5dedada25f58c13feb91a4eb00febe67451014318ae9a807930672aff8be88','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18502','GHBC-REQ-018502','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2.1','GHBC-C-004781','demands are small, the levels of illumination derived from a criterion of visual performance alone maybe too low to satisfy the other requirements.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','14a5951c082511af2c2565efd09abf519eb4b2a93a76e9cf4cde6d6579ca6736','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18503','GHBC-REQ-018503','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2.1','GHBC-C-004781','For such situations, therefore, illuminance recommendations are based on standards of welfare, safety and amenity judged appropriate to the occupations; they are also sufficient to give these tasks brightness which ensures that the visual performance exceeds the specified minimum.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9846490e9c4398a21c423a60429ff02dafa3ca1602afc796f2ccb6056e99ddd9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18504','GHBC-REQ-018504','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2.1','GHBC-C-004781','Unless there are special circumstances associated with the occupation, it is recommended that the illuminance of all working areas within a building should generally be 150 lux, even though the visual demands of the occupation might be satisfied by lower values.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":" building should generally be 150 lux, even though the visual dem"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','411d061191a1364ccf4228feeb6a78b5db27d3dfe65c790c20403cf244023704','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18505','GHBC-REQ-018505','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2.2','GHBC-C-004782','Where work takes place over the whole utilizable area of room, the illumination over that area should be reasonably uniform and it is recommended that the uniformity ratio (minimum illuminance divided by average illuminance levels) should be not less than 0.7 for the working area.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.7,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"illuminance levels) should be not less than 0.7 for the working area."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5a1aa1c34f0df93b242e4b7313fba51b087a24509d7909f312b1f5cb3c3aeaf8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18506','GHBC-REQ-018506','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2.3','GHBC-C-004783','to an occupation has been determined, the brightness of the other parts of the room should be planned to give a proper emphasis to visual comfort and interest.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','64ebc02b3efd8372ee2d39fc45da5bf1f525f9419bb0b6e679b99b987ebe0813','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18507','GHBC-REQ-018507','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2.3','GHBC-C-004783','A general guide for the brightness relationship within the normal field of vision should be as follows:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f79030f2a418ac949795d0e377a35db1364ee136d4b0eeea513057d971efad3b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18508','GHBC-REQ-018508','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2.3','GHBC-C-004783','a) For high task brightness Maximum (above 100 cd/m2):','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','98253f7db6a30df325257c72e214995c2517669b1ed31fcabac6b094493f9ab5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18509','GHBC-REQ-018509','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2.3','GHBC-C-004783','1) Between the visual task 3 to l and the adjacent areas like table tops.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4bf7faba4c07fd3968fd2514187bc028343d2f36dfd7cb619521f39a6e0d16a4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18510','GHBC-REQ-018510','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2.3','GHBC-C-004783','2) Between the visual task 10 to 1 and the remote areas of the room.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','58cd91a483dca7d2d6471761a999af879531bb6ab1ffb4b48ee10a1bbeed9348','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18511','GHBC-REQ-018511','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.2.3','GHBC-C-004783','b) For low and medium task brightness (below 100 cd/m2): The task should be brighter than both the background and the surroundings; the lower the task brightness, the less critical is the relationship.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','16c847b834033e816634d1c8eab1d39112102982878ec5adab39c64d4b00ec11','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18512','GHBC-REQ-018512','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3','GHBC-C-004784','Table 3 gives recommended values of illuminance commensurate with the general standards of lighting described in this clause and related to many occupations and buildings; These are valid under most of the conditions whether the illumination is by daylighting, artificial lighting or a combination of the two.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0849f80226d3a343aeeca1c37d8a7b7ee1379e80871784f365286b2299fb845f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18513','GHBC-REQ-018513','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3','GHBC-C-004784','The great variety of visual tasks makes it impossible to list them all and those given should be regarded as representing types of task.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6e015970b70b52675e980ad0b7f3e7ccfcc636a0991edaba125807cfa524b5df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18514','GHBC-REQ-018514','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.1','GHBC-C-004785','are grouped within the following four clauses: a) industrial buildings and process; b) offices, schools and public buildings; c) surgeries and hospitals; and d) hotels, restaurants, shops and homes.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','697e2781df1c93ffe599dff4471e4a7f2106fb7fbe48a7186c3ebf61a2722825','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18515','GHBC-REQ-018515','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.2','GHBC-C-004786','in Table 4 are those to be maintained at all time on the task.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7c092ed05a0793aecf26d31a5678e9ffd071bf5125225fde47efe4189c203610','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18516','GHBC-REQ-018516','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.2','GHBC-C-004786','As circumstances maybe significantly different for different interiors used for the same application or for different conditions for the same kind of activity, a range of illuminances is recommended for each type of interior or activity instead of a single value of illuminance.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7e809b70b0c591c7ec9043dfce941e9127b5120ea1b1335f0c464a6cd3b49e7e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18517','GHBC-REQ-018517','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.2','GHBC-C-004786','Each range consists of three successive steps of the recommended scale of illuminances.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6c088569d772425444f057511b6f5b50749c9140f1a3ea2191f538bbe352bd7f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18518','GHBC-REQ-018518','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.2','GHBC-C-004786','For working interiors the middle value of each range represents the recommended service illuminance that would be used unless one or more of the factors mentioned below apply.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','566b9419340945dcbec37cbecb35d313cb970a0b6ec438cef9a3885160f7d3d3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18519','GHBC-REQ-018519','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.2.1','GHBC-C-004787','should be used when: a) unusually low reflectance or contrasts are present in the task;','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2175d83be7e254fb3c00969b29b94bb638a9d4e6f0df99200a4860e759d0a70b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18520','GHBC-REQ-018520','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.2.1','GHBC-C-004787','b) errors are costly to rectify; c) visual work is critical; d) accuracy or higher productivity is of great importance; and e) the visual capacity of the worker makes it necessary.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e0548abf0c04cfe9eb569b0c30dacfb42c6e3116266082797db5fa3fe74c2ad2','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18521','GHBC-REQ-018521','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.2.2','GHBC-C-004788','be used when: a) reflectance or contrast are unusually high; b) speed and accuracy is not important; and c) the task is executed only occasionally.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9c0481ccb342337160d5be98f019f22b8a06d0fa9e3dc5ab985c19ec1f39f7ac','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18522','GHBC-REQ-018522','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.3','GHBC-C-004789','carried out throughout an interior, general illumination level to the recommended value on the working plane is necessary; where the precise height and location of the task are not known or cannot be easily specified, the recommended value is that on horizontal plane 850 mm above floor level.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":850,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"e is that on horizontal plane 850 mm above floor level."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a83fba7ddd044118dd35549d7a1652daf05b3d559c19cdf12b5251d66298c901','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18523','GHBC-REQ-018523','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.3','GHBC-C-004789','Note: For an industrial task, working plane for the purpose of general illumination levels is that on a work place which is generally 750 mm above the floor level.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":750,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"work place which is generally 750 mm above the floor level."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','56da45c67ce62fb9b22c038cffbb1cf61a302ca4823fdcfe2621f72000cd1593','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18524','GHBC-REQ-018524','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.3','GHBC-C-004789','For certain purposes, such as viewing the objects of arts, the illumination levels recommended are for the vertical plane at which the art pieces are placed.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','969279142ea167a2a0acb733ab4e955fea10b0f9950e55ba38daca8544d4e27a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18525','GHBC-REQ-018525','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.4','GHBC-C-004790','Where the task is localized, the recommended value is that for the task only; it need not, and sometimes should not, be the general level of illumination used throughout the interior.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5f3a44befd14b8fcd2b81e3b6de623f3210d774c30651b95b3caddcc064114ab','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18526','GHBC-REQ-018526','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.3.4','GHBC-C-004790','Some processes, such as industrial inspection process, call for lighting of specialized design, in which case the level of illumination is only one of the several factors to be taken into account.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db2ea527045863585f4a762084842ebd5856e03f9bec8e188c8043543b034c56','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18527','GHBC-REQ-018527','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.4','GHBC-C-004791','Excessive contrast or abrupt and large changes in brightness produce the effect of glare.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f37e0ced2bd515ffa38262f13da3a7105de55a4fc2476fb1f026343b179b17da','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18528','GHBC-REQ-018528','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.4','GHBC-C-004791','When glare is present, the efficiency of vision is reduced and small details or subtle changes in scene cannot be perceived.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f18b2f288943e60ca7c26eb911df03a409bcade639051e578e31ddb5dbb58c9c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18529','GHBC-REQ-018529','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.4','GHBC-C-004791','It may be:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed3618995f2980d1433b2724bc8723310848e808f6d7c35133830511eaca9290','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18530','GHBC-REQ-018530','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.4','GHBC-C-004791','a) direct glare due to light sources within the field of vision; b) reflected glare due to reflections from light sources or surfaces of excessive brightness; and c) veiling glare where the peripheral field is comparatively very bright.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5350de524ac6050987c538997427b6db14529a7fe08e3fe7cb2fc4471304a046','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18531','GHBC-REQ-018531','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.4.1','GHBC-C-004792','An example of glare sources in daylighting is the view of the bright sky through a window or skylight, especially when the surrounding wall or ceiling is comparatively dark or weakly illuminated.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7de8eb62ca33e72f89a6aacbfb89f87227260a29c88bf693f42a4bf64d31b95a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18532','GHBC-REQ-018532','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.4.1','GHBC-C-004792','Glare can be minimized in this case either by shielding the open sky from direct sight by louvers, external hoods or deep reveals, curtains or other shading devices or by cross lighting the surroundings to a comparable level.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','901ba1f6354ab204bca66f2d8725d4180449f4df0899fe3b2cbf08ab092ef831','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18533','GHBC-REQ-018533','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.4.1','GHBC-C-004792','A gradual transition of brightness from one portion to the other within the field of vision always avoids or minimizes the glare discomfort.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc62eeca31fb9c5f20689a0f0397431e88c6b499a6f85f21ee1b3f19e0f8ab0b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18534','GHBC-REQ-018534','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5','GHBC-C-004793','Lighting for movement about a building Most buildings are complexes of working areas and other areas, such as passages, corridors, stairways, lobbies and entrances.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6d5bfa66076c2b1e4733a96151c351aa5f29655e0567bd2bd2a5764cb09af1ee','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18535','GHBC-REQ-018535','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5','GHBC-C-004793','The lighting of','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','212e2f08710eb598447aa75099476bec78e3f540b3ed4e4ef72e2ea48a982aaa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18536','GHBC-REQ-018536','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5','GHBC-C-004793','all these areas should be properly correlated to give safe movement within the building at all tides.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5477eb300b13dbfdb40ae64fc8a3e552b239a29db97a413259cf1e1489c59217','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18537','GHBC-REQ-018537','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.1','GHBC-C-004794','Accidents may result if people leave a welllighted working area and pass immediately into corridors or on to stairways where the lighting is inadequate, as the time needed for adaptation to the lower level may be too long to permit obstacles or the treads of stairs to be seen sufficiently quickly.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d05ed22ed1810ad987c93871705505000e495ac515077fb1ff9c8ffb3200f535','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18538','GHBC-REQ-018538','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.1','GHBC-C-004794','For the same reason, it is desirable that the illumination level of rooms which open off a working area should be fairly high even though the rooms may be used only occasionally.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3a72f276da96b9c232dc554bf5ddb2f2552efce5d9faedf391a9504182e08a38','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18539','GHBC-REQ-018539','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.1','GHBC-C-004794','It is important, when lighting stairways, to prevent disability from glare caused by direct sight of bright sources to emphasize the edges of the treads and to avoid confusing shadows.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','63a06291f50124a53ccf043d5590cfeeffd3700fe6dc052fee7cc5d1b1e12a1e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18540','GHBC-REQ-018540','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.1','GHBC-C-004794','The same precautions should be taken in the lighting of cat-walks and stairways on outdoor industrial plants.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ddf237d65339bdc1e9909b3f024b93254bb28ca75000b4eb6479c38d16e4aa88','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18541','GHBC-REQ-018541','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.2','GHBC-C-004795','The problems of correctly grading the lighting within a building to allow adequate time for adaptation when passing from one area to another area are particularly acute at building entrances.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93e78c5d343c11eecc92095e1cf21127bcf1f22edef9560f45478de006c5f97d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18542','GHBC-REQ-018542','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.2','GHBC-C-004795','These are given below:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bb5ece7259cfec9e98644c4967af8dca62f76439c2722b6fe9c0e57d14867016','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18543','GHBC-REQ-018543','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.2','GHBC-C-004795','a.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','26c83d56640cb442927cbf853e43a98235fe0b908eb79da7aff527834741e56f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18544','GHBC-REQ-018544','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.2','GHBC-C-004795','By day, people entering a building will be adapted to the very high levels of brightness     usually present outdoors and there is risk of accident if entrance areas, particularly any steps, are poorly lighted.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','235ceeafdf303c51f4fd7b22e1af696880709a819ebf405b48be72faebb2a552','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18545','GHBC-REQ-018545','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.2','GHBC-C-004795','This problem may often be overcome by arranging windows to give adequate natural lighting at the immediate entrance, grading to lower levels further inside the entrance area.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5c63768c1755ebf75879cfa1b639f949acd44c5dd865be632503dbcd64bae4c0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18546','GHBC-REQ-018546','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.2','GHBC-C-004795','Where this cannot be done, supplementary artificial lighting should be installed to raise the level of illumination to an appropriate value.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29f2e1f307938adb4a129fc86a14dd2490ce7ff34a298b17430a28cb9b545390','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18547','GHBC-REQ-018547','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.2','GHBC-C-004795','b.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3af8400604e91b6de4a21e1d24e07f24b118ea4b8a595643e39adfee54821407','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18548','GHBC-REQ-018548','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.2','GHBC-C-004795','At night it is desirable to light entrance halls and lobbies so that the illumination level reduces towards the exit and so that no bright fittings are in the line of sight of people leaving the building.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5419533343178e986f4f63da011ad2cc14649bfc0ec878115a3432d90c77ac7a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18549','GHBC-REQ-018549','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.5.2','GHBC-C-004795','Any entrance steps to the building should be welllighted by correctly screened fittings.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6a83dcd877ff43dd91ba2bf3eb79f325140609e537745102ca271117e1bcebfc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18550','GHBC-REQ-018550','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.1.6','GHBC-C-004796','principles of good lighting, reference may be made to IS 3646: Part 1- Code of practice for interior illumination.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["IS 3646"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0d7e159c3bdecc16c1051389437c3c9b9eedb815e1593d4415c80bcb300d5f6a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18551','GHBC-REQ-018551','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2','GHBC-C-004797','The primary source of lighting for daylighting is the sun.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7c589f24d169228d0d789bb6ea581b54673306b61cf0639ac5b287f5432298b9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18552','GHBC-REQ-018552','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2','GHBC-C-004797','The light received by the earth from the sun consists of two parts, namely, direct solar illuminance and sky illuminance.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f4288bfd847b79d082fdc20d9628dbd8841915a131c3e02f962fdbddd143514b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18553','GHBC-REQ-018553','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2','GHBC-C-004797','For the purposes of daylighting design, direct solar illuminance shall not be considered and only sky illuminance shall be taken as contributing to illumination of the building interiors during the day.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b154004c47dbea62dde31bed8258040e5dc39230e4ca916691bead1213ae71c5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18554','GHBC-REQ-018554','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.1','GHBC-C-004798','depends on the position of the sun defined by its altitude, which in turn, varies with the latitude of the locality, the day of the year and the time of the day.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3b07b62603e425204726cf57c3a176b7ea3440908b74c9fb7365d7fd66c9f88b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18555','GHBC-REQ-018555','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.2','GHBC-C-004799','illuminance (diffuse illuminance) values which are exceeded for about 90 percent of the daytime working hours may be taken as outdoor design illuminance values for ensuring adequacy of daylighting design.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":90,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":" which are exceeded for about 90 percent of the daytime working hours "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f29322f2cabfd6dab0cfd5d0f6be58b6b9e95c1a0127a3a90cee2ed1945cb930','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18556','GHBC-REQ-018556','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.2','GHBC-C-004799','The outdoor design sky illuminance varies for different climatic regions of the country.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2a21dcfc29842d2155810c7f4a2533512561627e1d4c068559fbd247c4f240e7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18557','GHBC-REQ-018557','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.2','GHBC-C-004799','The recommended design sky illuminance values are 8000 lux for composite climate, 9000 lux for warm humid climate, and 10500 for hot-dry climate.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":8000,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"gn sky illuminance values are 8000 lux for composite climate, 9000"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":9000,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"00 lux for composite climate, 9000 lux for warm humid climate, and"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7772056cb0b4b8211c41c60d4c43d7748916b5d02a284ea233ac1fd297d83c63','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18558','GHBC-REQ-018558','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.2','GHBC-C-004799','For integration with the artificial lighting during daytime working hours an increase of 500 lux in the recommended sky design illuminance for daylighting is suggested.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":500,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":" working hours an increase of 500 lux in the recommended sky desi"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0d8d377200a5d5d6fd5c4b1a94a49facd7ae311efc81069c9e7904a7735a46cc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18559','GHBC-REQ-018559','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.3','GHBC-C-004800','The daylight factor is dependent on the sky luminance distribution, which varies with atmospheric conditions.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','076df52748786fdbb08fddf173e74b9641ecdc181cc72175a9e8a5d46e57f730','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18560','GHBC-REQ-018560','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.3','GHBC-C-004800','A clear design sky with its non-uniform distribution of luminance is adopted for the purposes of design in this clause.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','39d22bd5c86692b1bd3b43aa6c480f83e8188cb762addd969e931bf5459c2ad6','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18561','GHBC-REQ-018561','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.4','GHBC-C-004801','Daylight factor is the sum of all the daylight reaching on an indoor reference point from the following sources: a)  the direct sky visible from the point; b) external surfaces reflecting light directly (see Note 1) to the point; and c) internal surfaces reflecting and interreflecting light to the point.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','547246a28957813d083ee83e95af451f30ae0f8f001ff8dc0825e2b09058cf55','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18562','GHBC-REQ-018562','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.4','GHBC-C-004801','Notes: 1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0aa9bcd031011285cddc9d90ac49a3371e332409fb67f8c2322ba9078693dafe','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18563','GHBC-REQ-018563','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.4','GHBC-C-004801','External surface reflection may be computed approximately only for points at the centre of the room, and for detailed analysis procedures are complicated and these may be ignored for actual calculations.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e44999de0b1e8d21bf5371995eab5ac1f78fca62098559a86e78ed0717d1b7ae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18564','GHBC-REQ-018564','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.4','GHBC-C-004801','2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c92c6fa248dadce9d5581b126276fd6a904a74691c45fb0a4579d8a8df62fdf7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18565','GHBC-REQ-018565','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.4','GHBC-C-004801','Each of the three components, when expressed as a ratio or percent of the simultaneous external illuminance on the horizontal plane, defines respectively the sky component (SC), the external reflected component (ERC) and the internal reflected component (IRC) of the daylight factor.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ba3e210e60671c639389b053828f851334159d96a0a15a1addf38e4e5932b7c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18566','GHBC-REQ-018566','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.4.1','GHBC-C-004802','plane only are usually taken, as the working plane in a room is generally horizontal; however, the factors in vertical planes should also be considered when specifying daylighting values for special cases, such as daylighting on classrooms, blackboards, pictures and paintings hung on walls.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e6b3ab3e2ec38e776498a08bb7f68a29e35cc4776f058d49e7be2159ec9c3b74','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18567','GHBC-REQ-018567','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.5','GHBC-C-004803','Sky component for a window of any size is computed by the use of the appropriate table of Appendix A.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','93d262ccddb42ce09f54fcae5d1e7ec128d5d71625d1034ada4a13adc58106ca','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
