('rowid-18569','GHBC-REQ-018569','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.5','28.5.2.5','GHBC-C-004803','b) The daylight area of the prescribed sky component should not normally be less than half the total area of the room.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ae82ae6667578aa012b770eea4d35e51a5007d0f3532eaa38a4dd1fe9041eb77','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
