('rowid-18692','GHBC-REQ-018692','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.5.4.3.3','GHBC-C-004843','The following steps shall be followed for the use of the nomograph:','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c9d4e6161f24df16aa182a079f1617fa05f822fe5319165d00848c5866bc9d95','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18693','GHBC-REQ-018693','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.5.4.3.3','GHBC-C-004843','a) Step 1 — Decide the desired illumination level depending upon the task illumination requirement in the proposed room and read the value of watts per square metre on the curve corresponding to the required illumination level.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5c25bcb16aa3d1d594df1671884741fe62763e2d78b26bb0d1adfca36c99aff8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
