('rowid-18697','GHBC-REQ-018697','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.5.4.3.3','GHBC-C-004843','However, if the fenestration provided is less than the required value, the wattage of supplementary artificial lights should be increased proportionately to make up for the deficiency of natural illumination.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9e0bf0f6f1427f1793181a3c8fe9e60aa98bb25c5dffe2cef7228b40a916e59','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
