('rowid-18927','GHBC-REQ-018927','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.1','GHBC-C-004870','In the planning and design of an electrical wiring installation, due consideration shall be made of all the prevailing conditions.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4e43f75536f5b778507320f8724f900e0b3cd54564007bbaa0b8ca05478e3b64','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18928','GHBC-REQ-018928','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.1','GHBC-C-004870','It is recommended that advice of a competent electrical engineer be sought at the initial stage itself with a view to providing an installation, that will prove adequate for its intended purpose be reliable and safe and efficient.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2b5b048fc2c464ae7283fc9eba0c6c32dcdbbedaf16ae066ddcc7ffeefcc003b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18929','GHBC-REQ-018929','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.1','GHBC-C-004870','A certain redundancy in the electrical system is necessary and has to be built in from the initial design stage itself.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f4e332430608cc53410bf1ff64a6fd227b0d535080ecb23153dda2229a893070','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18930','GHBC-REQ-018930','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.1','GHBC-C-004870','The extent of redundancy will depend on the type of load, its criticality, normal hours of use, quality of power supply in that area, co-ordination with the standby power supply, capacity to meet the starting current requirements of large motors, etc.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b12491350b3213bcba8a286ed73f1ff43663e9bc46357348348392d24eada86','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
