('rowid-18932','GHBC-REQ-018932','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.2.2','GHBC-C-004873','and above, the relative advantage of high voltage three-phase supply should be considered.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bced5ea04283c352d812d81543bfb662452466c0b423a9ca769ebd515f85e4ad','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18933','GHBC-REQ-018933','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.2.2','GHBC-C-004873','Though the use of high voltage supply entails the provisions of space for the capital cost of providing suitable transformer substation at the consumer‘s premises, the following advantages are gained:','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bac8c5740a24840b1545637a1a7ff3bb092dba9e320225834ea4e3cee670dd47','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18934','GHBC-REQ-018934','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.2.2','GHBC-C-004873','a) advantage in tariff;','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','84a451c44a730cc3a73cddbbb2272eb8f96ac4a5a16cfe07c67e21327ebcc298','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18935','GHBC-REQ-018935','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.2.2','GHBC-C-004873','b) more effective earth fault protection for heavy current circuits; c) elimination of interference with supplies to other consumers permitting the use of large size motors, welding plant, etc., and d) better control of voltage regulation and more constant supply voltage.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b1c9ce136ae660525896e6ea574c14a6e3dc43e44058e22e0431b44b249e5498','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18936','GHBC-REQ-018936','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.2.2','GHBC-C-004873','Note: Additional safety precautions required to be observed in HV installations shall also be kept in view.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e74a8d6772bafcf8c447bfbd8a7abfe5ff457e5914014003f5f36294ccdfd85b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18937','GHBC-REQ-018937','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.2.2','GHBC-C-004873','In many cases there may be no choice available to the consumer, as most of the licenses have formulated their policy of correlating the supply voltage with the connected load or the contract demand.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7b03fb707fd089bf48e5127a1fe72d508bac74a1361e062d8b2e975953f63d86','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18938','GHBC-REQ-018938','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.2.2','GHBC-C-004873','Generally the supply is at 400/230 volts, 11 kV (or 22 kV) for loads up to 5 MVA and 33 kV or 66 kV for consumers of more than 5 MVA.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":5,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"s, 11 kV (or 22 kV) for loads up to 5 MVA and 33 kV or 66 kV for co"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":5,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":" kV or 66 kV for consumers of more than 5 MVA."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"kV (or 22 kV) for loads up to 5 MVA and 33 kV or 66 kV for cons"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"kV for consumers of more than 5 MVA."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','dfccfcd88668a7a595257e6afe6443ce39878ad02eaddc0d387b749a7cb62a38','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18939','GHBC-REQ-018939','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.2.3','GHBC-C-004874','heavy electric demands occur at scattered locations, the economics of electrical distribution at high voltage from the main substation to other subsidiary transformer substations or to certain items of plant, such as large motors and furnaces, should be considered.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6d4b0b19a96d955012d4b1376d0622cb63b6b62a638b5f7e0a9bdb88000294b0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18940','GHBC-REQ-018940','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.2.3','GHBC-C-004874','The relative economy attainable by use of medium or high voltage distribution and high voltage plant is a matter for expert judgement and individual assessment in the light of experience by a professionally qualified electrical engineer.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','da37ee1acbf7cb6cb08cdd4f7ca8843ae607a7cdbd0e73d52fdec4d0993187b3','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
