('rowid-18972','GHBC-REQ-018972','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','Generally three types of bus ducts namely nonsegregated, segregated and isolated phase bus duct shall be used.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eacb2ba7e897660e3cb6813c14f42941b2442e90e6244d7ad14c8b7c396cdf14','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18973','GHBC-REQ-018973','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','The non-segregated bus ducts consists of three phase busbars running in a common enclosure made of steel or aluminum.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4c12da4153cfdab7706a5a66298f5a45fcbcfbf9abdc649bd47c22d9dd8a7ffb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18974','GHBC-REQ-018974','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','The enclosure shall provide safety for the operational personnel and reduces chances of faults.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5a4590ef8787759f3aa37c4b17382628ebe5ec24129730ade91a7c807fe80443','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18975','GHBC-REQ-018975','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','The enclosures shall be effectively grounded.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fddcc19d31db3eb44476255f6987fbe818823bac1f066a0e6c6aba2518fbf5b2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18976','GHBC-REQ-018976','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','Segregated phase bus duct are similar to nonsegregated phase duct except that metal or insolation barriers are provided between phase conductors to reduce chances of phase to phase faults.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8560f26dc8391537be8acc82167cc074dfbb325a5e32672fc43aeadb43668678','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18977','GHBC-REQ-018977','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','However, it is preferable to use metal barriers.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','42c0e4b0f78b147c346aca3145c3bff604343dba17974fb9f057702c73e5076c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18978','GHBC-REQ-018978','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','In the case of isolated bus ducts, each phase conductor shall be housed in separate nonmagnetic enclosures.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0dab74c8015afe3af363974d182cb394a24af13271c67660b70532aa3e0a5ab6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18979','GHBC-REQ-018979','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','The bus duct shall be made of clauses which are assembled together at site to make complete assembly.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2f7cda27b1940607133f216eec28eba43af7221479c6d3ffe970b17f09251cc8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18980','GHBC-REQ-018980','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','The enclosure shall be of either round or square shape and welded construction.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','31774b5ba431a383c87d5d1852616e1bf1c50d789310af73f6e9bfd6beb21ea9','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18981','GHBC-REQ-018981','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','The enclosures of all phases in general to be supported on a common steel structure.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','97bf4f51d4bdd68eb00edab8b74d84951a39596e15a00166cc14caadc043e467','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18982','GHBC-REQ-018982','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','Provision of fire protection shall be provided in all openings in accordance with Part 3 ‗Use and Occupancy‘.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','287279cb7acb064df8cc5d8161145b85000eae2b66d02eb8b26767cd13e4ca59','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18983','GHBC-REQ-018983','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-004885','Fire separation in openings shall be provided using materials having 2h fire resistance rating.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"ovided using materials having 2h fire resistance rating."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7489ba42f97f784a525719fb6ce54c57d4bfa01f472cd5189af6b294706e5b71','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18984','GHBC-REQ-018984','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','Where heavy loads are to be carried, busbar systems are preferred.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a7eaf436f85030890d6e56f38b36499958c89ba7ac1b2627032f85bdb8bb2e93','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18985','GHBC-REQ-018985','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','The busbars are available for continuous run from point to point or with tap offs at standard intervals and have to be chosen as per specific requirement.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e6f5535b81c18a93e2a1f5bafa9f346ada62b1c3c004aa6c7021ece59d06fcb3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18986','GHBC-REQ-018986','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','MV/LV busbar trunking shall be a type-tested switchgear and control gear assembly in the form of an enclosed system.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','00a859751224ded56fd4b1ee7501fedd82cea9755791ffc37c36981147af12f0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18987','GHBC-REQ-018987','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','There are two types of MV/LV bus duct system for power distribution system: a) conventional type b) compact and sandwich type.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5649ffd27f245a00c4565cc0acdd0bb853ff857906726479b62eceacd453973b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18988','GHBC-REQ-018988','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','Conventional type bus duct is used for large power handling between transformer and switchger or between switchgear and large power loads, such as compressor drive motor etc. This type is generally used in plant rooms, riser shafts, substations etc. Compact type is available either air insulated or sandwich type for use within areas of the building which are put to other higher (aesthetic) level of use.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c99e353c67f89ee5ef24a2620af290300621b6cd0050c158d5034259d46fe8df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18989','GHBC-REQ-018989','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','They could be used in false ceiling spaces or even in corridors and shafts for distribution without any false ceiling as they provide an aesthetically acceptable finish to merge with other building elements such as beams, ducts or pipes in functional buildings.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1549a67f17710d1d19eadeaa22619cc8966c72510ee04745bd36007c27f68960','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18990','GHBC-REQ-018990','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','The class of protection shall be specific depending on the requirement at the place of installation.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b0ad05d97ed6f21eca0daec62fd4aeb39c161082854bfb4d1290b024b091eefe','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-18991','GHBC-REQ-018991','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','Protection class (IPxx) will automatically identify the ventilation, protection from weather, water, dust, etc.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c356970f99a4b2a8fc0f3f0bd586e61199136c715e345bec7f6fe01824304cfa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18992','GHBC-REQ-018992','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','In modern building technology, high demands are made of the power distribution system and its individual components: a) Long life and good service quality, b) Safe protection in the event of fire, c) Low fire load, d) Low space requirement, and e) Minimum effort involved in carrying out retrofits.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','60ac518d17d40de692633234bf586a9ab0a6e18de221ea9d3336b36de795a608','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18993','GHBC-REQ-018993','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','The high load density in modern large buildings and high rise buildings demands compact and safe solution for the supply of power.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1c91d9d7410dc493f0e1c8a5753590386b103005df40a74db1b108df55de3f53','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18994','GHBC-REQ-018994','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','The use of busbar trunking system is ideal for such applications.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eb46973a654977159987db3f28ffefc3b1ab4ee08ad58b3d41b1f1d429f087b0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18995','GHBC-REQ-018995','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','Bas bar trunking can be installed in vertical risers ducts or horizontally in passages for transmission and distribution of power.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','79fb03e14603183e4be4e09dad779df9cc7eb8b554a94d8c0d92d9e825749cec','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18996','GHBC-REQ-018996','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','Busbar trunking systems allow electrical installations to be planned in a simple and clear fashion.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dbedea8b0affdcc614514d9f548d02d7bfa738311a9f673d5bfe2b4443d19ec4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18997','GHBC-REQ-018997','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','In the building complexes, additional safety demands with respect to fire barriers and fire load and use of bus bar trunking meets this requirement.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','32cf02a7f2b668016f6b4df2a9c2e7f7966b8cb10aa57128bf7308935343d7f3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18998','GHBC-REQ-018998','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','Busbar trunking system reduces the combustible material near the area with high energy in comparison with other distribution systems such as cables and makes the building safe from the aspect of vulnerability to fire of electrical origin.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6b047872d2aa23b1a8db7c887a1108043c5df30b0a6047cac789e21e03a6d3bb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-18999','GHBC-REQ-018999','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','In addition, unlike cable systems the reliability of a bus trunking system is very high.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be4ae450c19b5fc9580521675e6c59d8d77e7665f19f3933fcf71433f633e292','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19000','GHBC-REQ-019000','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','These systems also require very little periodic maintenance.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c0bfc47d8f1db1ce74ee52469163cbd8ae1d43e0126df0383082027e04acee4f','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19001','GHBC-REQ-019001','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.4','GHBC-C-004886','Choice of busbar trunking for distribution in buildings can be made on the basis of: a) Reduced fire load (drastically reduced in comparison to the cable system). b) Reduced maintenance over its entire lifetime. c) Longer service lifetime in comparison with a cable distribution. d) Enhanced reliability due to rigid bolted joints and terminations and extremely low possibility of insulation failure.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0a13f07836b34e7c6226334e5a38236d65eb69d01c0a6604fa806e053722f9aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19002','GHBC-REQ-019002','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','28.7.3.5.1 General design objective while selecting the transformer(s) for a substation would be to provide at least two or more transformers, so that a certain amount of redundancy is built in, even if a standby system','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5414cd7ecd61d6a1ee650e0a492db9a42204be17d698a84c5e76fe8364a4f88f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19003','GHBC-REQ-019003','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','is provided.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1096cc5255fcc85309a9b542c27acc71ec455a8b8d0de606370cf3b311e2eb98','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19004','GHBC-REQ-019004','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','The total installed transformation capacity would be marginally higher than the anticipated maximum demand.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','aa0bbdf2a09b5baab723a38bac645565ac283c6fa437bb22eceac5fe57357495','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19005','GHBC-REQ-019005','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','With growing emphasis on energy conservation, the system design is made for both extremes of loading.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f8338847f5f7d5d9aa2efff857ba1c2bac4cb67361d04dc3a2cfd0e8095837b5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19006','GHBC-REQ-019006','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','During the periods of lowest load in the system, it would be desirable to operate only one transformer and switch in additional transformers as the load variation takes place in a day.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','946e646fbcd1bb3ffb436fb728a509e411e99e869589a499aa7166526dedc810','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19007','GHBC-REQ-019007','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','The minimum size of a transformer would quite often depend on the minimum load that is anticipated over a period of about 4 h in a day.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"ipated over a period of about 4 h in a day."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','dcbb7bcb62dc4e2e002d8dc96cc0c0ca2d5101daf1728c7525e1cfb7ddb3a873','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19008','GHBC-REQ-019008','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','Total transformer capacity is generally selected on the basis of present load, possible future load, operation and maintenance cost and other system conditions and selection of the maximum size (capacity) of the transformer is guided by short-circuit making and breaking capacity of the switchgear used in the medium voltage distribution system.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','86a5cd50870ebb76f7d1df80ea5ff073a7f7017db9aa798875d5207546c027c6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19009','GHBC-REQ-019009','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','Maximum size limitation is important from the aspect of feed to a downstream fault.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3417314b3640b07552f357d4a9e06bc787bcc62e5f27147a8f0cffaa68e62087','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19010','GHBC-REQ-019010','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','For feeding final single phase domestic type of loads or general office loads it is advisable to even use transformers of capacity much lower than what the switchgear can handle, so that lower fault MVA is available in such areas and use of hand held equipment fed through flexible cords is safe.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b41f4896c7b7c16642de596a336327161d07752ae7c51a6b12c1060bffae400c','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19011','GHBC-REQ-019011','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','For reasons of reliability and redundancy it is normal practice to provide at least two transformers for any important installation.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0817b35c3367019b550dd4150884cd9feb661fe5052978ab5b217c886e96249e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19012','GHBC-REQ-019012','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','Interlinking by tie lines is an alternative to enhance reliability/redundancy is areas where there are a number of substations in close vicinity, such as a campus with three or four multi-storeyed blocks each with a substation.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','80a6634690b10f7e28c7058083aab4cd97ee9a7e80a19d9e6f83733e2313fbba','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19013','GHBC-REQ-019013','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5','GHBC-C-004887','Ring main type of distribution is preferred for complexes having a number of substations.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa608e3f8449a4f873e95b9dffc690c64789d7cd087f5cf7243e5504e7bd5ce5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19014','GHBC-REQ-019014','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.2','GHBC-C-004888','to be installed in a substation to supply a medium voltage distribution system, the distribution system shall be divided into separate clauses each of which shall be normally fed from one transformer only unless the medium voltage switchgear has the requisite short-circuit capacity.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','06ad967f345b36ced807ed1709fb893bb6c6853b0a50a75700e8bff1a0028b3b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19015','GHBC-REQ-019015','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.2','GHBC-C-004888','Provision may, however, be made to interconnect separate clauses, through a bus coupler in the event of failure or disconnection of','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','64817f34412677d5ca9ee3a50551df68c38b1682ad729be1b1926a20cf1fe7ac','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19016','GHBC-REQ-019016','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.2','GHBC-C-004888','one transformer.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0ca0fe2b63cec55930a386abb503cdecfd4f80590c33767f0a2edb58070695bf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19017','GHBC-REQ-019017','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.2','GHBC-C-004888','See Clause 28.4.2 for details of location and requirements of substation.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','75d7cddcab8ac9523608a941cf362d60d098a8fbc3cc6121494d9830e6ef7cdc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19018','GHBC-REQ-019018','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.2','GHBC-C-004888','The transformers, that may at any time operate in parallel, shall be so selected as to share the load in proportion to their respective load ratings.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','34d4687374bbbcbbd2b029ad01c48e0190b304ada4e4201d2d1761d9bb04da6c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19019','GHBC-REQ-019019','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.2','GHBC-C-004888','While the general practice is to avoid operation of transformers in parallel for feeding final distribution in buildings, it is possible to use transformers with slightly different impedance or voltage taps to operate in parallel, but with appropriate protection.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d162d87bfb6f71f9f9279ff6014cd2a9e17b40f09dcd7ba33c925e7b3d24b148','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19020','GHBC-REQ-019020','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.2','GHBC-C-004888','Installations designed for parallel operation of transformers shall have protection for avoiding circulating current between transformers, avoid overload of anyone transformer due to reactance mismatch and the system shall be so arranged as to trip the secondary breaker in case the primary breaker of that transformer trips.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9b65c92c698cee4f8f8dd015d347bba6c37b9faf4e605d11596befb83b51fe6','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19021','GHBC-REQ-019021','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.1','GHBC-C-004890','device) shall have breaking capacity not less than the anticipated fault level in the system at that point.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','054f2e1143b809e77c067fa4086b038265162f2fb1fa4bc74e63c92545da201d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19022','GHBC-REQ-019022','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.1','GHBC-C-004890','System fault level at a point in distribution system is predominantly dependent on the transformer size and its reactance.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9798e29d647974b4da09f6f73c3bf0881c75e0c4a7b078347ea48e30376f0044','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19023','GHBC-REQ-019023','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.1','GHBC-C-004890','Parallel operation of transformers naturally increases the fault level.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','481729b147c5458a7f48fd2eaddd083e37c3441eeb33e0b180e274e872369e59','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19024','GHBC-REQ-019024','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.2','GHBC-C-004891','breaker shall be interlocked so that the isolator cannot be operated unless the corresponding breaker is in open condition.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f72d0473a5bc704e39dcf52698b8edf68196ff409f0f5fdb0947fdac9d02131a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19025','GHBC-REQ-019025','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.2','GHBC-C-004891','The choice between alternative types of equipment may be influenced by the following considerations: a)  In certain installations supplied with electric power from remote transformer substations, it may be necessary to protect main circuits with circuit-breakers operated by earth fault, in order to ensure effective earth fault protection. b) Where large electric motors, furnaces or other heavy electrical equipment is installed, the main circuits shall be protected from short-circuits by switch disconnector fuse or circuit breakers.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b0bc920b3adeb5c783bebb8ed1805881738758de34ca8c8b314fd7e58d763a80','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19026','GHBC-REQ-019026','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.2','GHBC-C-004891','For motor protection, the combination of contactor overload device and fuse or circuit breakers shall be Type-2 coordinated in accordance with accepted standards.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa16487dc60a178cf48125803f8c99783ca6062886d7d454c1de3006022ae593','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19027','GHBC-REQ-019027','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.2','GHBC-C-004891','Wherever necessary, back up','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','901d7e2bb309803b0436362005b4dd688ecd98fcdf0a355533fb0bde3a9e6cef','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19028','GHBC-REQ-019028','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.2','GHBC-C-004891','protection and earth fault protection shall be provided to the main circuit. c) Where mean of isolating main circuits is separately required, switch disconnector fuse or switch disconnector may form part of main switchboards.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','467f85fb2b15460d52b9abd39cbb8fc4007178aabf41c577243fd9882c5970b3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19029','GHBC-REQ-019029','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','It shall be mandatory to provide power factor improvement capacitor at the substation bus.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0a13ac5712f1811606b1b91522eafcda336f95ad33d5d6af8a5b3e3ea066f76b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19030','GHBC-REQ-019030','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','Suitable capacitor may be selected in consultation with the capacitor as well as switchgear manufacture depending upon the nature of electrical load anticipated on the system.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','89e842deae2634918a1c58e0caf5eef878b02e013b658a3d55b9f126f16b09e6','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19031','GHBC-REQ-019031','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','Necessary switchgear/feeder circuit breaker shall be provided for controlling of capacitor bank.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b701c03bcf7a37b99aab76c7423468d50375ae1c92e136d2b31141eb60df95fa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19032','GHBC-REQ-019032','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','Power factor of individual motor may be improved by connecting individual capacitor banks in parallel.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3560df5943af7a12df519feaf46f5321888a14eceb07bee0ecca1f1d15937407','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19033','GHBC-REQ-019033','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','For higher range of motors, which are running continuously without much variations in load, individual power factor correction at load end is advisable.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b5b4c5f5bc2260bbc5167126753b8b97938385158d41f9212b286b158cac831c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19034','GHBC-REQ-019034','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','Note: Care should be taken in deciding the kVA rating of the capacitor in relation to the magnestising kVA of the motor.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','672e4fe2e95720a27c2416c9e876f321dd90bfc6cf61b5826b2f565459e699fb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19035','GHBC-REQ-019035','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','Over rating of the capacitor may cause injury to the motor and capacitor bank.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','17a9d20f579e211302da0aed81ada8e42fab01eba451808a71e30721e73a5e01','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19036','GHBC-REQ-019036','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','The motor still rotating after disconnection from the supply, may act as generator by self-excitation and produce a voltage higher than supply voltage.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a43f1b74af87adb124217bec1da1d16df975717d241d42d5f16606fbfb75eb74','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19037','GHBC-REQ-019037','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','If the motor is again switched on before the speed has fallen to about 80 percent of the normal running speed, the high voltage will be superimposed on the supply circuits and will damage both the motor and capacitor.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":80,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"the speed has fallen to about 80 percent of the normal running speed, "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93aa439667b4793bf605ced38a9c1a255ed1174ef17971b4454b799c2c939095','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19038','GHBC-REQ-019038','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','As a general rule, the kVA rating of the capacitor should not exceed the no-load magnetizing kVA of the motor.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0709ed9b2ede56f0976573252086526eeb7e933fbf1748b34bbdee3a5147c1df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19039','GHBC-REQ-019039','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','Generally it would be necessary to provide an automatic control for switching in capacitors matching the load power factor and the bus voltage.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','98df6ab38346bddf205e86db4f85b7894d9751518304d60be651961d0f0d244a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19040','GHBC-REQ-019040','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.3','GHBC-C-004892','Such a scheme would be necessary as capacitors permanently switched in the circuit may cause over voltage at times of light load.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','056ee15f8b7974afd71fb9bdc2f6250e17f307f6d5a522145b1761c1e8a81fbf','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19041','GHBC-REQ-019041','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.4','GHBC-C-004893','Sufficient additional space shall be allowed in substations and switchrooms to allow operation and maintenance and proper means shall be provided for isolating the equipment to allow access for servicing, testing and maintenance.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ce0aec6eae108ae6bd5c50974356d22cbdf3c56b0ce2a166d026ec874e8f22c0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19042','GHBC-REQ-019042','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.4','GHBC-C-004893','Sufficient additional space shall','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0d7e1bd7b33053d59c67e3d14ad41ce9c9dd96302c486b544ccf66d70d06e23e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19043','GHBC-REQ-019043','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.4','GHBC-C-004893','be allowed for temporary location and installation of standard servicing and testing equipment.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6fa395b7e73696f0fd9c6828ea29d03cf5a614296db06bb0a25a25dd3d78379d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19044','GHBC-REQ-019044','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.4','GHBC-C-004893','Space should also be allowed to provide for anticipated future extensions.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed12d3f282814392a4bf059aca8b01d89f3630c9142a50b3bb97902273f8df24','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19045','GHBC-REQ-019045','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.5','GHBC-C-004894','Electrical installations in a room or cubicle or in an area surrounded by wall fence, access to which is controlled by lock and key shall be considered accessible to authorized persons only.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3b8775b56259150b3714834e23aafe2a9597d9e93920e90b95abd37f5893dccc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19046','GHBC-REQ-019046','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.5','GHBC-C-004894','A wall or fence less than 1.8m in height shall not be considered as preventing access unless it has other features that provide a degree of isolation equivalent to a 1.8m fence.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1.8,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"A wall or fence less than 1.8m in height shall not be consi"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.8,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"A wall or fence less than 1.8m in height shall not be consid"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.8,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" of isolation equivalent to a 1.8m fence."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fac0337baf489263a95388e43aa456698709a4af75758d4c8911566f37cc6a00','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19047','GHBC-REQ-019047','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.6','GHBC-C-004895','are becoming a greater problem due to the increasing use of electronic equipments, computer, fluorescent, mercury vapour and sodium vapour lighting, controlled rectifier and inverters for variable speed drives, power electronics and other non-linear loads.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b4e741eaf86ce70643e5a2307c84e3233610ac7876598ff2612deae0b8ce9f39','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19048','GHBC-REQ-019048','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.6','GHBC-C-004895','Harmonics may lead to almost as much current in the neutral as in the phases.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','49fe8276162cf6cd034599475c3bfbee3f274e866e5c34cf84b1be6b7a2f85de','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19049','GHBC-REQ-019049','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.6','GHBC-C-004895','This current is almost entirely third harmonic.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','455114f15cde2d4537a6220a08c11d334f6061e62e81b1b22f814e7a3311d8b0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19050','GHBC-REQ-019050','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.6','GHBC-C-004895','Phase rectification devices may be considered for the limits of harmonic voltage distortion may be considered at the planning stage in such cases.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','79656596db368270b1d35501add44961016ccb149f24f5f1a63140a6eb663322','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19051','GHBC-REQ-019051','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.6','GHBC-C-004895','With the wide spread use of thyristor and rectifier based loads there is necessity of providing a full size neutral; but this requirement is limited to the 3-phase 4-wire distribution generally in the 400/230 V system.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1c981e5187c8a214786564ac642e77d1acc683ec763c8dc82a6ecd3987d7113c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19052','GHBC-REQ-019052','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.5.6.6','GHBC-C-004895','As a result it is not desirable to use half-size neutral conductor, as possibility of neutral conductor overload due to harmonics is likely.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ea673f2434767d80e1f83d6c491c49fed77d83d0d0575966600c69d230b01539','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19053','GHBC-REQ-019053','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6','GHBC-C-004896','supply','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a90a01c51216daa551c5e391a57949493958f12e0e5198d093b090296cbce566','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19054','GHBC-REQ-019054','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1','GHBC-C-004897','of supply','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0f4c9a78ff371c285fdff9f730c067033a42c434618f703c25d50984cdc29388','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19055','GHBC-REQ-019055','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.1','GHBC-C-004898','There shall be a circuit-breaker or miniature circuit-breakers or a load break switch fuse on each live conductor of the supply mains at the point of entry.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b86738ab237647179f70f28d2db47468b22f985a814ffab1a3c6c0e2b080b41e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19056','GHBC-REQ-019056','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.1','GHBC-C-004898','The wiring throughout the installation shall be such that there is no switch or fuse unit in the earthed neutral of conductor.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29333fb170bc21b135ee276fd074126a7449fd601d645f6eaffa8897bd622bcb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19057','GHBC-REQ-019057','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.1','GHBC-C-004898','The neutral shall also be distinctly marked.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e63319f940f96eb004f6960da9a2939615c187aa2037351952b78b2e420e4781','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19058','GHBC-REQ-019058','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.1','GHBC-C-004898','In this connection, Rules, as amended up to date shall also be referred.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','90558c5fdb2b53a30f7a8d4c62a7f5455b46201b43af01505a529159c24cab10','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19059','GHBC-REQ-019059','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-004899','The main switch shall be easily accessible and situated as near as practicable to the termination of service line.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9dafbb25464dd65fca133c5b5430376d849ebdedbe6db35ccd30b03e7214cb8d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19060','GHBC-REQ-019060','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-004900','On the main switch, where the conductors include an earthed conductor of a two-wire system or an earthed neutral conductor or a multi-wire system or a conductor which is to be connected thereto, an indication of a permanent nature shall be provided to identify the earthed neutral conductor.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dbd4f5b0b4119de9fafc112fe3a2e3108fb8568b83808dc6b2f85d5f9ac79cca','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19061','GHBC-REQ-019061','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-004900','In this connection, Electricity Company of Ghana Rules, shall be referred as amended up-to-date.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b02280371111419b467bb3aba290b068777ea4c2530c77ec2491da2e4a49810e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19062','GHBC-REQ-019062','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.4','GHBC-C-004901','Energy meters shall be installed in residential buildings at such a place which is readily accessible to the owner of the building and the Authority.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0831717132a0be169cbc64dc54c04056b73a532f8f4781aa63038bc4ac2a8ea7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19063','GHBC-REQ-019063','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.4','GHBC-C-004901','These should be installed at a height where it is convenient to note the meter reading, it should preferably not be installed below one metre from the ground.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b8b925ea8fa42a1581a9e672b2bb9b175387c5849cb76383fd0e0c449c0372a6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19064','GHBC-REQ-019064','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.4','GHBC-C-004901','The energy meters should either be provided with a protecting covering, enclosing it completely except the glass window through which the readings are noted or should be mounted inside a completely enclosed panel provided with hinged or sliding doors with arrangement for locking.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','716034ed4da17b5c8b433edcff042779e8a4d860ca209026f659e8014405e14a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19065','GHBC-REQ-019065','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.1.4','GHBC-C-004901','In multi-storeyed buildings meters shall be installed with tapping point for meters of the rising main (bus trunking) on individual floors.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae99f8feb699ca6f2b9eca450b6858f63df6eb5f7b67ec9a9b5ba2528599ce4c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19066','GHBC-REQ-019066','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.1','GHBC-C-004903','All main switches shall be either of metal-clad enclosed pattern or of any insulated enclosed pattern which shall be fixed at close proximity to the point of entry of supply.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','387bb4dbc1fde468e2bdb26b282a155e0d6bfe344a8b06667d7b0b5ab7d0188f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19067','GHBC-REQ-019067','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.1','GHBC-C-004903','Every switch shall have an environmental protection level rating (IP), so that its operation is satisfactory in the environment of the installation.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4a59b6e6a3f54a6fe2790e1a362ee5d3d05663a06d7587a96699b55db4a7a76b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19068','GHBC-REQ-019068','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.1','GHBC-C-004903','Note: Woodwork shall not be used for the construction or mounting of switches and switch boards installed in a building.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f3f3533ad84fcae9b01e98cec274fd44065f9cf72f886dc88d26467d44f30979','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19069','GHBC-REQ-019069','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','a)  The location of the main board should be such that it is easily accessible for fireman and other personnel to quickly disconnect the supply in case of emergencies.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f65672e87e810765e786eee1fe9b64136f467747d2e9051e69d915faa7bfe64a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19070','GHBC-REQ-019070','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','If the room is locked for security, means of emergency access,','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9ce71321afdef1654a3ac590ad2fe37ec827fa905060c2053c93f4ec75031a32','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19071','GHBC-REQ-019071','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','by schemes such as break glass cupboard, shall be incorporated. b) Main switch board shall be installed in rooms or cupboards so as to safeguard against operation by unauthorized personnel. c) Switchboards shall be placed only in dry situations and in ventilated rooms and they shall not be placed in the vicinity of storage batteries or exposed to chemical fumes. d) In damp situation or where inflammable or explosive dust, vapour or gas is likely to be present, the switchboard shall be totally enclosed and shall have adequate degree of protection.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0eabdb597cf8d472e67a5baad426ee11f9dcce61efe851ce13a350c7c2c4537b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19072','GHBC-REQ-019072','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','In some cases flameproof enclose may be necessitated by particular circumstances. e) Switchboards shall not be erected above gas stoves or sinks, or within 2.5m or any washing unit in the washing rooms or laundries, or in bathrooms, lavatories or toilets, or kitchens. f) In case of switchboards unavoidably fixed in places likely to be exposed to weather, to drip, or to abnormal moist temperature, the outer casing shall be weatherproof and shall be provided with glands or bushings or adopted to receive screwed conduit, according to the manner in which the cables are run. g) Adequate illumination shall be provided for all working spaces about the switchboards when installed indoors.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"as stoves or sinks, or within 2.5m or any washing unit in the wa"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0f084146f07d2f7925cae2bf6768c56e4d77b2ae2f2e3c6ccc0a99599d3a336f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19073','GHBC-REQ-019073','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','28.7.3.6.2.3 Metal-clad switchgear shall preferably be mounted on any of the following types of boards: a) Hinged-type metal boards – These shall consist of a box made of sheet metal not less than 2 mm thick and shall be provided with a hinged cover to enable the board to swing open for examination of the wiring at the back.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" of a box made of sheet metal not less than 2 mm thick and shall be provide"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"28.7.3.6.2.3 Metal-clad switchgear shall pre"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" of sheet metal not less than 2 mm thick and shall be provided w"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bf0418cdaf8d2d3b35e15594191dc7d29917b5102721df679a7f5799d6521f15','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19074','GHBC-REQ-019074','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','The joints shall be welded.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1d70a78f054ee4f66506fff44af99959540c2b01d505b5e3c87d2654c3091923','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19075','GHBC-REQ-019075','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','There shall be a clear distance of not less than 2/5','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" shall be a clear distance of not less than 2/5"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ca167870cf66b51ec4884b7835de129680248a178eb370f59bf04510513ca527','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19076','GHBC-REQ-019076','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','cm between the teak wood board and the cover, the distance being increased for larger boards in order that on closing of the cover, the insulation of the cables is not subjected to damage and there should be no excessive twisting or bending in any case.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','00678d199cca24869965b454ad06a2b871de387529cf7f29d462af6e1e55fc96','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19077','GHBC-REQ-019077','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','The board shall be securely fixed to the wall by means of rag bolts, plugs, or wooden plugs and shall be provided with a locking arrangement and an earthing stud.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cd0cc232894e52dd07c1b4e12046ba9bc246f1e4bc26d93fea5fb9c6621d7968','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19078','GHBC-REQ-019078','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','All wires passing through the metal board shall be protected by a rubber or wooden bush at the entry hole.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9005873e41036bc24d48e0477aedf6301461381936c4b74ec1af083a724c5687','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19079','GHBC-REQ-019079','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','The earth stud should commensurate with the size of earth lead/leads.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','665c3988f6df9867246b61783a3ffd0e174e8a154c93325ac94c85b014af6202','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19080','GHBC-REQ-019080','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','Alternatively, metal boards may be made of suitable size angle iron of minimum size 35mm x 35mm x 6mm or channel iron of minimum size 35 mm x 25mm x 6mm frames work tagged to specification on front with a 3mm thick mild steel plate and on back with 1.5mm thick mid steel sheet.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":35,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ze angle iron of minimum size 35mm x 35mm x 6mm or channel iron "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":35,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"e iron of minimum size 35mm x 35mm x 6mm or channel iron of mini"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"of minimum size 35mm x 35mm x 6mm or channel iron of minimum si"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":35,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" channel iron of minimum size 35 mm x 25mm x 6mm frames work tagg"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" iron of minimum size 35 mm x 25mm x 6mm frames work tagged to s"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"f minimum size 35 mm x 25mm x 6mm frames work tagged to specifi"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"specification on front with a 3mm thick mild steel plate and on"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.5,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" steel plate and on back with 1.5mm thick mid steel sheet."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','08f16006e14649afb6507c0d1d2031ef0da0574a9a4521025a5c99b45399b18d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19081','GHBC-REQ-019081','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','No apparatus shall project beyond any edge of panel.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','947af085e8d7409756f8018ac8b47f917f8621a6beac5712478f49b3f755016d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19082','GHBC-REQ-019082','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','No fuse body shall be mounted within 2.5 cm of any edge of the panel.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','abbcbd906109d0d2e706dd693273da728e62ba69e3360b235d3a954f79dc81d7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19083','GHBC-REQ-019083','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','Note : Such type of boards are particularly suitable for small switchboard for mounting metal-clad switchgear connected to supply at low voltages. b) Fixed-type metal boards – These shall consist of an angle or channel iron frame fixed on the wall or on floor and supported on the wall at the top, if necessary.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','60c168f4470decdce928d89bdc57fa48b5dcf5d73b06f6c043ff0fd7638da9e2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19084','GHBC-REQ-019084','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','There shall be a clear distance of 1m in front of the switchboards.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" shall be a clear distance of 1m in front of the switchboards."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db90dff897adb0c9d1edf09613996f7cc1c8e6a30595121ad2228792c4350789','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19085','GHBC-REQ-019085','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','If there are any attachments of bare connections at the back of the switchboards ECG rules shall apply.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3bc614847f946a40b161def32dbaf7cb77a5577137280900b6d3fb835657f338','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19086','GHBC-REQ-019086','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','The connections between the switchgear mounting and the outgoing cable up to the wall shall be enclosed in a protection pipe.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bb1121944d3238a97d42c22bbd47bb3c014a894058dfa15706a220f921cf4168','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19087','GHBC-REQ-019087','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','Note: Such type of boards are particularly suitable for large switchboards for mounting large number of switchgears or high capacity metalclad switchgear or both. c) Protected-type switchboard – A protected switchboard is one where all','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b6bc5ada3f7ef80dbe3301b0b008e55410ade4acac9b6d86a4b373847ad0b6b6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19088','GHBC-REQ-019088','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','of the conductors are protected by metal or other enclosures.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','18bc41bc95b81adfcfa573954443743cd103d16542edd8539e225a2b951afe61','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19089','GHBC-REQ-019089','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','They may consist of a metal cubicle panel, or an iron frame upon which is mounted metal-clad switchgear.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','97f80992baf55d1c2afee8ffb9717f9a9bd8e60d85e98ab1449a2a937ed8c173','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19090','GHBC-REQ-019090','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','They usually consist of a main switch, busbars and circuit breakers or fuses controlling outgoing circuits. d) Open-type switchboard – An open type switchboard is one, which has exposed current carrying parts on the front of the switchboard.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','deb8c2dae8348c2d94f8f5f6a5f15cdcc889585b4e1705869c8d3ad5f6de83d8','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19091','GHBC-REQ-019091','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','This type of switchboard is rarely used now-a-days but where this exists, a hand rail or barrier has to be provided to prevent unintentional or accidental contact with exposed live parts.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b02042eb76ea36a72b21a1aefd7d0c5d4cc3eb312a371942dd57e38dd3fe0037','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19092','GHBC-REQ-019092','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','They must be located in a special switch room or enclosure and only a competent person may have access to these switchboards.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ba215b2e343dc030ce106176a5788072095bf8b106488b14881e7aadd4a44050','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19093','GHBC-REQ-019093','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','Note – These boards may be existing in old installations.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c0d8f9deda13d0a788ca436a57740ca4e5ccecda673def99e7ab15b7223116ec','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19094','GHBC-REQ-019094','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','It is recommended that they be phased out.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','486a5eb062f215edce4cadbb8941abc78fa67e6120b35487bbcf81a4970db26e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19095','GHBC-REQ-019095','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.2','GHBC-C-004904','With the continuously increasing fault power feed due to increases in generation and strengthening of distribution systems, these open boards are a source of accidents.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a0b9c0c97fba7629a939ffe829e06c1ff74a4ac86661a0324bf6b2a90d4493f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19096','GHBC-REQ-019096','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.4','GHBC-C-004905','Where so specified, the switchboards shall be recessed in the wall.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a2d6a12ce35ecd5d1cc761c95828436deb0e15253b210a38597f6e0941ec0a59','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19097','GHBC-REQ-019097','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.4','GHBC-C-004905','Ample room shall be provided at the back for connection and at the front between the switchgear mountings.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5bf35ec2989a2b48c7540ea61b812c639845219eea53f0e6372142e65038ec62','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19098','GHBC-REQ-019098','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.5','GHBC-C-004906','a) Where a board is connected to voltage higher than 250 V, all the apparatus mounted on it shall be marked on the following colours to indicate the different poles or phases to which the apparatus or its different terminals may have been connected.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c353c351f5a0674733ec6ab176970d05dbba10823898e92d53981915904858d9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
