('rowid-19104','GHBC-REQ-019104','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.5','GHBC-C-004906','Where four-wire three phase wiring is done, the neutral shall be in one colour and the other three wires in another colour as mentioned above or shall be suitably tagged or sleeved for fool proof identification. b) Where a board has more than one switch, each such switch shall be marked to indicate which clause of the installation it controls.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','08d544085b32a28ac41a838ef1b29f056784d38d922310f2f7af6377a059351d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19105','GHBC-REQ-019105','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.5','GHBC-C-004906','The main switch shall be marked as such and where there is more than one main switch in the building, each such switch shall be marked to indicate which clause of the installation it controls.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2033c9a9038460bb857f783dc8bd6ee5fba6c51dfaa718cf59cb4e7e6b59f02','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19106','GHBC-REQ-019106','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.5','GHBC-C-004906','All markings shall be clear and permanent.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6ba2740cd8742421feea635c7be2151e3f78bdc2a23c3bde4c2f507eb43bf136','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19107','GHBC-REQ-019107','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.6','GHBC-C-004907','Before proceeding with the actual construction, a proper drawing showing the detailed dimensions and design including the disposition of the mountings of the boards, which shall be symmetrically and neatly arranged for arriving at the overall dimensions, shall be prepared along the building drawing.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6e7547a0c86c7706c24d3f7e72daa58b6b1170210a2469fb66d933e82b151c84','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19108','GHBC-REQ-019108','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.6','GHBC-C-004907','Such drawings will show the mandatory clearance spaces if any, and clear height below the soffit of the beam to satisfy regulations and safety considerations, so that other designers or installers do not get into such areas or spaces for their equipment.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','82b8e1c01b5686e2e47a0973879f6245ad8e2c1159886e378190ac693efd8d1e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19109','GHBC-REQ-019109','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.7','GHBC-C-004908','switch, each such switch shall be marked to indicate which clause of the installation it controls.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae826a1ce0ae9b23506cb1ad7b4c76c41c3473d55cd01cfecb08baa81db5d0df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19110','GHBC-REQ-019110','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.7','GHBC-C-004908','The main switch shall be marked as such and where there is more than one main switch in the building, each such switch shall be marked to indicate which clause of the installation it controls.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f8fc8b9e1bf6614297f39d7735ce680028f0ebfc8ded4aed5b0c6a8ca90f88e0','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19111','GHBC-REQ-019111','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.7','GHBC-C-004908','All markings shall be clear and permanent.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','71c2816b5dcf1b5571b8ccadaac2aa5453c301b4d461230d0c40ce0d2947e8a2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19112','GHBC-REQ-019112','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.2.8','GHBC-C-004909','or more circuits, must be controlled by a main disconnnector (TP & N), or Isolating links or TPN MCB to enable them to be disconnected from the supply.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ccc6efabb5a606276048de06e7f9b765bf70bf2ef638d7301a348a1142d2e021','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19113','GHBC-REQ-019113','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.3','GHBC-C-004910','A distribution board comprises of one or more protective devices against over current and ensuring the distribution of electrical energy to','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','08cc5bb32fd6015f74234dd5ce9911726e7a2acc367d34a88e50c6bce8f2a1af','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19114','GHBC-REQ-019114','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.3','GHBC-C-004910','the circuits.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','95b0e6b5ffeb46a18c698b54436f774f881bca39b965f222d2d2c5c6c39abcae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19115','GHBC-REQ-019115','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.3','GHBC-C-004910','Distribution board shall provide plenty of wiring space, to allow working as well as to allow keeping the extra length of connecting cables, likely to be required for maintenance.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be611ccb624ce950537184668a7d8d16110ad1cf51c40ed475d320ada4175ad6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19116','GHBC-REQ-019116','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.3.1','GHBC-C-004911','Main distribution board shall be provided with a circuit breaker on each pole of each circuit, or a switch with a fuse on the phase or live conductor and a link on the neutral or earthed conductor of each circuit.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d49467e1519337c0ff20b96c76c7d79a4900844af5f056b8083b268b19b7cd72','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19117','GHBC-REQ-019117','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.3.1','GHBC-C-004911','The switches shall always be linked.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e1a01f4d36edd2101c8dff46c6ada39e84c6e0a9d3e6568e49c0d094bdfc1f5f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19118','GHBC-REQ-019118','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.3.1','GHBC-C-004911','All incomers should be provided with surge protection devices.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','819518c59e61566b79979adb4ee85e2b62fe70390589bb0d5d5b20944d355bce','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19119','GHBC-REQ-019119','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.1','GHBC-C-004913','Branch distribution boards shall be provided, along with earth leakage protective device (ELCB) (incoming), with a fuse or a miniature circuit breaker or both of adequate rating/setting chosen on the live conductor of each sub-circuit and the earthed neutral conductor shall be connected to a common link and be capable of being disconnected individually for testing purposes.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b51aa123c70593d51735a9d84b341810e99dd75bccd540d4a8c56477f818da07','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19120','GHBC-REQ-019120','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.1','GHBC-C-004913','At least one spare circuit of the same capacity shall be provided one each branch distribution board.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ebc69bc5570f1dd5f611fa69a97cb473e89db0867c90b5b2e9ffe96bd2e67fea','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19121','GHBC-REQ-019121','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.1','GHBC-C-004913','Further, the individual branching circuits (outgoing) shall be protected against overcurrent with miniature circuit breaker of adequate over-current with miniature circuit breaker of adequate rating.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7f08075f3c94247ed64ad6243be2366581afa41d2a4478258cf860ce5aa956b1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19122','GHBC-REQ-019122','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.1','GHBC-C-004913','In residential/industrial lighting installations, the various circuits shall be separated and each circuit shall be individually protected so that in the event of fault, only the particular circuit gets connected.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e2d18c9b62384d4ede51cf30e2a16c4fbcb383d646e1e470947a2a14fd580ee0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19123','GHBC-REQ-019123','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.2','GHBC-C-004914','Circuits shall be separated for installation at higher level such as those in the ceiling and at higher levels, above 1 cm. on the walls and for installations at lower level such as sockets for portable or stationery plug in equipments.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7524be6899878adc307fd48fd98281bcdfe973dbd56a1abc22693897ee9c71f1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19124','GHBC-REQ-019124','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.2','GHBC-C-004914','For devices consuming high power and which are to be supplied through supply cord and plug, separate wiring shall be done.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d6b68164c1a93150f04ae7fd171bff096f0926e5d2d6e2552540b06982196bdb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19125','GHBC-REQ-019125','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.2','GHBC-C-004914','For plug-in equipment provisions shall be made for providing ELCB protection in the distribution board.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','45837b77ad2720b9dd9d223265c4b174f2c35c0e9fe0862b9f073d133a45c663','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19126','GHBC-REQ-019126','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.3','GHBC-C-004915','circuit for kitchen and bathrooms.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','531cede38163fbd0521c241f488358d5ddb4ec88716c3868ed42c924ec6e9b64','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19127','GHBC-REQ-019127','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.3','GHBC-C-004915','Such subcircuit shall not have more than a total of ten points of light, fans and 6A socket outlets.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a3111a9f2290a4050946a773766011136d9612acc7b5ac5d0c97d81ea5295fac','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19128','GHBC-REQ-019128','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.3','GHBC-C-004915','Where the load of such circuit is provided, the number of fans in the circuit shall not exceed ten.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1df4b60001fa4ccfe3faea196b41f603a7945fcb449a74230fbaa1b9b9dc96cc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19129','GHBC-REQ-019129','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.3','GHBC-C-004915','Power sub-circuit shall be designed according to the load but in no case shall there be more than two 16A outlets on each subcircuit.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5597f0ec24aab66141d4f8463e00e5c079ac0fa5450f6a38184c99fa68f52e26','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19130','GHBC-REQ-019130','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.4','GHBC-C-004916','area shall be separate.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c5489c22906bbe22fdf7309b84ca82cd42137b3617a9c3c8e9dfa20380dc33ba','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19131','GHBC-REQ-019131','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.4','GHBC-C-004916','For large halls 3-wire control with individual control and master control installed near the entrance shall be provided for effective conservation of energy.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc1ee1563b7a36fef252a1dfd19f336ac520ea43fcd1b5fe1d1beb1dbdb32c63','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19132','GHBC-REQ-019132','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.5','GHBC-C-004917','particularly in large halls, lighting in the area near the windows, likely to receive daylight shall have separate controls for lights, so that they can be switched off selectively when daylight is adequate, while keeping the lights in the areas remote from the windows on.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cf9581ed9bc32bb851076e7d9f8c1f6e8ff76feb22c844b104942a9612caae92','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19133','GHBC-REQ-019133','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.6','GHBC-C-004918','kept separate circuits feeding fans and lights.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3d8971f9b84752f7dd61226f32a8e28a3f00323ab575a8cec5dc98718b6922ea','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19134','GHBC-REQ-019134','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.6','GHBC-C-004918','Normally, fans and lights may be wired on a common circuit.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','431832488bfbddb1447d7dbc4dbc39eecc115653c8b1e012571840ba4a28b859','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19135','GHBC-REQ-019135','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.6','GHBC-C-004918','In large spaces circuits for fans and lights may also be segregated.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','57dcf2475af002f36ee02529c285928e5a9ef89b78f62c53d7bef12c9f65953f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19136','GHBC-REQ-019136','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.6','GHBC-C-004918','Lights may have group control in large halls and industrial areas.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3d0d82427c02a344ec62a134eea33eb0310c753e358f59fe1049ecb3bacb27bb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19137','GHBC-REQ-019137','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.6','GHBC-C-004918','While providing group control consideration may be given for the nature of use of the area lit by a group.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e3dfb3363f6208c2148e505ae545eecf674249d041aeec602d243fffe27d7a41','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19138','GHBC-REQ-019138','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.6','GHBC-C-004918','Consideration has to be given for the daylight utilization, while grouping, so that a group feeding areas receiving daylight can be selectively switched off during daylight period.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','050b2ca30301fc6c4883ad5862d4927752ffc15010a0d8c8f711dd61fac49c21','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19139','GHBC-REQ-019139','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.7','GHBC-C-004919','circuit shall not exceed 3000W.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ddb00c98914588884d4c149c3d4656d4d379c173b0a2f265cd4d0268c1dcfc1d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19140','GHBC-REQ-019140','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.7','GHBC-C-004919','In case of a new installation, all circuits and sub-circuits shall be designed with an initial load of about 2500 W, so as to allow a provision of 20 percent increase in load due to any future modification.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"so as to allow a provision of 20 percent increase in load due to any f"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6c1b8dee8c03e5641fd0304218158e5a5f4ad334f8f1bed61035e4ece3a8870a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19141','GHBC-REQ-019141','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.7','GHBC-C-004919','Power subcircuits shall be designed according to the load, where the circuit is meant for a specific equipment.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','112d08af630402146969626f223ff9caee8cb329fe52b7a5e562c8475b4cd6cb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19142','GHBC-REQ-019142','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.7','GHBC-C-004919','Good practice is to limit a circuit to a maximum of four sockets, where it is expected that there will be diversity due to use of very few sockets in large spaces (example sockets for use of vacuum cleaner).','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cb2e77d6fa0340eeba7ad4641622a4b376b7c51f9d6b4c0198fca0049eb4ce38','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19143','GHBC-REQ-019143','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.7','GHBC-C-004919','General practice is to limit it to two sockets in a circuit, in both residential and non-residential buildings and to provide a single socket on a circuit for a known heavy load appliance such as air conditioner, cooking range etc.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3724b04b6a8df8bb8f8a7986f1880c9b8901929badd695f6ed98bd5d1eae3824','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19144','GHBC-REQ-019144','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.4.8','GHBC-C-004920','places like construction sites, stadium, shipyards, open yards in industrial plants, etc. where a large number of high wattage lamp may be required, there shall be no restriction of load on any circuit but conductors used in such circuits hall be of adequate size for the load and proper circuit protection shall be provided.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','74487394e49071c6fcb29aeca334ed889347bb4e53a712ece42c7edcb46f07dd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19145','GHBC-REQ-019145','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.5','GHBC-C-004921','a) the distribution boards shall be located as near as possible to the centre of the load they are intended to control; b) These shall be fixed on suitable stanchion or wall and shall be accessible for replacement/reset of protective devices, and shall not be more than 1.8m from floor level. c) These shall be of either metal-clad type, or air insulated type.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1.8,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"ive devices, and shall not be more than 1.8m from floor level. c) These s"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.8,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"s, and shall not be more than 1.8m from floor level. c) These sh"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5131d36b1274ce1fccee0ed7799a12e18c5ef02385c9a585e1cf19a4de862ed1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19146','GHBC-REQ-019146','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.5','GHBC-C-004921','But, if exposed to weather or damp situations, these shall be of the weatherproof type and, if installed where exposed to explosive dust, vapour or gas, these shall be of flameproof type in accordance with accepted standards.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7d5bd0db4c6eebafd4b87fc925abf50092ab1021b4845bbc9993971eb92cc250','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19147','GHBC-REQ-019147','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.5','GHBC-C-004921','In corrosive atmospheres, these shall be treated with anti-corrosive preservative or covered with suitable plastic compound. d) Where two and/or more distribution boards feeding low voltage circuits are fed from a supply of medium voltage, the metal case shall be marked ‗Danger 415 V‘ and identified with proper phase marking and danger marks. e) Each shall be provided with a circuit list giving diagram of each circuit which it controls and the current rating of the circuit and size of fuse element. f) In wiring branch distribution board, total load of consuming devices shall be divided as far as possible evenly between the number of ways in the board leaving space circuits for future extension.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','abbfbd5f98998f084a4edb7dc60bb49e31608c685532d056ee4eb88296823336','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19148','GHBC-REQ-019148','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.6','GHBC-C-004922','a) Appropriate protection shall be provided at switchboards, distribution boards and at all levels of panels for all circuits and','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bc9db8fb2c4acf2f6a707d9a04d24b7488c37b624761a2bd45943f35ad64a1e2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19149','GHBC-REQ-019149','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.6','GHBC-C-004922','sub-circuits against short circuits, overcurrent and other parameters as required.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a293606a9c890507bf554fcd7b54a830ee917dbd93343dde9fd4f5138917a83','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19150','GHBC-REQ-019150','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.6','GHBC-C-004922','The protective device shall be capable of interrupting maximum prospective short circuit current that may occur, without danger.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ad0bcc3660faa2f71a3c3b1087cf57d1a71fce1013a61f5e3a64ef3d92e84e21','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19151','GHBC-REQ-019151','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.6','GHBC-C-004922','The ratings and settings of fuses and the protective devices shall be co-ordinated so as to afford selectivity in operation and in accordance with accepted standards. b) Where circuit-breakers are used for protection of a main circuit and of the sub-circuits derived therefrom, discrimination in operation may be achieved by adjusting the protective devices of the sub-main circuit-breakers to operate at lower current settings and shorter time-tag than the main circuitbreaker. c) Where HRC type fuses are used for back-up protection of circuit-breakers, or where HRC fuses are used for protection of main circuits, and circuitbreakers for the protection of subcircuits derived there from, in the event of short-circuits protection exceeding the short-circuits capacity of the circuitbreakers, the HRC fuses shall operate earlier than the circuit-breakers; but for smaller overloads within the short-circuit capacity of the circuit-breakers, the circuit-breakers shall operate earlier than the BRIC fuse blows. d) If re-wireable type fuses are used to protect sub-circuits derived from a main circuit protected by HRC type fuses, the main circuit fuse shall normally blow in the event of a short-circuit or earth fault occurring on sub-circuit, although discrimination may be achieved in respect of overload currents.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ffde308d96b9ca4c5bfce1719fab60787471fb79a54cbd18a48064fd71d46073','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19152','GHBC-REQ-019152','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.6','GHBC-C-004922','The use of re-wireable fuses is restricted to the circuits with short-circuit level of 4 kA; for higher level either cartridge or HRC fuses shall be used.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cff7de3a8b8525ea5a9ac3692e02f7099c959853485ca31019f3ae1d75066277','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19153','GHBC-REQ-019153','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.6','GHBC-C-004922','However, use of requireable fuse is not desirable, even for lower fault level areas.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4e7135fbef19e54f5f9ae25f6815e41efd681de8cb11c24f2ab9ca16afa66c23','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19154','GHBC-REQ-019154','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.6','GHBC-C-004922','MCB‘s provide a better and dependable protection, as their current setting is not temperable.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','02e8b367ca681d409b8c140e55074a38e4dc3ff9775faff15a73e8ad7cd26665','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19155','GHBC-REQ-019155','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.3.6.6','GHBC-C-004922','e) A fuse carrier shall not be fined with a fuse element larger than that for which the carrier is designed. f) The current rating of a fuse shall not exceed the current rating of the smallest cable in the circuit protected by the fuse. g) Every fuse shall have its own case or cover for the protection of the circuit and an indelible indication of its appropriate current rating in an adjacent conspicuous position.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4bee423c90a461610a169eb9cff2b2745e91c5b96291e941909887d60a3c8554','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19156','GHBC-REQ-019156','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.4','GHBC-C-004923','It should be ensured that all equipment connected to the system including any appliances to be used on them are suitable for the voltage and frequency of supply of the system.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9be8b33b8f9408b12926e4f64b533db612aaf3d66a35abf059aae0f2405bfde0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19157','GHBC-REQ-019157','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.4','GHBC-C-004923','The nominal values of low and medium voltage systems in Ghana are 240V and 415 V ac., respectively, and the frequency 50 Hz.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"spectively, and the frequency 50 Hz."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','999cdddc51f398f7e17911ea169e89f01a66386e0bdba6c58a87efc64bab468c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19158','GHBC-REQ-019158','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.4','GHBC-C-004923','Notes 1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d0f0014817fee19677857b1430f27f1664ca0b0105969437fed8014968aa8f98','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19159','GHBC-REQ-019159','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.4','GHBC-C-004923','The design of wiring system and the sizes of the cables should be decided taking into account two factors;','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dad2a3f9128ce822b5b580f85082663a1accb537fbf9d908c16d356ed61cf336','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
