('rowid-19176','GHBC-REQ-019176','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.6','GHBC-C-004931','Socket in kitchen, bathroom, toilet, garage etc. should not be provided within a height of 1m from the ground level.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"e provided within a height of 1m from the ground level."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e623b36a3456f52f60f2b93b9bfd56a4088c4b135180da1cab42e05d61599ba7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19177','GHBC-REQ-019177','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.6','GHBC-C-004931','Similar care has to be taken for installations involving foundations, swimming pools etc. Light fittings in such areas should be fed at low voltage, preferably through an isolating transformer with a proper earth leakage protection.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b8acecd41c6efe78c997a4d4fc6982d6f2a71850506a2ce26a8b4d6edf43a427','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
