('rowid-19187','GHBC-REQ-019187','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.7.3','GHBC-C-004934','This includes a reference to the composition of diffused and directional light, direction of incidence, the distribution of luminances and the degree of glare; and c) Colour of the light and colour rendition.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aadedf35382fd529b597dcddcc23903a9fe6e6b3432caeea219aafea0239c2bb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
