('rowid-19196','GHBC-REQ-019196','GS 1207:2018',28,NULL,'28.7.7.6','GHBC-C-004938','Energy conservation may be achieved by using the following: a) Energy efficient lamps, chokes, ballast, etc. for lighting equipment b) Efficient switching systems such as remote sensors, infrared switches, master switches, remote switches, etc. for switching ON and OFF of lighting circuits. c) Properly made/connected joints contacts to avoid loose joints leading to loss of power.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a0346ef4f6781474dcc61ce0c2a4842e9d7ce417608871bce2fbce8bede3f44e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
