('rowid-19208','GHBC-REQ-019208','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.2.4','GHBC-C-004947','When such socket-outlets with plugs are connected to any current consuming device of metal or any non-insulating material or both, conductors connecting such current-consuming','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','49118b1f332bb2f3845196bcb8fbac257c834cc67a51a1c8ccbe9f9c82288cf5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
