('rowid-19239','GHBC-REQ-019239','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','be no joint in the suspension rod, but if joints are unavoidable then such joints shall be screwed to special couplers of 5 cm minimum length and both ends of the pipes shall touch together within the couplers, and shall in addition be secured by means of split pins; alternatively, the two pipes may be welded.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0f817d158bbe39728f0ce547ef81b74515c96f603e9f76214858990f16e2a83f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19240','GHBC-REQ-019240','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','The suspension rod shall be of adequate strength to withstand the dead and impact forces imposed on it.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3305f5f25496715775279b742114a5421d945dbd6eba1c6934efe7dd45090447','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19241','GHBC-REQ-019241','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','Suspension rods should preferably be procured along with the fan.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c03082ccb61c52525e6c3dc75bcde05a55904b8f66d65553b91a63838ddc6223','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19242','GHBC-REQ-019242','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','c) Fan clamps shall be of suitable design according to the nature of construction of ceiling on which these clamps are to be fitted.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','35057a3964473007eca02c348ef5ff834fe5d3be3786ca56dea3c13b77b94335','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19243','GHBC-REQ-019243','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','In all cases fan clamps shall be fabricated from new metal of suitable sizes and they shall be as close fitting as possible.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5b9853321db577e9a20b3eb54d323c4443a13bfad0e8c60fed7747398c1eb2df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19244','GHBC-REQ-019244','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','Fan clamps for wooden beams, shall be of suitable flat iron fixed on two sides of the beam and according to the size and clause of the beam one or two mild steel bolts passing through the beam shall hold both flat irons together.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5072a5f7fb2ac8afbeb0a93e1a18f66f5711e975a58812befdad5fbbfd5ee566','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19245','GHBC-REQ-019245','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','Fan clamps for steel joist shall be fabricated from flat iron to fit rigidly to the bottom flange of the beam.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d111d8ce63778e356b011b53e1e68f979b79b5b7befd831bb7b6f2809c06c946','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19246','GHBC-REQ-019246','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','Care shall be taken during fabrication that the metal does not crack while hammer to shape.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f1ee4ad492cd55c8865db0aa5eca5db2950da251b471902d93073ab86ef73528','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19247','GHBC-REQ-019247','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','Other fan clamps shall be made to suit the position, but in call cases care shall be taken to see that they are rigid and safe.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','754dff01baac11f26bb85567f517cb7c04c4cf9b4b7fd6a2b91e21d1e000424c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19248','GHBC-REQ-019248','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','d) Canopies on top and bottom of suspension rods shall effectively conceal suspensions and connections to fan motors, respectively.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','18dea2c429ac8de263a2ec3dc6565f66980b1e1d97f7eab721eef60742ec355e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19249','GHBC-REQ-019249','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','e) The lead-in-wire shall be of nominal cross-clauseal area not less than 1.5mm2 copper and shall be protected from abrasion.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1.5,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"f nominal cross-clauseal area not less than 1.5mm2 copper and shall be protec"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.5,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"s-clauseal area not less than 1.5mm2 copper and shall be protecte"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29c0a445e013e212c9b247855bc85e85d072a97cc9c4a8e246d7c280dfd2f83c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19250','GHBC-REQ-019250','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','f) Unless otherwise specified, the clearance between the lowest most point of the ceiling fan and the floor shall be not less than 2.4m.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2.4,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"ng fan and the floor shall be not less than 2.4m."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.4,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" floor shall be not less than 2.4m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','32b57fa367aedff8abe06a5a07798c5e257e2ccbef1eb25ae3c7e327946588db','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19251','GHBC-REQ-019251','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','The minimum clearance','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ccf36efbf50ced22219931a74f204f49961ba462d9b1811d2b99f4682b9dfbae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19252','GHBC-REQ-019252','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','between the ceiling and the plane of the blades shall be not less than 300mm.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":300,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" plane of the blades shall be not less than 300mm."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"blades shall be not less than 300mm."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f5421afc1be6bfd76552e42ccd3bc6fa7a05db71322a4587f8b15a171e6ede4c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19253','GHBC-REQ-019253','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','A typical arrangement of a fan clamp is given in Fig.2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','09281919ec317f7c1c3ae888b8a285caef5c8877b339aee5a24b98e913238e77','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19254','GHBC-REQ-019254','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.1','GHBC-C-004958','Note: All fan clamps shall be so fabricated that fans revolve steadily.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8b1ed3835ea3ac0c274647f5de4cce80d6d53cc603880005d3ee5d4fec7084b0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19255','GHBC-REQ-019255','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.2','GHBC-C-004959','For fixing of an exhaust fan, a circular hole shall be provided in the wall to suit the size of the frame which shall be fixed by means of rag-bolts embedded in the wall.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f6999d829f96257904a8baa31db85c6d88354db8c6e1fa7d954b03c470dff4e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19256','GHBC-REQ-019256','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.2','GHBC-C-004959','The hole shall be neatly plastered with cement and brought to the original finish of the wall.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6d75c6c878008a2b12dcbf346296fbde51c7b12380094d9b40008b1d906f2bf6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19257','GHBC-REQ-019257','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.8.2','GHBC-C-004959','The exhaust fan shall be connected to exhaust fan point which shall be wired as near to the hole as possible by means of a flexible cord, care being taken that the blades rotate in the proper direction.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e440c3345bd846d7ecbe90a56c4e2f8f3468a99c5fecf5367c26edbaaa5febbb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19258','GHBC-REQ-019258','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.9.1','GHBC-C-004961','ceiling roses, brackets, pendants and accessories attached to walls or ceilings shall be mounted on substantial teak wood blocks twice varnished after all fixing holes are made in them.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2b709f38e4b001c650502ed4ffddd35ebdb481966058411eb3afdb827a43c8ab','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19259','GHBC-REQ-019259','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.9.1','GHBC-C-004961','Blocks shall not be less than 4 cm deep.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":4,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"Blocks shall not be less than 4 cm deep."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d942592806c68b5f09ad394610208a97ecb64df80484bfdbac286848e65edb42','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19260','GHBC-REQ-019260','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.9.1','GHBC-C-004961','Brass screws shall only be use for attaching fittings and accessories to their base blocks.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','67a02190bd07ff9635937a1e377a4aadc93fd23f1e842c489e325d0675a43ea3','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19261','GHBC-REQ-019261','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.9.2','GHBC-C-004962','used for mounting switches, regulators, etc. these boards shall be well varnished with pure shellac on all four sides (both inside and outside), irrespective of being painted to match the surroundings.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','02ea1206ede0a4fdbb00d7ba547a645c80742c7a5e366363dff1317d035c36b0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19262','GHBC-REQ-019262','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.9.2','GHBC-C-004962','The size of such boards shall depend on the number of accessories that could conveniently and neatly be arranged.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c044e3ef6a100a629ba68f2575b3f67e2a5c09b0ddfd3449b89857e6f3d92d32','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19263','GHBC-REQ-019263','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9','28.9.9.2','GHBC-C-004962','Where there is danger of attack by white ants, the boards shall be treated with suitable anti-termite compound and painted on both sides.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','86072f2f72efa59b88e71bc917ef518eb5d909486a2c7fb37ce331e3e4a2f3dc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19264','GHBC-REQ-019264','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.10',NULL,'GHBC-C-004963','Similar part of all switches, lamp holders, distribution fuse-boards, ceiling roses, brackets, pendants, fans and all other fittings shall be so chosen that they are of the same type and interchangeable in each installation.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','27cdea1028a2da3f22a90751811f6c7c5c7fa207fdc61c3ee15b520cf3c1d3a5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19265','GHBC-REQ-019265','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.11',NULL,'GHBC-C-004964','Electrical equipment which form integral part of wiring intended for switching or control or protection of wiring installations shall conform to the relevant Indian Standards wherever they exist.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6f2555c75a5117420616677672c88316772a5ff9e34500500242d0c21bce7013','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19266','GHBC-REQ-019266','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.1','GHBC-C-004965','Where ceiling fans are provided, the bay sizes of a building, which control fan point locations, play an important part.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7feeb3c7730f8fbed57979285954fc81c498366ef133d94b197c1c5c94d3e6bb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19267','GHBC-REQ-019267','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.2','GHBC-C-004966','to 10m2 and therefore in general purpose office buildings, for every part of a bay to be served by the ceiling fans, it is necessary that the bays shall be so designed that full number of fans could be suitably located for the bay, otherwise it will result in ill-ventilated pockets.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"to 10m2 and therefore in general purp"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','68b61c173d9b32319323558dff023ffd20621a2c32698325459d4dd915b2e2b7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19268','GHBC-REQ-019268','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.2','GHBC-C-004966','In general, fans in long halls may be spaced at 3m in both the directions.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"n long halls may be spaced at 3m in both the directions."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b4afb770b1ae7d279045dfb86758574662b05a56a1a2e1dd3b1a20ff576fce7b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19269','GHBC-REQ-019269','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.2','GHBC-C-004966','If building modules do not lend themselves for proper positioning of the required number of ceiling fans, such as air circulators or bracket fans would have to be employed for the areas uncovered by the ceiling fans.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec3a04cd72347c1b30d9326488506bde67ec3dbc3888aab9bea6e449e7c1c26d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19270','GHBC-REQ-019270','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.2','GHBC-C-004966','For this, suitable electrical outlets shall be provided although result will be disproportionate to cost on account of fans.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4fe936a582a56e120ad922e06569a89a6c5ec21c3a17a6e493081ec3842c2c6c','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19271','GHBC-REQ-019271','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.3','GHBC-C-004967','achieved either by larger number of smaller fans or smaller number of larger fans.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae517ef1b56e64f771b8697c54ebed7a1e6ad7dd3f0209367e41b5cc0471243a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19272','GHBC-REQ-019272','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.3','GHBC-C-004967','The economics of the system as a whole should be a guiding factor in choosing the number and type of fans and their locations.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6370d225ef1aff9680f7cdd9bcdcae836a01b7f2473f27643bd063b7bcea9b5f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19273','GHBC-REQ-019273','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.4','GHBC-C-004968','Exhaust fans are necessary for spaces, such as community toilets, kitchens and canteens to provide the required number of air changes.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','736a9bdeb7e6a8c0a249a88677eed0636096a734930862ca8deda3505b533ad5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19274','GHBC-REQ-019274','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.4','GHBC-C-004968','Since the exhaust fans are located generally on the outer walls of a room appropriate openings in such walls shall be provided for in the planning stage.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2163b22a12d4fb6967724ebd8a607ad9b40ddfc5ff83d3d4a0819f096b0e6554','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19275','GHBC-REQ-019275','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.4','GHBC-C-004968','Note: Exhaust fan requirement is based on the recommended air changes.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','307eb45136d50373c177dae3b07237f5a56b118b035fc8f711d9ec225649017d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19276','GHBC-REQ-019276','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.4','GHBC-C-004968','Reference may also be made to Part 3 ‗Use and Occupancy‘.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7e1444a6a406da53e35b6cd261b46bfd2b3fcbbe89abef5a95fdaedfda58fc98','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19277','GHBC-REQ-019277','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.4','GHBC-C-004968','Exhaust fan requirement','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b2e503d8add9f897cee1c425ac1a9a5ec8b7939bc6ab6c2df0d5d49ec3b8952a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19278','GHBC-REQ-019278','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.4','GHBC-C-004968','comes for catering to smoke extraction also.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a21e4c9ae300465368b3f89d98a81737d3e260593abeba2e987844dbffd8291e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19279','GHBC-REQ-019279','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.4','GHBC-C-004968','Basement areas depend on the system of fresh air fans and exhaust fans.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','da78274ee58e16283bade3a98f168cdde16e8a943929e0cc630e0692c10fcc3f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19280','GHBC-REQ-019280','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.9.12','28.9.12.5','GHBC-C-004969','shall be chosen to make these effective without causing shadows and stroboscopic effect on the working planes.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','282349d3eae21679c49ed97a2d192a71785c9db33b662ff50847742da48f5689','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19281','GHBC-REQ-019281','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1','GHBC-C-004970','Earthing shall generally be carried out in accordance with the relevant regulations of the ECG.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0badf2a1694f832d37a4f4d98d25800579c48d145de2287e66721a929fec2a87','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19282','GHBC-REQ-019282','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1','GHBC-C-004970','The main earthing system of an electrical installation must consist of: a) An earth electrode; b) A main earthing wire; c) An earth bar (located on the main switchboard) for the connection of the main earthing wire, protective earthing wires and/or bonding wires within  the installation; and d) A removable link, which effectively disconnects the neutral bar from the earth bar.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','abb665b954a72a5225ea9f6f699be3e449529cad0477e26ad630f2a593123bae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19283','GHBC-REQ-019283','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1','GHBC-C-004970','Note: The requirements of (c) and (d) above must be carried out by the licensed electrician as part of the switchboard installation.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8527e24db0514b40c5ab2a50bf46a2ba7ecd105a657febc3b7f16329d437347b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19284','GHBC-REQ-019284','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1','GHBC-C-004970','The main earthing wire termination must be readily accessible at the earth electrode.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','146c1faa7e81ba383fef07a5f664463449af28110493603db2427799d897af0c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19285','GHBC-REQ-019285','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1','GHBC-C-004970','The main earthing wire connection must: a) Be mechanically and electrically sound; b) Be protected against damage, corrosion, and vibration; c) Not place any strain on the various part of the connection; d) Not damage the wire or fittings; and e) Be secured at the earth electrode.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','002b0ed0adeccba7a935216ff692dd1bbea7936a0974cd8dce0eefc85b2c642d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19286','GHBC-REQ-019286','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1','GHBC-C-004970','Use a permanent fitting (like a screwed-down plastic label or copper label, or one that can be threaded onto the cable) at the connection point that is clearly marked with the words: ―EARTHING LED – DO NOT DISCONNECT‖ or ―EARTHING CONDUCTOR – DO NOT DISCONNECT‖.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c184de00b6b24ebc57ab10c344c2c28c78378211e28e761db392141a6d27ee06','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19287','GHBC-REQ-019287','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.1','GHBC-C-004971','All medium voltage equipment shall be earthed by two separate and distinct connections with earth.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["IS 3043"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ca29453cff90afad76a2d37cf023f4b184bc50e084e190d75de5b918651b654','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19288','GHBC-REQ-019288','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.1','GHBC-C-004971','The contact area of','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["IS 3043"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fd3463592256c4a1801e0d44cb33619a84e288b67d337ece6256af9dceb028a0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19289','GHBC-REQ-019289','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.1','GHBC-C-004971','earth conductor/plate shall be determined using guidelines specified in GS IS 3043 (Refer to Electrical Regulation 2012, LI 2008).','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2012,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"efer to Electrical Regulation 2012, LI 2008)."}]','["IS 3043"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1e6ab0a4267ccb8ff10f1186034207cdfbbfb855036e1abf8d809b348423edf4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19290','GHBC-REQ-019290','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.1','GHBC-C-004971','The system of 400/230 V (HV/LV), 4-wire, 3 phase system are normal in Ghana operated with the neutral solidly earthed at source.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["IS 3043"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7bb11decf47563aa0d9e42a551ba2b13e5d4d9846bca8ba9a3f36063ae7f1717','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19291','GHBC-REQ-019291','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.1','GHBC-C-004971','The neutral will carry a current more than the national out-of-balance current and as such neutral conductor shall be of the same size as the phase conductor.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["IS 3043"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0ec7ee7d0a881cc1ee9d8ef36bab6b17e34fb339f36756040872ca275726a0f2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19292','GHBC-REQ-019292','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.1','GHBC-C-004971','In the case of high and extra high voltages, the neutral points shall be earthed by not less than two separate and distinct connections with earth, each having its own electrode at the generating station or substation and may be earthed at any other point provided no interference is caused by such earthing.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["IS 3043"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e81f845a28944441b66382ef6002708112dde3acfe4a78dc96f38b3d749e7648','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19293','GHBC-REQ-019293','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.1','GHBC-C-004971','The neutral may be earthed through suitable impedance not more than 10 ohms.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":10,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"ed through suitable impedance not more than 10 ohms."}]','["IS 3043"]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ef15437c99258b39a7956152b57a3ff63ae5907b59324da5db6e1c642adece58','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19294','GHBC-REQ-019294','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.2','GHBC-C-004972','shall be visible for inspection.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9fa293d838ecc617dfd2f7cf0383ed71f426a0b1610ca4bdc396699fda44d8a0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19295','GHBC-REQ-019295','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.3','GHBC-C-004973','Earth system shall be so devised that the testing of individual earth electrode is possible.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b4eff5fac0f7da7bdd88a316bf3e7b697d370e61c5ebc6f6b3441e714e37ed1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19296','GHBC-REQ-019296','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.3','GHBC-C-004973','It is recommended that the value of any earth system resistance shall be such as to conform with the degree of shock protection desired.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e64bb16a8957020c9e5229514bcdc38cd1a58fc9127d40a7bea2812bd9edbab6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19297','GHBC-REQ-019297','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.4','GHBC-C-004974','showing the main earth connection and earth electrodes be prepared for each installation.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1612e366d4939e98abaa248bdcce05ee03b26e3b14568b8c64c1ebf00021a31e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19298','GHBC-REQ-019298','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.5','GHBC-C-004975','system, either temporary or permanent, shall be made which will increase the maximum available earth fault current or its duration until it has been ascertained that the existing arrangement of earth electrodes, earth busbar, etc. are capable of carrying the new value of earth fault current which may be obtained by this addition.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','06835b657ffa090fcb1730c0730a0bb4b91d9efe269365cfd593cb22b39a10df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19299','GHBC-REQ-019299','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.6','GHBC-C-004976','No cut-out, link or switch other than a linked switch arranged to operate simultaneously on the earthed or earthed neutral conductor and the live conductors, shall be inserted on any supply system.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0f8f7b988aaeb5380027085d2e4d61a177fd5e707bfb0edd17f6669f63a1ddb3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19300','GHBC-REQ-019300','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.6','GHBC-C-004976','This, however, does not include the case of a switch for use in controlling a generator or a transformer or a link for test purposes.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d1581474c339175b53f1a772d6bf039f782c071102a6e95d1a770d00fc05c25c','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19301','GHBC-REQ-019301','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.7','GHBC-C-004977','All materials, fittings, etc. used in earthing shall conform to Indian Standard specifications, wherever these exists.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1e43c57251a8cd38a31a9446f26708f67df3362fd53f225d8434d2a46e3b6099','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19302','GHBC-REQ-019302','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.1.8','GHBC-C-004978','carrying conductor is normally essential for the security of the system and is generally known as system earthing, while earthing of non-current carrying metal work and conductor is essential for the safety of human life, of animals and of property and it is generally known as equipment earthing.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12fb6b64e56039b39a52971174dede8ef4fd5da13b372f9fc08ff5272c3baca2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19303','GHBC-REQ-019303','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.2','GHBC-C-004979','The system of 400/230 V (HV/LV), 4-wire, 3 phase system are normal in Ghana operated with the neutral solidly earthed at source.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0bcd3c7e7fd3c862822618dc9502bc4a90ea677f1b1db18d6f4a47f6121c710b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19304','GHBC-REQ-019304','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.2','GHBC-C-004979','The neutral will carry a current more than the national out-of-balance current and as such neutral conductor shall be of the same size as the phase conductor.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','33d9507a5cc368ed880a80295bc7812d41597925af974956facac176a615ec88','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19305','GHBC-REQ-019305','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.2','GHBC-C-004979','Details of typical pipe and plta earth electrodes are given in Fig.3 and Fig.4.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3c3bebea620a89587fdae38a0670d726df996944f609d54e03bf04c0ac5cade7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19306','GHBC-REQ-019306','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.2','GHBC-C-004979','Although electrode material does not affect initial earth resistance, care should be taken to select a material which is resistant to corrosion in the type of soil in which it is used.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cb8ea89a3b5ae56558ab375e63f345636fe30fef30e964fb340504d29e8d54c6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19307','GHBC-REQ-019307','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.2','GHBC-C-004979','Under ordinary conditions of soil, use of copper, iron or mild steel electrodes is recommended.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','62007347a7790a7f142a5871887b57cfee1a0cbba6e8f6ca7595c2c74f35bcbc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19308','GHBC-REQ-019308','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.2','GHBC-C-004979','In the case where soil condition leads to excessive corrosion of the electrode, and the connections, it is recommended to use either copper electrode or copper clad electrode or zinc coastal galvanised iron electrode.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d778d214ca77ff6f7df680d9efd33a8b200a64b765c78b153aa60afd2de45265','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19309','GHBC-REQ-019309','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.2','GHBC-C-004979','The electrode shall be kept free from paint, enamel and grease.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ffb9f1b94caf74281347cb06663e3e5da25fc2fe8bf5500b5e6977ba5f59b7d8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19310','GHBC-REQ-019310','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.2','GHBC-C-004979','It is recommended to use similar material for earth electrodes and earth conductors or otherwise precautions should be taken to avoid corrosion.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','05c8f64cfb107bcdd060c2b9096a7d137bb34f2f1d589615168737891c88f78a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19311','GHBC-REQ-019311','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.3','GHBC-C-004980','shall be in concrete inspection chambers visible for inspection and shall be carefully made; if they are poorly made or inadequate for the purpose for which they are intended, loss of life and property or serious personal injury may result.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec58275255b46c1a0e92b8bc8ec36fa9233f8fb3c12c8d93a0271864c0e0b228','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19312','GHBC-REQ-019312','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.3','GHBC-C-004980','To obtain low overall resistance the current density should be as low as possible in the medium adjacent to the electrodes; which should be so designed as to cause the current density to decrease rapidly with distance from the electrode.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','beb920cd8918a7973b936271b798f30c93bb81587ca2709935b791a076d55a28','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19313','GHBC-REQ-019313','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.3','GHBC-C-004980','This requirement is met by','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e2c92e041cd874a7f3f45276055238b3ddc0fa8c6cb50746dc6414c49c8bbdb6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19314','GHBC-REQ-019314','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.3','GHBC-C-004980','making the dimensions in one direction large compared with those in the other two, thus a pipe, rod or strip has a much lower resistance than a plate of equal surface area.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','dc7cd1dd57ac8aa28deeb9c9499e1f4a6737f3c169bc147ef767006bc7eec309','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19315','GHBC-REQ-019315','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.3','GHBC-C-004980','The resistance is not, however, inversely proportional to the surface area of the electrode.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0627143386226f4505105772e42baae8abffa37082cade4955157010b98e7a16','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19316','GHBC-REQ-019316','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.3','GHBC-C-004980','28.10.4 Equipment and portions of installations which shall be earthed','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','48200c114e9128d2c5b18420a0d89481b83c16e0bd1876e18ae377a1cbfa82ce','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19317','GHBC-REQ-019317','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.4.1','GHBC-C-004981','Except for equipment provided with double insulation, all the non-current carrying metal parts of electrical installations are to be earthed properly.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ca840387a4f534b2b8a3ec6861816a9cb3f3f8d92143b793b242c00d6b5693f3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19318','GHBC-REQ-019318','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.4.1','GHBC-C-004981','All metal conduits, trunking, cable sheaths, switchgear, distribution fuseboards, lighting fittings and all other parts made of metal shall be blended together and connected by means of two separate and distinct conductors to an efficient earth electrode.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2c3c67982c81d0ad8fae8250a738701a9dde5bc0117b17d338c6abf77d84c34d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19319','GHBC-REQ-019319','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.10','28.10.4.2','GHBC-C-004982','Earthing of the metallic parts shall not be effected through any structural metal work which houses the installation.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b234acdf0abf837d5cd60c8037a3578b3298df87747266baa9c822f84e8cd452','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
