('rowid-19413','GHBC-REQ-019413','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.3.1','GHBC-C-005013','and hotels where many TV receivers are located, a common master antenna system may preferably be used to avoid mushrooming of individual antennas.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','df8fc9279245c40b936cd9e46aa99de0e1a2e4e9bb084376e139c6d44698d275','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19414','GHBC-REQ-019414','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.3.2','GHBC-C-005014','at the top most convenient point in any building and a suitable room on the top-most floor or terrace for housing the amplifier unit, may also be provided in consultation with the architect/engineer.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ab186822e18908e0262dbe9c5cf5493d70f7b37c82e15e45e8f4dba602be226c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19415','GHBC-REQ-019415','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.3.3','GHBC-C-005015','laid in recess to facilitate drawing coaxial cable to individual flats.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8edae47eae55ebe4f762428bc4f758bc55111f04128c30a9ee0cdbbdcff37c09','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19416','GHBC-REQ-019416','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.3.3','GHBC-C-005015','Suitable ‗Tap Off‘ boxes may be provided in every room/flat as required.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5c9ecaedb7ba921dfd51849c2bc60fe2ff001f68dfbde08a64f36e3815817c33','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19417','GHBC-REQ-019417','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.4','GHBC-C-005016','The UPS is an electrical device providing an interface between the mains power supply and sensitive loads (computer systems, instrumentation, etc.).','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5103be7c09bb7ee7fbbdaf0a4066b4efe239e918398dc57b69bc3ec5dbcba170','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19418','GHBC-REQ-019418','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.4','GHBC-C-005016','The UPS supplies sinusoidal a.c power free of disturbances and within strict amplitude and frequency tolerances.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2ed53b23991e4526308c5fd38e9c40ea16ad2286620a4ecd7b1955006ce3a251','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19419','GHBC-REQ-019419','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.4','GHBC-C-005016','It is generally made up of a rectifier/charger and an inverter together with a battery for backup power in the event of a mains failure with virtually no time lag.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a30a9586770edd949e52199e7beebb2606c8e5b96c74a60025d382d131a6b864','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19420','GHBC-REQ-019420','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.4','GHBC-C-005016','In general UPS system shall be provided for sensitive electronic equipments like computers,','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fcae17d3cca322a924e28bac9a163849920964f9e0e5bc5b17d93b6e66dfc8d9','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19421','GHBC-REQ-019421','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.4','GHBC-C-005016','printers, fire alarm panel, public address system equipment, access control panel, EPABX, etc. with the following provisions: a) Provisions of isolation transformers shall be provided where the capacity exceeds 5 kVA. b) UPS shall  have dedicated neutral earthing system c) Adequate rating of protective devices such as MCB, MCCB, fuses, ELCB, etc. shall be provided at both incoming and outgoing sides. d) UPS room shall be provided with adequate ventilation and/or air conditioning as per requirement.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c299ec8356632b0582a95e63f057d825a335a076388d1d7a8da0930d483eff4a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19422','GHBC-REQ-019422','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.5','GHBC-C-005017','In general, an inverter system shall be provided for house lighting, shop lighting, etc. with the following provisions: a) Adequate rating of protective devices such as MCB, MCCB, fuses, ELCB, etc. shall be provided at both incoming and outgoing sides.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','abd7de9e4a533d823f6217c62bde440e11d949ec55aa5d54c4f411e640b768d6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19423','GHBC-REQ-019423','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.5','GHBC-C-005017','b) Earthing shall be done properly.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dfff1c3ddc0e847e97754c32d1248119476884ff5cf3a56c31fe1ec72c6f4d95','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19424','GHBC-REQ-019424','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.5','GHBC-C-005017','c) Adequate ventilation space shall be provided around the battery clause of the inverter.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bcd071dcaa1a33396e0d8a599fc8482dd8c1c0a9b71ed721acb437fb688ef37f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19425','GHBC-REQ-019425','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.5','GHBC-C-005017','d) Care in circuit design to keep the connected load in such a manner that the demand at the time of mains failure is within the capability of the inverter.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','57b6b2f2edc825d3a971e59f998a331417fd2be8df9b67185720b03b14d06611','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19426','GHBC-REQ-019426','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.5','GHBC-C-005017','(If the inverter fails to take cover the load at the time of the mains failure, the purpose of providing the inverter and battery backup is defeated).','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1e118fcdfbcda62cad106e036c33f1359f41998f429368c825aea0358406b3bb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19427','GHBC-REQ-019427','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.5','GHBC-C-005017','e) Circuits which are fed by the UPS or Inverter systems should have suitable marking to ensure that a workman does not assume that the power is off, once he has switched off the mains from the DB for maintenance.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','740c7067ecdfe99ba20b377aec6e62acb6a7dfb70cb845b44363313d27621fbc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19428','GHBC-REQ-019428','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.5','GHBC-C-005017','f) UPS systems and Inverter systems have a very limited fault feeding capacity in comparison to the mains supply from the licensee‘s network.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','994bf31226c02421e9ec63c16fe6c1ece3a4679c5709ee3673d9c140d4fb417f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19429','GHBC-REQ-019429','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.5','GHBC-C-005017','The low fault current feed may cause loss of','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5370ede5f8ba0f37d1cb434758c69a43af101905deb66025fd91a051d7537529','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19430','GHBC-REQ-019430','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.5','GHBC-C-005017','discrimination in the operation of MCB‘s, if the inverter on UPS system feeds a number of circuits with more than one over current protective device in series (such as incoming MCB at the DB and a few outgoing MCB‘s).','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed155849d316792433ff9f797893e8bc0d193a54bd5e8b397c0733082d1ce690','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19431','GHBC-REQ-019431','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.5','GHBC-C-005017','The choice of MCB‘s in such cases has to be done keeping the circuit operating and fault condition parameters under both (mains operation and UPS operation) conditions.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c9318ff6146ed7460acc974d91331dea6307192c7322f53469e49752ab6cd227','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19432','GHBC-REQ-019432','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.6','GHBC-C-005018','kVA) In general small diesel generating sets shall be provided for small installations such as offices, shops, small scale industry, hostels, etc. with the following provisions: a) These shall be located near the exit or outside in open areas b) They shall be in reach of authorized persons only c) Adequate firefighting equipment shall be provided near such installations d) Exhaust from these shall be disposed in such a way so as not to cause health hazard. e) These shall have acoustic enclosure, or shall be placed at a location so as not to cause noise pollution. f) Adequate ventilation shall be provided around the installation g) Adequate rating of protective devices such as MCB, MCCB, fuses, ELCB, etc. shall be provided h) Separate and adequate body and neutral earthings shall be done.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aaf7444de04ba09df9c9b5cf8b20fe893a43bec7a04ed15e036f99d8386689b6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19433','GHBC-REQ-019433','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.7','GHBC-C-005019','A building management/automation system may be considered to be provided for controlling and monitoring of all parameters of HVAC, electrical, plumbing, fire fighting, low voltage system such as telephone, TV, etc. This not only lead to reduction of energy consumption, it shall also generate data leading to better operation practice and systematic maintenance scheduling.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e9e23cadfcc767764f801ce670a3e093fcbb5c7e05e68fda9ebbca9ac36f26a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19434','GHBC-REQ-019434','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.7','GHBC-C-005019','The total overview provided by a Building Automation System, with a capability to oversee a large number of operating and environmental parameters on real time basis','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a899dc1d4cbd3318d3e2dcb5f006e395a24db4f49372f67853704020f32e690','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19435','GHBC-REQ-019435','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.7','GHBC-C-005019','leads to introduction of measures which lead to further reduction in energy consumption.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc656589972013cfc92a7692baee2fc04dd62a93c8b62e85e60d72afe705c4e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19436','GHBC-REQ-019436','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.7','GHBC-C-005019','It shall also help in reduction of skilled manpower required for operation and maintenance of large complexes.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a69ff61ea1b7bcddaab8c3401ae2cdff5a4d0b14b1581c6ba8262a2503b1158','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19437','GHBC-REQ-019437','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.7','GHBC-C-005019','This system can further linked to other systems such as Fire alarm system, public address system, etc. for more effective running of services.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c346256b3aa573df6a777d1855058c01513a7cfb3e04fb7d6d11d70ee4c348b2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19438','GHBC-REQ-019438','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.7','GHBC-C-005019','This system can be used for analysis and controlling of all services in a particular complex, leading efficient and optimum utilization of available services.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b29b4eea3cdab530c43223a17e161f04fb3a965e52fd1f65a52093e59482a38','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19439','GHBC-REQ-019439','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.8','GHBC-C-005020','Security system may be defined as an integrated Closed Circuit Television System, Access Control System, Perimeter Protection Systems, movement sensors, etc. These have a central control panel, which has a defined historey storage capacity.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c00608c0b255147d68277402519121d03601669f43ed5479e98862d22b4c5f82','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19440','GHBC-REQ-019440','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.8','GHBC-C-005020','This main control panel may be located near to the fire detection and alarm system.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d48c59e0597cbadc1fa8064bb7fdb8ffe84ad2db2530403657f97bba55161bbe','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19441','GHBC-REQ-019441','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.8','GHBC-C-005020','These may be considered for high security areas or large crowded areas or complexes.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f69d94a22400d8355b526ae61ede9abda0242bab710477462f9627fc38643a49','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19442','GHBC-REQ-019442','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.8','GHBC-C-005020','High security areas may consider uncorded, high-resolution, black and white cameras in place of coloured cameras.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ca5fd9b16d659bf4f1565c2c1cacc68a2e27ce7c781640d570ae044a31c8f902','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19443','GHBC-REQ-019443','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.8','GHBC-C-005020','These may be accompanied with movement sensors.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c70953fc9ce8d2499e3aba1aac1a2afb11f9f34ba86a385b321edcc4b63837aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19444','GHBC-REQ-019444','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.8','GHBC-C-005020','Access control may be provided for entry to high security areas.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','85dbfa0db863cd075ccbb53526d4d555654e7e00e04c3aca19fce95afc0cfe49','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19445','GHBC-REQ-019445','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.8','GHBC-C-005020','The systems may have proximity card readers, magnetic readers, etc.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c60512c4eaf88793e2d8bfac03504c62261b389dcc4f74dc98e9d912b27ca987','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19446','GHBC-REQ-019446','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.9','GHBC-C-005021','Networking is the practice of linking computing devices together with hardware and software that supports data communication across these devices.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','54fd6f46b4c3c5a7bced5e5ca6e468503719c2424e9e166bbefa5496fca9c24e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19447','GHBC-REQ-019447','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.10','GHBC-C-005022','The Car management System may be provided in multi-level parking or other parking pplots where number of vehicles to be parked exceeds 1000 vehicles.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','477178021863a4d36aa04e28ba819a6527b0a1a5f9c22d7007834a6a03686f97','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19448','GHBC-REQ-019448','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.10','GHBC-C-005022','The Car Park Management System may have features of Pay and Display Machines may be manned and unmanned type.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7c7b63c34a6e3a77b12a58e9f035d7662e563ba3263a7c4cfdcc9249397fc6d2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19449','GHBC-REQ-019449','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.10','GHBC-C-005022','Parking guidance system needs to display number of car spaces vacant on various floors, direction of entry and exit, etc. This system can be of great benefit in evaluating statistical data‘s','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ee3d58f3f4c8bcd59d8319af038be6f115f960cc6893fa27d1cce9fe989a2532','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19450','GHBC-REQ-019450','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.12','28.12.10','GHBC-C-005022','such as number of cars in a day or month or hour, stay time of various vehicles, etc.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','878fbf8b98c16c3035aba5d6c470385254c25819c16380cfefa52faefb325529','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19451','GHBC-REQ-019451','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1','GHBC-C-005023','Before proceeding with the detailed design of a lightening protecting system, the following essential steps should be taken: a) Decide whether or not the structure needs protection and, if so, what are the special requirements (see 28.13.1.1)','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2dcc60f1202dee37c89365ba0cfbadf91aac60d97671f7a0bd62b34ec229a189','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19452','GHBC-REQ-019452','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1','GHBC-C-005023','b) Ensure a close liaison between the architect, the builder, the lightening protective system engineer, and the appropriate authorities throughout the design stages.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f47abfaae00bb3ce8277509fcc81789467fbb672c2d28dc77d7047232d50b9d8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19453','GHBC-REQ-019453','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1','GHBC-C-005023','c) Agree the procedures for testing, commissioning and future maintenance.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','14e732c74c4c341c6f0454a9f2ec2a90270057212ac0bceed2d48c5d166f68b4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19454','GHBC-REQ-019454','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.1','GHBC-C-005024','Structures with inherent explosive risks; for example, explosives factories, stores and dumps and fuel tanks; usually need the highest possible class of lighting protective system.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','02d216153e0bc20a000b2c8109e4852f4b20ade414b07b40603b2ded2c378b83','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19455','GHBC-REQ-019455','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.1','GHBC-C-005024','For all other structures, the standard of protection recommended in the remainder of the Code is applicable and the only question remaining is whether to protect or not.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ac8a330696b519b8d9ef523d20db34a95d05b888e42014ffe03ba39e5c22d632','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19456','GHBC-REQ-019456','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.1','GHBC-C-005024','In many cases, the need for protection may be self-evident, for example: effecting risk of being struck and the','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a1662bc1f0ba2609b4a55c835cb7df798d8d6d90f4e589530a722280283365be','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19457','GHBC-REQ-019457','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.1','GHBC-C-005024','consequential effects of a stroke in these cases are discussed in 28.13.1.2 to 28.13.1.8.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b98ef3ebd5417542f04978376128c982f3b13e39051a0ee754053d64fc396814','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19458','GHBC-REQ-019458','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.1','GHBC-C-005024','It must be understood, however, that some factors cannot be assessed, and these may override all other considerations.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','603a0f5aa08c92bbc1690015ce56f03736d2398f7f7e29a376785e303b1dcf90','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19459','GHBC-REQ-019459','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.1','GHBC-C-005024','For example, a desire that there should be no avoidable risk to life or that the occupants of a building should always feel safe, may decide the question in favour of protection, even though it would normally be accepted that there was no need.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','43813e15e0fe0dfc72b624df3cfcaf602cdb91ed0b54fed3666a8ff99cbd2e37','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19460','GHBC-REQ-019460','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.1','GHBC-C-005024','No guidance can be given in such matters, but an assessment can be made taking account of the exposure risk (that is the risk of the structure being struck) and the following factors: a) Use to which the structure is put; b) Nature of its construction; c) Value of its contents or consequential effects; d) The height of the structure (ion the case of composite structures the overall height).','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','67801f83d161ad80dc5dc6620a326bdf037145be1409795a118628f462980dd7','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-19461','GHBC-REQ-019461','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.2','GHBC-C-005025','The probability of a structure or building being struck by lightning in any one year is the product of the ‗lightning flash density‘ and the ‗effective collection area‘ of the structure.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3e6d5c58dd471006cc2e21f2dbfe77ead7997ef8d058c592fa67ca9af8d10225','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19462','GHBC-REQ-019462','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.2','GHBC-C-005025','The lightning flash density, Ng, is the number of (flashes to ground) per km2 per year.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','22c04fb5ec27d1d64587d5275066f2b39c6c60b38746b5b3ac81fc3c9ba10321','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19463','GHBC-REQ-019463','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.2','GHBC-C-005025','Note: For the purpose of this Code, the information given in Fig.5 on thunderstorm days per year would be necessary to be translated in terms of estimated average annual density Ng.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cd4aa8f33f402ca8059fc321177e282bcd5c59ac6ccd20df8a0852eea7e489be','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19464','GHBC-REQ-019464','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.2','GHBC-C-005025','The table below which indicates the relationship between thunderstorm days per year and lightning flashes per square kilometer per year:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','95715449f5b73f72446a14bb8cece0c95d6decd754045a43d0b88bb4d9af025e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19465','GHBC-REQ-019465','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.2','GHBC-C-005025','The effective collection area of a structure is the area on the plan of the structure extended in all dimensions on the plan of the structure extended in all directions to take account of its height.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ccf436130acd22522486cbd85d5f95d620b890b4855547fcb3e8879b4274f1e4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19466','GHBC-REQ-019466','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.2','GHBC-C-005025','The edge of the effective collection area is displaced from the edge of the structure by an amount equal to the height of the structure at that point.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b728a2fbc798ed97fff80927eb7e94e9f7e5887436eda10e8869be98348cf2cd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19467','GHBC-REQ-019467','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.2','GHBC-C-005025','Hence, for a simple rectangular building of length L., width W and height H metres, the collection area has length (L + 2h) metres and width (W + 2h) metres with four rounded corners formed by quarter circles of radius H metres.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"llection area has length (L + 2h) metres and width (W + 2h) me"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"L + 2h) metres and width (W + 2h) metres with four rounded cor"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7cc79cbc626951b0023afadea5fa72295384f2592144ea311b0ad1dc67294f9f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19468','GHBC-REQ-019468','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.2','GHBC-C-005025','This gives a collection area, Ac (in m2).','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','84d3913bb6d9bf78b97994526ca8b52f55744aa2b3dd231e595397dea46555a5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
