('rowid-19470','GHBC-REQ-019470','GS 1207:2018',28,'28.13','28.13.1.2','GHBC-C-005025','(1) The probable number of strikes (risk) to the structure per year is: Ac x Ng x 10-6 P = It must first be decided whether this risk P is accepted or whether some measure of protection is thought necessary.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','85d501d8a2a2c631cba674fd792e0c5318dc7128a1be8fecc183f29e046c29b2','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
