('rowid-19702','GHBC-REQ-019702','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.1','29.1.2','GHBC-C-005058','It could be a cluster of complex irritative symptoms like irritation of the eyes, blackened nose and throat, headaches, dizziness, lethargy, fatigue irritation, wheezing, sinusitis, congestion, skin rash, sensory discomfort from odours, nausea, etc. These symptoms are usually short-lived and experienced immediately after exposure; and may disappear when one leaves the building.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 760","is 100","is 21"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc38b0897071c9c563de0466f6a9e338dcfb4ed31598a2cebc5e90a73f11e98a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
