('rowid-19772','GHBC-REQ-019772','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.1','29.1.2','GHBC-C-005058','pH is a measure of acidity, pH is a negative logaritham base 10, of the concentration of hydrogen ion in grams per litre.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 760","is 100","is 21"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2279a6d1f600e1a2722adc0710af780b59f2834a7382fda58894d4e5e0676cc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
