('rowid-19904','GHBC-REQ-019904','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.2.7.2','GHBC-C-005113','While considering orientation of the building, glazing in walls subjected to heavy sun exposure shall be avoided.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cd7139968617ff818a2acc37836f39dd4dc11e4d8de137c9b511b9739f98394e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19905','GHBC-REQ-019905','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.2.7.2','GHBC-C-005113','In case it is not possible to do so, double glazing or heat resistant glass should be used.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','32247dfab56443c3366da193a8f71165d496070c167e93b8f91b38e4e3195398','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19906','GHBC-REQ-019906','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.2.7.2','GHBC-C-005113','Glazing tilted inward at about 120 also helps curtail transmission of direct solar radiation through the glazing.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','290d1bffe820b69c394440464ff622725d65963a24316558d876bbf78fc8837e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19907','GHBC-REQ-019907','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.2.7.3','GHBC-C-005114','Where sun breakers are used, the following aspects shall be kept in view:','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c043b7b2e5c043fec4ed4af4a80bded077b7b1a842f4797a260dfd2ffd25bbcc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
