('rowid-19909','GHBC-REQ-019909','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.2.7.3','GHBC-C-005114','b) The sun breakers shall preferably be light and bright in colour so as to reflect back as much of the sunlight as possible.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','90e66a419559084c961a19f713ac93021a287f2db7f57da607b16e2177b47e95','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19910','GHBC-REQ-019910','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.2.7.3','GHBC-C-005114','c) The sun breakers shall preferably be 1m away from the wall face, with free ventilation, particularly from top to bottom, and are meant for carrying away the heat which is likely to get boxed between the sun breakers and the main building face.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" breakers shall preferably be 1m away from the wall face, with"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2c1f2367c65bf31a6babcf9e627c4fe018e599de351ef6d835ce7c71cf4deaf0','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
