('rowid-19924','GHBC-REQ-019924','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.1','GHBC-C-005124','Systems for air conditioning need to control temperature and humidity within predetermined limits throughout the year.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','016af85e1167ccdd25e0ae43ff6df22482af8756a3ef6ea5366bc229f49786c8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19925','GHBC-REQ-019925','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.1','GHBC-C-005124','Various types of refrigerating systems are available to accomplish the tasks of cooling and dehumidifying, which are an essential feature of air conditioning.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','760e0476a58f96d7da21621ae31cfdff72c82c2980278f441339c45b0e436b13','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
