('rowid-19945','GHBC-REQ-019945','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005128','The installed cost however is naturally the lowest of all the circulation systems.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e2e4c844a22d6a1e49585857537e33a1168504106dc11352c9cc0ac4e58b14c1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
