('rowid-19948','GHBC-REQ-019948','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005128','The best system from a control point of view is the four pipe system, where separate hot water and chilled water supply and returns are taken from the plant room to the terminal units.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8ced205ed24b63ed53fa66846e8637b548cb1620f61bd20bd77b261f9dc082d1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
