('rowid-19993','GHBC-REQ-019993','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005132','On systems using a direct expansion evapourator, the oil is trapped in the evapourator and an oil recovery system is necessary.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 100"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e587ef793c3f9da2119eb417a660a94dc9b9198278de6d8c69b9b654fe63c792','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19994','GHBC-REQ-019994','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005132','With some systems an oil cooler is required in the oil circulation system, to remove the heat gathered by the oil during compression cycle.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 100"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5bcd95701bc202b7f20dd6060970d6cd2e7acb916be262110756ff736887c56a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19995','GHBC-REQ-019995','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005132','On other systems liquid refrigerant is injected into the compressor to remove the heat of compression instead of using the conventional oil cooler.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 100"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','67bb4d34b5b3516217929dd9968ae8d5c2b1c516b64fa8175e097edfefd0be05','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19996','GHBC-REQ-019996','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005132','Such an arrangement can impose a small penalty on the plant capacity.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 100"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c7736f0bcf4c968fca753f45293f40a9bd663fcc288c155bc9bb5a60c2c9309a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19997','GHBC-REQ-019997','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005132','The condenser most commonly used on packaged units is the water cooled shell-andtube type, but equipment with air cooled condensers is also available.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 100"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7b3c579f0d30ac13a5eef92d9cc789fbc7efa016215c3dea1315c354b1ea8c8c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19998','GHBC-REQ-019998','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005132','The expansion device used will depend on the evapourator type but it is often an electronic expansion valve (single or in multiple) of conventional or modified form.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 100"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c9e90146014d0ffd49bbb8de917da9bc22dcb476968ebc2be09b6c34a47cbf99','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-19999','GHBC-REQ-019999','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005132','Screw compressors are available in open and semi-hermetic form (see clause 29.2.3.2.2.1) and are generally coupled direct to two-pole motors.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 100"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','72dcd2d41197cd3c8ca74869c8b80eefef986ed9fdd6c1fbe7baa7fc6e5191e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20000','GHBC-REQ-020000','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005132','The capacity of the compressor can be modulated down to 10 percent of full load capacity.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"ssor can be modulated down to 10 percent of full load capacity."}]','["is 100"]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','41d0a5478e020d434b5a8c94534dd2f93bcf2b1cd0d42c73c3cab71b7876d48c','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20001','GHBC-REQ-020001','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','These are available in a wide range of sizes and designs.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','20daa810dca0e80118889dc864db71489b434daa742786f712dfe42c2f751fc5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20002','GHBC-REQ-020002','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','They are almost invariably used in packages up to 120 TR cooling capacity.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":120,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"t invariably used in packages up to 120 TR cooling capacity."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ac64274c428b191946e1b93c0deda417f5bfaddfae83ea6ea18b7ca219e9d5ff','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20003','GHBC-REQ-020003','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','Because the cylinders have automatic valves, a single compressor may be used over wide range of operating conditions with near optimum efficiency, whereas other types of compressors require detailed modification to give optimum efficiency at different conditions.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b0a77d4c7e83391f9844ea861c9550dff87c211346f0a5c3d1fad769a15b1a5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20004','GHBC-REQ-020004','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','This is, however, of minor importance for normal air conditioning duties.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ff7b876ad89dd1f782814e1f65f5d6d607b7c75b650f00d1d85a9b89e321ab58','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20005','GHBC-REQ-020005','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','Capacity control is achieved by making cylinders in-operative, usually propping open the suction valves, thus, capacity reduction is in a series of steps rather than by modulation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','64921cf04e4b41ff37cdac23eb696369139409cec1bb3e78a2d482c51f4037da','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20006','GHBC-REQ-020006','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','Typically, a four-cylinder compressor would be unloaded in four steps.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','227c23b8597150cc0136baabddddd3073b5e75e36ae9750745b7427cc00798f9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20007','GHBC-REQ-020007','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','It is therefore necessary to allow for this stepwise operation in designing the chilled water temperature control system.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1ad18cb7eb0bb57703d05474ca89fb684bbe8b50009f463b52504fab0c33a7e2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20008','GHBC-REQ-020008','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','The evapourator is normally of the dry expansion type, to permit oil from the compressor to circulate round the system with the refrigerant.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6b696665d0e153cbac70c7bca4ece71be0fa0a39e0c9c92f295b2421d38c94b9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20009','GHBC-REQ-020009','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','Shell-and-tube water cooled condensers are common, but any type of condenser can be used.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5ba09a29cbe39660d66d216360da6bcf049056efb1fa20ca16eea84a3eeda58a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20010','GHBC-REQ-020010','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','With air cooled condensers it is normal practice to build the machine package so that it may be located on the roof in a package including the condenser.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','605f119c066dd3cec3dc2470bd3d506dfbf39f5ccf81ee1bd876dbf9fc1ac591','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20011','GHBC-REQ-020011','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','It is common for the electric drive motors to be built into the compressor assembly; this is known as a ‗semi-hermetic‘ drive to distinguish it from the ‗hermetic‘, in which the compressor and motor are enclosed within a pressure vessel and cannot therefore be serviced.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8dc1b0ace8b4fd238d2b7ba65d6b0879bfef3eb49ec2bb6f358cd8fd392bdef7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20012','GHBC-REQ-020012','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','The semi-hermetic compressor is more compact and is quieter in operation than the ‗open‘ drive compressor, but involves a more difficult service operation in the event of a motor failure.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e1e91d399876c99dac70adf8621beacf19c51e05dfd4859de8ac5de8b176c57','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20013','GHBC-REQ-020013','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','It gains in reliability, however, by avoiding the shaft seal of the ‗open‘ compressor.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','09a14d01640a12a77ac06d451e5525df8bd83147c1c69d71f304538b82ee1570','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20014','GHBC-REQ-020014','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','It is recommended that a multiple hermetic or semi-hermetic compressor unit should not be connected to a common refrigerant system, as','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f63595c89e04e33bbb6f55c7225dfa97ab0c3e0c1451e3fdc87998ce5da7079a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20015','GHBC-REQ-020015','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','failure of one motor can precipitate failure of the others.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','525a8e75030aefd9a6383b0d7eee80e0ed1360d0501eb4952d31d385795650eb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20016','GHBC-REQ-020016','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005133','Separate refrigerant circuits for each compressor should be used.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','31bdbdb08601656a62bc880fbbab3fef5ec4ebae31416b8326820a0fa61e59aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20017','GHBC-REQ-020017','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005134','The absorption cycle uses a solution that by absorbing the refrigerant replaces the function of the compressor.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b2ca0486eb25ab8fae8d7fb2864dfd48d489862ec2d4c77537045e123038c03d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20018','GHBC-REQ-020018','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005134','The absorbent/refrigerant mixture is then pumped to a higher pressure where the refrigerant is boiled off by the application of heat, to be condensed in the condenser.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','349c0a9d624a9a9f1a161506f20b0d2ef6290ea3619b2b000bf771173db81941','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20019','GHBC-REQ-020019','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005134','Absorption machines are mostly used in liquidchilling applications.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e702af191ca4c361dc048852494809d8758ea60a5576ce56a9b4ec09f12b1846','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20020','GHBC-REQ-020020','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005134','These are most suitable for hotels and hospitals where steam is readily available from the boilers.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6fa41cbbae95330815147f39523cf229b734e7ff5e03c7b569687329d7584197','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
