('rowid-20022','GHBC-REQ-020022','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.3.1','GHBC-C-005135','Water is the refrigerant and the lithium bromide the absorbent.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e10bc119794a9bf937890eb5748d1e2cf773d0f742aa2ad5cf93de59fcbe43cc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20023','GHBC-REQ-020023','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.3.1','GHBC-C-005135','The four compartments enclosing the heat exchanger tube bundles for the condenser, evapourator, generator and absorber can be a single or multiple pressure vessel arrangement.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7d0ed1bb3cae7fd65cae8852cef587605edd6afc75ec59d0951ffe35e262921d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
