('rowid-20026','GHBC-REQ-020026','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.3.1','GHBC-C-005135','Capacity control down to 10 percent of full load capacity is achieved by modulating the flow of the heating medium in relation to the cooling demand.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"Capacity control down to 10 percent of full load capacity is achi"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4d9514be6c5894e9be18ebcf5854c372bba8c885120624daad2a334316e858ec','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20027','GHBC-REQ-020027','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.3.1','GHBC-C-005135','There is some loss in performance at part load, which can be compensated by refinements in the system design and control.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','21f96f6448de603ead788988a6e5f07083501945bd24199ca08be76035518ba5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20028','GHBC-REQ-020028','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.3.2','GHBC-C-005136','Direct fired lithium bromide/water absorption plants have become common, by incorporating precise control of generator temperature necessary to avoid crystallization.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3b312ece51c0488ea808c7c30190f325f45a0caf43908bdeb94ddd6d3535995e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
