('rowid-20030','GHBC-REQ-020030','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.2.3.2','GHBC-C-005136','There are two reasons for this, firstly capital costs are higher and secondly the danger to personnel in the event of leakage of the refrigerant.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','39079f6a25a2dae2b0a7d23afe24b8b8655e85e01aa300f5320e9dfa46cb4a5b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
