('rowid-20085','GHBC-REQ-020085','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005148','a) Fire properties – Certain insulating materials are combustible or may, in a fire, produce appreciable quantities of smoke and noxious and toxic fumes.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cbc2950c48511cb725178198a2e8e9b789b9108e4a82a28dcb38eb3395335f27','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20086','GHBC-REQ-020086','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005148','b) Materials and their finishes should inherently be proof against rotting, mould and fungal growth, and attack by vermin, and should be non-hygroscopic.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a7205afc171e1fc91f167c41e2a8dbfe8b75abab582268e57b0e72db265edf56','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20087','GHBC-REQ-020087','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005148','c) Material should not give rise to objectionable odour at the temperature at which they are to be used.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2f4e6a191f095d0eb817b16b296fb629ed5434e78e267d7e09b899aa4f44f631','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20088','GHBC-REQ-020088','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005148','d) The material should not cause a known hazard to health during application, while in use, or on removal, either from particulate matter or from toxic fumes.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','560f41216b63d6d5d5caeeba3e5a9b13a4acd79a625014e6048bf4aed620d1e3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20089','GHBC-REQ-020089','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005148','e) It should have a low thermal conductivity throughout the entire working temperature range.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4acb86961310569b5865dfcbe1f8469bd7a27e63f6bcd2b4c292bbe978569dd8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20090','GHBC-REQ-020090','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005148','f) It should be non-flammable and should not support nor spread fire.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d8ae198ed155fccedb5604de57c6759c578b766530ff326885fe2c9735f150dd','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20091','GHBC-REQ-020091','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005148','g) It should have good mechanical strength and rigidity otherwise it would have to be clad for protection.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fd74d2aa43967a54f3e128ef24062c5d64c19d120fa3cece97ebf8a8f3875500','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20092','GHBC-REQ-020092','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005151','Certain minimum temperatures may be required depending on the type of application and by local regulations.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9b39c09ce268dcced557eafbe787d1e4fa089fe8eb9c1a59eed141133969845','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20093','GHBC-REQ-020093','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005151','Maximum permitted cooling temperatures may be stipulated by relating to energy conservation.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0f7e3c5622eb2277959456ce462f388690d327bb384bb79c889963a384e2a858','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20094','GHBC-REQ-020094','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005151','From the comfort aspect, it is important to take into account the effect of radiant temperature in fixing the desire air temperatures to maintain comfortable conditions.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fda7df6002d55d295c7e0ca2b673bf473c4c03df82e6fa33fc84ce12f663810d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20095','GHBC-REQ-020095','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005151','When large windows/curtain walls are used, it may be necessary to provide shading/north orientation to protect the occupants form solar radiation and to reduce the cooling load on the system.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec8106967a50f2022b64ecedd62e8a544e801e42ba9e99cf564af49a1cdfa6c9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20096','GHBC-REQ-020096','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005151','It is not practical to fully compensate for solar heating, owing to its intermittent nature, simply by lowering air temperature.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','74b173844b1190a219b2f6fb4217d41c68e52fb743c4f9006838f81a60172499','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20097','GHBC-REQ-020097','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005151','A person‘s heat loss, and hence his feeling of comfort, depends not only on the air temperature but also on the radiant heat gain, the air movement and the humidity of the air.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ea5b676f856debf4d4b37d3d14bd785ca6dd56e4b22aa1c5234afde30a0fb34e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20098','GHBC-REQ-020098','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005151','Many attempts have been made to devise a single index that combines the effect of two or more of these separate variables.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','095a4108e9d88fc603e0881229f19e6457734ac45c9882eae25562e97fb047f7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20099','GHBC-REQ-020099','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005151','In practice the difference between these indices is small, provided the various parameters do not vary beyond certain limits.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ea14a16bb682cfe1f772b85042241625c006e094dc814991d613853a1cecf991','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20100','GHBC-REQ-020100','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.1.2','GHBC-C-005152','It should be noted that, although comfort conditions are established in terms of resultant temperature, the design air temperature of air conditioning should be as specified in this Clause in terms of dry-bulb temperature and relative humidity or wet-bulb temperature.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','01980e70cfe38cabc21f64984234b814ea1ffd63f2f8d0ff0dc9120e5004adaa','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
