('rowid-20102','GHBC-REQ-020102','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005154','A high humidity reduces evapourative cooling from the body and hence creates the sensation of a higher temperature.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','49b2d6dba3e8d14c782578cd760ec660bad87c9fa5b7f6ca960e10086c231f36','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20103','GHBC-REQ-020103','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005154','Beyond certain limits however, humidity produces disagreeable sensations.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3a6efd3fb8aefe36d57ffe5c116f98347f02567e04bdbfb6f6824ab02b598955','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20104','GHBC-REQ-020104','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005154','For normal comfort conditions, relative humidity (RH) values between 40 percent and 70 percent are acceptable.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":40,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":" humidity (RH) values between 40 percent and 70 percent are acceptable"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":70,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"values between 40 percent and 70 percent are acceptable."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','570e0323c20f315ccb066153c2ed6f65d19e11181f25b9eaa44fe0a3b29100f6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
