('rowid-20227','GHBC-REQ-020227','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.6.3','GHBC-C-005170','The decision to use odour-removing equipment will normally be made on economic grounds; this may become necessary by the currently rising cost of fuel.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','17c0b589ad7697c45befe2b60e004458d5c9f765827c02498c112bd565df2306','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20228','GHBC-REQ-020228','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.6.3','GHBC-C-005170','Once such equipment is installed, it has to be regularly serviced to ensure satisfactory performance.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','46df56a7f9b21c6440a355c9b772263b45951597d79872a0c788204a11c121ee','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20229','GHBC-REQ-020229','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.4.6.3','GHBC-C-005170','Failure to do this may result in unacceptable conditions within the building.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a8e5b3ab8c5e0e4a8efb71b103920e8fb0a55635a103ed2fbcfbf8fd9285291c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20230','GHBC-REQ-020230','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5','GHBC-C-005171','considerations','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1f84215b12bb9714c8e028848107b16cd7ead0e7d57692e2552ce48b3a2caf2b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20231','GHBC-REQ-020231','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.1','GHBC-C-005172','Authorities and approval of schemes A ventilation or air conditioning system should comply with the requirements laid down in the current statutory legislation or any revisions currently in force and consideration should also be given to any relevant insurance company requirements.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b89f6f489f0196b2907577f91ec87b0183bb7ba55c8758999d1f6a346e702c24','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20232','GHBC-REQ-020232','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2','GHBC-C-005173','Fire protection requirements of air conditioning systems shall be in accordance with this Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a1ebe5ca1093c37c13abfe8298de14a53bccc38c5809194827478bf7427a74d7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20233','GHBC-REQ-020233','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005174','The design of air conditioning system and mechanical ventilation shall take into account the fire risk within the building, both as regards structural protection and means of escape in case of fire.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a22d49f1e7ec553d554b8377e5b52dcb40796138615ae0a9ac14567f2f7fdf2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20234','GHBC-REQ-020234','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005174','The extent and detail of statutory control and other specialist interest may vary considerably according to the design, use, occupation and location of the building, and the type of system of mechanical ventilation and air conditioning proposed.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fe613eddd0f1e4f84c1f398b93b608971aa90c489971609fa6808240b47bc038','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20235','GHBC-REQ-020235','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005174','It is therefore particularly important that the appropriate safeguards are fully considered at the concept design stage of the building.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dc7c2f7eba19fac80e59b6875a5bd923eab524bfd71d3539b4174ff1e1decc54','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20236','GHBC-REQ-020236','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005174','The degree of control and the requirements vary according to the application.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','16fcc22d165cdbec41b412034dc81e2c0aa3c23510db1212044f54cbbff9c036','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20237','GHBC-REQ-020237','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005174','Full details may have to be approved by the Authority having jurisdiction in the following cases:','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','426e6881ccbe77f559dbab926dac8597de0da23b299cf1db1bf3461e3f5530a0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20238','GHBC-REQ-020238','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005174','a) From the point of view of the means of escape (except dwelling houses) where re-circulation of air is involved and/or where pressurized staircases are contemplated as part of the smoke control arrangements;','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a3669ac9585621135875c4042fa39b707507cbb7d60f48a04ac7dfcd4318b745','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20239','GHBC-REQ-020239','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005174','b) Places of public entertainment, and','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0a8bee8361a409f041b782518bd5347e658044a02ac77e8f11a6d22c96ea1fa7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20240','GHBC-REQ-020240','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005174','c) Large car parks, hotels, parts of building used for trades or processes involving a special risk, and departmental stores and similar shop risks in large buildings.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9bed7efe871859757b7a121fa852e98c786e6e868ec98310ed8160dfdf2f9e01','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20241','GHBC-REQ-020241','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005175','All ductwork including connectors, fittings and plenums should be constructed of steel, aluminium or other approved metal or from non-combustible material.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e79042b60e0f83ae495b7e28c442628a15dc0511fff23faacd1ec40ac17ec75','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20242','GHBC-REQ-020242','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005175','All exhaust ducts, the interior of which is liable in normal use to accumulate dust, grease or other flammable matter, should be provided with adequate means of access to facilitate cleaning and inspection.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cdb4f24980b88451ceef6d98c6130f246626c22ecc97f807529dc227f318d54a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20243','GHBC-REQ-020243','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005175','Also, the concerned provisions of Part 3 Use and Occupancy Classification of the Ghana Building Code shall be complied with.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b7cf4da132a904c0a02bd3d8dc95070e0b0b030a144411e360ba697f8ccc4c41','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20244','GHBC-REQ-020244','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005175','29.2.3.5.2.3 Thermal and acoustic insulation To reduce the spread of fire or smoke by an air conditioning system, care should be taken for the choice of materials used for such items as air filters, silencers and insulation both internal and external.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12e8f15802e8d0d3dd72b1a754f21271e50957dade9251b9dfcdc242b0fcfbb1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20245','GHBC-REQ-020245','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','When the system involves the re-circulation of air, consideration should be given to the installation of detection devices that would either shut off the plant and close dampers or discharge the smoke-laden air to the atmosphere.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5fef6b2f23c7cc03adbf0d9225386361d0996482986d0ef7c8353c2ab17dcac9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20246','GHBC-REQ-020246','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','Detectors may be advisable in certain applications even when the system is not a re-circulatory one.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e3baa0c3aa9c9c0a3182ec93cad33bf80d78b398a699742ab1af9b67801a6e53','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20247','GHBC-REQ-020247','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','Exhausts should not be positioned near the fire escapes, main staircases or where these could be a hindrance to the work of fire authorities.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','acb18fc1ea532f832649c0647221e1a366176997d43d6b213b097558cda0cc65','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20248','GHBC-REQ-020248','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','The local fire authorities should be consulted.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5ad519d0af16daa816a2f20c5765ea5feb9d20798d428a260e494cb9be7c88a7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20249','GHBC-REQ-020249','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','A careful study of the operating characteristics of each type of sensing device should be made before selection.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4925c3a7cf1c499946625b1f1b0487effb5c64ec2f3cda9c749d6763a954ad09','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20250','GHBC-REQ-020250','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','Smoke detectors are normally either of the optical or ionization chamber type.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5b4fe23cadbecd9c893e37f84d8ea7e8950d46335294575fe2a194643b50e29a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20251','GHBC-REQ-020251','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','These can be used to either sound an alarm system or operate a fire damper.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1b2bf490b0fdfdf303baa97a01db556924157e567d2b2e698cfee985ab4cfd92','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20252','GHBC-REQ-020252','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','Care should be taken with their location as various factors affect the satisfactory operation.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b4e8150ba5ae56fbedd607866104687d2417bcbc949b4ce764057724c6a6971d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20253','GHBC-REQ-020253','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','Ionization type detectors are sensitive to high velocity air streams and if used in ductwork the manufacturer should be consulted.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8b5859255971729dff5bb69ff95b13d2d0cf368e3d8c10e7eef1e08bfc2f1dfc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20254','GHBC-REQ-020254','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','Activation of a smoke detector should stop the air handling unit supply air fan, close the fire damper in supply and return air duct and operate a suitable alarm system.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ded8ff0af32b5c4a23ff134fc6eb7a74137500211ba1430e46156f14c6af15ec','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20255','GHBC-REQ-020255','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005176','In all the above instances the appropriate controls would require manual re-setting.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2afa57cf726ed673b1b11ddfdedb0c9f63401c1f0e1486d118ca102be86d3e0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20256','GHBC-REQ-020256','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005177','While it is essential that the spread of smoke through a building to be considered in the design of air conditioning systems for all types of applications, it assumes special significance in high rise buildings, because the time necessary for evacuation may be greater than the time for the development of untenable smoke conditions on staircases, in lift shafts and in other parts of the building far away from the fire.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4fd0fffd2e69b43cfb06c5e8aab4a0dc1d54d7487cae9cfb40726c85a67a3d0a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20257','GHBC-REQ-020257','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005177','Lifts may be filled with smoke or unavailable, and, if mass evacuation is attempted, a staircase may be filled with people.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','91c1b21e1a6c6f53c7ebc656f23a914404a0c61ca1cbd966b6816928e4d90686','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20258','GHBC-REQ-020258','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005177','One or more escape staircases connecting to outdoors at ground level, should be pressurized, to enable mass evacuation of high rise buildings.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4161f51745aa72198a738992a091aa2396151f417236f247bd8f39b13ec14eab','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20259','GHBC-REQ-020259','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005177','Therefore all air handling systems of a building should be designed with fire protection and smoke control aspects incorporating, where appropriate, facilities to permit their operation for the control of smoke within the building in event of fire.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','50520b8f4d994cc773a75bef39f61f5f09b192e204a046ddb15192d9ac2490c3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20260','GHBC-REQ-020260','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005177','The pressurization systems for staircases use large volumes of outside air.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','486c490e76d09cee46066ffae94e556e1480a317cabb3a4eceef151db6c753ea','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20261','GHBC-REQ-020261','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005177','The system may be designed to operate continuously at low speed, being increased to high speed in the event of fire, or to operate only in emergency.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','11bf2d4782975104c764a140d03faa40db7a82852a2b239b2941573a3f2641d5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20262','GHBC-REQ-020262','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005177','Noise and droughts are not considered a problem in an emergency situation.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','52a1329b0b0ed8a3cef3da695dfaf15ddb4170093307df48b4fe29ee11a2a6ea','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20263','GHBC-REQ-020263','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005177','Fan motor and starter should be protected from fire and connected to the emergency electrical supply through cables with special fire resistant coating.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','71ac179383a4e1250d8dfd89fb232097b50f86b2cbc4a1f5e1bc0a4045a4b787','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20264','GHBC-REQ-020264','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1','GHBC-C-005179','This clause gives general guidance, for various applications, for the factors that usually influence the selection of the type, design and layout of the air conditioning or ventilating system to be used.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','07e0b09813219c5ced9c639afec7338ef4d5a4427cd3c7171fd384c6253727e6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20265','GHBC-REQ-020265','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.1','GHBC-C-005180','The primary objective of the application described under this heading is the provision of comfort conditions for occupants.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','01dc3a658cd2884e8307264c64833f4c13a1e782d74c946ee09b5041ba1b0d21','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20266','GHBC-REQ-020266','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','Office building may include both external and internal zones.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e3d5bd4e5ccc49d86031a43fc396ec410c9e03723de86bc69a77e2d02f9ea6f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20267','GHBC-REQ-020267','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','The external zone may be considered as extending from approximately 4m to 6m inwards from the external wall, and is generally subjected to wide load variation owing to daily and annual changes in outside temperature and solar radiation.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" extending from approximately 4m to 6m inwards from the extern"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ding from approximately 4m to 6m inwards from the external wal"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4185bf6dccf9919fda6b0dbe3c035bf589bcc8824f73cca76e1d582e44f91f93','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20268','GHBC-REQ-020268','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','Ideally, the system(s) selected to serve an external zone should be able to provide hot season cooling and dry/cold season heating.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9b347f63a62b79d71ac64c505d0c1914d88c7ce762e849d7bd83d9a04106e19b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20269','GHBC-REQ-020269','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','During intermediate seasons the external zone of one side of the building may require cooling and at same time the external zone on another side of the building may require heating.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','232f9751f76a43520eecc9fdb20dbfdbbbdfac187cb77264a29a243a699fc9c2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20270','GHBC-REQ-020270','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','The main factors affecting load are usually window area and choice of shading devices.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','81df76b0ca6fa1c2411746ed45397a4dd7d2e05bc7e7f0bbbb51049b5511952d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20271','GHBC-REQ-020271','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','The other important factors are the internal gain owing to','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc75ecfc12307f4d3fc3fe30113dd2ec25b9be4e876e38a2b607e7dce1ce4bb3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20272','GHBC-REQ-020272','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','people, light and office equipment.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','42fa5cb363f54de0390b1f2b735d43cb4db9527c903e685faca39b199105fb4d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20273','GHBC-REQ-020273','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','Choice of system may be affected by requirements to counteract down draughts and chilling effect due to radiation associated with single glazing during cold weather.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a49714845004dd315215e83c52f3055f0b0434f616948ad280f1254196a60742','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20274','GHBC-REQ-020274','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','Internal zone loads are entirely due to heat gain from people, lights and office equipment, which represent a fairly uniform cooling load throughout the year.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0c069a589c37d1e57e51d5f754f2b19f22c8081600d8d12a3da89bf817bb3735','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20275','GHBC-REQ-020275','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','Other important considerations in office block applications may include requirements for individual controls, partitioning flexibility serving multiple tenants, and requirement of operating selected areas outside of normal office hours.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3cb467c4b656ab76d80bb6556fe19ad03c9ed8a8bb3e5a40143593b6a5fe4950','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20276','GHBC-REQ-020276','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','Areas such as conference rooms, board rooms, canteens, etc. will often require independent systems.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','414f87b9e779289bb98da9cb5c17d653a7ba5647be9706a90e5749f183f61710','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20277','GHBC-REQ-020277','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','For external building zones with large glass areas, for example, greater than 60 percent of the external façade, the air-water type of systems, such as induction or fan coil is generally more economical than all air systems and has lower space requirements.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":60,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"as, for example, greater than 60 percent of the external façade, the a"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0d497417549e6da33e587fb7c28cb9c89e93206af44ccdae25f97e08d7a9c171','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20278','GHBC-REQ-020278','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','For external zones with small glass areas, an all- air system, such as variable volume, may be the best selection.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4e995a52f91cf64b6aba4cc4b31f78ab7c27768aedd32de4db67de5ab3636cf8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20279','GHBC-REQ-020279','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','For buildings with average glass areas, other factors may determine the choice of system.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ad969e39cd4eee236fd753a0672744660126c31b40990874634954c9274f3939','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20280','GHBC-REQ-020280','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','For internal zones, a separate all-air system with volume control may be the best choice.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c4ce9b26d46f0239e7c03f1787b5b30aad6fc5bf8ab6c3746a19c0d58d92c859','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20281','GHBC-REQ-020281','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.2','GHBC-C-005181','Systems employing reheat or air mixing, while technically satisfactory, are generally poor as regards energy conservation.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4607a99d5f3235d8e47476ebcc9157a24d8a4417ce285cd2b1e1877e42374845','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20282','GHBC-REQ-020282','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-005182','In ideal circumstances, each guest room in a hotel or motel should have an air conditioning system that enables the occupant to select heating or cooling as required to maintain the room at the desired temperature.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5a4f33b6998c31374314aaa4253f0d8e283ee1164285f289f30199c898c3a009','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20283','GHBC-REQ-020283','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-005182','The range of temperature adjustment should be reasonable but, from the energy conservation view point, should not permit wasteful overcooling or overheating.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','486832c23e27fb6b774f740f23edd02e2fbe9c35f41bca0f125c3325fb884f39','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20284','GHBC-REQ-020284','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-005182','Guest room systems are required to be available for operation on a continuous basis.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f715460c6ba05cc47fa9a803aea05a769cc62fa2c88c46fb369e58e53855fac0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20285','GHBC-REQ-020285','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-005182','The room may be unoccupied for most of the day and therefore provision for operating at reduced capacity, or switching off, is essential.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b751af44d07c808107e80d424d337e90ad3548572d57c7a8f493633c45c44d4a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20286','GHBC-REQ-020286','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-005182','Low operating noise level, reliability and ease of maintenance are essential.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f532fa29755abf044ec7500a6f897ad683e871e016523f795778b2f6f128231f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20287','GHBC-REQ-020287','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-005182','Treated fresh air introduced through the system is generally balanced with the bathroom extract ventilation to promote air circulation into the bathroom.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3476201b34fb660b3d45913141f73dfd75c9732ce2da810c7f3b7f1e0d831928','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20288','GHBC-REQ-020288','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-005182','In tropical climates, where the humidity is high an','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','92eb58e2f043bb54b83db740cb355e71bd377f7c27ce8c4872bc9f02e474c761','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20289','GHBC-REQ-020289','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-005182','all-air system with individual room reheat (and/or re-cool) may be necessary to avoid condensation problems.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','38b58b824dfb9abef3df0abe1251422fb981b55b7560e2db42fa376636013e05','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20290','GHBC-REQ-020290','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.3','GHBC-C-005182','Fan coil units are generally found to be most suitable for this kind of application, with speed control for fan and motorized/modulating valve for chilled water control for cooling.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0dc6065d9cc8e9d8de317375a032fa803329d59073b07c8283829fc3ebe247ee','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20291','GHBC-REQ-020291','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.4','GHBC-C-005183','Restaurants, cafeteria, bars and night-clubs Such applications have several factors in common; highly variable loads, with high latent gains (low sensible heat factor) from occupants and meals, and high odour concentrations (body, food and tobacco smoke odours) requiring adequate control of fresh air extract volumes and direction of air movement for avoidance of draughts and make up air requirements for associated kitchens to ensure an uncontaminated supply.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4e587eb80081577718a750fe1f85d9b85a5a09f34398ad69a49ad80b169f5b61','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20292','GHBC-REQ-020292','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.4','GHBC-C-005183','This type of application is generally best served by the all-air type of system preferably with some reheat or return air bypass control to limit relative humidity.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ef6dc8dfe36f113536a9d6aa84b35a14d91f6f85f2516e8b4482e18a59b13a21','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20293','GHBC-REQ-020293','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.4','GHBC-C-005183','Either self-contained packaged units or split systems, or airhandling unit served from a central chilled system may be used.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','63308fa85b19adf89ba50c7f603de803681af7a125c3b80e61116e6df22302a0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20294','GHBC-REQ-020294','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.4','GHBC-C-005183','Sufficient control flexibility to handle adequately the complete range of anticipated loads is essential.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c8b188ef80a204415d88dea079cae5c5b87fa3726ee204771082fd80c830dfa9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20295','GHBC-REQ-020295','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.5','GHBC-C-005184','For small shops and stores, unitary split type air conditioning systems offer many advantages, including low initial cost, minimum space requirement and ease of installation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c3ccae22faf36b12bf61b66f947bfd16d4d6856a898bc76584cfd361d45fdb75','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20296','GHBC-REQ-020296','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.5','GHBC-C-005184','For large department stores, a very careful analysis of the location and requirement of each individual department is essential as these may vary widely, for example, for lighting departments, food halls, restaurants, etc. Some system flexibility to accommodate future changes may be required.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cba14a1b63179827bb937a8645cc513e9a989c628c389816d66aaa8c454d8c60','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20297','GHBC-REQ-020297','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.5','GHBC-C-005184','Generally, internal loads from lighting and people predominate.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bde95535a06c8ec298acb94a19daf4b78788d2f669d61aca9162456d74698686','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20298','GHBC-REQ-020298','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.5','GHBC-C-005184','Important considerations include initial and operating costs, system space requirements, ease of maintenance and type of operating personnel who will operate the system.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a038f76f16e6611cb4054794dc09650c5842f74d4c7b795d8f2d3e5ce3298d9c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20299','GHBC-REQ-020299','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.5','GHBC-C-005184','The all-air type of system, with variable volume distribution from local air handling units, may be the most economical option.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e3664cc3c1b8de76425576f8f65bb6bb389afbd4fa785cf911e45eba3e2cb0bd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20300','GHBC-REQ-020300','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.5','GHBC-C-005184','Facilities to take all outside air for ‗free-cooling‘ under favourable conditions should be provided.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a4cd7498efe6597fb771bd4fed2fe10f1e3f5e389a9e7c1aa808d25e8695cb40','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20301','GHBC-REQ-020301','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.6','GHBC-C-005185','Characteristics of this type of application are buildings generally large in size, with high ceiling, low external loads, and high occupancy producing a high latent gain and having low sensible heat factor.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cd2528a771a7649e99603a8a62c522dce0e687ff68d561e4fd5d958b112f8beb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20302','GHBC-REQ-020302','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.6','GHBC-C-005185','These give rise to the requirements of large fresh air quantities and low operating noise levels.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4c0cd5b37d9a4b17bf21d0633851e94c4732dd930f826e634b913de0d9eb8fc3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20303','GHBC-REQ-020303','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.6','GHBC-C-005185','Theatres and auditoria may be in use only a few hours a day.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','03fd0b53d4861cc0d317f1d98f9c83a6e02a4e9e1e34b45000f2337b45aaad91','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20304','GHBC-REQ-020304','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','In many cases proper air conditioning can be a factor in the therapy of the patient and in some instances part of the major treatment.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3dd5168232e6a2d6b7c9c7299e5fb95d20bc3c5b44e03088f46aabde83bcb40d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20305','GHBC-REQ-020305','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','For special application areas of hospitals such as operation theatres, reference may be made to specialist literature.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','83b89ae6618052333617814b3d4c82f85efe378c8070135dbd61273ff1b3edf7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20306','GHBC-REQ-020306','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','The main differences in application compared with other applications are:','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a56c7e939885b9f2d8c03fb365a96ef892ec5cf0440875a8ff66eae34491c6d7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20307','GHBC-REQ-020307','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','a) Restriction of air movement between various departments and control of air movement within certain departments, to reduce the risk of airborne cross infection;','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9431b0d86e061890366cb38f3ff8dd40dbbf4331fbc998d8dedd8f450e593eb5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20308','GHBC-REQ-020308','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','b) Specific need for the ventilation and filtration equipment to dilute and/or remove particulate or gaseous contamination and airborne micro-organisms;','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','456528e087893240e1e820f6c423773c4757e78a1faac84faf2a34ae1dda1d30','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20309','GHBC-REQ-020309','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','c) Close tolerances in temperatures and humidities may be required for various areas;','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db4373c62e231761ca018d919cb545283f49b9cd86c8300e51b24d01a876f2eb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20310','GHBC-REQ-020310','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','d) The design should allow for accurate control of environmental conditions.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b9fee6ef8164d23f47a1c92d7692cd9f863146de800667f2cd33132b727f5989','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20311','GHBC-REQ-020311','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','For (a) and (b) the air movement patterns should minimize the spread of contaminants as for instance, in operating departments where the air flow should be such as to reduce the risk of periphery or floor-level air returning to the patient owing to secondary air currents whilst the general pressurization pattern should cause air to flow through the department from sterile to less sterile rooms in progression.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','42334b7d5e97b1ceac7e7379c2d3213996cceb19b8deab59b94bed74c9e9de75','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20312','GHBC-REQ-020312','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','In operating theatres 100 percent fresh air system is normally provided and air pressures in various rooms are set by use of pressure stabilizers.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":100,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"In operating theatres 100 percent fresh air system is normally "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dcf02c23830fc88a1914958fbb7a9cad567e7c714178a3122ff92b7a0d9b99cc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20313','GHBC-REQ-020313','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','Many types of air distribution patterns within operation theatres','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cd9ba1968d617fcdb494eca834c013fd49fda1561253040060610bbdda730724','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20314','GHBC-REQ-020314','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','are in use but generally they conform to highlevel supply and low-level pressure relief or exhaust.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','27b5707ec39dec00eeee601f99b59644b27d3bda1a11cc25b313c35da2851c54','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20315','GHBC-REQ-020315','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','There is also need for a separate scavenging system for exhaled and waste anaesthetic gases with in theatre suites where general anaesthetic may be administered.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','34a1eb37e281b839f57792af6904af94b618a286c2c16e62b2338cfd45795a78','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20316','GHBC-REQ-020316','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','When zoning air distribution systems to compensate for building orientation and shape, consideration should be given to ensure that the mixing of air from different departments is reduced to a minimum.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','102e4c15d449138cb323cb6ab70a2de87f751b7b6155fbf00b86226b7e84db52','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20317','GHBC-REQ-020317','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','This can be accomplished by the use of 100 percent conditioned fresh air with no recirculation or, where re-circulation is employed, by providing separate air handling systems for different departments based on the relative sensitivity of each to contamination.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":100,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"be accomplished by the use of 100 percent conditioned fresh air with no"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2f659293fdff790718f797de1dfe5be0cd986630c165ec116a345de65f49ac74','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20318','GHBC-REQ-020318','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','A degree of stand-by is provided by this system so that breakdown will affect only a limited clause of the hospital.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8f3cf72d6f97d4e9947bc512492c6f28ba5dd4a120fdcf10052fbc2c8c5596ad','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20319','GHBC-REQ-020319','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.1','GHBC-C-005187','Laboratories and other areas dealing with infectious diseases or viruses, and sanitary accommodation adjacent to wards, should be at a negative air pressure compared to any other area to prevent exfiltration of any airborne contaminants.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc4855c6ff815a0926902b03cd7cefbd0f161695ff63421bfa07d3c485d25f1d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
