('rowid-20325','GHBC-REQ-020325','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.2','GHBC-C-005188','The relative humidity may be controlled within + 5 percent in the range 40 percent to 60 percent.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"ty may be controlled within + 5 percent in the range 40 percent to 60"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":40,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"thin + 5 percent in the range 40 percent to 60 percent."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":60,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"nt in the range 40 percent to 60 percent."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c80f8866c5d4247d336bf912898583f8e9cd75f27060f34b571c606f368167fe','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20326','GHBC-REQ-020326','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.2','GHBC-C-005188','Manufacturers normally prescribe specific conditions to be maintained.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cfc27b1f147b8f8d3ffcbf21ac2c01130b74ff500f23f1930bc667bb8baabde3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20327','GHBC-REQ-020327','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.2','GHBC-C-005188','Typical conditions are air dry-bulb: 21 + 1.60C; relative humidity 50 + 5 percent; and filtration 90 percent down to 10 microns.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"1.60C; relative humidity 50 + 5 percent; and filtration 90 percent do"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":90,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"0 + 5 percent; and filtration 90 percent down to 10 microns."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"filtration 90 percent down to 10 microns."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c78372ac528d8440b33647d995d4b93c55cee29b2f3370b72e395ef52db33fde','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20328','GHBC-REQ-020328','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.2','GHBC-C-005188','A low velocity re-circulation system may be used with 5 percent to 10 percent fresh air make-up which is allowed to exfiltrate from the room and ensure a positive pressure to prevent entry of dust and untreated air.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"ation system may be used with 5 percent to 10 percent fresh air make-"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"may be used with 5 percent to 10 percent fresh air make-up which is al"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cdae9aaae9218fc70360e20e4863c47c0d528824d31cf1ae438e66627f2ab0fc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20329','GHBC-REQ-020329','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.2','GHBC-C-005188','The air distribution should be zoned to minimize temperature variations owing to fluctuation in','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b0ba28c40ca501b601fac4ec19e8b7f69c0033c4a06f98701c2753a40c15e1f5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20330','GHBC-REQ-020330','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.3.6.1.7.2','GHBC-C-005188','heat load.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','78eb12ca5d7069aa2874216d6833a410fd86ef17712a1e586d32aa10d86fa514','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
