('rowid-20392','GHBC-REQ-020392','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005207','Select a fan that will generate the lowest possible sound level, commensurate with other fan selection parameters.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','82e1757a4c7e66412a2044049e5d4971a84ba5d93eeccfc7be69c3d84b6f778e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20393','GHBC-REQ-020393','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005207','c) Fans with relatively few blades (less than 15) tend to generate tones, which may dominate the spectrum.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":15,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"s with relatively few blades (less than 15) tend to generate tones, whic"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e482037574cb99820dd5eda7e0a82c5736bbee97584b42511501d25edfcb5ae6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20394','GHBC-REQ-020394','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005207','These tones occur at the blade passage frequency and its harmonies.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5ea733969ffecd3a9d2b1ea08f71ecaa87f520470e9b846a74f407a469438676','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20395','GHBC-REQ-020395','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005207','The intensity of these tones depends on resonance with the duct system, fan design, and inlet flow distortions.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fa620b900628db323eabfe2e42b81639b6dae6708d87d55a8bbc63e273cac40c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20396','GHBC-REQ-020396','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005207','d) Select a fan to operate as near as possible to its rated peak efficiency when handling the required quantity of air and static pressure.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ca6aa2faa9d40d571cb2cac533ec0dcffb90c1599533550151daa5425b3e5e92','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20397','GHBC-REQ-020397','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005207','Also, select a fan that generates the lowest possible noise but still meets the required design conditions for which it is selected.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','85393f5f1a58c85e24eb3c264fa7fd444c029957952ccf658bffd4bb5818b859','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20398','GHBC-REQ-020398','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005207','Using an oversized or undersized fan, that does not operate at or near rated peak efficiency, may result in substantially higher noise levels.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c0aae220c4399a093b1e0403a0ad20aa8c70acfa1d986c305a0664b7c588356d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20399','GHBC-REQ-020399','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005207','e) Design duct connections at both the fan inlet and outlet for uniform and straight airflow.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3197af11e63d4e6c13e86368949ed686fbce6eed0e2b1098ea715c318d61e6a2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20400','GHBC-REQ-020400','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005207','Avoid unstable, gusting and swirling inlet airflow.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1eea2fb138379e8c1e76e0e712b451241158eddd12641665656bd0eefd057d6b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
