('rowid-20402','GHBC-REQ-020402','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005207','f) Select duct silencers that do not significantly increase the required fan total static pressure.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','72d5bad63d6c0b46c8a4ff59abf29cfaf4f75f1e331ddd75ed4759fdcf4ca2ac','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20403','GHBC-REQ-020403','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.6','GHBC-C-005208','Sizing and selecting a chiller is an important aspect in noise control.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8a2f174848a75799077cc74a6f729bc772cfcdf79e7ffdb06d1320290d353c58','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20404','GHBC-REQ-020404','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.6','GHBC-C-005208','The following guidelines may be considered for noise control:','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','65a4e819899717b945df2bab2b7026c825c751bf9825f2e79ce105e0d2ffa52d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20405','GHBC-REQ-020405','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.6','GHBC-C-005208','a) For roof top installation of chillers, these may be placed on beams connected on the elevated levels of pillars on correctly chosen vibration isolators.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed984fa197ec26a624d9a6a0f3f7f4ac51522ab902e3babfe3e263e941a0e478','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20406','GHBC-REQ-020406','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.6','GHBC-C-005208','b) Water cooled chillers have less vibration.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','89066e936a0d5e2d68c82e71b3c60b11a01e4bcd6396bf8f73b4b3723e419ee3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20407','GHBC-REQ-020407','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.6','GHBC-C-005208','However, if air cooled chillers have to be chosen, choose them with fans of lower speeds and compressors must be jacketed without compromising their ventilation requirement.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','07dd98296c13aa68ce801dbab4421465f392eb79b74079026d65e1cc834e6f17','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20408','GHBC-REQ-020408','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.6','GHBC-C-005208','c) If much more silencing is required, plan a silencer on the exhaust of the fans and also an acoustic enclosure around the chillers.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','769b876e2c99c8957637f5c655b4a81b2eccc24b53f1c51d44d97c1a1d6a8b6a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20409','GHBC-REQ-020409','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.6','GHBC-C-005208','Care must be taken for the additional static demand in the fan.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','10da7339a13578d61cc7b6f7a7fb76f45344bbf97051e1acb9daea4f84e1e5cc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20410','GHBC-REQ-020410','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','The following measures should be adopted:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','72122a45e15a3dc3a45c300b6be1f84d7047dada326a0cc277e2781f1a916ebd','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20411','GHBC-REQ-020411','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','a) Shorter ducts with flanges and bracings are advantageous for noise reduction. b) Choose the right thickness of sheets for ducting. c) Provide calculated turning vanes in all bends. d) Provide take off pieces in all branches and collars. e) Minimize the number of terminals since each terminal of equal noise will create a higher overall noise inside the room – two equal noise sources increase the noise by 3 dB. f) Velocities of supply and return ducts and also terminals are important for noise control. g) For auditoriums, conference halls etc., choose the right silencers in the supply.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','070304f73ad007709151c98c3169477b0ff1024793d074aabed3321a20520834','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20412','GHBC-REQ-020412','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','Define a clear opening for return air and fix return air silencers (parallel baffle silencer).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b0216d29cf591344e7f72196ae597ad35b008820bf254ef84733f5bc6ee60c80','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20413','GHBC-REQ-020413','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','The pressure drop expected across these silencers','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2d4dca9531b80de629e35a04aca9776fde03bcff638cf9dbc6eadad15496d052','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20414','GHBC-REQ-020414','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','varies from 6 mm to 10 mm of water column. h) Selecting double skin air handling unit should be done with care.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"varies from 6 mm to 10 mm of water column. h) "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"varies from 6 mm to 10 mm of water column. h) Selecting"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cde95651d06167a6d7d11c888a2fa60e10b242065fe3b665dc6e895e0ec51614','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20415','GHBC-REQ-020415','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','If used without supply and return air silencers, it adds to the noise in the duct patch.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4cd48ac4ddd6baa576f1a6c4ae0307eee38c120349ebce90c14703c8e091ee7f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20416','GHBC-REQ-020416','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','However, by using double skin air handling units the noise inside the plant room can be lowered. i) Instead of insulating the plant room, increasing the density of the plant room wall and providing return air baffles in the return air patch is more helpful in noise reduction.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8f45026f2327ed65f16570c04b5b18731d9acdea6d8418af209e80c2b14391e9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20417','GHBC-REQ-020417','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','The doors to the air handling unit room should be either with an attic entry or dense enough to avoid noise transmission. j) Avoid terminal dampers and grilles if the noise criterion is of the order of NC 20 (recording studios). k) If ducts have to be routed outside the conditioned space, the density of the insulating materials over the duct surface is very critical.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8bede25fce0b6f75ea2b4cdc7b1934604cf1da7e9162ab00fe5d3223d49bb0cf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20418','GHBC-REQ-020418','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','The higher the density, the lower is its transmittal of noise and hence break in noise inside the duct can be avoided.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','16463da8548bb7fee65289b0b8cca329ce1bbc670c1f0073417242f91388b3a7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20419','GHBC-REQ-020419','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','The density is to be decided based on the outside noise level. l) Selection of a proper terminal device helps in noise reduction. m) VAV shall be planned along with relevant VFD or bypass arrangement.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b83056e7984368b3dcc8588c4d1c8296a117afccbdf39c9e700c2e697705e957','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20420','GHBC-REQ-020420','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','Otherwise the duct is subjected to variable pressures resulting in variable noise pattern. n) Minimize flow-generated noise by elbows or duct branch takeoffs, whenever possible, by locating them at least four to five duct diameters from each other.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','88b6c583d4aa7b9bf05ed112794f129cb1a2cb6cc94056d9359ea338629f7020','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20421','GHBC-REQ-020421','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','For high velocity systems, it may be necessary to increase this distance to up to ten duct diameters in critical noise areas. o) Keep airflow velocity in the duct as low as possible (7.5 m/s or less) near critical noise areas by expanding the duct cross-clause area.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":7.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" the duct as low as possible (7.5 m/s or less) near critical nois"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e6b69ae474440ccad66f6165cc8421a8459ca85b6e5e01f87534246f681b5238','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20422','GHBC-REQ-020422','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','However, do not exceed an included expansion angle of greater than 15°..','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e4b92d8b66b8d57a0ddf75cb9d8ed78e46f30e837b18d7be38e3fc7032e7c2d1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20423','GHBC-REQ-020423','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','Flow separation, resulting from expansion angles greater than 15°, may produce rumbling noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2ca04a4b6cd2d03524d2319f2f5015adb1c9870f88b6f97ad35b8e4d4eb20e8e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20424','GHBC-REQ-020424','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','Expanding the','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3a1a20726368c5b79a6435e45210fc0a423c719e0f9fc391065d46270e498af4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20425','GHBC-REQ-020425','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','duct cross-clause area reduces potential flow noise associated with turbulence in these areas. p) Use turning vanes in large 90° rectangular elbows and branch takeoffs.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1dfb9760c6ad1748fe2ce135643e41bff3a026e2e38590b792c598a276595143','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20426','GHBC-REQ-020426','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.5.7','GHBC-C-005209','This provides a smoother transmission in which the air can change flow direction, thus reducing turbulence. q) Place grilles, diffusers and registers into occupied spaces, as far as possible from elbows and branch takeoffs. r) Minimize the use of volume dampers near grilles, diffusers and registers in acoustically critical situations. s) Vibrationally isolate ducts and pipes, using spring and/or neoprene hangers for at least the first 15m from the vibration – isolated equipment.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"angers for at least the first 15m from the vibration – isolated"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6d0ace5dd773ffd081788899483fa7ecfa8b507106dbe71028097604e9bdfaaa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20427','GHBC-REQ-020427','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.6','GHBC-C-005210','Most obvious paths for solid-borne noise are the attached piping and pump support systems.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a00a010f543e11e96e65ab117c8b3dab2d59dc268ac37d69b25f8861274f0372','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20428','GHBC-REQ-020428','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.6','GHBC-C-005210','Oscillatory energy generated near the pump can be conducted as solid-borne noise for substantial distances before it is radiated as acoustic noise.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5398e3232730dc49b4356fad9e086f70959d2295b14e15b3238b00b5620d5f78','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20429','GHBC-REQ-020429','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.6','GHBC-C-005210','It can be controlled using flexible couplings and mechanical isolation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3c16f3730d1233f99c0a311f71e58a7a7e6e569af426e7a25a1b3af8e275d8f9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20430','GHBC-REQ-020430','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.7','GHBC-C-005211','Measurements should be taken with a sound level meter either using the ‗A‘ weighting scale or to draw up a noise criteria curve.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','865e8742cc043374b09fb3d5eb54a518ab4ad111c449c6df2dc6607d315ce954','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20431','GHBC-REQ-020431','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.7','GHBC-C-005211','Measurements should be taken in the following locations:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','69f7f35157bdffccd18bbb2435ba49ce1787dd318d68071de7d669f9133cc014','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20432','GHBC-REQ-020432','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.4.7','GHBC-C-005211','a) plant rooms; b) occupied rooms adjacent to plant rooms; c) outside plant rooms facing air intakes and exhausts and condenser discharge, to assess possible nuisance to adjacent occupied areas; d) in the space served by the first grille or diffuser after a fan outlet; and e) in at least two of the spaces served by fan coil units or high velocity system terminal units (where applicable).','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8ec5d75c1f1f925422c58b97cccdfa7924e0fe9469bd21ed23678065921f610b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20433','GHBC-REQ-020433','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5','GHBC-C-005212','conditioned areas) and evapourative cooling','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1316a14ca70b46b2f7c11cb50b29906680540ea5053abaaec6f096da5c3ae209','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20434','GHBC-REQ-020434','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Ventilation is the process of changing air in an enclosed space.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','79b65a243a2089cbf3aac77c163a95d0f78aad9dd6176e658a020521b6a4fc28','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20435','GHBC-REQ-020435','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','A proportion of the air in the space should be continuously withdrawn and replaced by fresh air drawn from outside to maintain the required level of air purity.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','242ec65d2edd6fd581522aebe7f4f3c7fc0dbf04e57661004cc69dc682c090ca','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20436','GHBC-REQ-020436','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Ventilation is required to control the following:','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9c4bdb1dafa75351e8cde40ef3fad1494e1b3660ca15865439e0a00230875cb9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20437','GHBC-REQ-020437','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','a) Oxygen content – Prevent depletion of the oxygen content of the air; b) Carbon-dioxide and moisture – To prevent undue accumulation; c) Contaminants – To prevent undue rise in concentration of body odours and other contaminants such as tobacco smoke; d) Bacteria – To oxidize colonies of bacteria and fungi to prevent their proliferation. e) Heat – To remove body heat and heat dissipated by electrical or mechanical equipment or solar heat gains.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3a4b39c86bf651dac99cea68cfddf2dc09051ec85e7f015c8d68e00e274d8471','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20438','GHBC-REQ-020438','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Mechanical ventilation is one of several forms of ventilation options available.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','657038163f69052e53b5667bf5686b71039cbfcee283c6579e0aa18bc878255f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20439','GHBC-REQ-020439','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','It usually consists of fans, filters, ducts, air diffusers and outlets for air distribution within the building.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d3e4cbe9854ceae75638a41ff5d5f47bcca509eb20d3126bb0b38bd5caf921fd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20440','GHBC-REQ-020440','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','It may include either mechanical exhaust system or exhaust can occur through natural means.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','013db73a663cea086227d268a6acbc2c3bf4e35fc4f145c5b164a3a5a8a5356d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20441','GHBC-REQ-020441','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Natural ventilation and natural exhaust are also options.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','438e440f1ffe4853435261bd89d626d1c7e7f01e35de94e32ae99d167e18edcb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20442','GHBC-REQ-020442','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','The scope of this clause is therefore restricted to mechanical ventilation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93f0fd493f03471eb854d7dfec1c3c59df380a7192cb254d3271bd6faa070de9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20443','GHBC-REQ-020443','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Ventilation controls heat, odours and hazardous chemical contaminants (in a building) that could affect the health and safety of the occupants.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a3d07f438c69b179718a9201a64f7d3b2eedf17d775dd1c69fead007cb94a8b0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20444','GHBC-REQ-020444','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','For better control of heat and contaminants, air may need to be exhausted at their sources by local exhaust systems.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cbdef8e62e750743084f2e7599a9db0800eac1b1fd0e58fd8cd51b57e8fba845','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20445','GHBC-REQ-020445','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Usually such systems require lower air flows than general (dilution) ventilation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','39da2e24eefc4c229d4b2c0d378bb01df6bf2a0d1c6bd21c94fdc2df4c91c412','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20446','GHBC-REQ-020446','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','The following considerations provide details regarding the various parameters that affect the type of ventilation system selected for a particular application, and the sizing of the ventilation plant:','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','96a2269c295782df8f0e0dd11e32ed248d0b015669c4e723184a9fadcb05ba0d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20447','GHBC-REQ-020447','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','a) The climatic zone in which the building is located is a major consideration.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3eaf8952d4c547302e47f598653aff47963baf61bee34322556ad7b294262a8d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20448','GHBC-REQ-020448','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','An important','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b160299daf415807085bc4da2d662766624b122704273bb24b57d669f00edeb7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20449','GHBC-REQ-020449','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','distinction that must be made is between hot-dry and warm-moist conditions.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec662963f7b0ba98da08eb263d2385eedd961461342021006e7417b45764284a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20450','GHBC-REQ-020450','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Hot-dry work situations occur around furnaces, forges, metal-extruding and rolling mills, glass-forming machines, and so forth.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0bad4dc023725ccf246ac320b2d35eda1a06a3b70001a46ad102f44e7995ef57','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20451','GHBC-REQ-020451','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Typical warm-moist operations are found in textile mills, laundries, dye houses, and deep mines where water is used extensively for dust control.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2792955b8051ba44e9d2df65b38340508699e0b6c05858b42a1431b2c317f216','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20452','GHBC-REQ-020452','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Warm-moist conditions are more hazardous than hot-dry conditions.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','789420dd19349b6f5b72b699a574bb0e3ecb83630790012ac6a6acefb79f50a2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20453','GHBC-REQ-020453','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','b) Siting (and orientation) of the building is also an important factor.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c906147def50a33999fbca222cb634351a9d2b46eebcb69d16d1ced4b2897208','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20454','GHBC-REQ-020454','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Solar heat gain and high outside temperature increases the load significantly; how significantly, depends on the magnitude of these gains particularly in relation to other gains, for example the internal load. c) The comfort level required is another consideration.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e90fb5c90654b3e0f8f4abe0573f16134a1b75267a639e14e277f24ae9f6c583','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20455','GHBC-REQ-020455','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','In many cases, comfort levels (as understood in the context of residential buildings, commercial blocks, office establishments) cannot be achieved at all and therefore, what is often aimed at will be ‗acceptable working conditions‘ rather than ‗comfort‘.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e3eb10bfa3960457130c20b355ebf8b5984ccb1fb31ce4ca0233c086d608d25d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20456','GHBC-REQ-020456','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Having surveyed the considerations above, there are many options available in mechanical ventilation – spot cooling, local exhaust, changes in work pattern – to choose from, for achieving the desired acceptable working conditions.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b8ad75adec46596af944640bfe5fbb95960cd07f46dc63515660b9379b9bb2eb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20457','GHBC-REQ-020457','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','The options available may be extended to evapourative cooling in order to achieve more acceptable working conditions when confronted with more hostile environmental conditions.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f5ccf9c7411e54447f93205f716beb4751b8696d49ac52d476dd5af7b4015f31','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20458','GHBC-REQ-020458','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','It will be thus seen that there are many considerations involved in the selection and sizing of suitable ventilation and evapourative cooling plants to meet the requirements of any particular building and/or process.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8d8eb8f7d34d6e9f2e6220231330978e23115906dd6b0d9752beae6cf8327bf5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20459','GHBC-REQ-020459','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','It is the interplay of these various factors listed above like climatic conditions, internal load, exposure to heat and hazardous substances and level of working conditions aimed at, that determines the option which best meets the requirement and also, the capacity and other attributes of the option selected.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a151f5e95509bfadd5c43df7ce55dc46a56c2d55b4ab3d9c3e2efa20f3c31db5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20460','GHBC-REQ-020460','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Ventilation control measures alone are frequently inadequate for meeting heat stress standards.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f69bbe4f4354af8d54d0e6a4cebb18ef2097b70ffa49b78b0963ea7b516a7f69','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20461','GHBC-REQ-020461','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','Optimum solutions may involve additional controls, such as local exhausts, spot cooling, changes in work-rest patterns and radiation shielding.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','706e05d2aa276c1caf256a92a2bb6ae6600d004b9f6922e18f24e290c9a6a613','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20462','GHBC-REQ-020462','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.1','GHBC-C-005213','As a rule, it is the mechanical system that provides the best results and controls for the more complex situations and more stringent requirements arising out of harsher environment and need for better working conditions.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','692960dcbc5ad96bcdd4144b788de60f43d823976475a0df4d524e9673ce5759','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20463','GHBC-REQ-020463','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005215','A ventilation system provides the fresh air flow that is required to maintain an acceptable nonodorous atmosphere (by diluting body odours and tobacco smoke) and to dilute the carbon dioxide exhaled.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4623da31796372c711e13e87ec437fce37635e86120568de1ff4ee4061dcbe2c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20464','GHBC-REQ-020464','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005215','The quantity and distribution of introduced outside air takes into account infiltration, exhaust and dilution requirements of the building.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','445e0794f09e020b8337d8c76676aa835200b88660b422cfe94f766bbccd0ec9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20465','GHBC-REQ-020465','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005215','Proportion of fresh air introduced into a building may be varied to achieve economical operation.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6ad740e42f5a067671bdea759d724ed82101678e3f8427dfb34957baaae928ab','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20466','GHBC-REQ-020466','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005215','When fresh air can provide the usual cooling effect, the quantity should be controlled to match the cooling demand.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b4104748bdc34b4618b0317ac3751d674fdce5e9b914f6fe0df75a80f5fe65d2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20467','GHBC-REQ-020467','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005216','Ventilation systems help air circulation that is required to transfer the heat and humidity generated within the building.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3946202551a3b59c58a013e8fe44229485e7cee455642fb698461556e7ddb253','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20468','GHBC-REQ-020468','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005216','Heat generated by the occupants, electrical and mechanical equipment, and solar heat gains may be removed by the introduction of adequate quantities of fresh air and by expelling or extracting of stale air.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bd5454c000fe234245edcb277113bc79f2d1394ae6322a541f1d00848b33dfff','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20469','GHBC-REQ-020469','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005217','Ventilation systems provide air movement that is necessary to create a feeling of freshness and avoid discomfort, although excessive movement should be avoided as this may lead to complaints of draughts.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eb7143dc1e01da2a2dd22f0f84b27dfd505a9570e5ce71c7e89e6bd7bcc482fa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20470','GHBC-REQ-020470','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005217','The quantity of fresh air should not be increased solely to create air movement; this should be effected by air re-circulation within the space or by inducing air movement with the ventilation air system.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7727f893dc58033758601ce00d2f83ca3b995dc1fa773d806a975632334e86a1','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20471','GHBC-REQ-020471','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005217','Air flow should be controlled to minimize transfer of fumes and smells.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4f7921c063a8270c53a28e575fb929cfa73757419aeca01fb58bc50ae25ba88c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20472','GHBC-REQ-020472','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005217','In addition, air','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a5f2f86ee57982d79a7fc8329ac9d884872ee728a13755dcc2a551f94069850c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20473','GHBC-REQ-020473','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005217','pressure gradients may be created within the building, by varying the balance between the fresh air and extracting the stale air.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bd0d450ba67cb16f02a410a1a6c9e5f4ec85531b326c5aec36f568de8a766fd4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20474','GHBC-REQ-020474','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005217','Care should be taken, however, to avoid excessive pressure differences that can cause difficulty in opening doors or cause them to slam.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b9dd273d09d1e4f009f96acdddd09a7075a3f5398172c84c85adc49e41942f80','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20475','GHBC-REQ-020475','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005218','Ventilation system installed in a building should deliver clean, fresh air to the space served.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f9453bf18f78a75e180195fa87e168a24c771a8ee1a5d3f0208bc08d137e8ec3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20476','GHBC-REQ-020476','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005218','This may be achieved by providing the required amount of fresh air either to remove totally or to dilute odours, fumes, etc. Local extract systems may be necessary to remove polluted air from kitchens, toilets, slaughter houses, crematoria, etc. Special air filters may be provided to remove contaminants or smells when air is recirculated.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8727321f0ccbc1d5fea4894a65e2a82b49e585de1df159d05bf91114be0fa8b9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20477','GHBC-REQ-020477','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005219','from air Efficient air filtration to prevent fouling of the system should be considered, where damage is likely to be caused by discolouration owing to airborne dust particles.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e8a3a66d8bca58ab3bc3d47a6378a5cdd00481781373c6e323eb2742b3c72540','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20478','GHBC-REQ-020478','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005219','In order to obtain the best performance from the filters provided, care should be taken to locate the air intake appropriately in relation the prevailing wind, position of chimneys and relative atmospheric dust concentration in the environs of the building.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','42d267a8a0483b4dcd879419227c332f176e30fdebb9dceb5e86f25c9926434c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20479','GHBC-REQ-020479','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005219','This will promote cleaner interiors and reduce dust loading of the filters.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d0b6134c3e7dc93b39f73446b2803cc788781ba290552840b7a20c2c244d6e98','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20480','GHBC-REQ-020480','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005219','Adequate (space) provisions should be incorporated in plant layouts to ensure that filters can be serviced regularly.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','bce33bba48b3329bd6d66c87014724b1b7cf6d954dd6082a944f129db277c1ac','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20481','GHBC-REQ-020481','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005220','Ventilation systems can be designed to extract smoke in the event of a fire, to assist in the fire fighting operations and to introduce fresh air to pressurize escape routes.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cae87c79ba1d095dc5d60c0779f12735e384caeed024c78fef903a1055522969','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20482','GHBC-REQ-020482','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.7','GHBC-C-005221','from air Fumes and smell may be removed from air by physical or chemical processes.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','38f7664338d9f2f9dfbee9fac8454065d398f37dfbe8e4247b4dbd0bc8fb5252','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20483','GHBC-REQ-020483','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.2.7','GHBC-C-005221','Their removal may be essential when the ambient air is heavily polluted, although consideration must be given to limit the thermal loads caused by the introduction of large quantities of fresh air.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','22295766b9a8ab8127bf0bb922b05476ad5428f2ea1bf2a67569e9ee4fa4efcd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20484','GHBC-REQ-020484','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','Industrial buildings form a major application of mechanical ventilation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6b7c5f91f0c29445c2e28d8a53e04b52a4afc533bcc0327446cf1ba74c18f8c5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20485','GHBC-REQ-020485','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','In industrial buildings, ventilation is needed to provide the fresh air normally required for health and hygiene and also, to mitigate thermal working conditions by assisting in the removal of surplus heat due to equipment, people and building heat gains.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ed63f98f563bf2a34f52a5eff17d1fd0ec0db549e836077d85e5732a16d4d161','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20486','GHBC-REQ-020486','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','The following are some of the factors that should be considered in the system design:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','673c2a6d68a1316bc8f0be3ec10e6bee972b5574957274818ff456bac1f634b4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20487','GHBC-REQ-020487','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','a) A supply system would not be satisfactory without a complimentary exhaust system.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3c2bf58995055dec1d1966e3919216178c610137f52a2764f54e12391bdca3f0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20488','GHBC-REQ-020488','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','Similarly any exhaust system would require a complementary supply system.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fd80a41c5de88bc01ba39090e2b9b20c97bd3643c57af619d496790954177d5d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20489','GHBC-REQ-020489','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','b) Air should be supplied equitably through grilles, diffusers and such other devices.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5dc6a7573433613a6e58db5a2cd9318875e21c2895f0b5182a1277de73fb2dd2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20490','GHBC-REQ-020490','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','Directional grilles, diffusers and nozzles designed specifically to alleviate the thermal conditions should be considered.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8a682238c24a2b2c4dbad0644940421c0c4e15beb8b10194440d33e8dae1766d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20491','GHBC-REQ-020491','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','Drafts should be avoided.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ac506342f04bd69579e01a2641cf041d63569d9be16f28d15409edb4233ca721','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20492','GHBC-REQ-020492','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','c) Ventilation systems may need to be supplemented by exhaust hoods and canopies designed to capture the unwanted fumes or dust right at the source irrespective of other air currents in the vicinity.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cbf9dc6eb3022630017b959412c9c1d3026fc8da2326b0924e827f3f517df8c0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20493','GHBC-REQ-020493','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','Many industrial ventilation systems shall handle simultaneous exposures to heat, toxic and hazardous substances.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6ef8c914978acb45cedc1f393cea9a86563bdab618471a9bdf838340d18f797c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20494','GHBC-REQ-020494','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','The number of contaminant sources, their generation rate and effectiveness of exhaust hoods are rarely known; there is no option but to depend on common ventilation/industrial hygiene practice in such situations.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f4ebab24506f20d810772e6ad58e9e75efc52da858820c82f99d60380a219d07','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20495','GHBC-REQ-020495','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.3','GHBC-C-005222','Reference may also be made to good practice.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7261eb4241d1f4d68e2d4f228df459bdea96ac6649589f2524e9b88c124f8443','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20496','GHBC-REQ-020496','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.4','GHBC-C-005223','In the interest of efficient use of energy and comfort to occupants, it is imperative that all modes of ventilation should be considered in relation to the thermal characteristics of the building.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d2313b8f3bdaad0e16829b4a4ee9c76bc535529e3ed5667adc3f809fc2711d7d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20497','GHBC-REQ-020497','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.4','GHBC-C-005223','(Clause 29.2.5.5.1)','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4ce36b34d0b4a075d0be93d8c28029043dc0e09c6f2cb34de15b69e89854aff1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20498','GHBC-REQ-020498','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.4','GHBC-C-005223','29.2.5.4.1 Mechanical extract/natural supply This is the simplest form of extract system comprising one or more fans, usually of the propeller, axial flow or mixed flow type, installed in outside walls or on the roof.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4.1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"29.2.5.4.1 Mechanical extract/natural supp"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','946d280a0178f42589812d48320cd963926763c4d377f375aee70e26e15cc298','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20499','GHBC-REQ-020499','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.4','GHBC-C-005223','The discharge should terminate in louvers or cowls or a combination of both.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ca4b1bf05dd4ff08e7cdaac40f7777acccfa1639aa101ab73066b174f730ea6d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20500','GHBC-REQ-020500','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.4','GHBC-C-005223','Alternatively, the system may comprise of ductwork arranged for general extraction of the vitiated air or for extraction from localized sources of heat, moisture, odours, fumes and dust.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d5e4d9e5b3092a4349b87d0b9a1dfc983a958621368f979f81aef37ea6f65420','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
