('rowid-20547','GHBC-REQ-020547','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.3','GHBC-C-005232','It is more effective in dry climates (hot-dry climate zone) where wet-bulb depression is comparatively large.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f68f479b3925fb9fd526b60fe894b32e495b739f3c96d12c7920b25374b522ec','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20548','GHBC-REQ-020548','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.3','GHBC-C-005232','Factors to be considered – include those listed in 29.2.5.5.4; in addition the following also apply:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e4ede56eec579dd0533d99a97b1c27ee05298e9d8ab9c2edd8e539afbc8290f0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20549','GHBC-REQ-020549','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.3','GHBC-C-005232','a) saturation efficiency of the cooler – higher the better; b) ambient weather design data; c) permissible temperature rise; and d) type of cooling application – residential, industrial, etc.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1777cd3a8079213e271bd9411768735c21fb9856aecaebc9671c9b2344fd93e6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20550','GHBC-REQ-020550','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.4','GHBC-C-005233','for industrial application shall be carried out in the following manner for effective evapourative cooling:','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7cea26b3d6a890fe622f84e8ffeab5a89fec8ba8a345dd1c5139fca51b82c06e','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20551','GHBC-REQ-020551','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.4','GHBC-C-005233','a) Minimize external heat loads by shading, use of heat reflective paints, roof insulation and sealing of gaps. b) Minimize internal heat loads by shielding, use of reflective paints, insulation and installation of exhaust fans over the hot processes and machines. c) Make building tight. d) Wherever possible, exhaust of used washed air must be directed towards roof to partly cool the surface and trusses thereby reducing heat radiation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','310a7a2283948f8f283f39ff8432d5daf2da30bf3e8197e2917c09bcd6c02225','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20552','GHBC-REQ-020552','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.5','GHBC-C-005234','systems may be provided:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1596f3d99fd7ae7bcca564a9d6d396e22dd752628fe3f70499c71639be8083ae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20553','GHBC-REQ-020553','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.5','GHBC-C-005234','a) once through or pump-less type; b) re-circulating or pump type.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','10fb34c74596392f1d43ea980b3ffcd4249e232aa194dbb19525bab151902c9e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20554','GHBC-REQ-020554','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.5','GHBC-C-005234','The first type is simpler and cheaper but consumes more water, needs constant drainage and has lower efficiency depending upon the temperature of water.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','307b894abdd6aa39b172d5698b157e13c07f22196062cd3c83eb447773cc1240','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20555','GHBC-REQ-020555','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.5','GHBC-C-005234','The second type has higher cooling efficiency due to recirculated water approaching wet-bulb temperature conserves water and can operate with intermittent drainage.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b084b417c10a66a9cb198e690c73103c0c44e6ae512277c8acf35393a08e0d5e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20556','GHBC-REQ-020556','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.5','GHBC-C-005234','It is recommended to provide periodic bleed-off or blow down to remove accumulated mineral additions.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5a1002525f2047b7dc430cf09ce4287817c6530f072197f047201de01ab2284e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20557','GHBC-REQ-020557','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.5','GHBC-C-005234','This helps in reducing scaling of pads also.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','89732b01fc29ab110c39b7f34c9260717dfb5ef5eb790dac16a63eb7148631c9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20558','GHBC-REQ-020558','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.6','GHBC-C-005235','is recommended between 1.0 and 1.5 m/s.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"s recommended between 1.0 and 1.5 m/s."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','54693b663835904750d2cfd0003b01a5690e1f268b75a8943910d0bb8d3b99c2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20559','GHBC-REQ-020559','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.6','GHBC-C-005235','The lower face velocity reduces evapouration as damp air film isolates the dry air from the wet surface.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','44ce18d6a480f5d804a1f6df891baaf62a425cded1ecc0246755cea795c406d6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20560','GHBC-REQ-020560','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.6','GHBC-C-005235','Higher face velocity may provide insufficient air-water contact time.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5161fa2c8dae83b838734823095f8e3bf4632e285091a008505b8a2f775a8de6','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20561','GHBC-REQ-020561','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.7','GHBC-C-005236','Pad material should be such which provides maximum clean wet surface area with minimum airflow resistance.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','907d9f717951078d9b8b8fb1ac2a519ccd6c5b6de4fa47f325c395502a1983f6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20562','GHBC-REQ-020562','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.7','GHBC-C-005236','Materials, which have either good ‗wick‘ characteristics or surface that spread water rapidly by capillary action, should be selected.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','62f3ea06490549cc84d7eee9f2e5d61d45e1d226acfcf2d278ce8a4646d88b46','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20563','GHBC-REQ-020563','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.8','GHBC-C-005237','diffusers, grilles and registers should be preferably adjustable.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6b6a88d7a0a334e957d95d16c4ce530c5c64a81318fd93b07ecd2c2e5fbea898','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20564','GHBC-REQ-020564','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.9','GHBC-C-005238','supplemented with spot cooling in the hot workplaces.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a35736765e1a492816cb27ec29f406fd4e92df20d0836b566e167e5132fa138c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20565','GHBC-REQ-020565','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.6.10','GHBC-C-005239','Reference may also be made to good practice','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3575766653004d7aef38a42ea7adf4dfc08dba45b9755e0ff86cdcec4bb1e768','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20566','GHBC-REQ-020566','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1','GHBC-C-005241','Planning of equipment room for ventilation','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b72d625d0494b7d084dba1fb47b3952f0ea76435e795859a23aeea841f16c2ac','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20567','GHBC-REQ-020567','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.1','GHBC-C-005242','In selecting the location of equipment room, aspects of efficiency, economy and good practice should be considered and wherever possible, it shall be made contiguous with the building.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e555e0708ee134b96300a964b0f4f8e6086d5290b1077c216af6cc25e813a8a0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20568','GHBC-REQ-020568','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.1','GHBC-C-005242','This room shall be located as centrally as possible with respect to the area served and shall be free from obstructing columns.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8af040d327831473c369d1356f43c1712043ed89c150ebc87bbfb714ee28d58a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20569','GHBC-REQ-020569','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.1','GHBC-C-005242','Proper location helps achieve satisfactory air distribution and also results in a less expensive installation.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a682238b524aa804f65bb7993f07de9e41ffc71890e696f8e615b7f44aa30a88','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20570','GHBC-REQ-020570','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.1','GHBC-C-005242','29.2.5.7.1.2 Equipment room should preferably be located adjacent to external wall to facilitate equipment movement and ventilation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ac7ad829001bb7466669095e626f3293ecc7754d530ec64c5f974be708ea0e4a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20571','GHBC-REQ-020571','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.1','GHBC-C-005242','It should also be close to the main electrical panel of the building, if possible, in order to avoid large cable lengths.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','758c664956eafd2e65e79441e48a4dac82688c97ae03d03687d23d34291aac4d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20572','GHBC-REQ-020572','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.3','GHBC-C-005243','Location and dimensions of shafts, for ducting, cables, pipes, etc. (if envisaged), should be planned at the virtual stages itself of planning.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','35e8d4da0959202866fe5ea7e5dbf9ce64958179824436b655d7b4831a863fb9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20573','GHBC-REQ-020573','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.3','GHBC-C-005243','They should be located adjacent to the equipment or within the room itself.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3d7710d0983f9981d156b028749cdb6fe27a068c16e3e41a74982e480bd6f40a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20574','GHBC-REQ-020574','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.3','GHBC-C-005243','Evapourate cooling units (air washers) should be located preferably on heat seasonwindward side.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','30d60af285317fb49770ab96096cdee5687813afe533e25ae5193a2ab835a686','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20575','GHBC-REQ-020575','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.3','GHBC-C-005243','They should be painted white or with reflective coating or thermally insulated, so as to minimize solar heat absorption.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','06310f9eb04150a1c87e522c4a824e453942393adf6d252eb0a6d0baa3aef56a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
