('rowid-20577','GHBC-REQ-020577','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.3','GHBC-C-005243','Appropriate acoustic treatment should be considered, if the noise levels cannot be kept down to permissible limits.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bfba5386361ed14b956969448639693940c59ff169e64bf869ef3fe1171a1f79','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20578','GHBC-REQ-020578','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.5.7.1.3','GHBC-C-005243','Exhaust air devices, preferably to leeward and overhead side may be provided for effective movement of air.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','facd561a3aa5f0b86437276a4b651eb88fc545b642c2cc1df43f482efa85d293','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
