('rowid-20624','GHBC-REQ-020624','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.6','GHBC-C-005257','a) Means for heating during winter months; b) Reciprocating or rotary compressor; c) Swing louvers for better distribution of air in the room; d) In addition to normal, dust filters, indoor air quality filters, such as bactericidal enzyme filters for killing bacteria, low temperature catalyst filter for removal of unpleasant odours, electrostatic filters to trap particles of smoke as well as suspended maters present in the air; e) Digital LCD remote control which also indicates room temperature.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c3c030fa50132590b3a148857124a64f4a7694e6837ea2500b226e093117ba83','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20625','GHBC-REQ-020625','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.6.2','GHBC-C-005258','Most of manufacturers supply unitary air conditions in capacities of 3 500 W (1 TR), 5 250 W (1.5 TR) and 7000 W (2 TR).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','150316ad38ff2916531d93347ae572f6bbc2962a8a2a2a1ed30924ed9ec23552','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20626','GHBC-REQ-020626','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.6.2','GHBC-C-005258','However, some of them may be able to supply window air conditioners of 1750 W (0.5 TR) and up to 10500 W (3 TR) along with intermediate range.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":10500,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"ioners of 1750 W (0.5 TR) and up to 10500 W (3 TR) along with intermedi"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e4ef46ec0448f16b03224e6c3f1ffb164117c40ebe86a1498f503d0846aaffd6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20627','GHBC-REQ-020627','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.6.2','GHBC-C-005258','The capacity of window air conditioners is rated at outside dry bulb temperature of 35°C and wet bulb temperature of 30°C and they are suitable for 230 V, single phase 50 Hz power supply.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":35,"unit":"°c","operator":null,"context":"tside dry bulb temperature of 35°C and wet bulb temperature of 3"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"°c","operator":null,"context":"C and wet bulb temperature of 30°C and they are suitable for 230"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"table for 230 V, single phase 50 Hz power supply."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','da4a7cb00c0d6520275d8964d45b8f7a0f94c549fe8ef5ed1ca3ed2abbff2cba','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20628','GHBC-REQ-020628','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.6.2','GHBC-C-005258','Nominal capacity of all the window air conditioners has to be derated due to high ambient temperatures in the hot months in most of Ghanaian cities.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c175069245d6e98ec65345b32d54b852e181ffeacced9f6635494cbabc91610e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20629','GHBC-REQ-020629','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.6.2','GHBC-C-005258','Also, generally a voltage stabilizer has to be installed to ensure that window air conditioner gets stabilized rated voltage.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','65b8bf892e3ab786f1606993eaab1f5de34f6aa10882bf3d6771644731f07e75','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20630','GHBC-REQ-020630','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.6.3','GHBC-C-005259','Unitary air conditioners are suitable for bedrooms, office cabins, general office area, hotel rooms and similar applications where normal comfort conditions are required up to a distance of 6m from unitary air conditioner.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" required up to a distance of 6m from unitary air conditioner."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eb5e9dd25c2b759e28a78390120cbd82b3fa0155a2a04aa5f7c1b2040ad32411','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
