('rowid-20706','GHBC-REQ-020706','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.8.6','GHBC-C-005278','The sum of horizontal and vertical distances should be generally kept within 15m. d)     Special applications like sterile rooms of hospitals and clean room applications where high filtration efficiency is desired. e)    Operation theatres where 100 percent fresh air is needed and fire hazard exists depending on the type of anesthesia being used.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ould be generally kept within 15m. d)     Special applications "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":100,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":")    Operation theatres where 100 percent fresh air is needed and fire "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f382d9b790a993ed9b301abdd287b6fe3421faff0c5b66b1226f92ac968f5680','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20707','GHBC-REQ-020707','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.8.7','GHBC-C-005279','constructional and performance requirements and methods for establishing ratings of packaged air conditioners, reference may be made to accepted standards in this Code.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ffcc51bb2fa84ad4d92fea6568a4fe105eda8802eb16a2d9772862d90d039aff','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20708','GHBC-REQ-020708','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9','GHBC-C-005280','29.2.9.1The installation of an air- conditioning system may be used advantageously for the central heating system with additions such as hot water or boiler and hot water coils or strip heater banks.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b3ead211128c461a9721189102fa8872e56a61d192ea0906c2a467ef28f8b7b9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20709','GHBC-REQ-020709','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005281','in Clauses 9.3.10.2.1 and 9.3.10.2.2 (29.2.9.2.1 and 29.2.9.2.2) are generally used.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c05bd0a323163ef7032295b2f36aaf76fbbca90794473414dcecf79280128262','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20710','GHBC-REQ-020710','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9.2.1','GHBC-C-005282','Central heating systems using hot water usually require not more than one or two rows of tubes in the direction of air flow, in order to produce the desired heating capacity.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dfca4c4ac722c647e05f06d0b1b2638aac1c48f1fea87d19bd6e279222c6a929','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
