('rowid-20712','GHBC-REQ-020712','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9.2.1','GHBC-C-005282','Generally, the resistance to the hot water flow through the heater should not exceed 4 kPa in low pressure hot water heating installations.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"kpa","operator":null,"context":" the heater should not exceed 4 kPa in low pressure hot water hea"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5d78a85a386527b634842544421c931531d3db3e1c0614113bbe080a73dc2e67','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20713','GHBC-REQ-020713','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9.2.1','GHBC-C-005282','In high pressure hot water installations, the resistance to the water flow will probably be determined by other factors, for example, the need to balance circuits.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','05a52294fb68e5ced3aab137c94f68d30099415edb2bbe67ec8751ff37c3256a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20714','GHBC-REQ-020714','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9.2.1','GHBC-C-005282','The heaters should be served form hot water flow and return mains with sufficient connections to each row or bank of tubes or clauses to give uniform distribution of the heating medium.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','50e19bcd21efd189e7deac7d9a7f3fb5a6a91fc79f1d0148e245095ff881d298','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20715','GHBC-REQ-020715','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9.2.1','GHBC-C-005282','The flow connections to the heater should generally be arranged at the lowest point of the heater, and the return connections at the highest, to aid venting.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f804512854cf5db5881c2ff5880958044b1be48b66f6b688160d55f1010e366a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20716','GHBC-REQ-020716','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9.2.1','GHBC-C-005282','The expansion of the tubes when the heater is in operation should be considered and the necessary arrangements made to accommodate expansion and contraction.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d84c24012e37eb34fd83f22efc7c4dbca222b2dc27b0e130ae6bb682506fdeab','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20717','GHBC-REQ-020717','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9.2.1','GHBC-C-005282','Thermometer wells should be fitted in the pipes near the inlets and outlets of all airheating coils so that the temperature drop through the heater can be readily observed.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f8482fe2b588002217c4078b4421c17e425537e9514a0561fbb8d53cfa06792d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20718','GHBC-REQ-020718','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9.2.2','GHBC-C-005283','The air velocity through the heaters should be sufficient to permit the absorption of the rated output of the finned tube heaters within its range of safe temperatures and the exact velocity determined in conjunction with the manufacturers of the heater.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0618e3450b07f1d966d28e43ffcc55a6fbaffac5700099a13cd8601acecf6551','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20719','GHBC-REQ-020719','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.9.2.2','GHBC-C-005283','Electrical load should be balanced across the three-phases of the electrical supply.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cf846abed6085d09fcf4a28ed0c90cb5266c6cf30793b0e44d79eb0916ba7b5f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
