('rowid-20753','GHBC-REQ-020753','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.3.4','GHBC-C-005301','Some of the more important aspects of establishing energy conservation requirements for air conditioning and ventilation systems are given below.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c98857c10ba09b9c8bd868d19d10ff9e7a04b33cc2d6deef52a1ca0ce01ab09c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20754','GHBC-REQ-020754','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.3.5','GHBC-C-005302','associated controls should take into account the following:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d27bd7d7c8fbadc7d06ab9fe7ff804ac4710df95cd56714ee2b965d32af7162c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
