('rowid-20777','GHBC-REQ-020777','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005313','The two metals have different coefficients of thermal expansion, so a change in temperature causes the element to bend and produce a change in position.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','117e9873843cca04167fac40d717327f116caeee292ba99a2f5e29027800ab39','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
