('rowid-20779','GHBC-REQ-020779','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005313','c) Sealed bellows element is evacuated of air and charged with a liquid, gas or vapour, which changes in pressure or volume as surrounding temperature changes, resulting in change of force or movement.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e5635c29f428dd5e0ab65c1b070516da6ad11b907d2a0da29b051896e9708e3c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20780','GHBC-REQ-020780','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005313','d) Remote bulb element consists of a sealed bellows or diaphragm to which a bulb or capsule is attached by means of capillary tubing, the entire system being filled with liquid, gas or vapour.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','549acd1a6187d59346da1f810e10566559c7a09ab4ac0f9252d2a6e4fd16a894','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20781','GHBC-REQ-020781','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005313','Temperature changes at the bulb are communicated as pressure or volume changes through the capillary tube to the bellows or diaphragm.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c735fd9e8427bb943b329e75534731843266de5a365a4b80038ed38a323fcf89','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20782','GHBC-REQ-020782','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005313','e) Resistance temperature detectors (RTDs) are temperature sensors containing either a fine wire or a thin metallic element whose resistance increases with temperature and varies in a known manner.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0f88051737ccfc41f0cc81e299a4becca3aaa9e81751c17b0517f331e74de2ab','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20783','GHBC-REQ-020783','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005313','RTDs are characterized by their high degree of linearity, good sensitivity and excellent stability.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','742ce527055d806719ff7f40211d559edd7f4d47b7055666890a0e5a0dadee34','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20784','GHBC-REQ-020784','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005313','RTDs are used with electronic controllers.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','88ab024bec9b2a6c6037cc4ef493659e0d734d3f1048a45850bf65ba4e6665e9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20785','GHBC-REQ-020785','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005313','f) Thermocouple element comprises a junction between two dissimilar metals that generates a small voltage related to the temperature.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8bfc46a854a83612ae8c8c66d263068027757275bfb83049cbcda172f2948272','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20786','GHBC-REQ-020786','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005314','a)  These devices have a hygroscopic organic polymer deposited on a water permeable substrate.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','33176133d52f6645a5f2865ded8a670293120f36e429ab4b295b0863c7c91bd6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20787','GHBC-REQ-020787','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005314','The polymer film absorbs moisture until it is balanced with the ambient air.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a39cffc07ac6f5279fea95b89125537f1473d7e839364a5368b8ec5f2a3fc2df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20788','GHBC-REQ-020788','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005314','This causes a change in resistance or capacitance.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93a95df0bb5236b2db5155a6db65e75dfc6b4e11b0f269fbbc4b65a410fe9ca7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20789','GHBC-REQ-020789','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005314','b) Resistance elements, as employed in electronic systems, consist usually of two interleaved grids of gold foil, each connected to a terminal and mounted on a thin slab of insulating plastic material with a coating of hygroscopic salt (lithium chloride) on the block.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5568e3041c16b80732a32fb756cdd822e1b97997ad27176d69ac1a46173981c2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20790','GHBC-REQ-020790','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005314','A conductive path between adjacent strips of foil is formed, and the high electric resistance of this circuit changes as the chemical film absorbs and releases moisture with changes in the relative humidity of surrounding air.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a23d9d26141cf068a283ffc211c07168d869da2a2a4d45ef94d5c97f5b78d097','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20791','GHBC-REQ-020791','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005315','a) Low-pressure measuring elements for low positive pressure or for vacuum conditions, for example, static pressure in an air duct, usually comprise a large slack diaphragm, or large flexible bellows.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','80f15c7d46dc37427baefe00b2820423eb527e9fd94cdc549ae88ecd89d3b816','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20792','GHBC-REQ-020792','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005315','In one type of static pressure regulator, tow bells are suspended from a lever into a tank of oil, so that positive pressure under one of the bells moves the bell and lever up (or down) to complete an electric circuit.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7643685f5cae953299177f4ebcf7404ba34b2df961c043711b4e56ad17b30d48','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20793','GHBC-REQ-020793','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005315','The majority of these elements sense differential pressure, and when combined with pitot tubes, orifice plates, and venturi meters may be used to measure velocity, flow rate or liquid level.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0e8e33ad5d55824300c5721739de0db37f6e215d2d086b50c97e2bffa2313d33','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20794','GHBC-REQ-020794','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005315','b)  High-pressure measuring elements, for pressure or vacuum   measurements in the kPa range, are usually of bellows, diaphragm or Bourdon tube type.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f238e5be64999366a2127236ceee4733e05a610d191fce34fba395c2f1d89b35','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20795','GHBC-REQ-020795','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005315','If one side of the element is left open to the atmosphere, the element will respond to pressure above or below atmospheric.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1f1e1a166b9e724bdb66722bb204d6da480359527406b48c79bf4c9a75fc8d04','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20796','GHBC-REQ-020796','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005316','a) Special elements for various measuring or detecting purposes are often necessary for complete control in air conditioning or ventilating systems, for example a ‗paddle-blade‘ type of air flow switch may be interlocked with an electric heater battery to prevent battery from operating and overheating in the event of an air flow failure.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fffeab7decd51153b671981152037f6fea3952f860900e0d7c8493ceb2ed51d8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20797','GHBC-REQ-020797','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.4','GHBC-C-005316','b) Other elements employed form timeto-time are measuring smoke density, carbon monoxide (for example in road traffic tunnels or underground car parks) and carbon dioxide, and for flame detection.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','04abded830bd6b541ab91d13a0ef85c80463fec451681af9033af38974ccadcd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20798','GHBC-REQ-020798','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005317','Controlling elements normally regulate the application of either electrical or pneumatic energy.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bd16aa03f22863182e1774639879a6fa2dd79a45d25ed70b058e92578da5efe8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20799','GHBC-REQ-020799','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.5','GHBC-C-005317','Controllers are mainly of three types: thermostat, humidistats and pressure controllers.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bef2f2818b83140122c3586a3b72b9b1a15726ab6fc0a3c2698d79ce4e228d2f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20800','GHBC-REQ-020800','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','The following types of thermostats are in common use:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e8f27ceeadd6d26263b52a2d1d28944f4a0a203c51c0597c6f7826c90efb392c','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20801','GHBC-REQ-020801','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','a) The room type responds to room air temperature and is designed for mounting on a wall.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','02de9549de9d5081300f52403838cf2790cb24c5a76d43135e3830a69d3e44b0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20802','GHBC-REQ-020802','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','b) The insertion thermostats responds to the temperature of air in a duct and are designed for mounting on the outside of a duct with its measuring element extending into the air stream.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aaa0670492ffb36bb61663359694b20e72537ad20ba94fc5efedc2166dd5723c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20803','GHBC-REQ-020803','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','c)  The immersion type responds to the temperature of a fluid in a pipe or tank is designed for mounting on the outside of a pipe or tank with a fluid-tight connection to allow the measuring element to extend into the fluid.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2ff9351cc52f036c709d74dae04b7a1b28e836f7c3f306921bf9d21590bf6ba7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20804','GHBC-REQ-020804','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','d)  The remote bulb thermostat is used where the point of temperature measurement is some distance from the desired thermostat location, which may often be in a central panel.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e289c73a8309c87f0d317c84151ca463f1476685abb4730956035fb7847bc8c3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20805','GHBC-REQ-020805','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','A differential type employing two remote bulbs may be used to maintain a given temperature difference between two points.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4a48d3203d719ba0d2eeb32f26e0da747927161e35d4a5c588bb0c6daa92c7e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20806','GHBC-REQ-020806','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','e) The surface type is designed for mounting on a pipe or similar surface and measuring its temperature, or to give an approximate measurement of temperature of the fluid within the pipe.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','825cd5947982029481f5ad494fe5ee31f0449ab2c68f0dfa7d6baf78cd443a44','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20807','GHBC-REQ-020807','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','f) The day/night room thermostat is arranged to control at a reduce temperature at night, and may be changed from day to night operation at a remote point by hand or time clock, or from a time switch built into the thermostat itself.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c7a0fcee8a82c949dd6a8ea3407fb43eb61dd7de1200ba05bbaabc9d53c19a02','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20808','GHBC-REQ-020808','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','g) The heating/cooling thermostat can have its action reversed and, where required, its set points raised or lowered by remote control.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','098294e030825371b1b46a0a90186ddc17c13867e1ce9e34e2752ea7dd21b5a8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20809','GHBC-REQ-020809','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','This type of thermostat is used to actuate controlled devices, such as valves or dampers, that may regulate a heating medium at one time and cooling medium at another.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','03c9e9c65c42adb9b7d1f6dbc66c192a6cae33212472224971b5e5ce073c3060','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20810','GHBC-REQ-020810','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.6','GHBC-C-005318','h) The multi-step thermostat is arranged to operate in two or more successive steps.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f6dc67e8b4dc88cf55562c2da2efdeeb65d87ca14063c2fa40e92b818e58f29a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
