('rowid-20822','GHBC-REQ-020822','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','a) Valve types – The main type and their characteristics are summarized below:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2a0c1bf8f1734b156e7e7fee6c14a6ae576cfcf73dc51899e75c8a28d0c0ff39','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
