('rowid-20824','GHBC-REQ-020824','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','2) Double seated valves are designed so that the fluid pressure on the two discs is essential balanced, reducing the power required to operate; this type of valve does not provide a tight shut-off.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dc93f6ff57d0c2efdba9b11421637c89a60321965ccd6bf7c20114e7a115b4ac','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20825','GHBC-REQ-020825','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','3) Pipplot operated valves utilize the pressure difference between upstream and downstream sides to act upon a diaphragm or piston to move the valve, and are usually single seated, for two piston applications only, and used where large forces are required for valve operation.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3f464cd182f089a04f9ecde44c11aabdedde9022fcd6c42fc13268a8ac9f1467','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20826','GHBC-REQ-020826','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','4) Low flow valves may be as small as 3 mm port size and are used for accurate control of low flow rates.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"low valves may be as small as 3 mm port size and are used for ac"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1e41a8a7adf8d7baac4f7968765d0170f1c47e8eb36ebe01e30a3c3bde6f2d61','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20827','GHBC-REQ-020827','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','5) Three way mixing valves have two inlets and one outlet, and operate to vary the proportion of fluid entering each of the two inlets.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','133106522331d157535349717941e964474d8392bddf385bdc0a349996fb961b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20828','GHBC-REQ-020828','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','6) Three way diverting valves have one inlet and two outlets and operate to divert or proportion the inlet flow to either of the two outlets.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e90ae2faa0a04c94640d6f40d7f7323b1a7e57d1981748836b1143d0dbdea260','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20829','GHBC-REQ-020829','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','7) Two way modulating valves have one inlet and one outlet and operate to modulate or proportion the flow through the heat exchange equipment.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4a90a503f3b5b3074ae249ae383474d6c012247aedfe2149562479d22b1a3d1c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20830','GHBC-REQ-020830','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','8) Butterfly valves comprise a heavy ring enclosing a disc that rotates on an axis at or near its centre and may be used for shut-off where low differential pressures exist.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e0e0951f4c769da891db966b6a25cdd285b7f10753d37354d45ed0a11161a1e2','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20831','GHBC-REQ-020831','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','9) Special multi-port valves for various types of modulating/sequences operation are available for control of both hot and chilled water to three and four pipe fan coil and induction unit systems.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6b7192fd344e71aa8f9a438255e7d975554861b6546bc1ab4b313e3da69d0c8c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20832','GHBC-REQ-020832','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','b) Valve operators – Valve operators usually comprise an electric solenoid, electric motor, or pneumatic actuator, brief details of which are given below:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b780acf945be6711bc1d006109fa3e241d47f28a5c4e6ad434b7ed621fdcd04d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20833','GHBC-REQ-020833','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','1) A solenoid is a magnetic coil that operates a movable plunger to provide two-piston operation.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a7b6b245a6623565307f12320f25762cd100434e32cfc0f0c1b18054a462715a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20834','GHBC-REQ-020834','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','2) An electric motor is arranged to operate the valve stem through a gear train and linkage.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3ab36f5ec8e44036845c97706a32bdf2f27f43237c9ab96d42d8a9c4692f74fd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20835','GHBC-REQ-020835','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','Various types are available for different applications, such as:','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12fe0d46994882fbca8192abf4473f7c4b944592f632a9365e3dfd0429e9fadd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20836','GHBC-REQ-020836','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','i) An unidirectional motor is used for two position operation, the valve opening during one half revolution of the output shaft and closing  during the next half  revolution.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2e5d052e9a3055004d2fdec70dda37edfd6dff589bb2e9fa4c199a092a5e9833','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20837','GHBC-REQ-020837','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','ii) A spring return motor for two position control operation is energized electrically, driven to one position, and held there until the circuit is broken, when the spring returns the valves to its normal position.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f1574b58b1b11af087445ebda52560482ba41e5189f83ef61d2c09350c06b921','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20838','GHBC-REQ-020838','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','iii)  A reversible motor is used for floating or proportional operation and can run in either direction and stop in any position.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aaa1c81df5b7fcc9c37e4bbe38df11351dbe1853e06b898134bbf2248c4765e3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20839','GHBC-REQ-020839','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','3) A pneumatic actuator usually comprises a spring opposed flexible diaphragm or bellows connected to the valve stem, so that an increase in air pressure acts on the diaphragm or bellows to move the valve stem andcompress the spring.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bac89e03100f02b578a59814c4f01d2175c5ebe007e0fd16a39d916eaf54a490','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20840','GHBC-REQ-020840','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.1','GHBC-C-005322','When the air pressure is removed the spring will return the operator to its normal position.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ab0207cba4248a796438a9ac978dbd7610319255611520c920ad204e76fff765','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20841','GHBC-REQ-020841','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','Control dampers are designed to control the flow of air in a ductwork system in much the same as an automatic valve operates in a fluid circuit,that is by varying the resistance to flow.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','468fbad0c7d3ba100de42efe4dd02d42d1cc8ae8a8e4efef420c31bb2f2426a7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20842','GHBC-REQ-020842','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','Following are the details of various damper valves and damper operators:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29a8bd19ca0c43dff8776e2d4e7d74b38d02d8bf954c861bef1c51ffa97f9b73','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20843','GHBC-REQ-020843','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','a) Damper valves','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','63e32658d2a97c1618ff1ae119c6e4bae5ab04c53ccc7474bc0ea08b56c2c6ca','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20844','GHBC-REQ-020844','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','1) The single blade damper is generally restricted to small sizes since it does not provide accurate control.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','791cdd294b21268d4a6110bff3dc8e2cffaa25f7117fc4990c0ef5d029be269f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20845','GHBC-REQ-020845','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','When fitted in circular ductwork it may be referred to as a butterfly damper.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2a0bfd3ec255e836a29fb391a20be68e1f136f17ebaa8a3bb60b889609f8836','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20846','GHBC-REQ-020846','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','2) A multi-leaf damper is two or more blades linked together, which may be:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4c5c86e34f9bac556522fc378f38480af01f8ab673f33d1180a18cc7a3eb4040','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20847','GHBC-REQ-020847','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','i) parallel action multi-leaf damper, having its blades linked so that when operated they all rotate in the same direction;','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','21883351fc975a6ed0f91af9d2a5be38dc17377de220da327fda2f60b4a75aef','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20848','GHBC-REQ-020848','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','ii) An opposed action multi-leaf damper, having adjacent blades linked to rotate  in opposite directions when operated.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d0732620116b0f6b468e7609e791a98f72225b90c476e248c73d9728c21fc17a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20849','GHBC-REQ-020849','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','b) Damper operators','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','535e4cd13319a6cfaf4af92a0b097e9c04a318ec4e7f3511bafe02cce8418ccc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20850','GHBC-REQ-020850','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','These may be electric motors of the unidirectional, spring return or reversible type fitted with suitable linkage mechanisms, or may be  pneumatic actuators of a type designed for damper operation.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','efb0e9b0adf0c56fc0fcefcf13c98c6ff5f1fb5f489c7ec8eefb8fa1dc9629a6','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20851','GHBC-REQ-020851','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.2','GHBC-C-005323','29.2.11.5.2.9.3 Centralized control/monitoring equipment The centralized control system, which is shown diagrammatically in Fig.1, comprises three main parts: the remote location equipment, the transmission links and the central equipment.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a855d0dd6925e0a0a51251e43304c60afd637d56f1180e3869c94045a88856df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20852','GHBC-REQ-020852','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.4','GHBC-C-005324','This includes:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','adebd1539ce056a1794e4415329f038473b8ece64772f8b3199dfc5d896b48d2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20853','GHBC-REQ-020853','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.4','GHBC-C-005324','a)   input devices or sensors, which measure  the condition of a variable; b)   signal conditioning devices, which convert the sensor signal to a type compatible with the requirements of the remote panel, transmission system, or the central equipment; c) output devices, which provide a means for converting a command instruction, appearing at the remote panel, into a signal suitable for performing an operational function on external equipment; and d) remote data collection panels or remote enclosure, which act as termination points for the remote ends of the transmission links and for connection to the remote input and output devices.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0966becbd9575587823f32f60cd043f27d096734932267eed711c11c1faeb397','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20854','GHBC-REQ-020854','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.5','GHBC-C-005325','The transmission links provide the means for communication between the central equipment and the remote data collection panel and may be classified according to a number of variables, which include:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','034b851e4932c7fe9b599586b2cee2e51bf72f0fda0e2a194f08f3fefc411e44','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20855','GHBC-REQ-020855','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.5','GHBC-C-005325','a) medium (wires or cables, telephone lines, micro- wave); b) transmission mode (one direction only, one direction at time, etc); c) data sequence (series for 2-wire, parallel for multi-conductor etc); d)  wire or cable types; e)  signal types; and f) message format.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1834d68753ffcbfd7a3f88c2ca6ce17f6adfef4a8ff433f230ef678224855aa1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20856','GHBC-REQ-020856','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.5','GHBC-C-005325','Other considerations include the physical arrangement of the transmission system, security and supervisory aspect.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','116fdc4c4a1eb9199dc4f1f523b57b6b54543cd07ddabe7b159e237fd474b381','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20857','GHBC-REQ-020857','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.6','GHBC-C-005326','This may comprise: a) An interface, which provides a connection point and the signal conversion between the central processor and transmission links;','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1eefb6fb8f13e37a4d1e05620a3db08543617245a608149d0addb27f830a0736','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20858','GHBC-REQ-020858','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.6','GHBC-C-005326','b) The central processor, which is the collection of equipment at the central control room containing the logic for management of the centralized control and monitoring system; the processor has the means to receive, transmit and present information, with the ability to process all data in an orderly fashion, and may or may not include a computer;','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3e5ee2cfe2877f9c175d5da4d4496c2430e488490a652d79b1f9cf586eee2562','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20859','GHBC-REQ-020859','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.2.9.6','GHBC-C-005326','c)  Peripheral devices such as typewriters, printers, displays (digital type,  projectors,or cathode ray tubes, etc).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2b886efef2e8bad17fa93174a95a070023aeaef5b64dbdb847aedd56c994d0bd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20860','GHBC-REQ-020860','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.3.1','GHBC-C-005328','There are a number of factors to be considered in the selection of almost all control system components.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f649606c19796be8efe9417aacf18fc60d5258a42d8bfd745ac9f313ea7ec13a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-20861','GHBC-REQ-020861','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.3.1','GHBC-C-005328','These common factors include:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a115fc6f520241cb0829ece8ad151bf60cd1df82eefc1ca2f5d99a80a0a7ef0e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20862','GHBC-REQ-020862','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.3.1','GHBC-C-005328','a) supply and working electricity voltage, phase, frequency and number of wires; b) maximum and/or minimum temperatures, humidities or pressures to which components may be subjected; c) restrictions or location, mounting positions etc., or possible problems due to duct, vibration etc; d)  dimensions and mass; e) finish and type of enclosure; and required accessories or fittings. f)  required accessories or fittings.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1bc474c1c4b9dc30328b73623b2209ae33e2bff78e1d83cda654946bf3698f61','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20863','GHBC-REQ-020863','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.3.1','GHBC-C-005328','Note – These common factors, should only be used as a general guide, and control manufacturers should be consulted in establishing exact requirements.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7eb731752ff41d4107bf79b5eb1e5049db92493990519fe3458a4915861eef5d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20864','GHBC-REQ-020864','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.4','GHBC-C-005329','Sensing and measuring elements frequently form an integral part of a controller and the selection factors to be considered for this arrangement may be as given in Clause','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ff365d37be3e8566e156181adfcb13bf3cb169de0fd71eb853f1db24fee7e879','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20865','GHBC-REQ-020865','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.3.1','GHBC-C-005330','designed and arranged for operation with a remote controller and other components.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cbcacf8d8d3f8c566ede7229bf4e13394835c8f718fd979cec16a3f35439d0dc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20866','GHBC-REQ-020866','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.3.1','GHBC-C-005330','In that case some of the more important selection factors for temperature elements, for example, may be as follows:','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0e83824b12a23ffa5f365713d1951a98479fc6db517955efbdb8ce107a36e78d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-20867','GHBC-REQ-020867','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.2.11.5.3.1','GHBC-C-005330','a) control operations, for example reverse or direct-acting; b) sensing range, adjustable or nonadjustable; c) provision for air filter; d) pressure output; e) provision for branch pressure indication; f) application, for example room, duct or immersion in pipeline; g) application, for example room, duct immersion in pipeline; h) electronic; i) function, for example for primary or secondary control; j) temperature range; k) authority range of throttling range adjustment; l) nominal resistance and sensitivity; and m) provision for temperature indication.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dfcf7ed7f5708f318e3a45379cf5cbdd4d60b9e1de15e3a58b63525f224e80d8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
