('rowid-20933','GHBC-REQ-020933','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.3.1.6','GHBC-C-005353','Stationary local sources producing airborne particulates, heat, odors, fumes, spray, vapours, smoke or gases in such quantities as to be irritating or injurious to health shall be provided with an exhaust system or a means of collection and removal of the contaminants.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','539a05f13d851b637300cc176d49d373799612f80c92cf7a43eec805bf61fb4a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
