('rowid-21067','GHBC-REQ-021067','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.3.3.3.2.1','GHBC-C-005382','An outdoor air ventilation system consisting of a mechanical exhaust system, supply system or combination thereof shall be installed for each dwelling unit.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The outdoor air ventilation system is not required to operate continuously where the system has controls that enable operation for not less than 1 hour of each 4-hour period. The average outdoor airflow rate over the 4hour period shall be not less than that prescribed by Equation 29.3-9."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','32d48983a02fb04d3aa24f41a130ec0efd7dbf302dbb24d6638eb7452995e26f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21068','GHBC-REQ-021068','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.3.3.3.2.1','GHBC-C-005382','Local exhaust or supply systems, including outdoor air ducts connected to the return side of an air handler, are permitted to serve as such a system.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The outdoor air ventilation system is not required to operate continuously where the system has controls that enable operation for not less than 1 hour of each 4-hour period. The average outdoor airflow rate over the 4hour period shall be not less than that prescribed by Equation 29.3-9."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','acc853cbc3de7fc39e6c1744acf11dfd3b68f6d14b8e156a5ea42a23f86dfc13','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21069','GHBC-REQ-021069','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.3.3.3.2.1','GHBC-C-005382','The outdoor air ventilation system shall be designed to provide the required rate of outdoor air continuously during the period that the building is occupied.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The outdoor air ventilation system is not required to operate continuously where the system has controls that enable operation for not less than 1 hour of each 4-hour period. The average outdoor airflow rate over the 4hour period shall be not less than that prescribed by Equation 29.3-9."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f489b7c7f06a1c7bc2c6f838cfe38354a849f4b748186adf85c9f4a939102e59','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21070','GHBC-REQ-021070','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.3.3.3.2.1','GHBC-C-005382','The minimum continuous outdoor airflow rate shall be determined in accordance with Equation 29.39.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The outdoor air ventilation system is not required to operate continuously where the system has controls that enable operation for not less than 1 hour of each 4-hour period. The average outdoor airflow rate over the 4hour period shall be not less than that prescribed by Equation 29.3-9."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cf904b1c16b06e0cec7ce39bd530819859f2c88df5a2178aef9f5f0680c7a9a8','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
