('rowid-21102','GHBC-REQ-021102','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.1.1','GHBC-C-005399','For planning, the noise survey should examine all the possible causes of noise and consider the various factors causing actual nuisance.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','87619afe4a1c7da8e677f3bbcd8a1f9faaa3cc44fe00f9dc038bcbfac87e9544','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21103','GHBC-REQ-021103','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005400','of sleep, is more of nuisance than noise by day.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f274faebe86bcb4921507fff92be08480893014dbf5ab5fe83b9d80ce05cdd4b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21104','GHBC-REQ-021104','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005400','For this reason, housing colonies that adjoin areas with heavy traffic movement during the night are liable to cause serious complaints.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3517fa3b871ce25d339bf1c7253c3dc6c433b4a596d044dbe5e8b7edbd4bb81b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21105','GHBC-REQ-021105','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005400','Also, the factories that work by night are liable to cause serious complaints if housing estates adjoin them.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ed3bddfd69d329d2d46836692a939261390b8f23b0a49d2ff4c68de2da952f2d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21106','GHBC-REQ-021106','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005400','While planning, care should be taken that housing colonies are adequately setback from busy airports, state and national highways, factories, main railway lines and marshalling yards.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d40c78efe00927c3d109e75d443fa733cd798e06d81f77a943561ddeb10021c8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21107','GHBC-REQ-021107','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.1.3','GHBC-C-005401','by planning.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ca12b4bf30a3e2e514e88594cf4a6fc4dfe70d2714b38003c5468d06beeada31','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21108','GHBC-REQ-021108','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.1.3','GHBC-C-005401','The first is to plan so as to keep the noise at a distance.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b3240e0cf0378936216741836becf1812d0454f100f3ce8dff8490fd9576809a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21109','GHBC-REQ-021109','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.1.3','GHBC-C-005401','Under this aspect comes the separation of housing from traffic noise by interposing buffer zones, and the protection of schools and hospitals by green belts, public gardens, etc. The second is the principle of shading or screening.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fe75e5b6de950db6c7330b89b33a3092d566431bb066f567b429e64ec9e87fca','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21110','GHBC-REQ-021110','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.1.3','GHBC-C-005401','This consists of deliberately interposing a less vulnerable building to screen a more vulnerable one or by providing a solid barrier, such as a wall, between the source and the location to be protected.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c37a05a69a042677eff14891b66ec18d4aa21c42287f0ac5ad54194edf270a56','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
