('rowid-21142','GHBC-REQ-021142','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005405','NOTE – The values are applicable to free flowing traffic without honking.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','85da9097b7a9d19a94c9efda86d294a72fe418f5318a91b2749abd60cbf4a17a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21143','GHBC-REQ-021143','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.3','GHBC-C-005406','The outdoor noise regulations in force from time-to-time shall be complied with this Code.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e80a979cba5cc9f281b79c17cd39191560448d754d996eabbd2f107b20a14402','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21144','GHBC-REQ-021144','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1','GHBC-C-005408','a) Flyover noise – Flyover noise is that which occurs under flight paths close to airports and is the most serious and common problem.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','70ff3aee4a0ac5428bd0bf4bc93e9ec2cd71fac8b45fec4eab7bee9949db7e25','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21145','GHBC-REQ-021145','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1','GHBC-C-005408','As the aircraft passes overhead the noise level at any particular location rises to a peak and then decreases. b) Ground noise – The noise emitted by an aircraft during ground operations is less variable in direction than flyover noise, but is usually of a longer duration.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ef0ddd78fd3843bb154bd6cf77bb3b6f2672353431cc591806b5ad06aa2db154','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21146','GHBC-REQ-021146','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005409','rest and communication, and as such may be considered potentially harmful to health.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','abcca5aa916e2220f0dc28f61343d63e1f12c4a3ba76beef8960656a55c19b6d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21147','GHBC-REQ-021147','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005409','It is important that no new development is carried out within areas where the expected noise levels will cause mental and physical fatigue or permanent loss of hearing.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','448b3d29199e51c191d8de20d8814bafc6e3d437d247a91b6e4823af5a9998e2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21148','GHBC-REQ-021148','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.1','GHBC-C-005409','In case development in such areas is essential, adequate sound insulation shall be provided for the building.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f8ed46807eb6541853e08fb91e88a001e280536e55ede1c16663c8fabdfb74d4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21149','GHBC-REQ-021149','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.2','GHBC-C-005410','As the problems caused by aircraft noise have become more acute, a number of methods have been devised for evaluating noise exposure in the vicinity of airports.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','11437f72a0e32493c536c18f619dde982a40504e2123a5bf35a50c2f939cf209','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21150','GHBC-REQ-021150','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.2','GHBC-C-005410','They all combine many factors into a single number evaluation.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','045c14764fea0be6d725e3c717d45da4cc5ea382d32c197137adb00e7f74d880','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21151','GHBC-REQ-021151','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.2','GHBC-C-005410','A commonly used criterion is the noise exposure forecast (NEF).','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8731c7613c7c4bd4cdd2e7a0fa499dea02a75785fa726cf732a460a96a87d956','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21152','GHBC-REQ-021152','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.2','GHBC-C-005410','The NEF is used primarily to develop noise contours for areas around airports.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','57044e4175a063cc294418e6afa988726b19b77260976bcc5c464d10d6c4ea83','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21153','GHBC-REQ-021153','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.2','GHBC-C-005410','It has been accepted generally that noise exposure forecast levels greater than NEF 40 are unacceptable to people while levels less than NEF 25 are normally acceptable.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2381605b172d336cb30e4352bb629ddee3b2d02ad16ef29d0e4587cfe6a9974c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21154','GHBC-REQ-021154','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.3','GHBC-C-005411','While it is theoretically possible to provide sufficient insulation to achieve an acceptable indoor noise environment in the area of very high outdoor noise, there is a level above which aircraft noise seriously affects living conditions no matter how much sound insulation has been applied to the dwelling unit.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b1070f62cd5131ac93220e15d06395e3b13fbc13efff33359da6aafcc77d8e30','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21155','GHBC-REQ-021155','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.3','GHBC-C-005411','For this reason it is','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6a23f4fd77da519dd5f6f2b35a0fb82713cdbf83a912d2ce0c09cc8df1db8d87','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21156','GHBC-REQ-021156','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.3','GHBC-C-005411','recommended that no residential development be allowed beyond the NEF 35 level.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":35,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"ent be allowed beyond the NEF 35 level."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b49aff8aa5b51335a3c3cc8cdb9717fce8610bf9a81f2e93b438e287ceeb9ee3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21157','GHBC-REQ-021157','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.4','GHBC-C-005412','During summer months, the windows are normally kept open for adequate ventilation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1d131cd6356c06ca3481e82d2f7192393e114af7ac401087900e7995f4ab2d45','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21158','GHBC-REQ-021158','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.4','GHBC-C-005412','In view of this, no matter how much sound insulation is provided for the building structure, the noise level inside the room can never be less than 10 dB below the outdoor noise level.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":10,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":" inside the room can never be less than 10 dB below the outdoor noise le"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','73bf5559cb95dcc12d37f85d63ee9ac1293d2cf6e05be02dc688e85fd13765a8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21159','GHBC-REQ-021159','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.4','GHBC-C-005412','For very critical buildings, such as buildings necessary for maintaining and supplementing the airport services, and for commercial development, such as hotels, it is possible to provide sealed windows and to centrally air-condition the entire building.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cad065e713978a074878beb531aa4b8952a45b54a72c5c6a1a45474e5592d771','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21160','GHBC-REQ-021160','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.4','GHBC-C-005412','However, it is not feasible for most of the residential developments in the country.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a078b8cdb206793261c3c7c0b2aadd6822313f94954b15470ff6ecfb3efe25ff','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21161','GHBC-REQ-021161','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.1.4','GHBC-C-005412','In such cases proper zoning regulations and sitting of vulnerable buildings away from aircraft noise re of vital importance.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ce1bf5bf3e48f97a0e26748efd7f41840946a5ce620051e0d879e960a25c0377','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21162','GHBC-REQ-021162','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2','GHBC-C-005413','This is a very serious source of noise in builtup areas, both by day and by night.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5de6044f4ff6d179e31b0fe2a97adac40646352ec479fd0aa471fe4121837279','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21163','GHBC-REQ-021163','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2','GHBC-C-005413','Railway cuttings reduce the spread of noise, whereas embankments extend it.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e798ad0aeed17342e3bd87a162f6c404468a9474768a6159ecb026e0061f1883','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21164','GHBC-REQ-021164','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2','GHBC-C-005413','The elevated railway on viaducts or embankment is very common in built-up areas.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d18d4448c63881f5e2369c03686c7e5b15c39f044054bc672a9d4824e7f1ec78','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21165','GHBC-REQ-021165','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2','GHBC-C-005413','The elevation increases exposure to noise but in addition the construction of the viaduct may affect the propagation of noise.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8a0c651cf94795cb7c8df53197e595b71ea46ffd700ded18df7fa1bd3a597b9f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21166','GHBC-REQ-021166','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2','GHBC-C-005413','In this respect solid embankments are preferable to built-up arches, which tend to act as sound boxes.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d53fe5b2b949715f592fc4bd791e4fdc7496efea9c72fe1a0ba9c504fbf029dd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21167','GHBC-REQ-021167','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2','GHBC-C-005413','Worst of all are the steel bridges, which greatly magnify the noise due to vibration.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6f6430b8497b5957412fb068938a7ca7cb64d40f0112a9e48c3819a93becf876','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21168','GHBC-REQ-021168','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2','GHBC-C-005413','Uphill gradients are another feature tending to increase noise, especially of heavy goods trains.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a7aef553b7a5473943106a2c83e09987993c35dfde8d1abc6c94d852006037a6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21169','GHBC-REQ-021169','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005414','or public building zone should abut onto railway lines, especially in the marshalling yards which are particularly objectionable because of the shrill, clanging and intermittent noise they generate, often at night.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4287895febdd501ac01af50d9e989627f57a79a6f220cda04c6921ff54c70405','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21170','GHBC-REQ-021170','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005414','The appropriate zones alongside railway lines are industrial and commercial buildings other than office buildings.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2e65674a9c3c1d601b5eb3bcbbbaa1eabbb50d4c1160b267a3178d5bbbb5aec','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21171','GHBC-REQ-021171','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005414','Where these precautions are not practicable and housing has to abut on to railway lines, every attempt may be made to house as few people as possible in the vicinity of the railway lines.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ee0b470fd0132b99a1120ad4c090b32d187c506af2322038b3b538ed0210479','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21172','GHBC-REQ-021172','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005414','29.4.2.4.2.2 Underground transportation system can be a major cause of disturbance for the neigbouring community.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7a4bb899bb79d1b4c1236272b9ea14436ce2a9759050011fd657ba833177c571','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21173','GHBC-REQ-021173','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005414','Very high noise levels are propagated to long distances by the underground high speed railway, as a result of wheel rail interaction.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c5b94fb31f131b5f7ee5dfc93e60e54a41119e4ed409d14bb0499cbbefa61ff7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21174','GHBC-REQ-021174','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005414','Both air-borne','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dc5c04ba837e49e5955ec393a1fa3ac3946dd8268718059917c04f690ef9ee85','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21175','GHBC-REQ-021175','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005414','noise and ground or structure-borne vibration are potential sources of complaints.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a15b8171c85a053af7357c0ca884357537db17d47c1db7fe839f916391f5cfa2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21176','GHBC-REQ-021176','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.2.1','GHBC-C-005414','Noise control measures, therefore, need to be considered for the following: a) In station, where high noise levels are produced at the arrival and departure of trains; b) In tunnels, during high speed train movement; c) where an underground rail transit system passes close to existing structures or high rise buildings adequate attention should also be paid to the problem of ground vibration transmitted to the building, and proper isolation should be provided for critical areas; d) Wherever elevated railway tracks are provided, adequate measures should be taken to avoid the spread of noise in the surrounding built up areas; and e) In transit cars, where sound insulation is of vital importance to provide comfortable conditions for the comments.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d6ba7791438605fbf8c0e3315ba761220fcfa0e2992c5ed967704666e1e7956e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21177','GHBC-REQ-021177','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.1','GHBC-C-005416','trucks at night moving past through built-up areas cause serious noise complaints.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','55e1f4a0d853d8508b243ce8878709c2e3d2da82b9193d0a10e936e5d2ac20ac','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21178','GHBC-REQ-021178','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.1','GHBC-C-005416','On busy roads, the noise of continuous traffic may be a worse nuisance than that of railways.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4190caead59b3cea916ea7fada748186a18465bffbca40af6e65a943d2e586d9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21179','GHBC-REQ-021179','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.1','GHBC-C-005416','At least the same precautions may, therefore, be taken in the planning of dwellings in relation to arterial and trunk roads as with railways.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ff1ff5eaf0ab18fc6bdab46258c406a50450483ab0805083d5f86a98ab99ba5b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21180','GHBC-REQ-021180','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.1','GHBC-C-005416','Care may be taken that local housing roads do not provide short cuts for heavy traffic trough residential areas.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','acf40dfa1aa38ef184f6ee2dfe36b25d7ec203ac3e9bab3060121b10c4288a88','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21181','GHBC-REQ-021181','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.1','GHBC-C-005416','Hilly roads present the additional noise of gear changing.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a89a2d7b2d794caf2e8106c58c8d0c69308eff1908dd7a96e753bf3d9850a2e5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21182','GHBC-REQ-021182','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.1','GHBC-C-005416','Trees with heavy foliage planted on both sides of carriageway help slightly to muffle the noise, provided the foliage extends for a considerable distance (30m or above).','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" for a considerable distance (30m or above)."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','737febf0d66ad279ffe79d995735c6bbfbe228fff0d274d99ad4c6d52adfe25d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21183','GHBC-REQ-021183','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.2','GHBC-C-005417','Road traffic may give rise to serious nuisance particularly on busy thorough fares, between continuous high buildings in main streets, at the traffic lights, near bus stops, on steep slopes and in parking spaces and enclosed yards.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a46acb6cebd815587722d6e7c9b4ed760165ac0984232c228ff3556186dcd010','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21184','GHBC-REQ-021184','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.3','GHBC-C-005418','buildings in urban areas it is recommended','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5d692ea2f784c071348b9f67256a71933e7e913394cbe27dea72083fa52870c7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21185','GHBC-REQ-021185','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.3','GHBC-C-005418','that external LA10 is limited to a maximum of 70 dB (A) when the dwellings are proposed to have sealed windows and 60 dB (A) when the dwellings are proposed to have open windows.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":70,"unit":null,"operator":"maximum of","context":"external LA10 is limited to a maximum of 70 dB (A) when the dwellings are"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4241d0a40aafd5181abdad86588c4fa27a7a0a32fba8908e35729b828829870b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21186','GHBC-REQ-021186','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.3','GHBC-C-005418','Indeed it is desirable to confine major new residential development to locations subject to LA10 levels substantially lower than those given above.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"ent to locations subject to LA10 levels substantially lower than"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a04bf4cd4135847a45eefa9b60263a95e5e9615eebfbb5b88677a8b6a9c1f85c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21187','GHBC-REQ-021187','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.3','GHBC-C-005418','It is recognized, however, that within the large urban areas, the use of sites where the external LA10 is greater than 60-70 dB(a) cannot always be avoided.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','43219108af9b097c2b9441f66dbcb5788b1500b0edc041ec0cce551b8aef548c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21188','GHBC-REQ-021188','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.3','GHBC-C-005418','In that case it is suggested to utilize such design solutions as barrier blocks in order to reduce external LA10 noise levels to at least 60-70 dB(A) at any point 1.0m from any inward looking façade.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":60,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"external LA10 noise levels to at least 60-70 dB(A) at any point 1.0m fr"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"east 60-70 dB(A) at any point 1.0m from any inward looking façad"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d8b5d8c18a87d486a181677833ac703081a5b1cba91675151463d687b86b3f25','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21189','GHBC-REQ-021189','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.3','GHBC-C-005418','When the orientation of site and the density of development are such that this cannot be fully achieved some form of dwelling insulation will have to be provided.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9a5129889ca33ef3b2b16f72e907cc2cf360840114b0285abb91204d0de44aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21190','GHBC-REQ-021190','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.3','GHBC-C-005418','It should be appreciated that where open windows are a must, the occupants would have to put up with discomfort if the above conditions are not met.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cbb08babec958f3ead5860f25398fd1c59e5b543c5362ed7956240258065e081','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21191','GHBC-REQ-021191','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.4','GHBC-C-005419','be utilized to provide economical and effective protection from noise: a) Methods may be adopted to improve the smoothness of flow and reduce number of stopping and starting.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e86c7e99a63f4e2c76105fb81324b8d7c11f70cd8b308b4787d709d53405b968','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21192','GHBC-REQ-021192','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.4','GHBC-C-005419','This leads to an improvement even if it leads to increased flows.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d3246f9c6be70e8dfe6b2406ac8b2768dfd72338389dd09812cb5e89e50575d1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21193','GHBC-REQ-021193','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.4','GHBC-C-005419','Flow linking of traffic lights, for example, may reduce noise nuisance. b) Use of roads passing through residential areas may be prohibited to heavy commercial vehicles.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5b9b4563167e05965cb5b71c56426c2c3e5c8857f7cebaeb1d291cc078c3641f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21194','GHBC-REQ-021194','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.4.3.4','GHBC-C-005419','An alternative would be to limit use by commercial vehicles to certain times of the day. c) Use of honking may be prohibited near sensitive buildings, such as hospitals and the like. d) Barriers may be provided to shield sites from noise.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8b1575eb6ad1c69b493230afe003f376d3bc2a3fd0edc644de8ef11d041f6572','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21195','GHBC-REQ-021195','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.5','GHBC-C-005420','The zoning of the different cities shall be done by the town planning authorities, taking into account besides other aspects, the noise levels from different occupancies.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fd0039c5a0b1f57257e5e902c48b058111e42521bb144789381ea033663c3c94','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21196','GHBC-REQ-021196','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.5','GHBC-C-005420','Wherever necessary, experts in the field may be consulted.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0abc80647047f58eb008de3f5e2eca893cd872f1c734fff1e528ab52d4f60c4b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21197','GHBC-REQ-021197','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.6','GHBC-C-005421','Where relief from noise is to be provide by means of green belts these may be of considerable width and be landscaped.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3eed25f6811b7ae2c70ee88ffb607bc04ba519fb00f22b3c41c8a6fb9f40837b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21198','GHBC-REQ-021198','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.6','GHBC-C-005421','(In case of railway tracks, a minimum distance of 50 m to 70 m may be provided between the buildings and the tracks).','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"tracks, a minimum distance of 50 m to 70 m may be provided betwe"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":70,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"a minimum distance of 50 m to 70 m may be provided between the b"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','baedfb79bc46110e68230383fc49a5f130bfb7ab758d4470bab61512e623a96f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21199','GHBC-REQ-021199','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.6','GHBC-C-005421','The extent of relief that may be derived from the above may be estimated only after considering other environmental factors.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4caa4dc03d4254e5c0b2151ae4d577b80c1cf93e4e858c4227b8e8b7f06a24fd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21200','GHBC-REQ-021200','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.6','GHBC-C-005421','Only thick belts of planting (greater than 30m) are of real value.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"lts of planting (greater than 30m) are of real value."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ce72ebe11fb019a4143c8c9c7abdbd00cbdd2e950128aa97faa4f195058b3e0e','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21201','GHBC-REQ-021201','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.6','GHBC-C-005421','Strong leafy trees may be planted to act as noise baffles.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2fcad7b62a8188efba9c02abaac827ca3145d17312baa3d8b4560f22934e9e2e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21202','GHBC-REQ-021202','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.6','GHBC-C-005421','Shrubs or creepers may also be planted for additional protection between tree trunks; artificial mounds and banks should be formed where practicable.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ba8d071ff58bcb75d24a515ee1969bde9d6d35f22241c2a6f942fa1cd436a035','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21203','GHBC-REQ-021203','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.6','GHBC-C-005421','As little hard paving and as much grass as possible may be used.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ba8dc7420e97fec6d04ded4c0e453885eddb084f29f172f7dfcdadbb917a8c71','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21204','GHBC-REQ-021204','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.6','GHBC-C-005421','The creation of green belt is particularly advisable on the perimeter of aerodromes, along railway lines and arterial roads, through or past built-up areas and adjoining noisy industrial zones.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d8921cbff8cf1fc8ed70c3ab625b1a031e41ccf886dfe5ca69c8dac8ec6808dd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21205','GHBC-REQ-021205','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.7','GHBC-C-005422','Barriers are often the most effective means of reducing traffic noise around residential areas.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e6abcdb6ce95eedde3aa210aadf8f1300a81a7c205f473a573ca3240c6fddae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21206','GHBC-REQ-021206','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.7','GHBC-C-005422','They have the great advantage that they generally protect most or all of the sites.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c42beb87abd1a70a2f440432ec0d53da3330e9ad68e4318301b67ad1094b42e6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21207','GHBC-REQ-021207','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.7','GHBC-C-005422','In nearly all situations, a well-designed barrier of even a modest height (say 3m) can at least ensure that all areas of open space are free from excessive noise levels.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" of even a modest height (say 3m) can at least ensure that all"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5674e7424b35888a0c6dcc34719d218eb427c1c8ce64165e5548cb6a14f2cc75','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21208','GHBC-REQ-021208','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.7','GHBC-C-005422','There are two types of barriers that can be built to protect sites; one which are built solely for the purpose of reducing noise and two, which form part of the building complex (barrier blocks).','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7275d2d16fdae55885b78792ff243f5684a9401ea30391d502b07981e5269259','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21209','GHBC-REQ-021209','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.7','GHBC-C-005422','Free standing walls and artificial mounds are typical examples of the first type while single and multi-storeyed dwellings and/or garages are the most common form of the second.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','40afe01df7352291969fd9f094b4438a1e64ec90ede3e11ca512c66994e17cfb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21210','GHBC-REQ-021210','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.7','GHBC-C-005422','Of the two types, barrier blocks are more widely used because they are cheaper and also tend to form a more effective barrier overall because of their greater height and width.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4252d72a9b8087f4442b79b6981f81a6edb339f31c19ccc390a7e07c01dc4ca6','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21211','GHBC-REQ-021211','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.7','GHBC-C-005422','Barrier walls or mounds are more limited in their effect than barrier blocks for they protect little more than the area of the site close to ground level essentially because of the lack of height, as continuous walls much higher than 3m are often difficult to construct.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"inuous walls much higher than 3m are often difficult to constr"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f02c3c69ce35651c845f2ec5fc9db06748f0f6e79aa556f28106a6e54649fdd4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21212','GHBC-REQ-021212','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.8','GHBC-C-005423','Advice The purpose of noise control is to ensure that people are neither harmed nor disturbed by noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','162a20463251a32456ead3849e39bfcbf742f368b2d7f2dc92fb75368a9fcc13','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21213','GHBC-REQ-021213','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.2.8','GHBC-C-005423','In addition to provisions given in this Clause, special advice may be required for more complex situations, such as those listed in Annex E.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f45cbcb33fbb86e7076c2d2e3c98b86e966740a26e6403d52bb27bd5a88bde48','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
