('rowid-21288','GHBC-REQ-021288','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.4.2.3.3','GHBC-C-005447','Openings are the major cause of penetration of noise through a barrier.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','607c2053865e366eaef13397521ee13bafafb6312eeb3553602e3d90f9afef82','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21289','GHBC-REQ-021289','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.4.2.3.3','GHBC-C-005447','While designing it should be borne in mind that all components should provide a sound transmission compatible with that of the rest of the barrier so that an equivalent amount of sound energy is transmitted through each portion of the barrier.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','69772e28b6b807c91910db7c54f0eabbadcc119089b723ad97cf3cc8c4f43f3b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
