('rowid-21293','GHBC-REQ-021293','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.4.2.3.3','GHBC-C-005447','All doors and windows should be properly gasketed where a high degree of sound insulation is desired.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2b76fa64a81da947f5c1d64c7492ef96881050ac5fa400b389ba3fcd40dd6ca6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
