('rowid-21295','GHBC-REQ-021295','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.4.2.3.5','GHBC-C-005449','The floor of a room immediately above the bedroom or living room shall provide impact sound pressure level (L‘n‘Tw) not greater than 60 dB.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":60,"unit":null,"operator":"not greater than","context":"sound pressure level (L‘n‘Tw) not greater than 60 dB."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7010545ac196f8f3381b524909b01f06368cac2383e6f75cac6e3bb41500fba7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21296','GHBC-REQ-021296','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.4.2.3.5','GHBC-C-005449','For example, 150 mm thick concrete floor with (12mm) thick carpet covering would satisfy this requirement.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"For example, 150 mm thick concrete floor with (12"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":12,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"mm thick concrete floor with (12mm) thick carpet covering would "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7b01bab9e89f7b27ab021fa70af21478e1b069013497577d0d2b4edf76283f27','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21297','GHBC-REQ-021297','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.4.2.3.6','GHBC-C-005450','are often highly reverberant.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d32f62c93765341a2a03187568816ebc7e758d8eac795c565f9053ed3a4de43a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21298','GHBC-REQ-021298','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.4.2.3.6','GHBC-C-005450','Some of the surfaces at least (for example, the soffits of stairs and landings) should be finished with sound absorbent materials wherever required.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','912edb49ed9bba41ca20921679e2e461a3fe76122c94e93d0da47bd08d5ac4ec','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21299','GHBC-REQ-021299','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.1.1','GHBC-C-005453','The outdoor sources of noise produced on school premises, which cause disturbances within the school, include the noise arising from playground, playing fields and open-air swimming pools.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fd4632ead04f0aa63734df0fe61febde9fa08b72145fca3670c7dbed75ef34f6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21300','GHBC-REQ-021300','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.1.1','GHBC-C-005453','Though playgrounds are used mainly during break periods, they are also used for games, physical education and at times when teaching is in progress in the adjoining class rooms.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','107553f17c1b9b6abf07f30b18ae890e7ecf30a3e2acad62672bdbc502ac5d48','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21301','GHBC-REQ-021301','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.1.2','GHBC-C-005454','Indoor sources of noise are as follows: a) Singing, instrumental and reproduced music which may take place in class rooms and in dinning and assembly halls particularly in primary schools.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','670eb025e113a6c557fb7073d854f357d8d41c489ea90361cc3d009fd54e8de1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21302','GHBC-REQ-021302','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.1.2','GHBC-C-005454','In secondary schools, specialized music rooms are generally provided: b) The movement of chairs, desks and tables at the end of one period may disturb a class engaged in a lesson in a room below; c) The shutting and openings of doors and windows which may occur at any time during teaching periods;','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6cbef8fc43ae986e917b791f0ac9cbcc6ef7ef7d9ea64cc821722933f7b42d8e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21303','GHBC-REQ-021303','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.1.2','GHBC-C-005454','d) Audio-visual presentations in class rooms; e) Wood and metal workshops, machine shops (engineering laboratories), typing rooms, etc. which produce continuous or intermittent sound of considerable loudness; f) Practical work carried out in general teaching areas; g) Gymnasia and swimming pools; h) School kitchens and dining spaces where food preparation and the handling of crockery and utensils persist for the greater part of the school day; corridors and other circulation spaces; and i) Plumbing and mechanical services.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','abea103b5ba94c2d56aa16198dfb990c7219a5ef4f510d696161136a9263891b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21304','GHBC-REQ-021304','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005456','Where outdoor noise nuisance exists from local industry, busy roads, railway, airfields, sport grounds or other sources beyond the control of the school authority, school buildings should be sited as far as possible from the sources of noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3fca1f658f337ba4c7e0d269f25270b8886989004dae74cca8280e30ddfeadc1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21305','GHBC-REQ-021305','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.1','GHBC-C-005456','29.4.5.2.1.1Rooms should be planned in a manner so that the minimum amount of glazing is placed on the side facing the external noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be3ecb83d58c509f540659ce73a3fa4d03942f93be03531ccf7e84f8374aec62','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21306','GHBC-REQ-021306','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005457','of a school and from the use of the buildings after school hours may contribute a nuisance to occupants of surrounding property, therefore, it is desirable to place playgrounds, workshops, swimming pools, music rooms, assembly halls and gymnasia as far away as possible from buildings which require a quite environment.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f51effbeef7ad9b77036a0612f4a0edd89c7b79dbaab080f38e1a02e7968e886','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21307','GHBC-REQ-021307','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','The following principles should be observed in the detailed planning of educational buildings:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f9bd2f5edb56e9a771f378e09a524dcf3b34262b332b68134c39570a616360c1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21308','GHBC-REQ-021308','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','a) Grouping – Noisy rooms should be separated from quite ones, if possible.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b8ef6be346a5558191300f4ccba4ef1bba6dfef75efdc2f537f15e800dcd515c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21309','GHBC-REQ-021309','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','In general, it is desirable that rooms should be grouped','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6002d730cd1cb87a3523c42f6e15d8c79a129db4edc7daea308ce8a540f624aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21310','GHBC-REQ-021310','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','together in accordance with the classification given in 29.4.5.2.4.1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa8053c6292522ebe69570ce165c665b00a5fa506e9c750241955b2e5524dce3','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21311','GHBC-REQ-021311','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','b) Windows and ventilators – Windows of noisy and quiet rooms should not open to the same courtyard or be near to one another.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fe4fb9b3405a2adc316be4717fd5c299ed11e0621103af21706f7e1b4371d281','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21312','GHBC-REQ-021312','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','Roof lights and ventilators over noisy rooms should be avoided, if they are likely to be a source of nuisance to adjacent upper floors.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ac5b9f0b8e06742d02369e97b772a06898b52eb16cff5c6c39ed4dedd4f76962','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21313','GHBC-REQ-021313','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','c) Doors – Swing doors into rooms should only be used where no problem of sound transmission exists.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d10938a6f13b3c58ce32c739d5dc8ec4cba0b862480d3ffa606785130a8fdcf1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21314','GHBC-REQ-021314','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','Reduction of insulation between rooms and corridors due to doors must be borne in mind.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1cc90cfa8ed5b15cb61066462e42cec2f4f142cf46d340007b4f3830440e7756','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21315','GHBC-REQ-021315','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','The type and method of fitting of doors is important and necessary care shall be paid in this respect.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4df729de654868f59e14e8b7a8994b44dfe466b1400ab116995b6c477fb5828f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21316','GHBC-REQ-021316','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','d) Sliding partitions should only be used where essential.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','de0c60e15212f96de8f82abd851a5e0fd15b116d7c3476e830e9727ae77767f9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21317','GHBC-REQ-021317','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','e) Opening planning and circulation areas – Where open planning is used to permit spaces, such as assembly halls, dining rooms or entrance halls to be used in association with each other or for circulation, the degree of disturbance caused by interfering noise to teaching areas needs careful consideration; traffic through such areas should be strictly controlled; full use should be made of sound absorbent treatments to reduce the spread of noise from one space to another (see 29.4.5.2.3).','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d6a299b80c2773972fc6235ddf0c95ce51e3758de41ef31c54588b5468995d76','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21318','GHBC-REQ-021318','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','If rooms have large glazed panels or ventilation openings facing directly on the circulation areas, human traffic passing by the rooms should be controlled.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f10304a785416572c3bb69099e751350b37bdfc857e741b3be19b868ddd701be','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21319','GHBC-REQ-021319','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','Preferably baffled ventilation system or double windows should be used.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','67a53816ef7b51234cb7ddb64de61ca5b3d718dc4e20e7e918ed532c225d8eb8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21320','GHBC-REQ-021320','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','(Fan-lights over doors should be fixed and glazed).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','956796ee8bffaf3f2339e90b1f833d98f5a94b56610a446584968478de1cde9d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21321','GHBC-REQ-021321','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005458','f) Furniture – In all educational buildings, regardless of the character of the floor finish, rubber buffers should be fitted to the legs of chairs and tables.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','044f5cc30dc73e82d71e892caf095e7859bff3f0827762d040fdbcfb0ded44b9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21322','GHBC-REQ-021322','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005459','Sound absorbent materials play a useful part in reducing the built-up or air-borne noise at source.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','887702a46181662b85571a61812bd1451759b44ad80c0c1b07002c80fc557ec0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21323','GHBC-REQ-021323','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005459','In rooms, such as, classrooms, assembly halls and music rooms, a fairly short reverberation time under occupied conditions is one of the requirements of the acoustic design.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0b6864672f56d86824173465c729659de93b8e4e0022c79de76cbf6bdf513ca5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21324','GHBC-REQ-021324','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005459','The maximum reverberation times permissible for this purpose are usually short enough to give adequate noise control but in addition, the reverberation time should not be excessive under empty conditions, because noise may occur in these rooms with very few occupants.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4078701265599be66e9c22f93408f8b4b73cd98e95bbf317df4eab78def00e00','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21325','GHBC-REQ-021325','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005459','Table 6 gives the reverberation times often arranged in occupied rooms for acoustic reasons and the maximum times recommended in the empty rooms for noise reduction; the times given are for a frequency of 500 Hz, but they should not be greatly exceeded at any frequency.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":500,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":" given are for a frequency of 500 Hz, but they should not be grea"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8732971d4dce44c496d625e05eb22a8adec17887ad1a429185b0f9af2aa42184','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21326','GHBC-REQ-021326','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005459','When rooms are used for a variety of purposes, the reverberation period appropriate to the major use should be adopted.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4aae61e498873bdb985134a394dbadce768cf6e5e123c3f9de58e4d62eb67916','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21327','GHBC-REQ-021327','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.3.1','GHBC-C-005460','to noise reduction in schools for the deaf and schools for the blind.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','67f4eddbc1edf37cfe3d78a75641377dd6c825977cea1f9f8d68019336f274c0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21328','GHBC-REQ-021328','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.3.1','GHBC-C-005460','Deaf children are taught by means of hearing aids which cannot be used satisfactorily in high noise levels or in reverberant conditions.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','99da6c92830070e2354876f91f67da5606a61f3aa0a92052ad59fb563c584c73','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21329','GHBC-REQ-021329','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.3.1','GHBC-C-005460','Blind children depend on good hearing for understanding speech and for detecting changes in environment.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','62079070435784869e696c01bd44c2c1297b3858b2059ea83f79c2e316e2e5f7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21330','GHBC-REQ-021330','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.3.1','GHBC-C-005460','In both these types of schools, noise levels should be kept low and reverberation times short.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d9b240e607e4658f565cacd480c37a51967403f693088d7fa58a80004b030108','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
