('rowid-21352','GHBC-REQ-021352','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.4.3','GHBC-C-005463','d) The problem of noise in circulation areas is as a rule greatly mitigated in schools by the fact that classes usually change rooms together at regular times.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 45"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6d656efcd6d0741d705fe7e6cc8c86655236f88930fb23a53e99ca4c348377ee','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21353','GHBC-REQ-021353','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.4.3','GHBC-C-005463','In colleges and evening institutes, however, this is much less true and in such buildings particular attention should be paid to insulation between rooms and corridors.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 45"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','10ad6561051392fa628dae757d89392c3aef303d218ad2b2e1b00eef8060e267','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21354','GHBC-REQ-021354','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.4.5','GHBC-C-005464','A new concept in school planning is the use of a large teaching area with simultaneous instructions imparted to several groups of students.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','11794b305ce2354c191f917473c3491abf2abcd707ebd7d1210133bf49393419','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21355','GHBC-REQ-021355','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.4.5','GHBC-C-005464','These open plan teaching areas offer a different set of problems.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','961d5110b4d341140b0ed878cb00ac6b0166eefe899e0e99ade68327ae41e4ae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21356','GHBC-REQ-021356','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.4.5','GHBC-C-005464','Because of the limitations in achieving a great deal of attenuation across the space and related difficulties in noise control and speech interference, lecturing to a large number of students is not possible without interfering with neighbouring groups.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','103d8b2ee427933e08440b13bb3b960663c8275c83bee2992b6e53d46c783d26','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21357','GHBC-REQ-021357','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.4.5','GHBC-C-005464','The shape of such spaces may be as possible with a width to height ratio of 5:1 or greater.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1c847377dbfe4c53f987f337edfc176c6e6a681bf098cf31d20188a150c0d73c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21358','GHBC-REQ-021358','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.4.5','GHBC-C-005464','In addition, special measures are required to be introduced to reduce the level of intruding speech to an acceptable value so that the various teaching groups are not disturbed and adequate privacy is maintained.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ef92bfaf20667e592423356201e8ce10ed0099404a59acefdea5d22b3678cc3e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21359','GHBC-REQ-021359','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.4.5','GHBC-C-005464','Judicious positioning of partial height barriers 1.8 m to 2.1 m in height can improve the sound attenuation between teaching groups and the use of reflective screens can reinforce the speech locally without reflecting it to unwanted areas.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.8,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ng of partial height barriers 1.8 m to 2.1 m in height can improv"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"tial height barriers 1.8 m to 2.1 m in height can improve the sou"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ad14ae0996da1ea38e0686d1d265415f14834521d9089be657a90b4bc7dcf6c8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21360','GHBC-REQ-021360','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.4.6','GHBC-C-005465','In the case of schools, the concrete floor of the room immediately above the teaching rooms shall provide an impact sound pressure level, L‘n,Tw not greater than 70 dB.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":70,"unit":null,"operator":"not greater than","context":" sound pressure level, L‘n,Tw not greater than 70 dB."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5554c55897edb9575964392d0ffd17003219e1f9a6b11f7919e5130cc20a0116','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21361','GHBC-REQ-021361','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.5.2.4.6','GHBC-C-005465','For example, a covering of 6mm linoleum or cork tiles on concrete floor (hollow or solid) weighing not less than 220 kg/m2 will usually meet the above requirement.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":220,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"or (hollow or solid) weighing not less than 220 kg/m2 will usually meet the a"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"For example, a covering of 6mm linoleum or cork tiles on con"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":220,"unit":"kg","operator":null,"context":"solid) weighing not less than 220 kg/m2 will usually meet the abov"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','285fceaac8d73a194b7f52d1740135881d072927f9238f846f6468a35996b9e5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21362','GHBC-REQ-021362','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.1','GHBC-C-005467','Problems of noise control vary from hospital to hospital but the principles outline below apply','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','05710e5d30790d7a7d3d406c1fa019dc1ad1c6b14e7545042687e267b5e502f2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21363','GHBC-REQ-021363','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.1','GHBC-C-005467','to all types.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bd4a2a875338fe9961e62c6a45eb40188feaa76ee7c8cb22349c94844088cce2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21364','GHBC-REQ-021364','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.1','GHBC-C-005467','A quiet environment in hospitals is desirable for patients who are acutely ill.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1f1d39a79d6f05b305e4c4edd0e7ceba5f5c924ecd6590eb1f82f9b9893de886','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21365','GHBC-REQ-021365','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.1','GHBC-C-005467','Staff requires quiet conditions for consultations and examinations and also in their living and sleeping quarters.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','919c6aa34ae827f5fda3904f36c227b2fd2ead54f97a41b462f4010c36354e5d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21366','GHBC-REQ-021366','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.1','GHBC-C-005467','There have been rapid rises in noise levels in hospitals due to the higher levels of outdoor noise, increasing use of mechanical and mobile equipment (some of which is now brought much nearer to the patient in order to facilitate nursing procedure) and the introduction of loudspeaker, radio, television and call systems.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9bb4083c04c558bcda07429c11598842b7d55d5d5735298059ffd4ce3f4b30c5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21367','GHBC-REQ-021367','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.1','GHBC-C-005467','Noise control in the hospital is made much more difficult by the extensive use of hard washable surfaces which reflect and intensify the noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','07615e42dc02558916ccf7142336eca57591e95d54f4fb1f2144a0019cb1c6a7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21368','GHBC-REQ-021368','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.1','GHBC-C-005467','In most hospitals, windows to the open air and fanlights to corridors are usually open for the purpose of ventilation, admitting noise from outside and allowing it to spread through the building.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b1bfe418682e1e73b85b83e3c565031cd9a3d1fb1216f4f9532fdbbdaac5e885','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21369','GHBC-REQ-021369','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.2.1','GHBC-C-005469','This may be classified into two main categories:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','014f3b8423f8244474603a2910596da9208d663c1b625860aa8b0c1258866aed','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21370','GHBC-REQ-021370','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.2.1','GHBC-C-005469','a) Noise from sources outside the hospital premises, for example, traffic and industrial noises; and b) Noise from sources outside the building but usually within the control of the hospital authority, for example, ambulances, motor-cars and service vehicles, fuel and stores deliveries, laundries, refuse collection, trucks and trolleys.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d68aaaaf9d29c45ea3bfbcd45a644660aaa0741e4726d34ac67f919922ab2b6f','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21371','GHBC-REQ-021371','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.2.2','GHBC-C-005470','A hospital is a complex building with many services and the numerous internal sources of structure-borne and air-borne noises are grouped into three main categories:','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5d56ebdad3920939ceed2cf25ef72f99411cb0d6c45138f32065c3a1caa8005a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21372','GHBC-REQ-021372','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.2.2','GHBC-C-005470','a) Noise consequent upon hospital routines.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','955f84e5dd2c09d9141be461ac651bb5e2cd234936713f6e2031843174911a12','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21373','GHBC-REQ-021373','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.2.2','GHBC-C-005470','This category includes sources which transmit noise through both structure – borne and airborne paths, many of which may be quite near to patients particularly those in wards, such as the following:','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a157f594950905c1f86ce52418cb85064cce040ab62ee64c7532dd71d1dbc902','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21374','GHBC-REQ-021374','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.2.2','GHBC-C-005470','1) Wheeled trolleys of various kind, for food and medical supplies; 2) Sterilizing equipment; 3) Sluice room equipment including bedpan washers; 4) Ward kitchen equipment; 5) Footsteps; 6) Doors banging; 7) The handling of metal or glass equipment; 8) Noises caused during maintenance and overhaul of engineering services; and 9) Vacuum cleaners, mechanical polishers, etc.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa487a31dde672df540c57bd439ba7548704f6d323f9c2b7ecd4592a15907017','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21375','GHBC-REQ-021375','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.2.2','GHBC-C-005470','b) Loudspeaker, radio or television, audible call system, telephone bells and buzzers, and other air-borne noises, such as loud conversation; and c) Noises from fixed or mobile equipment and services not directly concerned with hospital routines.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5fa94811b2f26ba84794221576f8ec2fc5b6fa122723a8f3cd526aa54e2ea2d1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21376','GHBC-REQ-021376','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.2.2','GHBC-C-005470','These include all the fixed services as given below:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0f501da154c896931a22c19827705f4113eeb66109473dee4759a379ad017f76','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21377','GHBC-REQ-021377','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.2.2','GHBC-C-005470','1) plumbing and sanitary fittings; 2) steam hot and cold water and central heating pipes; 3) ventilation shafts and ducts; 4) fans 5) boilers; 6) pumps; 7) air compressors; 8) pneumatic tubes; 9) electrical and mechanical motors and equipment; 10) lifts; 11) laundry equipment; and 12) main kitchen equipment (refrigerators, mixers, steam boilers, etc).','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','33bc2138172fcdef4c8943470aac2ceaeff41512bed0dbb10a61a951c5134f30','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21378','GHBC-REQ-021378','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.1','GHBC-C-005472','Hospital sites with their high degree of sensitivity to outside noise should be as far away from outside sources as may be compatible with other considerations, such as','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d485b5bd5482f86b5442a61fbb118bf0dbefda01f50aaa9506bc21171ab4e25d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21379','GHBC-REQ-021379','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.1','GHBC-C-005472','accessibility and availability of services.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ffed8c1845a9875a93f7c68a26893d27c0cfca43a645488cec236827bc8f6120','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21380','GHBC-REQ-021380','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.1','GHBC-C-005472','The building should be so arranged on the site that sensitive areas like wards, consulting and treatment rooms, operating theatres and staff bedrooms are placed away from outdoor sources of noise, if possible, with their windows overlooking areas of acoustic shadow.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d0d49c94667689f4e963a9c11ee4d2b3e62fbb21b1d184294feb103dadb1f505','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21381','GHBC-REQ-021381','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.2','GHBC-C-005473','There is a very large number of units and room classification in hospital design and in planning the units in relation to each other and to the common services (such as X-ray departments, operating theatre suits and main kitchens), noise reduction in the sensitive areas should be weighed carefully against other design factors.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c3ec89f35d9d72808c2c1cdf910f3179bc0c9ddce99df58d87e95056c2e50dc2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21382','GHBC-REQ-021382','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.2','GHBC-C-005473','Special care in overall planning and internal planning against noise is required in the planning within the building of units which are themselves potential noise sources, for example, children‘s wards and outpatients‘ departments, parts of which require protection against noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','652aa9724834c027a020a72a1f9bd7edacf3bb3cec08e07363265798cb4550fa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21383','GHBC-REQ-021383','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.2.1','GHBC-C-005474','areas, boiler houses, workshops and laundries are examples of service units which should be as far from sensitive areas as possible.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','89bff0f5bc136e34143b42ab31badcbad18b32db48080ae1a38c9d0714a4bb92','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21384','GHBC-REQ-021384','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.2.2','GHBC-C-005475','of both air-borne and structure-borne noise and should preferably be in a separate building away from or screened from the sensitive areas.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6dd2baf08267366d2f38325ca4d5ef05c63753d4160c9ae0c7dfdaeca35a0e12','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21385','GHBC-REQ-021385','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.2.2','GHBC-C-005475','If this is not possible and the main kitchens must form part of a multi-storey building, noise control is easier if they are placed below and not above the wards and other sensitive rooms so as to facilitate the insulation of the equipment and machinery in order to reduce the transmission of structureborne noise to a minimum.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f7d277bc7a51901c5ccc6d15cc2cfa8978d44b8d52e0a8ed7fa9068db997e971','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21386','GHBC-REQ-021386','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005476','rooms, utility rooms, sterilizing rooms and other ancillary rooms, need to be placed quite near to the beds if they are to fulfill their purposes, which are all sources of noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ad816a25e6b9bd65557272e68eff6af12ee8bd491efcd6c6f152da984c9afdf1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21387','GHBC-REQ-021387','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005476','Some form of noise baffling between open wards and rooms of this kin will be needed.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29431624d68d716b1683423cb2f9c0dcb18d83a24202a1b0b8d7bd0a92aceb61','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21388','GHBC-REQ-021388','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3','GHBC-C-005477','In view of the difficulty of suppressing noise in hospital buildings, it is important to eliminate noise at its source wherever possible.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0d2a0df71cdc68f62ea57f7584c8d7b1d47931161da4bba13e124349a23b5db0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21389','GHBC-REQ-021389','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005478','Mats of rubber or other resilient material on draining boards and rubber-shod equipment will greatly reduce noise from utility rooms, sluice rooms and ward kitchens.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','434603bf8e32e2fa3364021474016ac32be2ed28622ba7db0ae41a23d73b1962','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21390','GHBC-REQ-021390','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005478','The use of plastics or other resilient materials for sinks, draining boards, utensils and bowls would also reduce the noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b6a58b675724735ac2f2182b46415391bc341ce573d27fe3e5e838b1894c1274','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21391','GHBC-REQ-021391','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005478','Many items of equipment especially mobile equipment, such as trolleys and beds, may be silenced by means of rubber-tyred wheels and rubber bumper and the provision of resilient floor finishes (see 29.4.6.3.4.1).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6a9f60fca78a402b34b07b3ebfbcf5b46d74b8dc049d0a20a6a33efc0d56d188','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21392','GHBC-REQ-021392','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005478','The latter also reduces footstep noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ddbac8ab671eeb0544037b06f4c4e770ecc3cab070ed1dd992bb27d8bac9e528','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21393','GHBC-REQ-021393','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005478','Silent type curtain rails, rings and runners should be used.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','40ee47ff20ff88c7aab445126d6d9720926c6ced1679e040e8f1398ea2507888','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21394','GHBC-REQ-021394','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005478','Lift gates and doors should be fitted with buffers and silent closing gear.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b5eb40a1008026bb38fdd5dafbd9640169ecc761f284f6c2f3500fe72a0b4acc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21395','GHBC-REQ-021395','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005478','Fans and other machinery should be mounted on suitable resilient mountings to prevent the spread of noise through the structure.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','45fc63915fe7a66c0c7a384a9ad64c147c89e890bbddef55a111620ba3080295','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21396','GHBC-REQ-021396','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005479','Noise from water or heating pipes may be reduced by installing systems which operate at comparatively low pressure and velocities.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','608056bd570fdfc76ee750732152868b73310df65a44eadc25289100f88a1f1a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21397','GHBC-REQ-021397','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005479','Silencing pipes and specially designed flushing action reduce water closet noise at source and make structural measures easier to apply.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','61a271f6c52cc764df3563f682ed16d0b88f4ac0bc684e929303759d0da74383','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21398','GHBC-REQ-021398','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005479','The ventilation system should be designed so as not to create a noise problem.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dcd07a6d184c5b141c408af327f4e6d252f4c1fcdbc4c9fc130a37bf1d011547','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21399','GHBC-REQ-021399','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.3.2','GHBC-C-005479','Silent closers should be fitted to doors.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0875aaf166e7bd0f2aec729e6434d224ce8529c4127ade0ef34d6ae83a4dff95','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21400','GHBC-REQ-021400','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4','GHBC-C-005480','means','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db1a7ccbd49f50e56057ece40874b2facf80de23c19338685f5b3d66cc7592c7','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21401','GHBC-REQ-021401','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','Since the various departments or units may be planned in many ways, only general guidance on the insulation values for walls and partitions is given as below:','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e6e58f5d05d5362a2dbe02e973bf6f68c197f2deb8b60dc090e0584985ac7444','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21402','GHBC-REQ-021402','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','a) It is recommended that walls or partitions between rooms should normally have a Rw of at least 40 dB.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":40,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":" should normally have a Rw of at least 40 dB."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eeb2063048789d45e399430618272cce3a595178d96fe35714c5b2c428a7b581','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21403','GHBC-REQ-021403','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','Higher values of Rw of at least 45 dB are necessary where a noisy room is adjacent to one requiring quiet conditions.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":45,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"Higher values of Rw of at least 45 dB are necessary where a nois"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8ab89eb3e190df451d59258a47cb6be564bf381ff35f827e163ced278615263a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21404','GHBC-REQ-021404','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','Doors should be solid with close fitting in the frames. b) There is little insulation value in double swing doors and where these are fitted in a noisy room the opening should be planned so that it is','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','89db9eb924e3514fb3f52d6075611d6dde067243f8f13563186bab6c270eca85','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21405','GHBC-REQ-021405','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','screened from areas requiring quiet by a baffle lobby lined with absorbent material.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12da84dfc348b6788428da94991eba39d8d722c00696e834d2e4c84682dc08a2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21406','GHBC-REQ-021406','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','Very high insulation values may be necessary in special cases and exceptional measures may be required.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b86deb23e13a3affa41fb23e3fed8aca40dff63179cecf59443edb5d4970f00b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21407','GHBC-REQ-021407','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','c) Solid floors with floating finishes and resilient surfaces are necessary particularly between wards and other parts of the building.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8142898b5e12416d63a005f737e7768ae4119b7819f6d8b602faaa4d719a95ae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21408','GHBC-REQ-021408','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','Ordinary timber board on joist floors should never be used.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f7e0ec5d595ec0a8e31e04684b516434f612f3d3f4a1d2ae8f460946d7428e74','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21409','GHBC-REQ-021409','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','d) Conduits, ventilation ducts, chases, etc. should be constructed so as not to form easy by-pass for disseminating noise about the building, and should be provided with sufficient sound insulation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0a093e9e5135459f79d8cddbc3988c430ad47705c5f7b5215dd7e79e168d107c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21410','GHBC-REQ-021410','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','Pipe ducts should be completely sealed around the pipes where they pass through walls or floors.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2f1b0f4f579c8a859b552cfb69c35df899e0d110571802a590a63253b09cf3e0','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21411','GHBC-REQ-021411','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.1','GHBC-C-005481','Ducts carrying waste or water pipes should be lined with sound insulating material to prevent noise from the pipes passing through duct walls into the rooms through which they pass.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1c3450cdf420c1a04d317370b288806655b77a23ede23d184a8322ec4e757c88','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21412','GHBC-REQ-021412','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.2','GHBC-C-005482','Most surfaces in hospitals should be easily cleanable, so as to prevent the build-up of bacteria which may cause cross-infection.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e532292bd19257e49ac31c5d5b3d1d94dc49d46530bc2f0bd3887b67c2e190a1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21413','GHBC-REQ-021413','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.2','GHBC-C-005482','Many sound absorbent materials of a soft nature and difficult to clean are unsuitable for use in some hospital areas and lose much of their effectiveness, if painted for hygienic reasons.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','68aea146dc9d3ca680c5227efd8d8287716a580720832692a1fea55fe28c67dd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21414','GHBC-REQ-021414','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.2','GHBC-C-005482','Some porous materials with very thin nonporous coverings (like mineral wool covered with thin plastic sheets) have good sound absorption and when covered with a perforated sheet metal facing can be used in most areas requiring a washable acoustical treatment.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0eb4bf2006dc9358a42068a435f219e333ba6f85a04e28559938a6916320ea43','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21415','GHBC-REQ-021415','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.2','GHBC-C-005482','In noisy areas, such as corridors and waiting rooms, however, a wider choice of absorbents is available.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','16faad82e805231240c17ecd4ce5f1f5c9fc1ed6d4e7d23638a391a54ff9f371','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21416','GHBC-REQ-021416','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.2','GHBC-C-005482','In the ward, bed curtains, window curtain etc, add to the absorbent properties of the room','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b3e4c312e558e6877fd79385e53e93adaf619529f118c264b0a45861545f4392','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21417','GHBC-REQ-021417','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.4.2','GHBC-C-005482','and help reduce reverberation in otherwise hard surfaced surroundings.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cafb6a99f54e3a1410c797244baaf1a578d3eabe62a2eb845ee5674cd907d491','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21418','GHBC-REQ-021418','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.5','GHBC-C-005483','theatres, Doctors‘ consultation rooms, intensive care units (ICU) require special consideration against noise control.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fcc66fbd82b967c0a2eeeec4695455192210516443e5b30f235512032e5d6796','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21419','GHBC-REQ-021419','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.5','GHBC-C-005483','Apart from outdoor noise, a common problem is the transmission of sound between the consulting room and the waiting room.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5d3b5311d1f080ab995be495d62d02ecbfba16ee66c53abb53f866330e858e70','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21420','GHBC-REQ-021420','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.5','GHBC-C-005483','To ensure silence, a sound isolation Dw of 45 B (A), between the rooms shall be provided.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','587d131752143a0af2f96d408c885580ce22cce9513219f98abd719b37da0e82','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21421','GHBC-REQ-021421','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.5','GHBC-C-005483','If the doors are directly connected by a single communicating door it will not be possible to achieve these values of isolation Dw.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a7bdc3ea462ae8e7a4a81c9318a440fe29b2a1c60f75528f8c597da2fed05eeb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21422','GHBC-REQ-021422','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.6.3.5','GHBC-C-005483','To obtain 40-45 dB(A) insulation between communicating rooms, it is necessary to provide two doors separated by an air gap, such as lobby or corridor.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c785332ffeb7801534c8986232d272284a4747b293a7e08543d65a8ff1d67104','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21423','GHBC-REQ-021423','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.1','GHBC-C-005485','Modern office buildings are often noisier than older buildings due to the use of thinner and more rigid forms of construction, harder finishes, more austere furnishings and use of business machines.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','91014ee5e193b54fc890db383e7b7645850b37c124abc88b98b5b25525cca900','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21424','GHBC-REQ-021424','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.2.1','GHBC-C-005487','Main sources of indoor noise include the following:','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','38e5832489e322b7a23ff8caecf8da18670db746c3698e289c541bebf5ee9a64','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21425','GHBC-REQ-021425','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.2.1','GHBC-C-005487','a) Office machines, such as typewriters, and printers; b) Telephone conversation; c) Noise from the public admitted to the building; d) Footsteps, voices and slamming of doors in circulation spaces, lift doors and gates; e) Sound reproduction in staff training rooms, conference rooms and recreation rooms, etc; f) Handing of crockery and utensils in canteens and kitchens; and g) HVAC and lift machinery.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be947ecb53560de4ea205c7080648f91a037fe7126032426f83dcefe466086fe','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21426','GHBC-REQ-021426','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.1','GHBC-C-005489','Rooms demanding quiet conditions should be placed on the quiet side of the site.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5fc7e6b852f36a8c79ddec0aa3dad2f397b96130c3c8a2d5444c6920702f9acb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21427','GHBC-REQ-021427','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.1','GHBC-C-005489','Even on quiet thoroughfares, these rooms should also not be planned at street level.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','66155287543e5e90eb93175f37288f7c44fbf83f80042e71fa8832e346ff897f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21428','GHBC-REQ-021428','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.1','GHBC-C-005489','They should also not be planned on enclose yards used for the parking of cars, scooters, etc. Where, however, the problems cannot be resolved by planning, the provision of double windows may be necessary.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9cbbb5afb26e9b0023f3643055083f362ea456b2f954473fe6815fb4ffc9bcc2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21429','GHBC-REQ-021429','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.1','GHBC-C-005491','The reverberation time should not exceed 1.0 s in all general offices of the types listed in','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"ration time should not exceed 1.0 s in all general offices of the"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c8ef15d5491e4aeb0648a1395fae2787ac0055461c64e8d2872bfd834ab997a0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21430','GHBC-REQ-021430','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.2','GHBC-C-005492','offices, the reverberation time should not exceed 0.75 second, in very large offices the reverberation time may be increased to 1.25 s.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.75,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"ration time should not exceed 0.75 second, in very large offices t"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.25,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"tion time may be increased to 1.25 s."}]','["is 1.25"]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c22b2350527d8ecd645916811316da5885d81d9b70407b029bbe488eae3a5471','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21431','GHBC-REQ-021431','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.2','GHBC-C-005492','For canteens, the recommended maximum reverberation time is 1.25 s.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.25,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"maximum reverberation time is 1.25 s."}]','["is 1.25"]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0fe325958f47408468d7aa632f96a9eeb175b70e08e9529aa2ba50ac152fe4c8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21432','GHBC-REQ-021432','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.2','GHBC-C-005493','The grouping of departments and machines together in one room should be avoided wherever possible.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8f1e760e8db7f3f9bb366d42d3b5f8ed9e6c50a24a442d12f40d85beae80e579','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21433','GHBC-REQ-021433','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.2','GHBC-C-005493','Where supervision is necessary, the provision of glazed screens carried up to the ceiling should be considered.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','92feb5e866992cdf77a2d094371d844c1c993c6ca11e60e27d502c8fb4221a80','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21434','GHBC-REQ-021434','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.2','GHBC-C-005493','If it is essential to the work for an office for machine operators and clerks to work side by side in the same room, the machines should be enclosed by panels or low screens lined with absorbent material and the ceiling should be sound absorbent.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','282015047c25921d9bf126d64d6e038917d3e231fdbf62ac89f8200c3e590648','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21435','GHBC-REQ-021435','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.2','GHBC-C-005493','In addition, the machines should be as quiet as possible in operation and mounted on suitable resilient mountings.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8669aa96b598b7209d2ecf89371c0835d0f0f63f45f325c703ba44bcba36f00d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21436','GHBC-REQ-021436','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.2','GHBC-C-005493','Note – A quiet area should be planned for prolonged telephonic conversation.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','73f0a1ad5abec51530a63a7253a20e876b33549e227c726ef3ba7aa5255046a9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21437','GHBC-REQ-021437','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','Modern construction methods and economy dictate the use of light weight construction for many office buildings.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','78e4e6915125aadd8e7c581029bda34fc9bd9864c55ffef153916c2a7de9382b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21438','GHBC-REQ-021438','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','While the tight weight materials lead to fast fabrication and erection and also effect considerable economy in the building structure, they may lead to tremendous sound insulation problems between adjacent offices and areas.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa3173e49f8c32deade35f86ae0edcaf2f2b53d7d0fad6e125d2a4571001957c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21439','GHBC-REQ-021439','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','Light weight construction is also frequently employed for the sub-division of large space into executive cabins and secretarial areas.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6b804651af7e4b8b2086869b74507e258f3b56293ee394092107b92a53a56829','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21440','GHBC-REQ-021440','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','Where such construction is considered desirable, efforts should be made to provide a','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','34dfd5742ef6c578f50bed4ecd3c6c5ecde27445fb36e50528d4b3fcb3d87e82','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21441','GHBC-REQ-021441','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','double-skin panel.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cb85159f27542ad087cb087e81855c3c9629575d55de63107c4435645e0da1ed','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21442','GHBC-REQ-021442','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','The panels should be isolated from each other as far as possible either by the use of separate framing or by the use of elastic discontinuities in the construction, and a sound absorbing material may be introduced in the air cavity between the panel.The partitions should be full height up to the bottom of the roof above and any openings required for air movement should be provided with sound attenuators compatible with the rest of the partition.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','37fbf0cfd7b93f3cd93b44075377aa1c3ad9cb6502c4b7f6a1d16e40345c1b8c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21443','GHBC-REQ-021443','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','When light weight floors are provided in multiuse buildings, adequate attention shall be paid to the question of air-borne and structureborne noise transmission from the upper floors to the floors below.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6674f0676582430370d16d9e2432730313383907183b1a9879b339c1f769157c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21444','GHBC-REQ-021444','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','For effective reduction of air-borne noise, a double panel hollow floor construction may be employed with some heavy sound damping material introduced between the panels and the panel isolated from each other.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fef1491d1392ad83667ede273434b1ce8116257589b9128f820073a81dc57a44','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21445','GHBC-REQ-021445','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','The sound damping material could be sand, mineral wool, etc. In case impact noise isolation is also required, the upper panel should be effectively isolated from the rest of the floors and building structure.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5c746e1a3acc1e58f1854ed5003a81059973a007133bc3a61d43610bdc277875','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21446','GHBC-REQ-021446','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','The choice of the isolation layer would of course depend upon the lowest frequency of interest.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8c7a4c14bd4e2898b0ceda3b36933734023f7dde8f840d032dfc481c899e70f8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21447','GHBC-REQ-021447','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','Another point to be kept in mind when going in for light weight construction is to ensure that the light weight panels are not in resonance with the natural frequencies of any mechanical equipment installed inside the building.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f31eb1918c18c380f2fd0e8f24aa235da63079e836e9a0fddedd7920ec4860ea','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21448','GHBC-REQ-021448','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','Light weight materials have high natural frequencies well within the audio range and may resonate or vibrate due to an applied vibratory force.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5f440660180c9a9093422d8f6b5375c018dc9534005fcd23be649ccf15187057','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21449','GHBC-REQ-021449','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.3','GHBC-C-005494','This vibratory force is caused by mechanical equipment, road traffic, rail traffic, etc. Special measures also need be taken to isolate either the source or the building so as to reduce the amount of vibration transmitted to the building structure.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','447d61de7072777352de57a693a5d3d9c5bbd4954fe67afbe4d7491511619a5a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21450','GHBC-REQ-021450','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','A new concept in office planning is the use of open plan offices.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b8cb6698c81b7b803322766ac0aaed58bb2743f697898e059aa11e98bcb3348b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21451','GHBC-REQ-021451','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','Large open floor spaces are converted into an office area with senior executives, junior executives and secretarial staff all seated within the same area without the use of any partitions or walls.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c282207d80d6f04ef1f97c2351b9396482ccb7a58acdc01ab6d3466d1a4a8549','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21452','GHBC-REQ-021452','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','While this method of planning is appreciated, it leads to a problem of inadequate acoustical privacy between adjacent work spaces.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e2a6248b101564746560f0c2a034f4b23bcca46727640cc8fb46229b73e60ba4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21453','GHBC-REQ-021453','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','Speech privacy in open plan offices is defined by the speech interference level of intruding noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fb50a3010463ecef102ebe0a06ddf2bdac9497aa449850f555d8781a7ddb6327','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21454','GHBC-REQ-021454','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','Speech privacy between two adjacent rooms or spaces is, therefore, a function of two key','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','68fc6e97d5a66b302770da6f535ab4a45a1d8130ab4087f123eb0cc37f58c482','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21455','GHBC-REQ-021455','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','parameters; noise reduction of the intervening partition and background noise levels.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7e33bc4fb5d3fb926029cfb6349de3b3f5cce6f109bb190ce3e49ca8b0e693e0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21456','GHBC-REQ-021456','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','Special design measures are, therefore, required to reduce the level of intruding sounds at work places to acceptable low value so that people are not disturbed and adequate privacy is maintained.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','acd35b9d8b8ac749fc0bb576911398ce10a9c63ce152ad9f95c1e583046a4867','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21457','GHBC-REQ-021457','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','Some special measures which might be considered for such open plan offices are the use of an acoustical ceiling together with partial height barriers between work spaces, all designed to provide adequate privacy between adjacent work spaces.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3d695f90458100785459c992b86d0ac40cc45a9af6c5c393950035316582f188','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21458','GHBC-REQ-021458','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','In addition use may have to be made of an electronic background masking noise system which provides a constant level of a generally acceptable background noise in the entire office area.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d7e099ade66a8600b291cc2735a2797e9484032fe874396b210769d1143a8065','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21459','GHBC-REQ-021459','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','The masking noise system is a very useful concept in open plan office design because by raising the background level at every workplace, intruding noises are made less disturbing.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','98609fbcad6d3f0deeb0ee2c36caac0d222b59efa921012f04b52e7d854fc669','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21460','GHBC-REQ-021460','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','A background music system cannot serve as a noise masking system because the music does not have a constant spectrum or sound level.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fce5792ff47aefdff91ac9279ae6730b39468ccea186fd9997cf2eb162a18be8','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21461','GHBC-REQ-021461','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','In fact the background noise masking system must be introduced gradually without the knowledge of employees.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8fa9a12bbf8b7d64836135eda112491f1ff2246f1b9dc5969496ba7da228c00c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21462','GHBC-REQ-021462','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','The air conditioning system can also be used to generate background masking noise if the noise level from the fans, ducts and grills is suitably tailored to generate the desired frequency spectrum.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ce4a766c52c5c013775d79f6e58b84d639371c3aeb246c57183b019355d5b64c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21463','GHBC-REQ-021463','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','However, it is not simple to predict the noise level of air conditioning components accurately.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','54a87097f1783ccd482a274ec8a823cd6154b16ca1b93f489d8a448ef6d07ea9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21464','GHBC-REQ-021464','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.4','GHBC-C-005495','On the other hand, the electronic system enables both the level and the spectrum of the background noise to be accurately adjusted to suit individual job requirements.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','efa5ec181820420919a5e3de9544bda6bcf0d18f2386e73ffcc944fc4c204410','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21465','GHBC-REQ-021465','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.5','GHBC-C-005496','It is important that machines like typewriters, printer, etc. should be quiet in themselves and also be fitted with resilient pads, to prevent the floors or tables on which they stand from acting as large radiating panels.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8517aa2bb9df34f75c077e2e115038c93c125e0351f33473bce2f4f569abfad1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21466','GHBC-REQ-021466','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.5','GHBC-C-005496','It is desirable to locate machines further apart and to apply sound absorbent treatment to the ceiling.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','42c5fb179dacf0c74034beb3643f1803e07c2dd838391b92f838040bdf51ba9c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21467','GHBC-REQ-021467','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.6','GHBC-C-005497','If banking halls are large an lofty, noise nuisance tends to be aggravated.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b2680d17be6193ad2076b14044f6b6c3fc2aef798898a42c691f49a7909fa905','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21468','GHBC-REQ-021468','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.6','GHBC-C-005497','It is advisable to avoid high reflective ceilings.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1b854ca217d1132c06990859c924d99ab2d8ba15042d5f48022509ac4f469b32','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21469','GHBC-REQ-021469','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.6','GHBC-C-005497','The worst effects may be reduced by segregating the noise from the quiet operations and screening one from the other and by applying sound absorbent materials to the surfaces of the ceilings, screens and nearby walls.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2c83127f15e81815b7a64856a3b2cf452f3da5e5e3342b7c98bfb37e911b88d0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21470','GHBC-REQ-021470','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.6','GHBC-C-005497','Resilient flooring is also recommended.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8b94121b263d7a0a7a4dfcbc4a84d78928bab0d5c02db5222ef4ea6b3a2d32f7','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21471','GHBC-REQ-021471','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.7','GHBC-C-005498','spaces Noise nuisance may be minimized by the provision of resilient flooring, sound absorbent ceilings and heavy full height screens between the public space and the clerical office.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e0aa84dd812635432646a2b6acac101e0dd4216c97336abb9163ecc4e24e6143','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21472','GHBC-REQ-021472','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.8','GHBC-C-005499','The provision of a sound absorbent ceiling, resilient flooring and the use of plastic trays and tables with ‗quiet‘ tops are recommended.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','640861495f65b125113458cc3368d48e224464fbfdeec97271473a2cc279307f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21473','GHBC-REQ-021473','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.8','GHBC-C-005499','openable windows (single or double) but only, of course, at such times as ventilation may be dispensed with.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8a5ba31b4ccda3446af870d5c5c8d82b0aa54f1631c44eca18efec662776b4a0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21474','GHBC-REQ-021474','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.8','GHBC-C-005499','Having to choose between ventilation and noise exclusion is a serious handicap to efficient working in offices.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','65829226b64d807abd6ad33419c6f13a604451a9ddd0d8541659049cf2d8250c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21475','GHBC-REQ-021475','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.2.8','GHBC-C-005499','In large office blocks on noisy sites, consideration should be given to the provision of sealed double windows and mechanical ventilation at least in the offices on the sides of the building exposed to noise.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','11fbb0b50248ae585f4b7f3c289c48e3df143c53f56e75cf9f7123a40b5e5127','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21476','GHBC-REQ-021476','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005500','adjoining rooms, both horizontally and vertically, depends upon the amount of noise created within the rooms, the amount of intruding noise and whether it is important that conversation should not be overhead between rooms.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12923534f7919e76fd075a8ce92d4ed9a1463c70e3039eed27e19e55af72245f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21477','GHBC-REQ-021477','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005500','Generally a sound isolation value (Dw)','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','df0189c1b9d78761a2c7a36edfdaad4af1d47c7b7c570d8b5fc8245db658a048','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21478','GHBC-REQ-021478','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005500','of 30 dB between one room and another room in office is recommended.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','caf4a1553c010030e0f2db56b7f3e6d4d2a558ba56f74823c21fd6f31a5355e3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21479','GHBC-REQ-021479','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005500','29.4.7.3.3.2 The following list may be considered as broad classification of noise producing rooms and rooms requiring quiet though many offices fall into both categories.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','05f8095e5f008f86c3347ae4a174729b809c0db24319dad1affdd1e4a96d4f0e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21480','GHBC-REQ-021480','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005500','Where rooms in opposing categories are planned adjacent to each other, a sound reduction (Dw) of at least 45 dB should be provided between them.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":45,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"er, a sound reduction (Dw) of at least 45 dB should be provided between"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4a188d20ce84778a3169c315c112d102589d15b2aa0093627ac8366027aa15be','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21481','GHBC-REQ-021481','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005500','a) rooms requiring quiet (as listed 45 dB above) on a quiet site where privacy is required;','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','16dc3cc1bb4cd79f2cdf378062adb78a99f47c10174543991b33ef1fcd0ebc44','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21482','GHBC-REQ-021482','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.3.1','GHBC-C-005500','b) rooms requiring quiet (as listed 40 dB above) but on a noisy site or where a lower degree of privacy is tolerable; c) clerical offices in which noise levels of 20-30 dB not constitute a major nuisance.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b1eb0b8b72a08e88812e0bcce68c2fc8e09d72092758e8c7ea8104d249ba95d4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21483','GHBC-REQ-021483','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.7.3.3.3','GHBC-C-005501','It is recommended that the minimum sound reduction index, Rw for floors should be 45 dB, and the floors should have a resilient finish.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2b85e4a8635108e96bbc7c357ef58628cd28c6c6115dfc966579809d129049c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21484','GHBC-REQ-021484','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.1','GHBC-C-005503','Hotels and hostels are primarily used as dwelling units, and hotels also provide for public entertainment.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f67d8a9d6ef1659f9e071306c798411fc369ed4c3d0fc29c3b5234aa9fa39d59','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21485','GHBC-REQ-021485','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.1','GHBC-C-005503','The most serious risk of course is disturbance to sleep, and adequate care, therefore, need be taken to protect the occupants from being disturbed by outdoor and indoor noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fbcbccb66a866d851c8413b0d57932eb29bcadcf4eb73cf914a4d2856baafae2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21486','GHBC-REQ-021486','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.1.1','GHBC-C-005504','Hotels near railway stations, airports, highways and those situated in highly urbanized areas are especially vulnerable to outdoor noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5df5123c38dc18dc15617c42a0ce1b75a1d97434eb2196da3147406c6442b5d0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21487','GHBC-REQ-021487','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.1.1','GHBC-C-005504','The outdoor noise in many of the areas is of a high level even late at night and in the early morning.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8c85b982f5d6d1a2d9cef1b6e06dff3852c3f5cd269b78bc1ecc6000e57af96e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21488','GHBC-REQ-021488','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.1.1','GHBC-C-005504','The noise could also be due to other types of activities such as building construction activity (pile driving, concrete mixing, etc) and various types of portable utility equipment, such as compressors or generators.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5d63d38ba01bccb642e63c21c8859e413a03f3636fecc09e563ce8c8326919bf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21489','GHBC-REQ-021489','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.1.2','GHBC-C-005505','In so far as indoor noise is concerned, the noise could be due to the occupants themselves, which is transmitted from one room to the other.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec9433d018fa91cabdad2aa84e3c3fb63eb205e4db544f7367b0324fd8a39d54','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21490','GHBC-REQ-021490','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.1.2','GHBC-C-005505','It could also be due to public functions and late night use of restaurants located in the hotel as also due to miscellaneous utility equipment installed for providing and maintaining the services in the hotel, such as, air conditioning equipment, pumping equipment, power laundry and kitchen.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5ab170e0f46ae648639b849d0142aa6eb06d5ac1ba6089082129ffdc13b4a59a','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21491','GHBC-REQ-021491','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.1.2','GHBC-C-005505','Sometimes hotels equipped with standby generators are a potential source of noise.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','97a20fa22893cafafbb160bbda6212d86a4f3dcb089fb30b5e650bca1afc17d1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21492','GHBC-REQ-021492','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.1.2','GHBC-C-005505','Another source which could lead to disturbance to the occupants is the plumbing.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','27fa9681814139e5fcd07116a76b1cf8a84fcaa96f46e4357f52bd1f19eea770','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21493','GHBC-REQ-021493','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.1','GHBC-C-005507','While it is desirable to locate the hotel, or hostel away from an area where there is a high ambient noise level, many a time these have to be located in noisy areas for public convenience.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6e9fbac21a157c8bdb67fd9fbe926bf803596162e4d52f7501cb0fde193c8d87','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21494','GHBC-REQ-021494','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.1','GHBC-C-005507','Hotels near airports and railway stations are becoming popular because they are convenient for passengers in transit.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','65f71a4f5496141d635148404fb30eaf8f547069e55b159a7507114c0e59c973','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21495','GHBC-REQ-021495','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.1','GHBC-C-005507','Hotels located in the commercial areas of a','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d0584b58caad8e290b83cd4be092bd24883a74f8eff1a945557e68952b1084e3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21496','GHBC-REQ-021496','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.1','GHBC-C-005507','city are also a commercially viable proposition and many a time this factor outweighs the other problems associated with such a location.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4be2aa5bd1cac720ec0e30301f9ad5827be869584b17578160c115f18d00bed1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21497','GHBC-REQ-021497','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.1','GHBC-C-005507','When a reasonably quiet location is not possible, it is desirable that adequate measures be considered to provide a comfortable acoustical environment for the occupants.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','abeabf02866be7406cf7526d9c95cd93643c1f5eb888ee2b23996eb15a47befc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21498','GHBC-REQ-021498','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2','GHBC-C-005508','Where a hotel is located in a noisy environment, the provision of sealed windows (single or double) and provision of an air conditioning system is desirable for rooms exposed to noise.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5e7f9f5f3d4854f68b76da90b2ffb745c61d8b5a4e9a0aa0a87c2dbf3d5caf51','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21499','GHBC-REQ-021499','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2','GHBC-C-005508','The requirements for the windows would of course depend upon the level and character of noise in the area.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','51a695393f3797fe84d79f82b6dbfdef449603e8c9b9154e1561bc7debf0df37','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21500','GHBC-REQ-021500','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2','GHBC-C-005508','The general recommendations for satisfactory acoustical design of hotels are given in','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1c6c26cda5167229333bef63dd17cf70f5fd1df75d38aca1050b30fc76c5191d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21501','GHBC-REQ-021501','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.1','GHBC-C-005510','Hotels of all classes shall by necessity provide good protection against indoor noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eafb1210cb20b9229d9ca27962e74d2739006ba5bdcffe39dc08797a0c14fd40','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21502','GHBC-REQ-021502','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.1','GHBC-C-005510','Since hotels can be considered as flats, the standards of protection recommended for flats are also applicable to hotels.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','047a71418fadfaaf3cb6b5a85bb3b77b847f9be4a141243426b6ed6b526e6e00','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21503','GHBC-REQ-021503','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.1','GHBC-C-005510','Partition between guest rooms and between rooms, corridors and floors shall not be less than 115 mm brick wall plastered or equivalent.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":115,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"idors and floors shall not be less than 115 mm brick wall plastered or eq"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":115,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"floors shall not be less than 115 mm brick wall plastered or equiv"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e7270215ff701d786d4dd792a0d1746f8272979fc648f8d97eeb59e08f3cc882','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21504','GHBC-REQ-021504','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.1','GHBC-C-005510','The floors shall have proper impact insulation.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aaf49909a754fcdc49c01443a995b8cf762f5ff7338bec2fde220ac16e24b100','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21505','GHBC-REQ-021505','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.1','GHBC-C-005510','Special attention should be paid to built-in wall cupboards as these are potential areas of sound leakage.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','02e3ec0ef978f356245232c689c0d347975b8d18ff7d7e8f06cd7dbbc051dd0a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21506','GHBC-REQ-021506','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.1','GHBC-C-005510','These will not serve as sound insulating partitions and may not be relied upon to increase the insulation value of partitions against which they may be built.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6a8348513194f413d01b8f0734a1bd95506fa7cd0b8bbda6212a2c6263ed649d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21507','GHBC-REQ-021507','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.1','GHBC-C-005510','In fact, partitions between adjoining rooms should be continuous behind the cupboards.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3579f8a875840ad9bcee918e9ab59837b770ef7fcaa3c04a112fbdbf2a199d82','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21508','GHBC-REQ-021508','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.1','GHBC-C-005510','Use of silent type door gear and cupboard catches is also highly desirable.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c605ca67043d7dafaeb1421fa7b6c4477eb34226af868a94e850d582ad536b8a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21509','GHBC-REQ-021509','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005511','of corridors shall be staggered and doors be provided with gaskets on head, sides and threshold.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9974def63f059f4d831a5cab71a594ddca0eb356d7d0fb1ac90c3a1c4145d295','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21510','GHBC-REQ-021510','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005511','Inter-communicating doors should be double doors, fully gasketed.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','114b9a461b2ef69fd6555f125e420c6bf048af61d2eed28b1e41261b0dfb7aec','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21511','GHBC-REQ-021511','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005511','Doors should also have quiet action latches.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7bd1fea8b6a3cd0a3dea1b4ef3ffd8f0d110c350b5ccee9e9ae709e5c11ba3bd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21512','GHBC-REQ-021512','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005511','Whenever possible, rooms should be entered through a baffle lobby.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','913cdbe0509755ac5becc2f9c1e0315974b3dc4412a13c628766c03d40ff614b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21513','GHBC-REQ-021513','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005511','Wherever possible, corridor walls should not have ventilators unless they are double- glazed and non-openable.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','89b74d875977ac35057454cc5f8246a293729e6692f90e485a2a8ea795ee047f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21514','GHBC-REQ-021514','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005512','have resilient floor coverings and sound absorbent ceilings are desirable unless the corridor is fully carpeted.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','079d24556f270e87258a95cd9876468e5e0f158e097bd6e4152074b5a7a65ead','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21515','GHBC-REQ-021515','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005512','Staircases and lift wells may be cut off from corridors by means of swing doors and, if possible, isolated from','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d4f99ca4f8b1e95311947708a4703e1ea7bc9a25eeb062c511a56566aff1ce2a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21516','GHBC-REQ-021516','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005512','guest rooms by linen stores or similar rooms.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e7c39327573949a78553c5cdddcc98c4eb00b15400266f946ea4322f37c996d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21517','GHBC-REQ-021517','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.3','GHBC-C-005512','Room service pantries on floors can also be a source of noise and may be separated from corridors by baffle lobbies, unless the rooms themselves have baffle lobbies.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eac7efab9786a3b694c36f442783affb2cd445ddcbb63256ecf857b5c3b3a1db','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21518','GHBC-REQ-021518','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.4','GHBC-C-005513','bathrooms should not be planned next to bedrooms.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','56f23ca487c6ee71f99da3cc5a5a236d04a0c2e14c982c00d9507337aa463aa9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21519','GHBC-REQ-021519','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.4','GHBC-C-005513','Where this is unavoidable, internal pipe shafts with heavy walls, un-pierced on bedrooms side may be used as means of separation.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7d5e7b012730843ad5e30ecebc1f4b82682235d35d8a78be172d37ba49d63f80','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21520','GHBC-REQ-021520','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.4','GHBC-C-005513','It is important to choose quiet type of sanitary fittings and to design the plumbing system so as not to create noise, that is by avoiding sharp bends, restrictions of flow, quick – action valves that might cause water hammer, etc.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','73ef13d879ef9d7c9e5b042f7c2e8feecaf30a108e0fac37e3a02a64112ee5fe','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21521','GHBC-REQ-021521','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.5','GHBC-C-005514','quiet in operation.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','90efd67c46bc5d2e8ab22aae37bb3a9f40a94c750aba975536887035eef46caa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21522','GHBC-REQ-021522','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.5','GHBC-C-005514','Care should also be taken that the air conditioning ducts do not lead to a cross-talk problem between rooms.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e971f6d54044b9cb43f7181f885979df771696d1314b6c59963835f1bb91bdb0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21523','GHBC-REQ-021523','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.5','GHBC-C-005514','Suitable acoustical lining would need to be provided in the ducts consistent with the fire safety requirements of the buildings.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aa63d41b7ea00452ddb49b191df78cc6bb70d7162e48e578a87d8738051a576e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21524','GHBC-REQ-021524','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.6','GHBC-C-005515','halls and conference halls which are separately hired out for public and private functions.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0ab339d0732e85ca67460a0eca6112df16db5e17aaa083353c8a4ca4ba7c2894','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21525','GHBC-REQ-021525','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.6','GHBC-C-005515','Late night restaurants and night clubs are also popular and functions in all these areas may go on well into the night.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2e287b991b1955bb7aa2ffe96c00f8231aa0e1fca3de556a33163b2840cbed66','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21526','GHBC-REQ-021526','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.6','GHBC-C-005515','It is therefore essential that these rooms be effectively isolated from bedrooms and effective insulation form all possible noise source is considered.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','edeaaed3cdfb711bb4fab09a412e461ebe4ba03fe723788539b2d9230d463337','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21527','GHBC-REQ-021527','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.6','GHBC-C-005515','Here it is not only necessary to consider the air-borne sound insulation but it is also necessary to consider the question of structure-borne and impact noise transmitted from areas where there might be dancing late into the night.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','684351b3197fa38967c841fb0a73766f34b5b09cd70b5b54ded99029a0dcc25b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21528','GHBC-REQ-021528','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.7','GHBC-C-005516','encountered in hotels are applicable to hostels, the latter are normally of more economical construction and, therefore, cannot cater for special sound insulation provisions.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e8d535b7c4196cddda82a71b1a3caab5cafd6df4aa12050f672a8c26b64043e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21529','GHBC-REQ-021529','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.7','GHBC-C-005516','However, as far as possible, precautions should be taken to provide comfortable conditions in hostel rooms.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','49997c20aa6ca10c48fa6feb5b34a66674bfbe2c5d735f0a6c70954e601c25cc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21530','GHBC-REQ-021530','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.7','GHBC-C-005516','This is especially true for student hostels where each room is also a living room.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','55074b39f3ebb2241799f3c1758f82eac5326341419325279421c3f658f32b1c','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21531','GHBC-REQ-021531','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.7','GHBC-C-005516','Students might play music or have loud discussions late into the night.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e020b04a22c58eaf29d2c2f58123b2dd0b9386e70561eccae97206a571ae013','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21532','GHBC-REQ-021532','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.7','GHBC-C-005516','This may disturb sleep or study of other students.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b36965e10dc578e24976fa1dc752240d4b76e54da5788f714848a4f1b8dd108f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21533','GHBC-REQ-021533','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.8.2.2.7','GHBC-C-005516','Proper precautions should, therefore, be taken to provide satisfactory conditions.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d07a8047fc482e27395f2ecb8253481987cc18a15ac78808368f585fcb15ccb7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21534','GHBC-REQ-021534','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.1','GHBC-C-005518','Industrial buildings are primarily producers rather than receivers of noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bfe7b646fc7ec69b2bc94215f943cf5aed4b2c4c983bb1c17bca9d2342d83840','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21535','GHBC-REQ-021535','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.1','GHBC-C-005518','The level of industrial noise commonly exceeds that from any other source with the exception of aircraft.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e601f83234cf4e45bbb6b245092a8cd3eb1e2e1549849a2962f077ea2ebe8f3d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21536','GHBC-REQ-021536','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.1','GHBC-C-005518','As compared with traffic noise, its effects are less widespread but it is often more annoying in character.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e855b899c34ac29d0e1d909eb06594b72c879f402d877ad24ac4a8b5b55af804','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21537','GHBC-REQ-021537','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.1.1','GHBC-C-005519','strong high frequency whines, screeches and clatter – these components are relatively more attenuated by passage through the air and by the insulation of light structure than are lower frequencies.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4967039203405e1027d2b705d70923b5f07262a673191a0d000c55f912da2ca3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21538','GHBC-REQ-021538','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1','GHBC-C-005521','mainly of indoor origin.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f0647643e98f4145f1a4035c57cd18e2026236c2952513cab59f7d7cc7710698','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21539','GHBC-REQ-021539','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1','GHBC-C-005521','Noise in factories and workshops is generally caused by machine tools and by operations involved in making and handling the product and they are classified into the following groups, depending upon how the noise energy is generated.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1204d8bee8d6cde42d8d9308797b2bc518b38e72995dc6af9c0214a9e6fc3b8b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21540','GHBC-REQ-021540','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.1','GHBC-C-005522','Noise caused by impact is the most intense and widespread of all industrial noises.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','af75741e07106f995dcf9adc26aeae44c39a48e6502a01f331b19598c4d08e39','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21541','GHBC-REQ-021541','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.1','GHBC-C-005522','It is normally coupled with resonant response of the structural members connected to the impacting surface.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3cf615986ee4871e206ccb83150aba70210e0fae484ecd042e601853d8fbf6d3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21542','GHBC-REQ-021542','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.1','GHBC-C-005522','Common sources of this type of noise are forging, riveting, chipping, pressing, tumbling, cutting, weaving, etc. Intense impact noise may also be produced during handling of materials as in the case of sheared steel plates falling one over another in collecting trays in a steel factory.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','03a67047348ebf728d34d208c27b85cfa1037c522194d8014bfe238450afe7bd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21543','GHBC-REQ-021543','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.1','GHBC-C-005522','Impact noise is usually intermittent and impulsive in character, but it may also be continuous as in the case of tumbling.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c594c90b2b2cca2a4ac5b41bb808d28682b62cedff6eee3514ced700b328b1f2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21544','GHBC-REQ-021544','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005523','Most of the noise due to friction is produced in such processes as sawing, grinding and sanding.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','00e2adaf6d4ea41c3d9afb149ba9fad4a9637ddf336b909674402c5cca3f14ac','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21545','GHBC-REQ-021545','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005523','Friction also occurs at the cutting edge on lathes and other machine tools and in brakes and from bearings.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','770cea4640a68347d7fff93e6ca5fca8753c1f955fa57a4d01725e596a48ef09','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21546','GHBC-REQ-021546','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005523','The spectrum of frictional noise often predominates in high frequency and is very unpleasant in character.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9f335227a8e46efddda5b780cb26c12472fdbd0548f8a84fc5be8f88dcc1397b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21547','GHBC-REQ-021547','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.3','GHBC-C-005524','A rotating or reciprocating machine generates noise due to unbalanced forces and/or pressure fluctuations in the fluids inside the machines.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ea4c709ec0fefb7c8263b644ca19ed352b56373bc436f61377661282c5971217','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21548','GHBC-REQ-021548','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.3','GHBC-C-005524','In many cases, the moving surfaces radiate noise directly and in other cases, the pressure fluctuations are','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7d0bb6e4794c2ed507d8f90465d8cb8410863343df6f41950c02a9fb4fa7f93a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21549','GHBC-REQ-021549','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.3','GHBC-C-005524','transmitted to the outer casing of the machine from where they are radiated as noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d0ce1391580dcc052af6cc1c8fa3b3105d5af1d6e480aea6e2165a96895102e9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21550','GHBC-REQ-021550','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.3','GHBC-C-005524','Interaction of rotating component with the fluid stream can also give rise to pure tone components, such as the whine in a turbine.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d4bdb2bd514dc1513ec7c3ec22879950679dff34c798709ceb28fe00793a5428','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21551','GHBC-REQ-021551','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.3','GHBC-C-005524','Since most machine casings have radiation efficiencies of unity in the higher frequency range, the amount of sound radiated is often substantial.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','722c661f7a8f595e293d56471da06660712a9347fd3604e832296ad93559a5c1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21552','GHBC-REQ-021552','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.4','GHBC-C-005525','Noise may be generated by rapid variation in air pressure caused by turbulence from high velocity air, steam or gases.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7e23ad20edd2744ed08f9e05ec3153851e7833cd5e3e6d92244e224ed910de07','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21553','GHBC-REQ-021553','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.4','GHBC-C-005525','Common examples are the exhaust noise from pneumatic tools and air jets.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','de3ec41961432efcd6aa8b8c4af697dbffa149579f00326277f68940566ddcb2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21554','GHBC-REQ-021554','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.4','GHBC-C-005525','The noise is intense, and broad based in character and the frequency criteria depends on the size of the jet.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a59e65d039207458fdfd1fbd0c712920642d456a9f3956e95d88b96da0323beb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21555','GHBC-REQ-021555','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.4','GHBC-C-005525','The intensity increases rapidly with the velocity of the air stream.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c9efe8ef8b48975555a883bb5a2c0c4fc7b6c6937cd6cabaad5a576228065dbe','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21556','GHBC-REQ-021556','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.2.1.4','GHBC-C-005525','29.4.9.2.1.5 Noises with pure tone components Whining noise from turbines and humming noise from transformers come under this group.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','48349fd52c97beedda3b6dc9d475acaf43e499c9fe1af4918abd9f5ca99cd5f6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21557','GHBC-REQ-021557','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.3.1','GHBC-C-005527','Continuous exposure to high noise levels may result in permanent noise induced hearing loss in the course of time.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d4816d9ae4ae018a89b1820e002116c4379cbeb4961c5307d63f337e286c36c7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21558','GHBC-REQ-021558','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.3.1','GHBC-C-005527','Damage-risk criteria specify the maximum levels and duration of noise exposure that may be considered safe.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','25a2ecf500c2f6b12125abe66b963640e08fbecd168ddde129173b1293b71fe2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21559','GHBC-REQ-021559','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.3.1','GHBC-C-005527','Generally accepted damage-risk criteria for exposure to continuous, steady broad band noise are shown in Table 7.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3c1685c2e8d230f7e8b765e1a302fe55c3dc4da38d355c14b9ec1f582915edc5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21560','GHBC-REQ-021560','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.3.1','GHBC-C-005527','Whenever the sound levels at the workers position in a factory exceed the levels and the duration suggested, feasible engineering controls shall be utilized to reduce the sound to the limits shown.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2c5eac508778e793a3f09cf59ac372903d668ca74d6165f442d98521c0bb0fe4','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21561','GHBC-REQ-021561','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.3.1','GHBC-C-005527','If such controls fail to reduce sound levels within the levels of Table 7, personal hearing protection equipment shall be provided and used to reduce sound levels within the level shown.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','506cc276d307ce9cd6827a187f955c2c5a6f30d83e92fbdd4b4a54b0a7207f0d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21562','GHBC-REQ-021562','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.3.2','GHBC-C-005528','In factories where audible warning signals are used, or where an operator follows the operation of his machine by ear, the background noise should not be so loud as to mask the signal or desired sound (the information sound) to be heard.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e31c1c6572525bcf7ea917bf6abcd62198f6c534c897b5fc3d437780d6ca6fa3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21563','GHBC-REQ-021563','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.3.2','GHBC-C-005528','Noise may be the cause of accidents by hindering communication or by masking warning signals.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','54ec0327f29f949cf13ea305d3e1da27476968a9d434314ec1fb581a6cf94831','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21564','GHBC-REQ-021564','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.4.1','GHBC-C-005530','Machines, processes and work areas which are approximately equally noisy should be located together as far as possible.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','79184547c12b5d849c3eda3893d8f37ff648fe8de1dc6369875aa24d66ade3ce','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21565','GHBC-REQ-021565','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.4.1','GHBC-C-005530','Areas that are particularly noisy should be segregated from quiet areas by buffer zones that produce and may tolerate intermediate noise levels.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7e99a6ac8737764edef0a1a916db7518fb3d519ca676f747940eb42baa5c1c3e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21566','GHBC-REQ-021566','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.4.2','GHBC-C-005531','The office space in an industrial facility should be as far as possible located preferably in a separate building.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','efed08473ba18bc924c2b1c146ae9d2a597d4bda8421c2ef0eb733ab9aae523a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21567','GHBC-REQ-021567','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.4.2','GHBC-C-005531','This building should not have a wall common with the production area.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','be5388357c2fecf2502e9d0d01ad23b8f06d495316251b7e5c962a785e3b53a4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21568','GHBC-REQ-021568','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.4.2','GHBC-C-005531','Where a common wall is unavoidable, it should be heavy with few connecting doors and no permanent openings.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','609483921270ea18c2942ded9ab28e23a4e7654883693b60de90f0c4d5705404','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21569','GHBC-REQ-021569','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.4.3.1','GHBC-C-005533','Noise should be reduced as near the source as possible.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','82c4d8c2eddf4593059e97f6884cb79f137db0457e674a924b6a874d72800ed7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21570','GHBC-REQ-021570','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.4.3.1','GHBC-C-005533','While the operational processes in a factory maybe fixed and may have no quieter alternative, careful selection of the machine tools and equipment to be used may considerably help attaining lower noise levels in the machine shop.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','15dd896df5c432fbd4c7b5187b676da5f51092edf00f473bda40d182d7494fa9','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
