('rowid-21572','GHBC-REQ-021572','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.9.4.3.2','GHBC-C-005534','Noise from handling and dropping of materials on hard surface may be reduced by using soft resilient materials on containers, fixing rubber tyres on trucks, trolleys, etc. Machine noise may be kept to a minimum by proper maintenance.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8fa8dba1490893055b5bd3395664473414e710cc4ed9f921ee251ee91360e8b2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
