('rowid-21712','GHBC-REQ-021712','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.11.3.2','GHBC-C-005566','the Rw for the roof 5 to 10 dB less provided the building is not unduly exposed to noise from aircraft in flight.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a7747abc177a478b502f485aa2d6e4fa42036366a5477d3ede6726f3ff8fcc22','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21713','GHBC-REQ-021713','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.11.3.2','GHBC-C-005566','Surrounding the auditorium with ancillary rooms and foyers is an obvious and invaluable planning method of obtaining the required insulation against outdoor noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','30a30ba79f02fc25f2b6dd1f3cf82abf3565958c9a23f78b11c429494055888a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21714','GHBC-REQ-021714','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.11.3.4','GHBC-C-005567','vulnerable features in the defence against external noise.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','26930b8f280b93fe09abc8b030571dc9c9caebda72e40bc3dc84910d0d10a5b5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21715','GHBC-REQ-021715','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.11.3.4','GHBC-C-005567','They should be positioned so as to avoid exposure to noise, and in addition sufficient length of both inlet and outlet ducts should be provided with carefully designed silencers.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ca739bcd5368ec34eba6d6adfa79c2591b4234e65c26f05b888962625858555c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21716','GHBC-REQ-021716','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.11.3.4','GHBC-C-005567','The ventilation system should also be designed to avoid transmitting or adding to internal noise.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3f957c2c01a265d72dfd4b7464159a25e41f9fddc7dbbe18dd49eb31b3c774ad','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21717','GHBC-REQ-021717','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.11.3.6','GHBC-C-005568','rehearsal rooms, scenery bays and workshops, stages of other halls where rehearsals or erection of stage sets might be in progress and foyers and bars where loud conversation might occur.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','097e1c7117d236700dcf30180fad90f91b72b2f8ee49a85f2c6be5f435255321','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21718','GHBC-REQ-021718','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.4.11.3.6','GHBC-C-005568','The insulation of the internal walls should be adequate to protect the auditorium from these noise sources and the insulation should not be by-','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e35459ff11bf4ee65c80f7bd9757e879cad60cd2dab4eff5a1b65fe55a2f0dfa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
