('rowid-21854','GHBC-REQ-021854','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','E-4 BROADCASTING AND RECORDING STUDIOS Broadcasting and recording studios have requirements similar to those of performing spaces.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c9a35568c2a43ff7fc11a08c3334340ee65bc8191492253ba419f9e362175796','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21855','GHBC-REQ-021855','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','For some infrequent intrusive noises, the requirements are sometimes relaxed on the grounds that a re-take of a recording can be done, but this can result in higher operating costs.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','23e0b870196fc8750f3a5d1bf929d32ae87024d27f283a7eadd2386fe5766046','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21856','GHBC-REQ-021856','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','E-5 AIRCRAFT NOISE As there are many variables affecting the level of aircraft noise heard on the ground, expert advice is almost always required.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1eaeb3b5116631d6505d8e724816c63e093a2fc4df9c72c3deab55aa58889e73','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21857','GHBC-REQ-021857','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','Contours of daytime LAeq.T levels are available from most major airports.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2f4bc181a62f8a8e64ba8faad0dfdda46904c3725568319fd8772566f366f88e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21858','GHBC-REQ-021858','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','Where measurements of façade insulation are necessary a standard test method may be preferred.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c60297c005d413cd62a8cd39c0c5e70bb33c0d15bc55ccef812ecb29ce655da0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21859','GHBC-REQ-021859','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','E-6 GROUND-BORNE NOISE Projects involving ground-borne noise from underground trains usually require expert advice.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','14cd8bdd0f133085ca6913e08c9d690f63409ca04577e86ff360c055cb762802','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21860','GHBC-REQ-021860','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','E-7 LOW-FREQUENCY NOISE Projects involving low-frequency noise usually require expert advice as accurate measurement is difficult and there is a shortage of reliable data below 100 Hz.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":-7,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"E-7 LOW-FREQUENCY NOISE Projects in"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":100,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"ortage of reliable data below 100 Hz."}]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c55fc1435af38d881cd48e26575b029618d974610507d131af6b63be96fe59ce','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21861','GHBC-REQ-021861','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','E-8 ACTIVE NOISE CONTROL Active noise control is the reduction of noise by cancellation with a similar noise (anti-noise) generated by electro-acoustic means.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1add70da6a5f09c98111d1e452d3eaa4faec8341a311a6c6fedf44e296c8d4aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21862','GHBC-REQ-021862','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','The technique is still under development, but commercial systems are available which successfully reduce low frequency noise from mechanical ventilation systems.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b534ecea6c09b3f287ceb9342ca4d13c52b062fd85d9fb4412a874c0845f7573','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21863','GHBC-REQ-021863','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','E-9 NOISE SURVEYS Noise surveys are carried out for a variety of reasons, for example. a) before construction, to establish the existing noise climate at the site of a proposed development where reliable prediction is impracticable, as an aid to the design of the building envelope, either to protect against external noise or contain internally produced noise;','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','20600b4460a13da39771e556cbe59f2a752bcdf278295c30ec53a7e03c1e69da','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21864','GHBC-REQ-021864','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','b) during construction, to monitor noise from building activity, either to assess the likely nuisance to the local community or the risk of hearing damage to the work force; c) at the end of a building contract to check the insulation of the building envelope, or the noise levels produced by the services; d) as part of a planning requirement; and e) to provide objective evidence to support or defend a legal action.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','da5182f41fa33b97766a1e8ac014b1b36cb66fed42a8c947d9dffb0e3723a5b2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21865','GHBC-REQ-021865','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','The expense of carrying out a comprehensive noise survey of any kind is likely to be high, so the cost-effectiveness of a full or partial survey should be weighed against alternatives such as prediction.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0513fd4a9d6acd9a97b85cd8e19ecae78f6d2d42a25182163b0710d5f2cb8dc0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21866','GHBC-REQ-021866','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','A survey will generally be more accurate and can take account of factor such as prevailing wind conditions.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cd34a870d9d2ccd78ace69fa682aa7e4353d5f3da3809f2cc89727a5444fdb8e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21867','GHBC-REQ-021867','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','APPENDIX ‗F‘ (Clause 9.4.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','57679fc43cc489fc7a32c4cc5379b1934f610958b7c1105e61719ae9bd72afea','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21868','GHBC-REQ-021868','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','4.4) AIR-BORNE AND IMPACT SOUND INSULATION F-1 GENERAL Air-borne sound refers to sources which produce sound by directly setting the air around them into vibration.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c02c74277731e4618b1c7fc0b1b50c4270856eb3e1fe0f5165c45c5c0a2566df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21869','GHBC-REQ-021869','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','Impact sound refers to sources which produce sound by impulsive mechanical excitation of part of a building (for example by footsteps, electric light switches, slamming doors).','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bc2fb4415f1fda0bc97cabd6f979c756dfae6a52f54e1634e33eef2c75c2c5f0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21870','GHBC-REQ-021870','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','Many sources of impact sound also produce significant levels of airborne sound.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a5039444ca641267be49f57f92880626bc2545572d02895806f958c797c1a7c9','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-21871','GHBC-REQ-021871','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','The term structure-borne sound has no very precise meaning as the structure can be excited by both airborne and impact sources; it is often used to refer to sound that travels for long distances via the structure, especially in connection with vibrating machinery linked directly to the structure.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1dcca0d8599f10b67a271cc304e6813ed4d1b8cfcfd64ab2e548f273eed5fda9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21872','GHBC-REQ-021872','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','F-2 DIRECT AND INDIRECT TRANSMISSION','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','53c3a72d549abb9c6ef9dea0e6e7136a9ff29d23d9ecf36e136e8b52eb44e920','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21873','GHBC-REQ-021873','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','rooms in a house where the construction consists of solid walls, etc. bonded together.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','77013dc40a5c99143761443fdbc8c240c23805e81999ffb97565b8e5713ca038','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21874','GHBC-REQ-021874','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','Sound traveling from room 1 to room 2 may travel via the direct path a-a and by the many indirect, or flanking paths shown.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"traveling from room 1 to room 2 may travel via the direct path "}]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2cf8a346950217b55b7601ab7fa66ff6d1a8b499e45e1949f8061b2ac3e8540d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21875','GHBC-REQ-021875','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','The term','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','57914e4ef9edca223593feec68a0d510a4c95d40cb983b12b17f758a1dc743df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21876','GHBC-REQ-021876','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','flanking transmission is usually used to mean transmission paths involving the structure, while the term indirect transmission includes flanking paths and airborne paths through gaps and ducts, etc. The indirect paths may limit the sound insulation attainable no matter how much the direct sound is reduced by the separating wall or floor.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','92a5d2e0ac9b25e1b048ff6327490f5c125831921c84c0796e43584f0e7c192b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21877','GHBC-REQ-021877','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','The indirect transmission can be reduced by measures such as the following: a) Increasing the mass of the flanking walls; b) Increasing the mass of the partition and bonding it to the flanking walls; c) Introducing discontinuities in the indirect paths; d) Erecting independent wall linings adjacent to the flanking walls to prevent energy','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','32a627881c26522cd3470016934a9720cf974ce8cbf4af01cae691196a7bcf22','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21878','GHBC-REQ-021878','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','entering the flanking construction; and e) Sealing any air gaps and paths through ducts.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','132454ecf97ea086858a2073280a465db79f944f739b9ce08f270aea0f31f235','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21879','GHBC-REQ-021879','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','have been found in offices.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0fe6bce1822edb9b0d4e8a025774acc6ffb01fe43a357b4e1b3ca8b86f034769','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-21880','GHBC-REQ-021880','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005572','It is important to remember that standard test laboratories are designed to minimize transmission by all paths other than the direct path.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 10","is 10","IS 11050:1984"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b33ab744114f7cea570551e50835024a821c82f4d4ea0a9d9e890d271fb724bd','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
