('rowid-22062','GHBC-REQ-022062','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005574','In many cases, simple solid partition give insulation values according to their mass (see F-3.3).','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4c6aa39a51c54186e4134b8847584f575a467ed0cfc483168c55ed277c97fa69','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22063','GHBC-REQ-022063','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005574','Moreover, with partitions of this type there is usually little variation between field and laboratory test results unless the laboratory insulation exceeds 45 dB.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7e62bf1b46bf795a447021e99bd60ec3b59eff582d64b90c9bf66f483659cd7c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22064','GHBC-REQ-022064','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005574','Exceptions may occur in buildings that have not been specially designed to minimize common cavities and strongly coupled elements in lightweight paneling.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5c5237ed19383fbece20136703b4b9fbf2546b9efc3c51d4ae2e5be4d245a0c4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
