('rowid-22066','GHBC-REQ-022066','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005574','Flanking structures are not listed since these can vary widely and are often dependent upon other factors such as thermal insulation, which are outside the scope of this Code.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','390963e29108c1963bd65c1fa586df6057d7f57b29b61618847fa5f709dc9acf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22067','GHBC-REQ-022067','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005575','(Clause 9.4.13.1)','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2c4b5b51ab6e0325813b28cc8efc0f90fde3b3ed572b55d952675052218fd276','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22068','GHBC-REQ-022068','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005576','G-1 When selecting fans and other related mechanical equipment and when designing air distribution systems to minimize the sound transmitted from different components to the occupied spaces that they serve, the following recommendations should be considered: a) Design the air distribution system to minimize flow resistance and turbulence.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3e44d9813a0dd33ab3f530ff0faa7d589f480425aa41df46cc0316dce6b1cac5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22069','GHBC-REQ-022069','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005576','High flow resistance increases the required fan pressure, which results in higher noise being generated by the fan.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8759ce3630f253ba75d47b17952392a8a9dc8f501840eee1cae0d347b44201b1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22070','GHBC-REQ-022070','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005576','Turbulence increases the flow noise generated by duct fittings and dampers in the air distribution system, especially at low frequencies.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9835e5a6a504632b976749806938728857a3023926eeba275a37364b13911eca','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
