('rowid-22073','GHBC-REQ-022073','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-005576','It is recommended that an equipment noise data sheet be furnished to intended bidders of mechanical equipment such as airconditioning, heating and mechanical ventilation machinery or diesel generation units specifying noise requirements at the time of request for quotation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29552dfdd155b19b1c78a0c58477a2f744f926f4899f92d2360f9f61ab3cfea1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
