('rowid-22075','GHBC-REQ-022075','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5','GHBC-C-005577','For Gas supply, installation and inspection shall comply with Ghana Standards.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2572c19e78b65b2f25540c3bd6600c2825bfdc404c1f582bb5f7536d3696f1ef','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22076','GHBC-REQ-022076','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.1','GHBC-C-005578','This clause covers the requirements regarding the safety of persons and property for all piping uses and for all types of gases used for fuel or lighting purposes in buildings.This Clause does not cover safety rules for gas burning appliances.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','64aacd30074752aa86803fec6d72967c0cbf9039cfcc432a30ecea3b2bacb028','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22077','GHBC-REQ-022077','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2','GHBC-C-005579','For the purpose of this Clause, the following definitions shall apply: Appliance valve – A device that will shut-off the gas supply to the burner(s).','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','73a997fa5f6ac4549157c4f6990ecaced1f77f47404c9ca9534e50b218cf26d0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22078','GHBC-REQ-022078','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2','GHBC-C-005579','Authority having jurisdiction – The Authority which has been created by a statute and which, for the purpose of administering the Code/Part, may authorize a committee or an official to act on its behalf; hereinafter called the ‗Authority‘.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1c73a5b98cdda519a600529220c145e08f1860b6b0c41c9915a55ffc67176c4f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22079','GHBC-REQ-022079','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2','GHBC-C-005579','Customer‘s/Consumer‘s connection – Piping tapped on riser to supply each individual customer/consumer.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f79db0810a4a41cf023919258c3a98d040013f518e1528f930abce86bffb2f2c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
