('rowid-22082','GHBC-REQ-022082','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2','GHBC-C-005579','Pressure regulator – A device designed to lower the pressure of gas coming from the distribution main and to maintain it practically constants downstream.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29f25f6cdd8a01e9a5bad6866174c96552b286fc4ec95b105c7a762cc6bce6d3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22083','GHBC-REQ-022083','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2','GHBC-C-005579','This normal operation pressure shall be practically in all cases that of the gas appliances used.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a387f7861c5c9962af394a49447e0ab1f2e1e1923c746b407e6c713abc438f62','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
