('rowid-22095','GHBC-REQ-022095','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005583','places the reuction of pressure from main distribution source of 400 kN/m2 to directly operating pressure (say 2.1 kN/m2, 10 kN/m2, 30 kN/m2, 200 kN/m2) is achieved in single stage pressure reduction.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":400,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":"m main distribution source of 400 kN/m2 to directly operating pres"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.1,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":"ectly operating pressure (say 2.1 kN/m2, 10 kN/m2, 30 kN/m2, 200 k"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":"ting pressure (say 2.1 kN/m2, 10 kN/m2, 30 kN/m2, 200 kN/m2) is a"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":"ure (say 2.1 kN/m2, 10 kN/m2, 30 kN/m2, 200 kN/m2) is achieved in"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":200,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":".1 kN/m2, 10 kN/m2, 30 kN/m2, 200 kN/m2) is achieved in single sta"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3379f634900156d781b06d4def0290ceb7238653d71e914ee092f44967cc7f9a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22096','GHBC-REQ-022096','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005584','If located inside a building, the required regulator shall comply with the following: a) If any of the diaphragms of the regulator ruptures, the gas shall be sent to an outlet vent pipe made of brass or plastic in order','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','67a179503971947d410167ed2bc65b85cff380b97816a6528c4980cb7ca69818','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22097','GHBC-REQ-022097','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005584','to ventilate or drain the gas out of the building.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0ea531c8123ffabceec8c67d8b8e1e7182bf63838485f1c68176aba491914ea4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22098','GHBC-REQ-022098','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005584','The vent pipe will, however, lead to outer air about 1m above the topmost storey of the building.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ever, lead to outer air about 1m above the topmost storey of t"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','02d3dd6b75b8f77a4fe299403d324c2f563130b8aece075f7b2c33d57813cf52','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22099','GHBC-REQ-022099','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2.2','GHBC-C-005584','Means shall be employed to prevent water from entering this pipe and also to prevent stoppage of it by insects or other foreign bodies. b) If the gas pressure at the outlet of the regular falls below 50 percent of the operating gas pressure or rises above twice the operating gas pressure, the gas input to the pressure regulator shall be cut off. c) In the event of malfunctioning of this safety device, a supplementary device shall connect the low pressure circuit to the outlet circuit (vent pipe) as soon as the exit pressure reaches 7 kN/m2.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"et of the regular falls below 50 percent of the operating gas pressure"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":7,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":" as the exit pressure reaches 7 kN/m2."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4fdcd790c641285f8773aac22ea2bfae4c7d4ce6fb15798cd93d1a7426c7d7a3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22100','GHBC-REQ-022100','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.2.3','GHBC-C-005585','It shall also be ensured by the supply authority that the calorific value and supply pressure of gas shall not exceed the values for the type of gas used.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','07fa49f7c4d19bec4a4cc2a44c33b41916593a150349dd0bfe30b0bc2c2d3dac','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-22101','GHBC-REQ-022101','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.3.1','GHBC-C-005587','Service shut-off valves shall be installed on all new services including replacements in a readily accessible location.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4ab3d3d236daaf7dc0fe2ae52db1d91dcc45182a8088ca061ed68c17a23aba8c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22102','GHBC-REQ-022102','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.3.2','GHBC-C-005588','Service shut-off valves shall be located upstream of the meter if there is no regulator or upstream of the regulator, if there is one.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','408bc7ee517dc1e1c6e84c75c20caf39ac2b5b99806a952fc6d01837efda0093','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22103','GHBC-REQ-022103','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.3.2.1','GHBC-C-005589','Service shut – off valves shall be located in the upstream of the meter, if a single regulator is supplying more than one consumer and each such stream shall have one additional shut off valve upstream of regulator.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0cecce839294a1e830ff8b236721c8394c0c79b46ac713750cf78ddcccfeb5d7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22104','GHBC-REQ-022104','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.3.3','GHBC-C-005590','greater than 7 kN/m2 shall be equipped with an approved service shut-off valve located on the service pipe outside the building.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":7,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":"greater than 7 kN/m2 shall be equipped with an "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"greater than 7 kN/m2 shall be equipped with an appro"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3d8daaf6d917a3cd204f993d11fd8eb5c580b01dd9daffefcbc0b2c70a543021','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22105','GHBC-REQ-022105','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.3.3','GHBC-C-005590','9.7.4.4 Underground shut-off valves shall be located in a covered durable curb box, manhole, vault or stand pipe which is designed to permit ready operation of the valve and the covers of which shall be clearly marked ‗Gas‘.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f11ce065dc25afc9028d39d5a7f69f6abfd9c9c7e1d0f79518289d6103b05be7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22106','GHBC-REQ-022106','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.4','GHBC-C-005591','Nothing herein shall prohibit the continued use of existing system of the gas piping without','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fcfa51ff65e63efddbb1f2ebd7fe61860505d64b5b56ba61dc433001fbe87a7a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22107','GHBC-REQ-022107','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.4','GHBC-C-005591','further inspection or test, unless the Authority has reason to believe that defects which make the system dangerous to life or property exist.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d3ed00f0e8d5690a1bf871357838fc6126e75187b05212204108d18fb3b4b2b6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22108','GHBC-REQ-022108','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.5','GHBC-C-005592','Rules for turning gas on','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c8dc687515b90fe2fcf3b0c6c242ac3197ae2b92b43e99e198c6c72e176c2734','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22109','GHBC-REQ-022109','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.5.1','GHBC-C-005593','No person, unless is the employ of the gas company or having permission from the gas company, shall turn on the gas at a service shut-off valve or at any valve that controls the supply of gas to more than one consumer.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bf358daeaee4e7b1be579f3f86e382653b2fef8ff0f03304ff9ff792ee551ea1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22110','GHBC-REQ-022110','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.5.2','GHBC-C-005594','Gas shall not be turned on at any meter valve without specific permission from the gas company or other authority if any of the following conditions exists. a) If the gas piping appliances or meter supply through the meter valve are known to leak or otherwise to be defective (see 10). b) If required inspection of the piping or appliance has not been made. c) If the gas company or other authority has requested that the gas be left turned off. d) If the meter valve is found shut off for some reason not known to the gas fitter.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8b691ca893c0bd0b1c66874d892d9e932581961dfe61d63146d4eda2e09a2516','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-22111','GHBC-REQ-022111','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.5.2','GHBC-C-005594','The gas shall not be turned on in the event of fire.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d6eb09467344916fb39822d8239c58e9df342cb9e32f3887d0c3b7a0e104b488','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22112','GHBC-REQ-022112','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005595','Gas shall not be turned on at any branch line valve if any of the conditions specified in this Code prevails.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a4d74764d7043444336fa3e3fc67fa2b6d8f117a91f90d16f405917a9a172220','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22113','GHBC-REQ-022113','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.5.3','GHBC-C-005595','Where a branch line valve is found closed, a gas fitter shall again turn the gas on at such valve only if proper precautions to prevent leakage are taken and no other unsafe conditions are created thereby.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7df9ebe1402566e6d5da9a5a71acf9185bec1bbe8b85ea22a8e84a0782473626','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22114','GHBC-REQ-022114','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.5.4','GHBC-C-005596','Gas shall not be turned on at either the meter valve or service line unless all gas keys or valves provided on all outlets in the piping system are closed or all outlets in the piping system are capped or plugged.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ee48721ddc891b51348fe79354fd3274d46a11d25bfc093669b0232e953b372b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22115','GHBC-REQ-022115','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.6.1','GHBC-C-005598','The gas fitter shall put the gas off to any appliance, pipe or piping system and shall leave the gas turned off, until the causes for interrupting the supply has been removed in any one of the following cases: a) If ordered to do so by the Authority','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','30d98092d06f440014d44a5edde9bc421675d6a09bf2b31ce7bb631e110056b6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22116','GHBC-REQ-022116','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.6.1','GHBC-C-005598','b) If leakage of gas is noted, which appears dot be sufficient to cause fire, explosion or asphyxiation c) If an installation of some gas appliance is found to be such as to cause a serious hazard to persons or property. d) If any condition exists which threatens interruption of gas supply which may cause burner outage or otherwise prove dangerous.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','553708547773c9a104c395ad909149858aa3c6b2805b14f3d6654d6234e92551','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22117','GHBC-REQ-022117','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.6.2','GHBC-C-005599','It shall be the duty of the installing agency when the gas supply is to be turned off to notify all affected consumers.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b864f28dc4c0e1afddf38b25697d092c6a752ab1b82b13963bb2d01801d6891b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22118','GHBC-REQ-022118','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.6.3','GHBC-C-005600','Before turning off the gas at the meter, for the purpose of installation, repair, replacement or maintenance of piping or appliance, all burner and pipplot valves on the premises supplied with gas through the meter shall be turned off and the meter test hand observed for a sufficient length of time to ascertain that there is no gas passing through the meter.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e6863f8e1a234546fbf219744891743e74ec4a13c4194d36f4dd4a0eaa4b900c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22119','GHBC-REQ-022119','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.6.3','GHBC-C-005600','Where there is more than one meter on the premises, precaution shall be exercised to ensure that the concerned meter is turned off.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ed77effbbfbf524d29510712090b90f60896d8a351abadde25ac3ff0233e7cb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22120','GHBC-REQ-022120','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.1','GHBC-C-005602','Installation, repair and replacement of gas piping or appliances shall be performed only by a qualified installing agency.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d17053849bdb3f44dcff098205b6f22f24c61bfb1059a3bad9221665d3e5c89c','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-22121','GHBC-REQ-022121','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.2.1','GHBC-C-005604','Piping shall be of wrought iron, steel, copper or cast iron when the gas pressure is less than 7kN/m2, with higher gas pressure e use of cast iron shall be prohibited.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":7,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"iron when the gas pressure is less than 7kN/m2, with higher gas pressur"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":7,"unit":"kn","operator":null,"context":"the gas pressure is less than 7kN/m2, with higher gas pressure "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9dfd6ddd851fbd90ee67f0f6df2419d09b625823668bb3754a5ee651c3e77ee9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22122','GHBC-REQ-022122','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.2.1.1','GHBC-C-005605','coated flexible pipe in rolls shall be permitted in low pressure system provided the pipe meets the required standard, to avoid the bends, fitting and leakages from the joint which are potential leakage points.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b18345bd625b7e51d3e68629eda8ed13ab1e384c789ae0f0681eb1cebbe39aed','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22123','GHBC-REQ-022123','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.2.1.1','GHBC-C-005605','Also reference may be made to accepted standard.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','35f1d6925c4ea72d0d6303f4d15c85c10c08d7ddbf5deeffed9009fb65d403ce','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22124','GHBC-REQ-022124','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.2.1.1','GHBC-C-005605','Heavy rubber flexible tube shall be permitted only as direct connection to burner form appliance valve.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8160380414e546d2484f6eee666b363c5f4d1e2a44f1bd64d2061df8cecb2e18','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22125','GHBC-REQ-022125','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.2.2','GHBC-C-005606','Gas piping shall be of such size and so installed as to provide supply of gas sufficient to meet the maximum demand without undue loss of pressure between the meter or service regulator when a meter is not provided, and the appliance(s).','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4da1f420951eeb18e5f7c491b98a4f8942efffe1860f7bb5f88e8fbae53cbd5c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22126','GHBC-REQ-022126','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.2.2.1','GHBC-C-005607','upon the following factors: a) Allowable loss in pressure from meter or service regulator, when a meter is not provided to appliance; b) Maximum consumption to be provided, c) Length of piping and number of fittings and d) Specific gravity of gas','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e098b871373d3c622f95a47f7e27a7d5bfd2f3e8796cd3fdd10b03ad6d19c61a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22127','GHBC-REQ-022127','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.2.2.2','GHBC-C-005608','shall be used.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','50645fe5ffae0fd9154465d51bcba5f4eedff995ccfb0e1109eda254de3a82db','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22128','GHBC-REQ-022128','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.2.3','GHBC-C-005609','of piping should be used.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ba66a6ceb07f1f392717f402a9964500fd8b994d5b8dfff8b2d637cd39cc6821','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22129','GHBC-REQ-022129','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.2.3','GHBC-C-005609','Where there are bends in the pipe line, these should have a radius of at least five times the diameter of the pipe.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2f48fec208d30f8c0cbdd37dcb75b4eb477c8611a90b5a37a5ac5b21b3699d00','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22130','GHBC-REQ-022130','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.2.4','GHBC-C-005610','shall be used on male threads only.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ceb650948694616c4f268651cdf273cde56b2783baeed899765185c42953f85d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-22131','GHBC-REQ-022131','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.3','GHBC-C-005611','The gas piping shall be of the colour stipulated by explosive authority to distinguish it from other piping and the piping shall be painted silver grey with read band of 150mm width.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"silver grey with read band of 150mm width."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3c1ed53db7bca645d7101a6295fb244fd58c0925211eb8b39cc64e10399e7b26','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22132','GHBC-REQ-022132','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.3','GHBC-C-005611','The gas pipeline shall be painted canary yellow in case of natural gas.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e520742ecd8815274089ae1d3b276e20098350f3101f76da647578c963c5dee0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22133','GHBC-REQ-022133','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.4.1','GHBC-C-005613','Piping shall be buried to a minimum depth of 1m or covered in a manner so as to protect the piping from physical damage.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" buried to a minimum depth of 1m or covered in a manner so as "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4d6b473d14a07027501f8a055c613a1032dc212182af968faea66b67c489c0bc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22134','GHBC-REQ-022134','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.4.2','GHBC-C-005614','Generally, all the piping within the premises where it has to run on the wall shall be exposed and should not be in contact with a wall to ensure that no corrosion takes place.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8bc1b123af9db69cba3f33c21e225973fb0eb7c68d0d35f49f48f5b82c098d33','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22135','GHBC-REQ-022135','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.4.2','GHBC-C-005614','Epoxy sealant or polyethylene conduit shall be used to ensure no contact of pipe with the wall in the situation of pipe crossing the wall.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e1c8e09f7966434d1b730fcf4bdc94ccca879283b03888ea3c6522c68c194446','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22136','GHBC-REQ-022136','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.4.2','GHBC-C-005614','Under ground or concealed gas pipeline in contact with earth or other materials which may corrode the piping shall be protected against corrosion by application of adequate corrosion resistant coating backed up by cathodic protection system.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','56382fba27fa98b16f811660c8867b0a6d182f5b93119764c385118bffd74566','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22137','GHBC-REQ-022137','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.5','GHBC-C-005615','The building shall not be weakened by the installation of any gas piping.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','feb3040b87ba963be0533a1c62b78d2fff3b4b1d9ead166c88af2885e7bcb79b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22138','GHBC-REQ-022138','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.6','GHBC-C-005616','Gas piping in building shall be supported with pipe hooks, metal pipe straps, bonds or hangers suitable for the size of piping','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1071672c6ffbef0f561e4d144b5e8093f3619801996159c2917fdfbb1fcfacd1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22139','GHBC-REQ-022139','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.6','GHBC-C-005616','and of adequate strength and quality and located at proper intervals so that the piping may not be moved accidentally from the installed position.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ac1527cd2c6b9c9d278800012e1b6bf1519e03990cba7ae7f74ffdb9ae83c1af','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22140','GHBC-REQ-022140','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.7','GHBC-C-005617','Where gas pipe enters a building through a wall or floor of masonry or concrete, any gas piping or other piping entering the walls or floors shall be suitably sealed against the entrance of water/moisture or gas.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bdbbe3c972d8d43092e52c305b4cc9982dfe32b84d037926769f70cd1ffb0449','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-22141','GHBC-REQ-022141','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.7','GHBC-C-005617','Regarding protection of openings in walls or floors, from fire, reference shall be made to Part 3: Use and Occupancy Classification.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','034a8a3d310879e6194d219842439d9c75a7c1bd7b4b03e9984ce0f8b04ebdda','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22142','GHBC-REQ-022142','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.7.1','GHBC-C-005618','Piping in solid floors, such as concrete, shall be laid in channels in the floors suitably covered to permit access to the piping with a minimum damage to the building.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b03a2677949affc0a76e1e6cfe7694915cfe8fe62eef5fde8e845c36c541ae5c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22143','GHBC-REQ-022143','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.7.2','GHBC-C-005619','Single pipe without joint shall be used for wall crossing in any building.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','acbe1874576fc7ef6acb800d781c0850b715a2f448e61a978736484cb363d7fb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22144','GHBC-REQ-022144','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.8','GHBC-C-005620','Gas pipe shall not be bent.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b349f159b5f67759f1578c06c85e38db1bc8619fdc1380113f6c517c705dc9b2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22145','GHBC-REQ-022145','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.8','GHBC-C-005620','Fittings shall be used when making turns in gas pipe.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','15f095d2cb050c02f4016f910250c26f02fc969f5f3d111854d193074918e42b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22146','GHBC-REQ-022146','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.9','GHBC-C-005621','Generally concealed piping shall not be allowed.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','338f61e1c0604509ebf1a2ad1dfb75ef75cf21628ee693d710cade91d382fb22','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22147','GHBC-REQ-022147','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.9','GHBC-C-005621','However, if it is necessary then it shall be under the Clause 29.5.7.4 of underground piping and all protection such as coating, cathodic protection shall be done.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','219a04b6b810af4f66cd946b99017301637a0b9d60c6f02e9cf6c03d4de4f710','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22148','GHBC-REQ-022148','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.10','GHBC-C-005622','A drip shall be provided in the gas distribution system, if the moisture contents in the gas is likely to reach saturation point at any stretch of pipe line in the system; a drip shall, however, be provided at any suitable point in the line of the pipe where condensate may collect and from where it can be easily removed.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f03bfc12f62833a989a1e01797bcd57eeac3cb5649361c73ed18bc7473e5fbf6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22149','GHBC-REQ-022149','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.10','GHBC-C-005622','This drip should be so installed as to constitute a trap where in an accumulation of condensate will shut off the flow of gas before it will run back into the meter.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6e3235b26a9cf647ea234cee11211d0c0e22e78bf608775c825a4926c91edf71','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22150','GHBC-REQ-022150','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.7.10.1','GHBC-C-005623','of gas consisting moisture content.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0d2dd78a9f7a6be0bdd71b455ae83fa5df511df252237741c3631031189260aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
