('rowid-22192','GHBC-REQ-022192','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.3','GHBC-C-005645','The following recommendations apply to installation in commercial =, industrial, educational and institutional premises.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a516f1632f72d3ad6cc551c84379ef0bd3ba34402067d2cd29f943f1fa806a96','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22193','GHBC-REQ-022193','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.3.1.1','GHBC-C-005647','Persons responsible for the installation of cylinders, equipment and piping should understand the characteristics of LPG and be trained in good practice of handling, installing and maintaining installations.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6ecdaebd7bea2b2daa51b69bb45ba94a16bf244301c11b90854baa831b10835a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22194','GHBC-REQ-022194','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.3.1.2','GHBC-C-005648','The jointing compound used at different joints in the system shall be decided by the Qualified Installing Agency.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8cea564a882aead874687ecbfd6e98e495f2b6b497b24cbf5e2cf5718e45b39c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22195','GHBC-REQ-022195','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.3.1.2','GHBC-C-005648','Hemp and similar materials shall not be used at the joint.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e7fe8db22e492b19b7761b1011cab4658a0af3c13e5abcd05a1ba973b9699c62','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22196','GHBC-REQ-022196','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.3.1.2','GHBC-C-005648','In any joint in which the thread provides a gastight seal, jointing compound shall be used only on the male thread.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8e4491b09a846b3d8f26cfde4e025ec72020ec1308724ee041fda16d757467dd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22197','GHBC-REQ-022197','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.3.1.3','GHBC-C-005649','type or carbon dioxide type conforming to accepted standards (9-2(4) shall be provided in places where LPG cylinder installations are situated and shall be located near such installations.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b0a435388dd152208e551584e76e993141afae775d16902338c0683e7b49c5f7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22198','GHBC-REQ-022198','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.3.1.3','GHBC-C-005649','Tow buckets filled with sand and two with water shall also be installed nearby.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fae8c111cc1dcf992aa59a3ac4275fc2604c9a1ed09e86bd426a1e7311638139','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
