('rowid-22235','GHBC-REQ-022235','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.3.4.3','GHBC-C-005665','A handbook containing all instructions with regard to the following aspects shall be supplied by supplier to the consumers: a) Operating of the whole system; b) How to recognize gas leaks; c) Action to be taken in case of leakage; d) Action to be taken in case of fire; and e) Action to be taken in case of damage to, or failure of any part of the installation.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','74de6c629e20e30cec244d2a475d226edcc91f11f8d9ed25b41c475c58e448a7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22236','GHBC-REQ-022236','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.3.6','GHBC-C-005666','installation of LPG cylinders in commercial, industrial, educational and institutional premises, reference may be made to good practice (9-2(6)).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','63f99f1dc9373e6bdf7fba49b6584330bd1c80eac6cdb99206f56f4f07417e31','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22237','GHBC-REQ-022237','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.4.0','GHBC-C-005668','apply to LPG bulk storage installations where storage tanks over 450 liters water capacity are used at industrial, commercial and domestic consumers‘ premises.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":450,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"ions where storage tanks over 450 liters water capacity are used "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','660f630174c224e84ec5973697d959907e7aa0eac69f09520db301376f73599c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22238','GHBC-REQ-022238','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.4.0','GHBC-C-005668','The maximum capacity of an individual tank and group of tanks at industrial, commercial and domestic premises shall be as follows;','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','36e2ed4e78dc37af7307e9c74af2ca10532e5d342750b20e837159fa610d9e07','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
