('rowid-22252','GHBC-REQ-022252','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.4.3.2','GHBC-C-005674','from the LPG tank lorry is a possibility, precautions against such damage shall not self-locking.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8dbd8a0674c5678a050342a34cb4da28b04f6459eb1fee44c332f48e8b601b74','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22253','GHBC-REQ-022253','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.4.3.3','GHBC-C-005675','Underground tanks shall be protected from above ground loading by providing a suitable curb to prevent a possible accidental damage to the tank and its fittings by LPG tank lorry.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7fcc22de57002a1324723796197b57df071b9c9dfddfa20d25c0e1df0eb5312f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22254','GHBC-REQ-022254','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.4.4','GHBC-C-005676','Road ignitable material, such as weeds, long grass or any combustible material shall be removed from an area within 3 m from the shell of any LPG tank of up to 2000 litres water capacity, and within 6 m from the shell of larger tanks.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2000,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":" the shell of any LPG tank of up to 2000 litres water capacity, and wi"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"e removed from an area within 3 m from the shell of any LPG tan"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2000,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"hell of any LPG tank of up to 2000 litres water capacity, and with"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"es water capacity, and within 6 m from the shell of larger tank"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','42f35087d5e5cefd418595b786c5eb935bef23f749ba4c1eb7b1612ebc82a1d2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22255','GHBC-REQ-022255','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.4.4','GHBC-C-005676','If weed killers are used, chemicals which are a potential source of fire hazards shall not be selected for this purpose.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cd7a180bf61b330d3b5fc851b3703db0f2535c7bf509c00d7a1af0d43e050671','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
