('rowid-22257','GHBC-REQ-022257','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.4.5','GHBC-C-005677','Prominent notices to this effect shall be posted at access point.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e4dcc10ab869ec475e09015db9f3b9c81e8640cc75d4937180b1bdcb9d1ff941','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22258','GHBC-REQ-022258','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.4.6','GHBC-C-005678','The possibility of a major fire outbreak, leading to direct flame impingement of the storage tank, shall be minimized by sound engineering in plant design and layout, good operating practice, and proper education and training of personnel on both routine operations and on action to be taken in an emergency.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a790fe01dc2c31f99a3183683149f6021bb14153a9d04a2ae785e763535ec4a9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22259','GHBC-REQ-022259','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.4.6.1','GHBC-C-005679','Provisions shall be made for an adequate supply of water and fire protection in the storage area according to the local hoses and mobile equipment, fixed monitors or by fixed spray systems which may be automatic.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3b3c6500ea32972de92be4c1e966711b836e0b64c87ef25b9c00f3b5508358ed','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22260','GHBC-REQ-022260','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.5.10.4.6.1','GHBC-C-005679','Control of water flow should be possible from outside any danger area.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f080c6bfaa6922c370d7a438863132af46e6f0ccbadc3fb3304c54355c1a5b84','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
