('rowid-22314','GHBC-REQ-022314','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.2.1.2','GHBC-C-005691','Equipment, appliance and system service rooms that house sources of odors, fumes, noxious gases, smoke, steam, dust, spray or other contaminants shall be designed and constructed so as to prevent spreading of such contaminants to other occupied parts of the building.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','713cc89957ee3f2b6702ee59bd565f434ee3adb5d02df73e0235bc5761b9364c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22315','GHBC-REQ-022315','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.2.1.4','GHBC-C-005692','The mechanical exhaust of high concentrations of dust or hazardous vapours shall conform to the requirements of Clause 29.6.10.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1adb3f33b6dcaef41153a5f60380b6b727655f4f3645cff3c5b9ca236e069017','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-22316','GHBC-REQ-022316','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.2.2','GHBC-C-005693','Compartments housing piping, pumps, air eliminators, water separators, hose reels and similar equipment used in aircraft fueling and defueling operations shall be adequately ventilated at floor level or within the floor itself.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','18e6b9d1377151237c65830ab74374c9858086ca50a14e2047a9c30086ece7e6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
