('rowid-22320','GHBC-REQ-022320','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.2.2','GHBC-C-005693','Stationary storage battery systems, as required by Clause 1206.2.11.3 of the Ghana Fire Code, shall be provided with ventilation in accordance with this part and Clause 29.6.2.4.1 or 29.6.2.4.2.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','921383dbb8aac4888cdbc9fcad0b1c598e61cc7312e022a3784774ce0d1e9aaf','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
