('rowid-22354','GHBC-REQ-022354','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.2.7.3.2','GHBC-C-005703','Air exhausted from spraying operations is allowed to be recirculated as makeup air to manned spraying operations where all of the conditions provided in Exception 1 are included in the installation and documents have been prepared to show that the installation does not pose a life safety hazard to personnel inside the spray booth, spraying space or spray room.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7cdbdd737f7a4675da001e6aae7071c2f4b77689b76356b992f5eb17af98a9a2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
