('rowid-22356','GHBC-REQ-022356','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.2.7.3.3','GHBC-C-005704','In addition, the spray booth shall be provided with mechanical ventilation so that the average air velocity through openings is in accordance with Clauses 29.6.2.7.3.3.1 and 29.6.2.7.3.3.2.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4a83b8abc5f816a9e9c9ac8fa69249fe20be16ee93cdf932371cfcbc1b321542','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
