('rowid-22986','GHBC-REQ-022986','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.6.2','GHBC-C-005826','Type I hoods shall be installed where cooking appliances produce grease or smoke as a result of the cooking process.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["A Type I hood shall not be required for an electric cooking appliance where an approved testing agency provides documentation that the appliance effluent contains 5 mg/m3 or less of grease when tested at an exhaust flow rate of 0.236 m3 /s (500 cfm) in accordance with UL 710B."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bc7c4c38d74b7f41591351ad26d3de0fa112ba377b5a037a9c92a572face0180','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
