('rowid-23072','GHBC-REQ-023072','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.7.1','GHBC-C-005854','Mechanical makeup air systems shall be automatically controlled to start and operate simultaneously with the exhaust system.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fdf0bf5250404e3329d08a283e00b86d5e44fe566e0de2c4fcbf54cd224328ff','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23073','GHBC-REQ-023073','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.7.1','GHBC-C-005854','Makeup air intake opening locations shall comply with Clause 401.4.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','516cbee459bc1253c23500a1e97d7ce8eb4ea0d7fa92218b66347bd38fab498a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23074','GHBC-REQ-023074','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.7.1.1','GHBC-C-005855','The temperature differential between makeup air and the air in the conditioned space shall not exceed 10ºF (6ºC) except where the added heating and cooling loads of the makeup air do not exceed the capacity of the HVAC system.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','61e41dfd6b9bc4a263d74e2c3b8be641ed08b4a490cb84d781cafffb3c3f1677','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23075','GHBC-REQ-023075','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.7.1.2','GHBC-C-005856','Design plans for a facility with a commercial kitchen ventilation system shall include a schedule or diagram indicating the design outdoor air balance.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','575f7239cbccd536e96f86b045afed1793741a5fdacb553acba27bcbb180b004','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23076','GHBC-REQ-023076','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.7.1.2','GHBC-C-005856','The design outdoor air balance shall indicate all exhaust and replacement air for the facility, plus the net exfiltration if applicable.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7ae0d8326530ed9b878513d86682888010676783d507ed79569b5e15d2af0494','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23077','GHBC-REQ-023077','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.7.1.2','GHBC-C-005856','The total replacement air airflow rate shall equal the total exhaust airflow rate plus the net exfiltration.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed6f0d797adf052f1b7f24c0dae02aa9aa623d6db4d4d0087cd14bade506f6ec','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23078','GHBC-REQ-023078','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.7.2','GHBC-C-005857','Manufacturers of compensating hoods shall provide a label indicating the minimum exhaust flow, the maximum makeup airflow or both that provides capture and containment of the exhaust effluent.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Compensating hoods with makeup air supplied only from the front face discharge and side face discharge openings shall not be required to be labeled with the maximum makeup airflow."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bf0c8629b0aeea7813edeadbdbb701c4a38b2ef6060f324c3d9148c6fdb9b303','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23079','GHBC-REQ-023079','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.7.2','GHBC-C-005857','EXCEPTIONS: Compensating hoods with makeup air supplied only from the front face discharge and side face discharge openings shall not be required to be labeled with the maximum makeup airflow.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Compensating hoods with makeup air supplied only from the front face discharge and side face discharge openings shall not be required to be labeled with the maximum makeup airflow."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','91e6c31469a859339af0be74a7b8ce7337e9ed3322ecc92e1c0c0f8c8ace512d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23080','GHBC-REQ-023080','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.8.1','GHBC-C-005859','Cooking appliances required by Clause 29.6.6.2 to have a Type I hood shall be provided with an approved automatic fire suppression system complying with the Ghana Building Code and the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4c68d5fa65d030f1e89f6ddd7838f6a88cab6a9aecaa9cef400dda69d8ff4e46','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-23081','GHBC-REQ-023081','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9','GHBC-C-005861','This clause shall govern the design and construction of duct systems for hazardous exhaust and shall determine where such systems are required.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b32a71f0488ca9feaa277de5c18819b3d95480609c6d83af67ed4af5449c7483','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23082','GHBC-REQ-023082','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9','GHBC-C-005861','Hazardous exhaust systems are systems designed to capture and control hazardous emissions generated from product handling or processes, and convey those emissions to the outdoors.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','35489ca453822b21a98fcdeec44e371b2ba49bba604033d00785fda0c2f10f0a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23083','GHBC-REQ-023083','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9','GHBC-C-005861','Hazardous emissions include flammable vapours, gases, fumes, mists or dusts, and volatile or airborne materials posing a health hazard, such as toxic or corrosive materials.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6a11c92fa4b8c2cfbb7b714094b658c87b1eda6229fdaf364439efcd88cdbcc3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23084','GHBC-REQ-023084','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9','GHBC-C-005861','For the purposes of this clause, the health-hazard rating of materials shall be as specified in the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','094d2b7d96b4133da93b094132bc0fbe87dbe4ef2357f6706aac7c8ec2edd3a3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23085','GHBC-REQ-023085','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9','GHBC-C-005861','For the purposes of the provisions of Clause 29.6.9, a laboratory shall be defined as a facility where the use of chemicals is related to testing, analysis, teaching, research or developmental activities.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b0560969ddf7be5cf105b3551ad9533820fe45c842c137445a0a6064c23c8aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23086','GHBC-REQ-023086','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9','GHBC-C-005861','Chemicals are used or synthesized on a nonproduction basis, rather than in a manufacturing process.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ffaac7e5c4b1f9ada3e029a47625a80731047fb5840296253ac4be6888cb694f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23087','GHBC-REQ-023087','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9.2','GHBC-C-005862','A hazardous exhaust system shall be required wherever operations involving the handling or processing of hazardous materials, in the','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Laboratories, as defined in Clause 29.6.9.1, except where the concentrations listed in Item 1 are exceeded or a vapour, gas, fume, mist or dust with a health-hazard rating of 1, 2, 3 or 4 is present in concentrations exceeding 1 percent of the median lethal concentration of the substance for acute inhalation toxicity."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','435aafcbbdf873a8244a665fa84fa00bd42bc32193e8a7d8a1e93c5760a894b7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23088','GHBC-REQ-023088','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9.2','GHBC-C-005862','absence of such exhaust systems and under normal operating conditions, have the potential to create one of the following conditions:','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Laboratories, as defined in Clause 29.6.9.1, except where the concentrations listed in Item 1 are exceeded or a vapour, gas, fume, mist or dust with a health-hazard rating of 1, 2, 3 or 4 is present in concentrations exceeding 1 percent of the median lethal concentration of the substance for acute inhalation toxicity."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','610f7069c120eb4bfab93d39674051e26074e3a786b94737cf7a99713cd1ae34','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23089','GHBC-REQ-023089','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9.2','GHBC-C-005862','1.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Laboratories, as defined in Clause 29.6.9.1, except where the concentrations listed in Item 1 are exceeded or a vapour, gas, fume, mist or dust with a health-hazard rating of 1, 2, 3 or 4 is present in concentrations exceeding 1 percent of the median lethal concentration of the substance for acute inhalation toxicity."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','43a8f0bfa66a05999ea1ef8130830df4bc58c1882244fa3552c7bbefb327a648','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23090','GHBC-REQ-023090','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9.2','GHBC-C-005862','A flammable vapour, gas, fume, mist or dust is present in concentrations exceeding 25 percent of the lower flammability limit of the substance for the expected room temperature.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Laboratories, as defined in Clause 29.6.9.1, except where the concentrations listed in Item 1 are exceeded or a vapour, gas, fume, mist or dust with a health-hazard rating of 1, 2, 3 or 4 is present in concentrations exceeding 1 percent of the median lethal concentration of the substance for acute inhalation toxicity."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"t in concentrations exceeding 25 percent of the lower flammability lim"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','21ad9b8d0cd03f15a1a4712ba20709a46558a144ca75a717869c502395f11bfe','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
