('rowid-23107','GHBC-REQ-023107','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9.4','GHBC-C-005866','All of the hazardous exhaust ductwork and other laboratory exhaust within both the occupied space and the shafts are under negative pressure while in operation.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The provisions of this clause shall not apply to laboratory exhaust systems where all of the following conditions apply:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1414e4d9bbce51c4217dcaee991299b550233963bbcb5a1c04d4249c16cac832','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23108','GHBC-REQ-023108','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9.4','GHBC-C-005866','2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The provisions of this clause shall not apply to laboratory exhaust systems where all of the following conditions apply:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b4f0e49467d5f81942c938039829d27d504a64612a2ff434e373184ebc5bca12','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23109','GHBC-REQ-023109','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9.4','GHBC-C-005866','The hazardous exhaust ductwork manifolded together within the occupied space must originate within the same fire area.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The provisions of this clause shall not apply to laboratory exhaust systems where all of the following conditions apply:"]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f33a521bfb5c2f49bdacca088a85d8463b25a888a840651840fcf86cf3d5fd15','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
