('rowid-23127','GHBC-REQ-023127','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.6','29.6.9.6','GHBC-C-005867','Systems for removal of vapours, gases and smoke shall be designed by the constant velocity or equal friction methods.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eec45f840fe3377ad9bbf6bd6f9383b9bf4ec244f5dd1e9e7aa879a3094191dc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
