('rowid-23252','GHBC-REQ-023252','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.5.3.1','GHBC-C-005912','29.6.12.5.3.2 Ducts and air transfer openings.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7ef6d458bf68afa96fceb9ee3dba1b9ed73af169a3b068c195555bbe8695d2c1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23253','GHBC-REQ-023253','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.5.3.1','GHBC-C-005912','Ducts and air transfer openings are required to be protected with a minimum Class II, 250ºF (121ºC) smoke damper complying with the Ghanal Building Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','807d9eab5035fd0c9bc35db3360f37e59981ea419ba7edfe608060807327653e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23254','GHBC-REQ-023254','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.6','GHBC-C-005913','The primary mechanical means of controlling smoke shall be by pressure differences across smoke barriers.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a976bc63e21085a0cf60ca6cf9abaa97a1b415c92975d2643d175d8fbba4e5c2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23255','GHBC-REQ-023255','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.6','GHBC-C-005913','Maintenance of a tenable environment is not required in the smoke control zone of fire origin.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','95ad027b820243a6abf666809531f0438b87b79da0b95d8802fe2b83e322c3ee','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23256','GHBC-REQ-023256','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.6.1','GHBC-C-005914','The pressure difference across a smoke barrier used to separate smoke zones shall be not less than 0.05-inch water gage (12.4 Pa) in fully sprinklered buildings.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.05,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"separate smoke zones shall be not less than 0.05-inch water gage (12.4 Pa) in "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','36991977dab0f90a80204d550a94483e665745d576071ac38db0eb9e6b96ae7d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23257','GHBC-REQ-023257','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.6.1','GHBC-C-005914','In buildings permitted to be other than fully sprinklered, the smoke control system shall be designed to achieve pressure differences not less than two times the maximum calculated pressure difference produced by the design fire.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2eafe692c61549d859176b160965df9e20e10b2b644efa3d87e7769f760137b5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23258','GHBC-REQ-023258','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.6.2','GHBC-C-005915','The maximum air pressure difference across a smoke barrier shall be determined by required door-opening or closing forces.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6af9d89fa0d25fbdcd2fdd82c9042d60f4f7ce755d3f664f1db7c95021868db4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23259','GHBC-REQ-023259','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.6.2','GHBC-C-005915','The actual force required to open exit doors when the system is in the smoke control mode shall be in accordance with the Ghana Building Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9ed27a0ac209f4cfe0a062e816fcbfa3743768af9dfed681c0d3363a430467a0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23260','GHBC-REQ-023260','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.6.2','GHBC-C-005915','Opening and closing forces for other doors shall be determined by standard engineering methods for the resolution of forces and reactions.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9814c60bceb05dac3fa7460e5bc253a2d7c074fcb0e1808379100f43c652f72c','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
