('rowid-23272','GHBC-REQ-023272','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.6.3','GHBC-C-005916','Where stairways or elevator hoistways are pressurized, such pressurization systems shall comply with Clause 29.6.13 as smoke control systems.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c71ab4fcf27653de9a4ab1266b7f87059a121296fe282700a55722e9c7b9d1f4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23273','GHBC-REQ-023273','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.7','GHBC-C-005917','Where approved by the Code official, smoke migration through openings fixed in a permanently open position, which are located between smoke control zones by the use of the airflow method, shall be permitted.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','191ba907c9659d7cac3693e8492abe84086e8f6a55f28fa7707817a597cf7420','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23274','GHBC-REQ-023274','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.7','GHBC-C-005917','The design airflows shall be in accordance with this clause.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1af6b3257b323b7282ef2b7b49778899fa17afd7f04500896594b77fdd0f48bd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23275','GHBC-REQ-023275','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.7','GHBC-C-005917','Airflow shall be directed to limit smoke migration from the fire zone.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1193e35a688924328387059c4dfc8e7e12b1fb8ecc77fa4972ae896b07b06b7c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23276','GHBC-REQ-023276','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.7','GHBC-C-005917','The geometry of openings shall be considered to prevent flow reversal from turbulent effects.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','44ee1173e9d3c4dd025e0f53dd22dfec7c8e4614a92fbc3e6ee8199214196b69','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23277','GHBC-REQ-023277','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.7','GHBC-C-005917','Smoke control systems using the airflow method shall be designed in accordance with the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9dbdf40bbce77dded0416a2dc7e13ebd2df23c3a814ebe288fc5363c756f3aff','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23278','GHBC-REQ-023278','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.7.1','GHBC-C-005918','This method shall not be employed where either the quantity of air or the velocity of the airflow will adversely affect other portions of the smoke control system, unduly intensify the fire, disrupt plume dynamics or interfere with exiting.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b1643c36164d7ee5ab2fb0492cdd8901872a20a85756e350782b6d95d8192eb0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23279','GHBC-REQ-023279','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.7.1','GHBC-C-005918','Airflow toward the fire shall not exceed 200 feet per minute (1.02 m/s).','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":200,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"ard the fire shall not exceed 200 feet per minute (1.02 m/s)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.02,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"t exceed 200 feet per minute (1.02 m/s)."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','723e9841e9bfef2f372f31df41e2932045e56b3b1481a9a97f8521ba9b48940d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
