('rowid-23304','GHBC-REQ-023304','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.10.2','GHBC-C-005928','Ducts shall be supported directly from fireresistance-rated structural elements of the building by substantial, noncombustible supports.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d52a02d81b0d70185da27d430c0d07a70fc9550319120bb8fffaf325fefc461b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23305','GHBC-REQ-023305','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.10.2','GHBC-C-005928','EXCEPTIONS: Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Flexible connections, for the purpose of vibration isolation, that are constructed of approved fire-resistance-rated materials."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','127e621419fd18f8bce97a7cd8d904520346c3823fba1e3dd711c820cd6baef9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23306','GHBC-REQ-023306','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.10.3','GHBC-C-005929','Equipment shall be located so as to not expose uninvolved portions of the building to an additional fire hazard.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','03d6720811f76c7bb342252a5559b6b23d962f773dd16a12f27645acbb464cfb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23307','GHBC-REQ-023307','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.10.3','GHBC-C-005929','Outdoor air inlets shall be located so as to minimize the potential for introducing smoke or flame into the building.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ee2b27dfb7b551fc375cc2a6a14d7290a7ff80e61f3935a13f671406ef2629da','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23308','GHBC-REQ-023308','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.10.3','GHBC-C-005929','Exhaust outlets shall be so located as to minimize reintroduction of smoke into the building and to limit exposure of the building or adjacent buildings to an additional fire hazard.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e5ce02d2165a5d78b7172bf6a85eed200af5774ba6e20d065e95b9de564d40df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23309','GHBC-REQ-023309','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.10.4','GHBC-C-005930','Automatic dampers, regardless of the purpose for which they are installed within the smoke control system, shall be listed and conform to the requirements of approved recognized standards.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1e070e2dd484aa399e7650864cbb30f182132e75d84c6d9b6ce32b3073e197b4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23310','GHBC-REQ-023310','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.10.5','GHBC-C-005931','In addition to other requirements, belt-driven fans shall have 1.5 times the number of belts required for the design duty with the minimum number of belts being two.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','82cdc0ed8dfc62826a7a6ad004408f09c5164525e7feb659fa824b3a8de34ea1','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
