('rowid-23335','GHBC-REQ-023335','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.12.2','GHBC-C-005937','In addition to meeting the requirements of Ghana Wiring Code, all wiring, regardless of voltage, shall be fully enclosed within continuous raceways.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5a6ca6f982f7c367713870e19335eb428572c1bac6144399c51a3acfd78ec8d3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23336','GHBC-REQ-023336','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.12.3','GHBC-C-005938','Smoke control systems shall be activated in accordance with the Ghana Building Code or the Ghana Fire Code.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','70f0d18a9134020a572469cde0941712cc462010e040cda7f913ed01fc99b3a1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23337','GHBC-REQ-023337','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.12.4','GHBC-C-005939','Where complete automatic control is required or used, the automatic control sequences shall be initiated from an appropriately zoned automatic sprinkler system complying with the Ghana Fire Code, from manual controls provided with ready access for the fire department, and any smoke detectors required by engineering analysis.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c8b5f57219fcf16b1e6d2cfb0eb5b261a9b9af862df6258ff6a39f22da594c73','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23338','GHBC-REQ-023338','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.13','GHBC-C-005940','Control-air tubing shall be of sufficient size to meet the required response times.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1a4a6c0b98b70b78b9248dcdde8cc3c8bc7257286c23ae5e00cacadcbc8c4050','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23339','GHBC-REQ-023339','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.6.12.13','GHBC-C-005940','Tubing shall be flushed clean and dry prior to final connections.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d17686a28b1826d6e2e8dbcd3da040dcad0217731cdb7eeb362161855ee60f1f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
