('rowid-23552','GHBC-REQ-023552','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8','29.8.2.1','GHBC-C-006007','Nonfactory-tested, field-erected equipment and appliances shall be pressure tested in accordance with this Code.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','27b32249a4d940a239f6391a7d981fb977e1d5ae63b479fad4f7b660a4fd689a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23553','GHBC-REQ-023553','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8','29.8.2.2','GHBC-C-006008','The refrigerant shall be that which the equipment or appliance was designed to utilize or converted to utilize.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fa8980ad248a56710c116eaf8e6b9cdac8a97ec3cc70dcd34c2d514a586a6073','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23554','GHBC-REQ-023554','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8','29.8.2.2.1','GHBC-C-006009','Refrigerants, including refrigerant blends, with different designations in this Code shall not be mixed in a system.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Addition of a second refrigerant is allowed where permitted by the equipment or appliance manufacturer to improve oil return at low temperatures. The refrigerant and amount added shall be in accordance with the manufacturer‘s instructions."]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d261f350a2bd1fb12d375d124b34c3d939d1971f0413221b80f1bb250f3ae52c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23555','GHBC-REQ-023555','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8','29.8.2.2.1','GHBC-C-006009','EXCEPTIONS: Addition of a second refrigerant is allowed where permitted by the equipment or appliance manufacturer to improve oil return at low temperatures. The refrigerant and amount added shall be in accordance with the manufacturer‘s instructions.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Addition of a second refrigerant is allowed where permitted by the equipment or appliance manufacturer to improve oil return at low temperatures. The refrigerant and amount added shall be in accordance with the manufacturer‘s instructions."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9142dec92a0d8c51868a5b3f064953f0969e2835bf32b05900f4c464ae77d505','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23556','GHBC-REQ-023556','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8','29.8.2.2.2','GHBC-C-006010','Refrigerants used in refrigeration systems shall be new, recovered or reclaimed refrigerants in accordance with Clause 29.8.2.2.2.1, 29.8.2.2.2.2 or 29.8.2.2.2.3.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The refrigerant used shall meet the purity specifications set by the manufacturer of the equipment or appliance in which such refrigerant is used where such specifications are different from that specified in Clauses 29.8.2.2.2.1, 29.8.2.2.2.2 and 29.8.2.2.2.3."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b8fbcb31f7240eeff0df201344c16a1061f1c6769787f75dbc09cccdabddf63b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23557','GHBC-REQ-023557','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8','29.8.2.2.2','GHBC-C-006010','Where required by the equipment or appliance owner or the Code official, the installer shall furnish a signed declaration that the refrigerant used meets the requirements of Clause 29.8.2.2.2.1, 29.8.2.2.2.2 or 29.8.2.2.2.3.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The refrigerant used shall meet the purity specifications set by the manufacturer of the equipment or appliance in which such refrigerant is used where such specifications are different from that specified in Clauses 29.8.2.2.2.1, 29.8.2.2.2.2 and 29.8.2.2.2.3."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2fcbe36fa17068d5020dda10131d88a74b1cf51337bf1e5c5763efc2b4d445a9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23558','GHBC-REQ-023558','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8','29.8.2.2.2','GHBC-C-006010','EXCEPTIONS: The refrigerant used shall meet the purity specifications set by the manufacturer of the equipment or appliance in which such refrigerant is used where such specifications are different from that specified in Clauses 29.8.2.2.2.1, 29.8.2.2.2.2 and 29.8.2.2.2.3.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The refrigerant used shall meet the purity specifications set by the manufacturer of the equipment or appliance in which such refrigerant is used where such specifications are different from that specified in Clauses 29.8.2.2.2.1, 29.8.2.2.2.2 and 29.8.2.2.2.3."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6fd26c6002d5c215afc3beba36a47a6d30542f22d604b84212a7611ae573cb85','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23559','GHBC-REQ-023559','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8','29.8.2.2.2.1','GHBC-C-006011','Refrigerants shall be of a purity level specified by the equipment or appliance manufacturer.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f7aaa603ffc619157ed2e1c26903115b652d566886b09bfacfc91d6946a43147','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23560','GHBC-REQ-023560','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8','29.8.2.2.2.2','GHBC-C-006012','Refrigerants that are recovered from refrigeration and air-conditioning systems shall not be reused in other than the system from which they were recovered and in other systems of the same owner.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9e7fe359f25b57ffe0a3faaadd0af177a40adbe217a32366d45137092de94b15','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
