('rowid-23663','GHBC-REQ-023663','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8.3.2',NULL,'GHBC-C-006018','Mixed occupancy occurs where two or more occupancies are located within the same building.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','561d227a790040e09dd2bc53dd4fc1dd7c570f1e892805f2e5977b65898cbef8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23664','GHBC-REQ-023664','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8.3.2',NULL,'GHBC-C-006018','Where each occupancy is isolated from the rest of the building by tight walls, floors and ceilings and by selfclosing doors, the requirements for each occupancy shall apply to its portion of the building.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e54eb51748587525243b895d7e42c8cadb9b0c74574a12adc4aa8e2df74a6d81','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23665','GHBC-REQ-023665','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8.3.2',NULL,'GHBC-C-006018','Where the various occupancies are not so isolated, the occupancy having the most stringent requirements shall be the governing occupancy.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','daf28eee9b6dc020152bb879d4ee4fcf59355ea15ef7c541ce02206a418d1699','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23666','GHBC-REQ-023666','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8.3.2','29.8.3.3','GHBC-C-006019','Refrigeration systems shall be classified according to the degree of probability that refrigerant leaked from a failed connection, seal or component could enter an occupied area.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8df158a63d2e44cfe3a76679236545b8ed46c815f32636a0f2e276585ebf2c98','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23667','GHBC-REQ-023667','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8.3.2','29.8.3.3','GHBC-C-006019','The distinction is based on the basic design or location of the components.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4bff9b3abd913688d7eef83d677c71256bc5728a971ab631daa8b78133eee802','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23668','GHBC-REQ-023668','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8.3.2','29.8.3.3.1','GHBC-C-006020','Double-indirect open-spray systems, indirect closed systems and indirect-vented closed systems shall be classified as low-probability systems, provided that all refrigerantcontaining piping and fittings are isolated','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bd96a4eac90b148e529647ab5aade412acf0b22b58db33fdc687117f0ec3acef','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23669','GHBC-REQ-023669','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8.3.2','29.8.3.3.1','GHBC-C-006020','where the quantities in Table 29.8.3.1 are exceeded.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2207c153ba2d7462b117821451da09da63498dda2b16f586d3fdd324ce15f0b4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23670','GHBC-REQ-023670','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8.3.2','29.8.3.3.2','GHBC-C-006021','Direct systems and indirect open-spray systems shall be classified as high-probability systems.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["An indirect open-spray system shall not be required to be classified as a highprobability system if the pressure of the secondary coolant is at all times (operating and standby) greater than the pressure of the refrigerant."]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','53e92dfe9fc8241cdf195fb2007cb9c992073828f3b0aaa3f9f7068808132cd1','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
