('rowid-23673','GHBC-REQ-023673','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8.3.2','29.8.4.1','GHBC-C-006022','The refrigerant, occupancy and system classification cited in this clause shall be determined in accordance with Clauses 29.8.3.1, 29.8.3.2 and 29.8.3.3, respectively.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','beed91ff405fee9e00cff2eeeccbadc4c65ddde86c88fb2af2c1716fd32572c8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-23674','GHBC-REQ-023674','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.8.3.2','29.8.4.2','GHBC-C-006023','Except as provided in Clauses 29.8.4.2.1 and 29.8.4.2.2, all components containing the refrigerant shall be located either outdoors or in a machinery room where the quantity of refrigerant in an independent circuit of a system exceeds the amounts shown in Table 29.8.3.1.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8bbad6418096d475954261aaa588908c1195ece5a54a7be7de5fec505b302f52','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
