('rowid-23883','GHBC-REQ-023883','GS 1207:2018',29,NULL,'29.8.8.1','GHBC-C-006077','Every refrigerant-containing part of every system that is erected on the premises, except compressors, condensers, vessels, evapourators, safety devices, pressure gauges and control mechanisms that are listed and factory tested, shall be tested and proved tight after complete installation, and before operation.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7d10d5067343b1e4741e675df749647dc7b4699797f9681a0028dbafc76d4c64','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
