('rowid-24003','GHBC-REQ-024003','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.9.2','29.9.4.2','GHBC-C-006134','The label shall clarify that these specifications apply only to the water storage tanks.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','429ec831e75bfad303b3b2341503d8bfdb773df5b944efc925055d4527e01bd2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24004','GHBC-REQ-024004','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.9.2','29.9.4.3','GHBC-C-006135','Drain and fill valves shall be labeled with a description and warning that identifies the fluid in that loop as ―Potable Water,‖ ―Food-Grade Fluid,‖ ―Non-Food-Grade Fluid‖ or ―Toxic.‖','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1c2bc5ceb2986504e55be86142964e0cbf8d3841826a7e81b4963fcb10f27022','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24005','GHBC-REQ-024005','GS 1207:2018',29,'29.9.2','29.9.4.3','GHBC-C-006135','Labeling shall also be provided that reads as follows: ―Fluid could be discharged at high temperature or pressure or both.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f19cf609313480f9594be271aa23047f1116c6db03abcc60cd34e8dd2b5dbbe0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
