('rowid-24029','GHBC-REQ-024029','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.1','30.2.1.3','GHBC-C-006140','Where two or more toilet rooms are provided for each sex, the required number of lavatories shall be distributed proportionately to the required number of water closets.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a8af73937531d4b0c304f0094b166af0485b2ac89d5ee3955d5110a0f50caa83','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
