('rowid-24146','GHBC-REQ-024146','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.1.3','GHBC-C-006192','Water supply requirements of traffic terminal stations The water supply requirements of traffic terminal stations (railway stations, bus stations, harbours, airports, etc.) include provisions for waiting rooms and waiting halls.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5286ed3f05f6940a33346b4b14fb0ab4a69de6978554235036e4246939ef75af','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24147','GHBC-REQ-024147','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.1.3','GHBC-C-006192','They do not, however, include requirements for retiring rooms.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f6d75a09549577b0a20bfffeb68d89fc5f76f049571fe7e16bcefa36b8873ccc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24148','GHBC-REQ-024148','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.1.3','GHBC-C-006192','Requirements of water supply for traffic terminal stations shall be according to Table 2.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','27039ddc473bf02bd18a06fad9499e3c694967d958543bef6cfe945965d11715','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
