('rowid-24167','GHBC-REQ-024167','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.1','GHBC-C-006204','The manholes shall be made of corrosion resistant material (for example, cast iron, reinforced cement concrete, steel fibre reinforced concrete, galvanized steel, high density polyethylene, fibre glass reinforced plastic or such other materials acceptable to the Authority).','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','31dec63d2dd7afe95fec6d3614278474005487f9b74bcfafae4f22d8340e7677','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24168','GHBC-REQ-024168','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.1','GHBC-C-006204','Manholes shall be provided with locking arrangement to avoid misuse and tampering.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d7915bc2dc6c9efe78b12aa9ec2cb7326f91f280ed3c6e7abecd2089e603cee0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24169','GHBC-REQ-024169','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.1','GHBC-C-006204','b) Catch rings and ladders — Tanks higher than 900mm deep shall be provided with corrosion resistant catch rings, steps or ladders according to the depth to enable a person to reach the bottom of the tank.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":900,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"d ladders — Tanks higher than 900mm deep shall be provided with c"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc8f3e67329a30c40bfac3ea11dc8ea3da051e05a46dd1b1dde218a9246329e7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24170','GHBC-REQ-024170','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.1','GHBC-C-006204','c) Overflow pipe — Each tank shall be provided with an overflow pipe terminating above the ground/terrace level to act as a ‗Warning Pipe‘ to indicate overflow conditions.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7afb1fea557969ccdc7b56f9f36d03758bb6241eb6098a7346f624d097171608','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
