('rowid-24180','GHBC-REQ-024180','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.1','GHBC-C-006204','h) Tanks on terraces and above ground shall be supported by appropriate structural members so as to transfer the load of the tank and the water directly on the structural members of the building.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b68541eb63f0f84e98d0f59a8de09dc5e648017dbfb3e8c52ea8eb7489a8b265','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
