('rowid-24182','GHBC-REQ-024182','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.2','GHBC-C-006205','If the storage capacity required is more than 5000l, it is advantageous to arrange it in a series of tanks so interconnected that each tank can be isolated for cleaning and inspection without interfering with the supply of water.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":5000,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":" storage capacity required is more than 5000l, it is advantageous to arran"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":5000,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":"apacity required is more than 5000l, it is advantageous to arrang"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','36d5cf17b18b76c90ecb4051d0b5d9fe756034a080d898e4605b45bc6e921e00','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24183','GHBC-REQ-024183','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.2','GHBC-C-006205','In large storage tanks, the outlet shall be at the end opposite the inlet to avoid stagnation of the water.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ff4dc85cee1461c6da6215e8f30ba424741c58b887275fed043707bd80b1e82','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24184','GHBC-REQ-024184','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.3','GHBC-C-006206','The outlet pipe shall be fixed 50 mm to 75 mm above the bottom of the tank and fitted with a strainer, preferably of brass.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"he outlet pipe shall be fixed 50 mm to 75 mm above the bottom of "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":75,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" pipe shall be fixed 50 mm to 75 mm above the bottom of the tank "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e4da42356d4b27f48d527f1a95abfd664351d81130c4c5671c708bf4624c977d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24185','GHBC-REQ-024185','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.4','GHBC-C-006207','tanks, the design of the tank shall be such as to provide for the draining of the tank when necessary and water shall not be allowed to collect around the tank.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','97b1fc919974b29a35423bc5b38df6b8b46bead92db8140fe2f525ae1eb1f98a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24186','GHBC-REQ-024186','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.4','GHBC-C-006207','The underground tanks should not be located in low lying areas or near any public or private sewer, septic tank, leaching pool or soakage pit to prevent any contamination.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7923bddb28f016395eab5793a4efd624641817fb7e812d0e892e342a3380c673','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24187','GHBC-REQ-024187','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.4','GHBC-C-006207','The overflow of the tank should be well above (preferably 600 mm) the external surface level and terminate as a warning pipe with a mosquito proof grating.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":600,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"uld be well above (preferably 600 mm) the external surface level a"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','561b57933ffbea7955d91a0289e58917ea6d5bace031ba58b761846e4baeb521','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24188','GHBC-REQ-024188','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.4','GHBC-C-006207','Care must be taken to prevent the backflow of local surface water into the tank in case of local flooding.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','73f58ca3a333c9d173d9b2a5905dbd4b0439bdbc87809c15f9ff732e1ee44d76','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24189','GHBC-REQ-024189','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.4','GHBC-C-006207','Otherwise the overflow must be terminated in a safer manner as per the site conditions.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','33935deae4aac4adc7f75dd481a95c2aea027346b83c36766a94ab64c6ee1fea','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24190','GHBC-REQ-024190','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.4','GHBC-C-006207','For tanks with at least one side','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','70b5924168cd09cdb389d51c217ad4dde368e560549599da1e8891538664c676','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24191','GHBC-REQ-024191','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.4','GHBC-C-006207','exposed to a basement, it is safer to discharge the overflow into the basement level.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ad1086a48ee03af5d4e43f9be394596612e43a75fbc1ae73bbc5485120caa309','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24192','GHBC-REQ-024192','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.4','GHBC-C-006207','The tank top slab shall also be designed to carry the load due to fire tender movement where anticipated as in the case of an extended basement.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','649414e8109158407d5a4af05cbd7a0ef8fdc78894939b5e9ed0a43d60491846','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24193','GHBC-REQ-024193','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.4','GHBC-C-006207','There should be no common wall between the tanks storing safe water and tanks storing water from unsafe sources.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6d1ecb4e7953c9efaba06861a7ea064badfb44e02d0eeb0b96039cd8892898b6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24194','GHBC-REQ-024194','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.5','GHBC-C-006208','of the tanks shall be placed clear off the terrace slab such that the elevation difference between the outlet pipe of the tank and the highest fixture at the top floor of the building is a minimum of 2m, which shall also prevent leakage into the structural slab.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2,"unit":null,"operator":"minimum of","context":"op floor of the building is a minimum of 2m, which shall also prevent le"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" the building is a minimum of 2m, which shall also prevent lea"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e37d9802e2ce55a5324edb2296f62719c5778855743bb17888c25b3ae12d4b7d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24195','GHBC-REQ-024195','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.5','GHBC-C-006208','In tall buildings, the top of the tank shall be provided with the safe ladder or staircase.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b73f2ce4e6ceb6dace5be6aab322dc1e1be04090e2b36fad9a99d784e73eaee9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24196','GHBC-REQ-024196','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.5','GHBC-C-006208','The top slab shall be provided with railing or a parapet wall.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','27628ee86869673dff1d2dc3c8783dc703789413bba5cf405d5074109ff910d5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24197','GHBC-REQ-024197','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.6','GHBC-C-006209','tank, the end of the pipe shall be screwed, passed through a hole in the tank and secured by back nuts, both inside and outside.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae4f83c703f64880298b66f4f5346d8554c1da9f25bfa972f7e5b4a6c289a898','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24198','GHBC-REQ-024198','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.6','GHBC-C-006209','The pipe end shall be flush with the face of the inside back nut.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bfb8213fd07e5b829149fdaafb9cc77e95ecc0e986583b8ddd2fbced646aeab2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24199','GHBC-REQ-024199','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.6','GHBC-C-006209','For jointing copper pipe to steel or copper tank, a connector of nonferrous material shall be used.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b3e2d356f92a0c9073071faace62298ae8cf466625d7f01da49c069d360e0907','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24200','GHBC-REQ-024200','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.6','GHBC-C-006209','The connector shall have a shoulder to bear on the outside of the tank and shall be secured by a back nut inside.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','decda564f326ae0f188b9daf6135cb174c24ab1e70ceab21beed025a0f1e9195','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
