('rowid-24203','GHBC-REQ-024203','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.7','GHBC-C-006210','If the water supply is intermittent and the hours of supply are irregular, it is desirable to have a minimum storage of half a day‘s supply for overhead tanks.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0c01856aa299722821f02577ad7acdbc472f871adc6e5993dff63cb920239ec1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
