('rowid-24206','GHBC-REQ-024206','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.7','GHBC-C-006210','Note: General guidelines for calculation of capacity of these storage tanks are as follows:','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','76d41624c276706a669b8ed613fdd8ac36afec88d77f5915eed1e0b4b1ddacd0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24207','GHBC-REQ-024207','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.7','GHBC-C-006210','a) In case only OHT is provided, it may be taken as 33.3 to 50 percent of one day‘s requirement; b) In case only UGT is provided, it may be taken as 50 to 150 percent of one day‘s requirement; and c) In case combined storage is provided, it d) may be taken as 66.6 percent UGT and 33.4percent OHT of one day‘s requirement.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"d, it may be taken as 33.3 to 50 percent of one day‘s requirement; b) "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"ded, it may be taken as 50 to 150 percent of one day‘s requirement; and"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":66.6,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"ovided, it d) may be taken as 66.6 percent UGT and 33.4percent OHT of on"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":33.4,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"taken as 66.6 percent UGT and 33.4percent OHT of one day‘s requirement."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1119d2a128c97d074a83746f0aa44a8320e8127e65b1308620e13c1664225777','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24208','GHBC-REQ-024208','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.8','GHBC-C-006211','provided for water supply to a building, it is not necessary to have separate storage for flushing and sanitary purposes for health reasons.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7776f535cbd09583ce11f5fcd8aa882b5790c46b16a9878fc9534ddd05f0a838','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24209','GHBC-REQ-024209','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.3.8','GHBC-C-006211','In such cases, when only one storage tank has been provided, tapping of water maybe done at two different levels (the lower tapping for flushing) so that a part of the water will be exclusively available for flushing purposes.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','70b5429447e064119bbe36a8b9140533fdce0d4f0069bf16c7c9e3c57fb20510','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
