('rowid-24243','GHBC-REQ-024243','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.7.3','GHBC-C-006226','It might also result in pipes and fittings being subjected to a pressure higher than that for which they are designed, and in flooding from overflowing cisterns.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d54ab308ed930332ab11cb9e5d39ff6ca7234d74037ee9b0601fd39bf7faff2a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24244','GHBC-REQ-024244','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.7.3','GHBC-C-006226','b) No pipe for conveyance or in connection with water supplied by the Authority shall communicate with any other receptacle used or capable of being used for conveyance other than water supplied by the Authority.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f1eefbac7af03b5b6869911eddb2d4a08e2c2c4dbe7fd9f9dd7975fbed20d681','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24245','GHBC-REQ-024245','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.7.3','GHBC-C-006226','c) Where storage tanks are provided, no person shall connect or be permitted to  connect any service pipe with any distributing pipe.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9676a9e1fc04fec300b39956b4dac742d07136eee75c80a23ecc3c96de9368a8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
