('rowid-24265','GHBC-REQ-024265','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.1','GHBC-C-006236','The installation shall be such that water delivered is not liable to become contaminated or that contamination of the public water supply does not occur.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ca4367b36bc4f90d97b9cd798a630890f21a89801ef3a108f0f46d0c63ca1ebf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24266','GHBC-REQ-024266','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.2','GHBC-C-006237','The various types of piping and mechanical devices acceptable for backflow protection are:','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e5785905597726f2adc5898fff27f65b06f6c894e257da548bd1940bddf52128','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24267','GHBC-REQ-024267','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.2','GHBC-C-006237','a)   barometric loop; b)   air gap; c)   atmosphere vacuum breaker; d)   pressure vacuum breaker; e)   double check valve; and f)   reduced pressure backflow device.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bcfc079f4f791c2bce30319eee4c91a0355c61ca279a3f2fb11215d1e974ad30','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24268','GHBC-REQ-024268','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.3','GHBC-C-006238','The installation shall not adversely affect drinking water:','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','21d50d39b0261c527bce65f47e306e9e2bba0308d0604e4ed8f3c0969ef3c3b8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24269','GHBC-REQ-024269','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.3','GHBC-C-006238','a) by materials in contact with the water being unsuitable for the purpose; b) as a result of backflow of water from water fittings, or water using appliances into pipework connected to mains or to other fittings and appliances; c) by cross-connection between pipes conveying water supplied by the water undertaker with pipes conveying water from some other source; and d) by stagnation, particularly at high temperatures.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','149b8e439a36225fe72e2ccce3305d24a15724f1f3d561afb5ebeda39af98db2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24270','GHBC-REQ-024270','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.4','GHBC-C-006239','No pump or similar apparatus, the purpose of which is to increase the pressure in or rate of flow from a supply pipe or any fitting or appliance shall be connected to a supply pipe.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a147b828edeb16be12025f26c079707acb9dfbc1af58506bd3063ef676230eb7','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24271','GHBC-REQ-024271','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.4','GHBC-C-006239','The use of such a pump or similar apparatus is likely to lead to pressure reduction in the upstream pipe work which, if significant, increase the risk of backflow from other fittings.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','38657477c065ccadd78305c4a959237e1ea6db343a523da5129a48f32b6798aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24272','GHBC-REQ-024272','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.5','GHBC-C-006240','The water shall not come in contact with unsuitable materials of construction.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','80110fe1f5e1f88f03510563e5d640f2de6386a075a61b25b65a02631f3fd6ae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24273','GHBC-REQ-024273','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.6','GHBC-C-006241','No pipe or fitting shall be laid in, on or through land fill, refuse, an ashpit, sewer, drain, cesspool, refuse chute, or any manhole connected with them.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5d2deb85ea2fa7d13da77ba6dd844a60880461791798c4690e992f5f05419ad1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24274','GHBC-REQ-024274','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.7','GHBC-C-006242','No pipe susceptible to deterioration by contact with any substance shall be laid or installed in a place where such deterioration is likely to occur.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4e96949a7a54139499c7fc7a349650b7dd410454d6b35344f8049ee11c1b9d11','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24275','GHBC-REQ-024275','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.7','GHBC-C-006242','No pipe that is permeable to any contaminant shall be laid or installed in any position where permeation is likely to occur.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4c6b325cf5e699e9a8d9f45e7c7c0b9dccc642a919119185e78aa79d0cf5e9bd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24276','GHBC-REQ-024276','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.8','GHBC-C-006243','If a liquid (other than water) is used in any type of heating primary circuit, which transfers heat to water for domestic use, the liquid shall be non-toxic and noncorrosive.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4806ddb4e2c294ce650e9776be1d0b47e59ceabb67308aa3da1d141a0fc80c38','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24277','GHBC-REQ-024277','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.9','GHBC-C-006244','A backflow prevention device shall be arranged or connected at or as near as practicable to each point of delivery and use of water.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f70d077f9e438e84ccd802f80640391a3a0b8658e38bd332f32b89551806cf5a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24278','GHBC-REQ-024278','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.9','GHBC-C-006244','Appliances with built-in backflow prevention shall be capable of passing the test.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','629a96d04d86f129bf3e81d984c430eb1c51e6afb7b8b09be5979a45d5d3ee40','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24279','GHBC-REQ-024279','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.9','GHBC-C-006244','All backflow prevention devices shall be installed so that they are accessible for examination, repair or replacement.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a20adce902fe0fe439ea6effcbe3594323c7cab07cc45ed4a84b01bc966029e1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24280','GHBC-REQ-024280','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.9.9','GHBC-C-006244','Such devices shall be capable of being tested periodically by the Authority to ensure that the device is functioning efficiently and no backflow is occurring at any time.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cbc82938623a59f9e8487f36dcba4fb8e02169cae173f78928c9c119aeec08d9','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24281','GHBC-REQ-024281','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10','GHBC-C-006245','within the premises','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','82f291119c81fc632562e1b2dde2269022c3a866630bc0e45c760f5ebe766f80','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24282','GHBC-REQ-024282','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.1','GHBC-C-006246','The design of the pipe work shall be such that there is no possibility of backflow towards the source of supply from any cistern or appliance, whether by siphonage or otherwise.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','940cdddb40f4221817fae688f9c36421fa77a4b87d015f222f98d8dedfade8e0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24283','GHBC-REQ-024283','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.1','GHBC-C-006246','Reflux non-return valves shall not be relied upon to prevent such backflow.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','24b8a03a36b865d92cacba5abc1f3e71d7c2a8691b682a6f5c8cb06969db6df6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24284','GHBC-REQ-024284','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.2','GHBC-C-006247','water than wholesome water becomes inevitable as an alternative or is required to be mixed with the latter, it shall be delivered only into a cistern and by a pipe or fitting discharging into the air gap at a height above the top edge of the cistern equal to twice its nominal bore and in no case less than 150 mm.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":150,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"s nominal bore and in no case less than 150 mm."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"bore and in no case less than 150 mm."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','35c69f0f8732ed00c4f117183bf5b18a83287d98b267141ce1d0b8594b45c5bf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24285','GHBC-REQ-024285','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.2','GHBC-C-006247','It is necessary to maintain a definite air gap in all appliances or taps used in water closets.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1e75617d45470e365e2b4d2824f018d8771d98ff507f70b84c6b4889aaba7c3e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24286','GHBC-REQ-024286','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.3','GHBC-C-006248','All pipe work shall be so designed, laid or fixed and maintained as to remain','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','43b4528c8f29dd05d0b41ffbda97ab8e14f356db9173c1895ecb0dd857db4145','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24287','GHBC-REQ-024287','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.3','GHBC-C-006248','completely water-tight, thereby avoiding wastage, damage to property and the risk of contamination.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f429613f1ed6b308e1e52f0db098bf6765cab164ee9863c88807addd19623f28','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24288','GHBC-REQ-024288','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.4','GHBC-C-006249','No water supply line shall be laid or fixed so as to pass into or through any sewer, scour outlet or drain or any manhole connected therewith nor through any ash pit or manure pit or any material of such nature that is likely to cause undue deterioration of the pipe, except where it is unavoidable.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a9430feee653217900926d8b673b88433782452a5a09fc1994bf9ef7b1504a35','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24289','GHBC-REQ-024289','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.4.1','GHBC-C-006250','through corrosive soil or pervious material is unavoidable, the piping shall be properly protected from contact with such soil or material by being carried through an exterior cast iron tube or by some other suitable means as approved by the Authority.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c09738aa26b77a5d73685f35e856faec1491453bfff3334f8c38fac3c01bf957','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24290','GHBC-REQ-024290','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.4.1','GHBC-C-006250','Any existing piping or fitting laid or fixed, which does not comply with the above requirements, shall be removed immediately by the consumer and relaid by him in conformity with the above requirements and to the satisfaction of the Authority.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a491319f2820a15df760be57f1a0a896bd9f2cf4e0d9c845cd7ef01ec2b4b196','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24291','GHBC-REQ-024291','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.4.2','GHBC-C-006251','proximity to electric cables or in corrosive soils, adequate precautions/protection should be taken to avoid corrosion.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2198211eb7f5534820c4c40a3c6f9cb2ba9b7d1abf590ed9097cd6d7af3241f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24292','GHBC-REQ-024292','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.5','GHBC-C-006252','Underground piping shall be laid at such a depth that it is unlikely to be damaged traffic loads and vibrations.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','45e7133340435a6874246fd0cbd6aa2bf1a06296863b218e8fccb13aac5d3baa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24293','GHBC-REQ-024293','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.5','GHBC-C-006252','It shall not be laid in ground liable to subsidence, but where such ground cannot be avoided, special precautions shall be taken to avoid damage to the piping.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','de14e98f2a9f5108e359ffc50b7928c17a42e4e4099df0dbf24b4aa7ba3a381b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24294','GHBC-REQ-024294','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.5','GHBC-C-006252','Where piping has to be laid across recently disturbed ground, the ground shall be thoroughly consolidated so as to provide a continuous and even support.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','17d2e9d631227913f2672ed133aca2ffbc449b8de7d5e7ccb7adc3024bced1b0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24295','GHBC-REQ-024295','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.6','GHBC-C-006253','In designing and planning the layout of the pipe work, due attention shall be given to the maximum rate of discharge required, economy in labour and materials, protection against damage and corrosion, water hammer, protection from frost, if required, and to avoidance of airlocks, noise transmission and unsightly arrangement.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','552abd8a250db3b92099a5dbce1055a6481833d483827bea480a7d84ffc6296a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24296','GHBC-REQ-024296','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.7','GHBC-C-006254','shall be as smooth as possible inside.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d31aa318fca1384c499581d0e5ddabb9859b02d70be9d68322e065444a6e11e9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24297','GHBC-REQ-024297','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.7','GHBC-C-006254','Methods of jointing shall be such as to avoid internal roughness and projection at the joints, whether of the jointing materials or otherwise.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','35de36800f6821bdc95264ea2dc8ef03758ad7c7d414735075f101d4092795ea','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24298','GHBC-REQ-024298','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.8','GHBC-C-006255','shall preferably be gradual rather than abrupt to avoid undue loss of head.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ea3889469f5dcf1bfe1fb3b0ad8de8d723a1a59d6ac5f9f5e343007b622f2d21','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24299','GHBC-REQ-024299','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.8','GHBC-C-006255','No bend or curve in piping shall be made which is likely to materially diminish or alter the cross-clause.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f21424783a9e6fd724da2bbd151ef94b917c7b6e53739430a2b22c1450255828','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24300','GHBC-REQ-024300','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.9','GHBC-C-006256','No boiler for generating steam or closed boilers of any description or any machinery shall be supplied direct from a service or supply pipe.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','56ce2ad6ff92a22f0816cf8fa150429f6a6de9a9c4332e093c7949714d606805','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24301','GHBC-REQ-024301','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.10.9','GHBC-C-006256','Every such boiler or machinery shall be supplied from a feed cistern.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','01b98d8b0188fab8c3fabba7eb5a7545c9254e94ea523e39142f99749ca9d01c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24302','GHBC-REQ-024302','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.1.1','GHBC-C-006259','The accepted method for, electric water heating practice for domestic purposes, shall be the instantaneous electric heating.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5d28775ccafd66209e22d6ace75148c6de4b16514c506352b4437bb87fe5981b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24303','GHBC-REQ-024303','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.10.1','GHBC-C-006261','type) shall be fed from a cold water storage tank and under no circumstances connected directly to the water main, except the type which incorporates a feed tank with ball valves and overflow pipe arrangement (cistern type heaters) or non-pressure type heaters.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e952452dd776fdd4ecb84e3ae3bcc548d51416716d420896cbbfbd37a885fd7a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24304','GHBC-REQ-024304','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.10.2.1','GHBC-C-006263','water tank shall be at least twice the capacity of the hot water heater.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','622073b9c9d418bb9e226857dbbde6d45d6f182e0311eee377d4e3d0c5397a3c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24305','GHBC-REQ-024305','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.10.2.1','GHBC-C-006263','The capacity of the storage tank may, however, be 1.5 times when the number of heaters connected to one common tank exceeds 10.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0122a7d0e1b5da7bf216e8d026f2a7ba751ac5cd4ae44a36aaef2385f0f52c2f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24306','GHBC-REQ-024306','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.10.2.2','GHBC-C-006264','The storage tank for supply of cold water to hot water heaters shall be separate, if practicable.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1e3de6751773eea46753bee89363aa11116e3ff3084d99dbdcffc70222cc020d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24307','GHBC-REQ-024307','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.10.2.2','GHBC-C-006264','In the case of a common tank which also supplies cold water to the fixtures, this cold water supply connection shall be so arranged that 50 percent of the net capacity, worked out as in Clause 30.4.12.10.2.1, shall be available for supply to the hot water heaters.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"ion shall be so arranged that 50 percent of the net capacity, worked o"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"out as in Clause 30.4.12.10.2.1, shall be available for supply t"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1ab319ef5f77c485df92376e67b4ed9b90d18467e992f0b1e6f965242ab48bf4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24308','GHBC-REQ-024308','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.10.2.3','GHBC-C-006265','buildings where a common overhead tank over the stair/lift well is generally installed, it is advisable to have one or more local tanks for supply to the hot water heaters.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93447afe4b4cd68bc3c4ed5c4a41f36109118e4acc9f37107a9c179fd62e7b4f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24309','GHBC-REQ-024309','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.10.2.3','GHBC-C-006265','This arrangement shall help in reducing the length of the vent pipes (see Fig. 9).','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2de203ca4e97035b62b0adc295f26f21c65c10483c7932f509a8d93f98672133','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24310','GHBC-REQ-024310','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.10.2.4','GHBC-C-006266','where the static pressure increases with the height, the total static pressure on the hot water heaters on the lowest floor shall not exceed the rated working pressure of the hot water heater installed.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c97d79e5027f73ad947512308124a24577a4e474093ce7eb37756168533dfb71','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24311','GHBC-REQ-024311','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.10.2.4','GHBC-C-006266','Should the height of the building so require, additional tanks shall be provided on the intermediate floors to restrict the static head to permissible limits (see Fig. 10).','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','375b89ce254b56730a1d13db10158f229c5c89284a7469003eab082a4874891b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24312','GHBC-REQ-024312','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.10.2.4','GHBC-C-006266','30.4.12.10.2.5 As an alternative to the arrangements stated in Clauses 30.4.12.10.2.3 and 30.4.12.10.2.4, an individual storage tank in each flat may be provided for supply to hot water heaters (see Fig. 11).','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','23f7eaf1f903d42f0aa56356d98dca7b355b54e1aeb3bce0b38c84f122c5ee0f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24313','GHBC-REQ-024313','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.11.1','GHBC-C-006268','water tank with the hot water heater shall not be of less than 20 mm bore and it shall leave the cold water tank at a point not less than 50 mm above the bottom of the tank and shall connect into the hot water heater near its bottom.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":20,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":" water heater shall not be of less than 20 mm bore and it shall leave th"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"he cold water tank at a point not less than 50 mm above the bottom of the ta"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ter shall not be of less than 20 mm bore and it shall leave the c"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"tank at a point not less than 50 mm above the bottom of the tank "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8b7b4d58ee2058aac33deb57d70e1248e638ec80ce60558b36c0280d43f4af1f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24314','GHBC-REQ-024314','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.11.1','GHBC-C-006268','The feed pipe shall not deliver cold water to any other connection, but into the hot water cylinders only.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cf76361f104a81aced22b0001c9907c5b58f029c5c4d0a47b0808d1d49276373','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24315','GHBC-REQ-024315','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.11.2','GHBC-C-006269','buildings, a common cold water feed pipe may be installed, but each hot water heater shall be provided with a check valve (horizontal type check valve shall be preferred to vertical type for easy maintenance).','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','718b08a4144536b8065d223a34ae03495a6a6dac98e9f735757f7b7b69e308f6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24316','GHBC-REQ-024316','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.11.3','GHBC-C-006270','Care shall be taken in installing the piping to prevent airlocks in the piping and negative pressure in the hot water heater.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c2cd2fc4062ecf0271eedf41846f522943732ee10677171c90ed57b8bc9b1589','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
