('rowid-24323','GHBC-REQ-024323','GS 1207:2018',30,NULL,'30.4.12.12.1.3','GHBC-C-006275','At no point, after leaving the vessel, shall the vent pipe dip below the level of its connection with the vessel.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1e1477fd7db874527890cf6abffc406aa02597e8b3fb45e743ea13ca6f4ac46d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
