('rowid-24393','GHBC-REQ-024393','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.1','GHBC-C-006304','Sewage and sullage shall be connected to sewers.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f4aa491472009bbff658189fc1a76729db0815e4dfafd341fe9b35f7ca7225b8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24394','GHBC-REQ-024394','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.1','GHBC-C-006304','However, storm water from the courtyard may be connected to the sewer where it is not possible to drain otherwise; after obtaining permission of the Authority.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','19cb141f3d114440e18fc653a4c6459b44c585477c7710c24d782cb95be87253','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
