('rowid-24404','GHBC-REQ-024404','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.1.3','GHBC-C-006309','All cast iron pipes, which are to be painted periodically, shall be fixed to give a minimum clearance of 50mm from the finished surface of the wall by means of suitable clamps.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"o give a minimum clearance of 50mm from the finished surface of "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d8bccf23297faea1adcdfb43d9180be32c79966c72c167999dfb2c418ebb21cf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24405','GHBC-REQ-024405','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.1.4','GHBC-C-006310','Drainage pipes shall be carried to a height above the buildings as specified for ventilating pipe (see Clause 30.5.5.5.4).','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','75958b025110f8c90da49f0024fba3bec482d2ff2e8010d0ff69cf6e4699499e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24406','GHBC-REQ-024406','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2','GHBC-C-006311','A soil pipe, conveying to a drain, any solid or liquid filth, shall be circular and shall have a minimum diameter of 100 mm.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":100,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ll have a minimum diameter of 100 mm."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fd42f60560f22d767d593d63f013efbd062e4171493803ddf3593a6e6daad3b4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24407','GHBC-REQ-024407','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2.1','GHBC-C-006312','Except where it is impracticable, the soil pipe shall be situated outside the building or in suitably designed pipe shafts and shall be continued upwards without diminution of its diameter, and (except where it is unavoidable) without any bend or angle, to such a height and position as to afford, by means of its open end, a safe outlet for foul air.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e9db4f398efd00aafcc5c9b5122b7986179a56d7d8f8c134bea2918e1fe826e6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24408','GHBC-REQ-024408','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2.1','GHBC-C-006312','The position of the open end with its covering shall be such as to comply with the conditions set out in this Code relating to ventilating pipes.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','53035da889d292b6f9c3f7bca9ed0fd3d44462160a1fd96ccb5d888f42d2ef3e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24409','GHBC-REQ-024409','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2.1','GHBC-C-006312','Even if the pipes are laid externally, the soil pipes shall not be permitted on a wall abutting a street unless the Authority is satisfied that it is unavoidable.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b5ec24deb23b6fe1d07c64c204fb9485158e4275c81c4debaac37c4f17eaaf5a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24410','GHBC-REQ-024410','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2.1','GHBC-C-006312','Where shafts for pipes are provided, the cross-clauseal area of the shaft shall be suitable to allow free and unhampered access to the pipes and fittings proposed to be installed in the shaft.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a65f50db8ff98b6fb7633860ca1fa08beb33e7fbcfca605c69f94df4ca7be79e','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24411','GHBC-REQ-024411','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2.1','GHBC-C-006312','However, in no case shall the cross-clauseal area of the shaft be less than one square meter.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9fd313e17d823098f2535218a43a6993cd49f8bdbf0b41abc5202b15e82041ed','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24412','GHBC-REQ-024412','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2.1','GHBC-C-006312','All pipe shafts shall be provided with an access door at ground level and facilities for ventilation.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','54c90d17bb5d0885f2551d7ff69313b8233657d4ef01d4010a650de1e234796c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24413','GHBC-REQ-024413','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2.2','GHBC-C-006313','a building, shall not be connected to any rainwater pipe and there shall not be any trap in such a soil pipe or between it and any drain to which it is connected.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','9818ac91c18ef5a72fe64dd368700aaac0dbdddca49a8b1443fa7c3f15cf7706','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24414','GHBC-REQ-024414','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2.4','GHBC-C-006314','The soil pipe shall be provided with a heel rest bend which shall rest on sound footing, if terminating at firm ground level.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9f002f26375d2d30e42a43239fb8bff498cf9ffe9d679853010a03039967a95','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24415','GHBC-REQ-024415','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2.4','GHBC-C-006314','When the stack is terminating at the ceiling (soffit) of a floor, the bend shall be provided with sufficient structural support to cater for the stack dead weight and the thrust developed from the falling soil/waste.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','79fb2c965a54696fd6a59254b33eb9ea0dde0cb4c4824c691bf302f6d3541c84','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24416','GHBC-REQ-024416','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.5.2.4','GHBC-C-006314','Vertical stack shall be fixed at least 50 mm clear of the finished surface of the wall by means of suitable clamps of approved type.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"Vertical stack shall be fixed at least 50 mm clear of the finished surf"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"stack shall be fixed at least 50 mm clear of the finished surface"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bc27f5014598655b6d5279b2be7247bb370cb993495edb66a9b7139a5a78c554','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24417','GHBC-REQ-024417','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.8.1','GHBC-C-006316','Piping system for all special wastes should be separate and independent for each type of waste and should not be connected to the building drainage system.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a074ba6548d45b8a8291faf6f4de7000a774d6387fff62debe94dcd6198ee8e5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24418','GHBC-REQ-024418','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.8.1','GHBC-C-006316','Other applicable provisions for installation of soil and waste pipe system shall however be followed.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f66352fddc3c9a2266a21cd068287e13560551a73a260b4076092f2b6fce64d9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24419','GHBC-REQ-024419','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.8.2','GHBC-C-006317','A study of the possible chemical, corrosive and toxic properties of wastes handled and disposed of in a laboratory need to be ascertained in advance.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d746fdba791a5e605d4a3d71aa35a5b4ba4e043e806d517019e5c4e836ee25ea','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24420','GHBC-REQ-024420','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.8.2','GHBC-C-006317','The relevant statutory rules and regulations regarding the method of disposal of strong and objectionable wastes shall be followed.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','403b73f828705c343e614d79b4af036aacf9dd0cccbc237eefae273b8e473ef9','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24421','GHBC-REQ-024421','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.8.2','GHBC-C-006317','All sinks, receptacles, traps, pipes, fittings and joints shall be of materials resistant to the liquids disposed of in the system.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','42c986aa40d6de1cab8a195c9c0d6c0739d3835b60ff7a277d28feb81b598127','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24422','GHBC-REQ-024422','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.8.2','GHBC-C-006317','In laboratories for educational, research and medical institutions, handling mildly corrosive and toxic wastes, such wastes may be neutralized in chambers using appropriate neutralizing agents.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aad6e1d7e464646ae323887953f0a0f3dcc6a5dc2b5777b432eabde9d877e8d7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24423','GHBC-REQ-024423','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.8.2','GHBC-C-006317','The chamber shall be provided with chambers at inlet and outlet for collecting samples of the incoming and outgoing waste for monitoring its characteristics.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','86bba73c0857add367ff2213d738b187a3026446d71e8afdef4bf15424b17c15','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24424','GHBC-REQ-024424','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.9','GHBC-C-006318','Grease traps shall be installed in buildings having oil and grease types of wastes.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fbaa56f63676e74c4be097393ba49ff0fb9f2afa30ec2e2f55028df6db38a2d0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24425','GHBC-REQ-024425','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.9','GHBC-C-006318','In principle the grease laden water is allowed to retain in a grease trap which enables any solids to be settled or separated for manual disposal.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1f5c77abcf55187a9e535dd47b48bd3ee14dce8f69f53219cd34ff8753f9db8e','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24426','GHBC-REQ-024426','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.9','GHBC-C-006318','The retention time allows the incoming waste to cool and allow the grease to solidify.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4907051576b43dd20bd1f8bdce672ba8998aa45ce12d970438dcaed3792cb65c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24427','GHBC-REQ-024427','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.9','GHBC-C-006318','The clear waste is then allowed to discharge into the building‘s drainage system.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','137bcdbeb984ab1b25377fff25c9487a860b9ca280fbe80f43ee1309a2ed9bb1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24428','GHBC-REQ-024428','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.14.5.1','GHBC-C-006319','The trenches for sewers shall be loosely filled with earth after laying sewers, since loose soil is a better insulator than compacted soil.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','04780ec45acce3cc39c549051176b720d0f01c631beb185917be7c919e68dffc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24429','GHBC-REQ-024429','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','31.1.1.1','GHBC-C-006321','This clause covers the requirements for installation, operation and maintenance and also inspection of lifts (passenger lifts, goods lifts, hospital lifts, service lifts and dumb waiter) and escalators so as to ensure safe and satisfactory performance.','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae5322e1081131735c1ab37ad53efd78d9f0f020456e9117a59aaa5a5b6002a1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24430','GHBC-REQ-024430','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','31.1.1.2','GHBC-C-006322','This clause gives information that should be exchanged among the architect, the consulting engineer and the lift/escalator manufacturer from the stage of planning to installation including maintenance.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e6338afb141e4b5ad49658a597008d0e9c322dc950d6ca9ace82da036d7f609d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24431','GHBC-REQ-024431','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','31.1.1.2','GHBC-C-006322','Note: The provisions given in this Clause are primarily for electric traction lift; however, most of these provisions are also applicable to hydraulic lifts.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','82c0fe7d85ffa73a4a7576df76a85d012fff4943f991e8436aafbcbcc42207a4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24432','GHBC-REQ-024432','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','31.1.1.2','GHBC-C-006322','Consequently, sewers laid under traffic ways and other places where soil compaction may be expected are required to be given adequate insulation.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7dd79ed0458e332e00ed478c41e69a3e195beac5e31f0a49af81fa0923be29a7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24433','GHBC-REQ-024433','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','31.1.1.2','GHBC-C-006322','Where feasible, sewers shall be so located that the trench line is not in shadow, when the sun is shining.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f2a93aed9a453caece61b8edd15584591bbe445b2734c021cdd8843aa9340f92','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24434','GHBC-REQ-024434','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','31.1.1.2','GHBC-C-006322','Concrete, cast iron and stoneware pipes conduct heat relatively rapidly and as such should be adequately insulated.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2c366ad21b3f2211fea3299dfccb9ce52d62f7beb1c5337dc3849e9779eb2034','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24435','GHBC-REQ-024435','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.5.14.5.4','GHBC-C-006323','Suitable design modifications for sedimentation, chemical and biological processes shall be applied to sewage treatment plants for satisfactory functioning.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4f4839beb51af464fa988fc9d2db6310022ff32a893f8aa19bbec57e3bff7dcd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24436','GHBC-REQ-024436','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.8','GHBC-C-006324','appliances','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a5a487bfda93206f415e8dffb449436576d52d30b1907ff073fc99c98f121da','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24437','GHBC-REQ-024437','GS 1207:2018',30,'30.5','30.5.8.1','GHBC-C-006325','of sanitary appliances shall be done in accordance with good practice.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec089c7a723e303c48a31f3b114556e2189ca068173b4a38cdd3417fce94784b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24438','GHBC-REQ-024438','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','For the purpose of this Clause, the following definitions shall apply.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','90df39e09af36b0625e939469dfaacab554cf0acb5808a7ca47a67820f0c911c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24439','GHBC-REQ-024439','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','AUTOMATIC RESCUE DEVICE A device meant to bring a lift stuck between floors due to loss of power, to the nearest level and open the doors in order to allow trapped passengers to be evacuated.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d4e9116aeeb526be723738ae506f957898cca3f1ee390444f535fb46632dd6eb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24440','GHBC-REQ-024440','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','Such a device may use some form of internal auxiliary power source for such purpose, complying with all the safety requirements of a lift during normal run.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29847adebd2de25b8b6775740a0861ffae78b03cfbfa5d65a0aff7ecd81d9e75','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24441','GHBC-REQ-024441','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','The speed of travel is usually lower than the normal speed.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','80721ea99ca11a896fd3e5fed9f7426d45b199d115ffa7e0b7e4af56f5ea2a08','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24442','GHBC-REQ-024442','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','In the case of manual doors on reaching the level, the device shall allow the door to be opened and in case of power operated doors the device shall automatically open the door.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a2490a49789ba24cf4b144b954dd96f823e8acf2f9a548d24ef827a9c854c438','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24443','GHBC-REQ-024443','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','BALUSTER: A short pillar slender above and bulging below.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a5c01c8592b925a7b6be68726fba17966e6c099ab4615cb86682432d2ed26f86','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24444','GHBC-REQ-024444','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','Balustrade – A row of balusters meant for supporting moving handrails.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f609490a0afaf08d920c92e8b6ea94ba2866cd4279094e510bbc3a77d0618cb2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24445','GHBC-REQ-024445','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','BOTTOM CAR RUNBY: The distance between the car buffer striker plate and the striking surface of the car buffer when the car is in level with the bottom terminal landing.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','cd9b807544fb5ff5c416012a481c6c229383c253980ef0dade526d3cf58000d4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24446','GHBC-REQ-024446','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','BOTTOM COUNTERWEIGHT RUNBY: The distance between the counter weight buffer striker plate and the striking surface of the counterweight buffer when the car is in level with the top terminal landing.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','bc459b75ace08e05026d5f5f8a56f5da70fdeef8b240aa2d29a86927e67c3b87','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24447','GHBC-REQ-024447','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','BUFFER: A device designed to stop a descending car or counter weight beyond its normal limit of travel by storing or by absorbing and dissipating the kinetic energy of the car or counterweight.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c7778435051e933ad1b4a349721910d336ad71456a583c31a6074e2e8f751cea','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24448','GHBC-REQ-024448','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','OIL BUFFER: A buffer oil as a medium which absorbs and dissipates the kinetic energy of the descending car or counterweight.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','990dba1dfd5b4197b13e5396a3a038fc3ffca9d2200ab8c5c1bec6e456582792','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24449','GHBC-REQ-024449','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','OIL BUFFER STROKE: The oil displacing movement of the buffer plunger or piston, excluding the travel of the buffer plunger accelerating device.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b12242c0182e6120e6db3670a24a0312240d44090ea73c72aa810b94a1793360','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24450','GHBC-REQ-024450','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','SPRING BUFFER: A buffer which stores in a spring the kinetic energy of the descending car or counterweight.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3601088d64fbdf06904762ca95581091b611bd65f3d741ce7d53f56dc05b4a57','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
