('rowid-24522','GHBC-REQ-024522','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','LIFT WELL: The unobstructed space within an enclosure provided for the vertical movement of the lift car(s) and any counterweight(s), including the lift pit and the space for top clearance.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','15a16344e79d9a4ec032ba21e77700508e7ab85543bfbdbf092bce0acb9be05a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24523','GHBC-REQ-024523','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','LIFT WELL ENCLOSURE: Any structure which separates the lift well from its surroundings.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c3aeb1a83018c5426dfbee026913abbaebe4a070bd6374827c1292de05b2c6dd','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24524','GHBC-REQ-024524','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','OPERATION: The method of actuating the control of lift machine.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5489148c3438857706a7dad6b8d43a78d6ad4b804a631ec41e26f598b6a35790','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24525','GHBC-REQ-024525','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','AUTOMATIC OPERATION: A method of operation in which by a momentary pressure of a button the lift car is set in motion and caused to stop automatically at any required lift landing.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','78e873cf8d8db30c95c366ed0b59245a231280f0d08ed05b7e08f9ff9fb4d4f1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24526','GHBC-REQ-024526','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','NON-SELECTIVE COLLECTIVE AUTOMATIC OPERATION: Automatic operation by means of one button in the car for each landing level served and one button at each landing, wherein all stops registered by the momentary actuation of landing or car buttons are made irrespective of the number of buttons actuated or of the sequence in which the buttons are actuated.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bbb61c898f32cb8d457f0bd6eb907c499e0cdf49e7451cc19762cab0c7d5f0c5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24527','GHBC-REQ-024527','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','With this type of operation, the car stops at all landings for which buttons have been actuated making the stops in the order in which the landings are reached after the buttons have been actuated but irrespective of its direction of travel.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d54c2fd119a42a37227dbd5cfb4d85aeec4d1021418a7e0aa0364d36dd1cdfc3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24528','GHBC-REQ-024528','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','SELECTIVE COLLECTIVE AUTOMATIC OPERATION: Automatic operation by means of one button in the car for each landing level served and by up and down buttons at the landings, wherein all stops registered by the momentary actuation of the car made as defined under non-selective automatic operation, but wherein the stops registered by the momentary actuation of the landing buttons are made in the order in which the landings are reached in each direction of travel after the buttons have been actuated.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ffcc94bdb2f746272cd6134925ab4802e48f9729a8548677ca2f9274cdb2d73a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24529','GHBC-REQ-024529','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','With this type of operation, all ‗up‘ landing calls are answered when the car is travelling in the up direction and all ‗down‘ landing calls are answered when the car is travelling in the down direction, except in the case of the uppermost or lowest most calls which are answered as soon as they are reached irrespective of the direction of travel of the car.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d4c78d4726cfdf5eaa9dd30e2f9581a51ed230cbb314aecad3c43866dcfb7b6b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24530','GHBC-REQ-024530','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','SINGLE AUTOMATIC OPERATION: Automatic operation by means of one button in the car for each landing level served and one button at each landing so arranged that if any car or landing button has been actuated, the actuation of any other car or landing operation button will have no effect on the movement of the car until the response to the first button has been completed.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c4edc289235ea610ada5aef84988b2d29044c2b54784233856057ea2eb78aab0','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
