('rowid-24532','GHBC-REQ-024532','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','The operation of the cars is co-ordinated by a supervisory operation system including automatic dispatching means whereby selected cars at designated dispatching points automatically close their doors and proceed on their trips in a regulated manner.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7f96edc700f054a49677704cac7c6e5cc059acb75b613b6fa4eb68ca9c7c80d7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24533','GHBC-REQ-024533','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','Typically, it includes one button in each car for each floor served and up and down buttons at each landing (single buttons at terminal landings).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','982496c9719554b29a3d944f28bc24969a3a86d81c8aa69992f47c7531a90402','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24534','GHBC-REQ-024534','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','The stops set up by the monetary actuation of the car buttons are made automatically in succession as a car reaches the corresponding landings irrespective of its direction of travel or the sequence in which the buttons are actuated.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a95ec4bc5bf9f8cf860656bb4525c018a914075cbf1d8684ebdf580d6fec9a3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24535','GHBC-REQ-024535','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','The stops set up by the momentary actuation of the landing buttons may be accomplished by any lift in the group, and are made automatically by the first available car that approaches the landing in the corresponding direction.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0278d612dca49e6ac223108c96b3e80490b820bc7eca7f7d670023dc234043bf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24536','GHBC-REQ-024536','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','CAR SWITCH OPERATION: Method of operation by which the movement of the lift car is directly under the operation of the attendant by means of a handle.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a971ca8a12ef82ed764660950a9f625510bec5e1518d247465c1d0e8b6f35b71','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24537','GHBC-REQ-024537','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','SIGNAL OPERATION: Same as collective operation, except that the closing of the door is initiated by the attendant.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0f7528b0fefa5eabaa9dd4e7886963a3e4b85f8609378485cd0207ea53985755','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24538','GHBC-REQ-024538','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','Double button (continuous pressure) operation – Operation by means of buttons or switches in the car and at the landings any of  which may be used to control the movement of the car as long as the button or switch is manually pressed in the actuating position.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ef6a18744c1bcfc107cf86016e37e8bce7a3afdc92611f7df11086b0df1699fb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
