('rowid-24567','GHBC-REQ-024567','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.2','GHBC-C-006327','TRAVEL: The vertical distance between the bottom and top lift landing served.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a26679167b2b5ac2a0285732434d05c121648bc14ec0a48dee128591b753adf4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24568','GHBC-REQ-024568','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.1','GHBC-C-006329','The appropriate aspect of lift and escalator installation shall be discussed during the preliminary planning of the building with all the concerned parties, namely, client, architect, consulting engineer and/or lift/escalator manufacturer.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','06e92fe64ac250bc0ea3d4510992011d6a0ca0f3b36c6bfc8bfc2506d1e89d92','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24569','GHBC-REQ-024569','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.1','GHBC-C-006329','This enables the lift/escalator manufacturer to furnish the architect and/or consulting engineer with the proposed layout or vice – versa.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fd8ffadddbc49fe7dcd0241b7e6c8f01ac52a7308dfa5257c7d499c9fad0f10b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24570','GHBC-REQ-024570','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.2.1','GHBC-C-006331','the scope of Clause 31.1.6 the guidelines laid down together with Fig.1 will enable the preliminary scheme for the installation to be established.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e4ed1439a196fd15e012a0b3c0349a5f5352cd1d31edff50efd5628b7f10e019','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
