('rowid-24586','GHBC-REQ-024586','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-006334','escalator installations, the drawings shall provide the appropriate information.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','05c9e7a61eebe9f86d018faa41feea9bc496ea12fba884beb3b3d445841701f3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24587','GHBC-REQ-024587','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.2.2.3','GHBC-C-006334','31.1.3.2.2.4 The architect/engineer should inform the lift/escalator manufacturer of the dates when the erection of the lift/escalator may be commenced and is to be completed so that sufficient time is allowed for the manufacture and erection of the lift/escalator.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8ccc8fa32a480181dd09ea996ab7177b13a2058a7c67d147a9d907c50e648be6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24588','GHBC-REQ-024588','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.2.2.5','GHBC-C-006335','When submitting application for a building permit to the local Authority, the building plans shall include the details of lifts (number of lifts duly numbered, location, type, type of doors, passenger capacity and speed).','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c4575eef4a166d2a92d55946525d1205fbbeb8c1745f37e4275bb0ffc127f9da','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24589','GHBC-REQ-024589','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.2.3','GHBC-C-006336','by the lift/escalator manufacturer','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6f2df6b22420512a8e180c334c6326a3422d14ef1f8fc66a9f951a6d1009c264','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24590','GHBC-REQ-024590','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.2.3','GHBC-C-006336','The lift/escalator manufacturer requires sufficient information for the preparation of working drawings and is usually obtained from architect‘s drawings supplemented by any information obtained from the site and by collaboration with the other contractors.','documentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','87c0e7b47678a5ed17d6286911a2a39c857dc66db68e3683bcd1306782b153bf','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24591','GHBC-REQ-024591','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.2.3.1','GHBC-C-006337','Working drawings showing the layout of lift/escalator duly numbered, details of builders work, for example, holes in walls for guide fixing, holes in machine room floor for ropes and conduits, recesses for landing sills, supports for lift/escalator machine and loads imposed on the building should be submitted by the lift/escalator manufacturer to the architect/engineer for written approval.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','028955bd4256826a9f6f3377067b219030118cdf171277151d53a5b5d50c4bb0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24592','GHBC-REQ-024592','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.3','GHBC-C-006338','For information of the electrical engineer, the lift/escalator manufacturer should advise the architect/engineer of the electrical requirements.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cb9fc6ad449f5e4bdfd1d0fd71dc251233cd04035922a1e4bc51ed1663705e87','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24593','GHBC-REQ-024593','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.3','GHBC-C-006338','This information should be available early in the planning stage so that the electrical supply requirements of the lift(s)/escalator(s) may be included in the electrical provisions of the building and that suitable cables and switchgear may be provided.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ad6154fd2786454ec346cbf0994841bad852d37a34d719f81cee61dad999b231','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24594','GHBC-REQ-024594','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.3.4','GHBC-C-006339','31.1.4 to 31.1.12 deal with installation of lifts and Clause 31.1.13 deals with the installation of escalators.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ff2f975c916bdc710fbd8e4bca5bec739e4052068a2360752272cb35ab5218ab','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24595','GHBC-REQ-024595','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.1','GHBC-C-006341','It is the responsibility of the owner of the premises where the lift will be installed, to obtain the necessary permission including pattern approval from the Authority having jurisdiction before and after the erection of lifts and for subsequent operation of lift(s).','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a6ff2b7ad3a56dd7812a55771b88530d6bf475d77c3c89cc276285b9f8358224','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24596','GHBC-REQ-024596','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.2','GHBC-C-006342','Electrical Wiring Code','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["GS 1009","GS 1009"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3e6f08995201ac21f034e7a5a2a2c7bcdefbc203e06633d51704c4faff455d45','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24597','GHBC-REQ-024597','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.2','GHBC-C-006342','All electrical work in connection with installation of electric lifts shall be carried out in accordance with the provisions GS 1009.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["GS 1009","GS 1009"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7fd084b16f76f242b09bede91346fc5298b815e2332cf2836540e4f97dd6b88b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24598','GHBC-REQ-024598','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.3.1','GHBC-C-006344','used in electrical installation shall conform to Ghana Standard specifications wherever these exist.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae4dba6c0434d39cd0a55cb5c8212a5724ef46a30860dc62c2f8f12b192b4a9d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24599','GHBC-REQ-024599','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.3.1','GHBC-C-006344','In case of materials for which Ghana Standard specifications do not exist, the materials shall be approved by the competent authority.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','743ab27d26d0d7dfddfd060b22a42c0461d9cd9484152dd8016a973c5a0d3eb0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24600','GHBC-REQ-024600','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.3.1','GHBC-C-006344','For detailed specification for lifts, reference shall be made to accepted standards.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f1271fdd0e5c8645fa836288a3c5b8f5ad6cfa68b9758b746132529561434394','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
