('rowid-24603','GHBC-REQ-024603','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.5','GHBC-C-006347','Higher factor of safety for various parts shall be applicable in accordance with accepted standards.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0a56c17d5037d0fe1859942dd2683b1612a20395a5e92566616e5248c2c50f8d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24604','GHBC-REQ-024604','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.5','GHBC-C-006347','31.1.4.6 Additional requirements for passenger and good lifts 31.1.4.6..1 Bottom and top car clearances','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2cc33ef7be54f570ed6d3ba3aa33a471acc8335ccfea775db58d630587703f28','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24605','GHBC-REQ-024605','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006348','When the car rests on its fully compressed buffer there shall be a vertical clearance of not less than 600 mm between the pit floor and the buffer striker plate or the lowest structural or mechanical part equipment or device installed.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":600,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"ll be a vertical clearance of not less than 600 mm between the pit floor and "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":600,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"al clearance of not less than 600 mm between the pit floor and the"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','218d1802eff5dde177f11717b68c0b22dc802c6aadea61ff651dd364d4918018','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24606','GHBC-REQ-024606','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006348','The clearance shall be available beneath the whole area of the platform except for:','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','29db98cfced1c29622bea9bdeaa44748b15e8539de10d921f72648229cfd6a90','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24607','GHBC-REQ-024607','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006348','a)  guide shoes or rollers, safety jaw blocks, platform aprons, guards of other equipment located within 300mm measured horizontally from the sides of the car platform; and b)   compensating sheaves.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ther equipment located within 300mm measured horizontally from th"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b04d7a71a095daa4a2f237e161a45074b1e7f366f2b02423d035eb77dcc33c1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24608','GHBC-REQ-024608','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006348','Provided that in all cases, including small cars, a minimum clearance of 600mm is available over a horizontal area of 800mm by 500mm.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":600,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" cars, a minimum clearance of 600mm is available over a horizonta"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":800,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ble over a horizontal area of 800mm by 500mm."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":500,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"a horizontal area of 800mm by 500mm."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d4af43322740be51ee68b2437b5f9a38917f5a50e9a774e1441888c62cf917bf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24609','GHBC-REQ-024609','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006348','Provided also that in all the cases when the car rests on its fully compressed buffers, there shall be a vertical clearance of not less than 50mm between any part of the car and any obstruction of device mounted in the pit.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"ll be a vertical clearance of not less than 50mm between any part of the car"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"al clearance of not less than 50mm between any part of the car a"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7b87dd87b6f62066269634a93c9146d0ae62d4bfffe2b9614b693ca76d1321ab','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24610','GHBC-REQ-024610','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.6.1.2','GHBC-C-006349','The vertical clearance between the car crosshead and the nearest overhead obstruction within 500mm measured horizontally to the nearest part of the cross head when the car platform is level with the top landing, shall be not less than the sum of the following: a) the bottom counterweight runby; b) the stroke of the counterweight buffer used; c) one-half of the gravity stopping distance based on:','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":500,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"t overhead obstruction within 500mm measured horizontally to the "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b938cc2ae3be6ece852a7ccdc09c07a56ebd9aa7d5f8dfa93e1cc0beaf022a11','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
