('rowid-24624','GHBC-REQ-024624','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.6.4','GHBC-C-006354','1) one hundred and fifteen percent of the rated speed where oil buffers are used and no provision is made to prevent jump of the counterweight at car buffer engagement; and 2) governor tripping speed where spring buffers are used.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f0ca6814e5b66aa71d594f53a4c5cb8fe7bf5c7edae612a19fec2eeaced5e1b6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
