('rowid-24626','GHBC-REQ-024626','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.7.1','GHBC-C-006356','and counterweights','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8c88b4dfab56abff30a375583b75383ca3775e2ece1a1c562acc081891bf4cff','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24627','GHBC-REQ-024627','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.7.1.1','GHBC-C-006357','The top car clearance shall be sufficient to avoid any protruding part fixed on the top of the car coming in direct contact with the ceiling or diverting sheave.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a16f4afd47b303d73cc657039adea427ed211aa19846931e2051c33839357783','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24628','GHBC-REQ-024628','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.7.1.1','GHBC-C-006357','The clearance shall be calculated taking into account the following and shall not be less than the sum of the following four items: a) the bottom counterweight runby; b) the stroke of the counterweight buffer used; points.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ef6da445621fd0b8eda0cc1a3f89681e46cb63f93b1617bf697450ecf5afb3aa','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24629','GHBC-REQ-024629','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.7.1.2','GHBC-C-006358','The bottom car clearance shall be maintained in such a way that the counterweight shall not come in contact with the ceiling or any part hanging underneath the ceiling, when the car completely rests on fully compressed buffers,','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','10d2b3f6f15a6bf05fdf3fa156f5cdd36b2c79b5c517dd8d94e5123f0e65c82f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
