('rowid-24637','GHBC-REQ-024637','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.8','GHBC-C-006361','1) trip hazard in machine room; and 2) caution notice against unauthorized use of rescue devices (for example, brake release device).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3254730a2e45cf0bdcdece26f7b4f2ce43b471fdd95a5f786cf9a77005d0a48c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
