('rowid-24686','GHBC-REQ-024686','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.9.3.4','GHBC-C-006374','Minimum floor to floor height for landings on same side for horizontally sliding door is f + 750 mm and for vertically bi-parting doors is 1.5 f + 250 mm, where ‗f‘ is the clear entrance height in mm.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":750,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"izontally sliding door is f + 750 mm and for vertically bi-parting"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":250,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"y bi-parting doors is 1.5 f + 250 mm, where ‗f‘ is the clear entra"}]','["is 1.5"]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','15e9a81927504c5a81b949f1e0de2b3d7728156f88ecdd71053e9874e6f1dea2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24687','GHBC-REQ-024687','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.1','GHBC-C-006377','a part of the lift or necessary for its operation and maintenance shall be installed in the lift well.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eed1c2cbb3de0abf1b36529d4374b7c3dc02cd6562dee591dd124b080b9b5124','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24688','GHBC-REQ-024688','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.1','GHBC-C-006377','For this purpose, the main supply lines shall be deemed to be a part of the lift and the underground cable, if laid along the lift well shaft, shall be properly clamped to the wall.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3960b74c8d6fe51b2afa6f15b35399d4d9305e658dfe66cd83a4b581bec05631','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24689','GHBC-REQ-024689','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.2','GHBC-C-006378','Sufficient space shall be provided between the guides for the cars and the side walls of the lift well enclosure to allow safe and easy access to the parts of the safety gears for their maintenance and repairs; safety gears provided shall be in accordance with good practices.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c69dbda93a51512b86bd0437cdfbdb75b16a86d155f5830586d86e7a2adc83c6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24690','GHBC-REQ-024690','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.3','GHBC-C-006379','of the contained equipment and apparatus, shall be rendered fire resistant to the greatest possible extent (see also Clause 31.1.4.4.1).','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bf9238d667af936ca7b6201515dd47b941fb9b5d9545510cb7aa7d470a85c4ca','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
