('rowid-24696','GHBC-REQ-024696','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.5','GHBC-C-006381','provided with a governor-operated','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2b65048eb0e40e76c348f0d7d44c0f55c4094c7ff5c4983fb66fc208e5be414f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24697','GHBC-REQ-024697','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.5','GHBC-C-006381','safety gear; and d) the forces required on the structure in the event of car buffering directly without safety gear application to be indicated in the general arrangement drawing.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5b065d00cdcc558d0972bde7a2537e2af64f7162ce11f6f335771a8b2cd5ca09','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24698','GHBC-REQ-024698','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.1','GHBC-C-006383','Lift well enclosures shall be provided and shall extend on all sides from floorto-floor or stair-to-stair, and shall have requisite strength and in proper plumb.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','94e7547f3eb3a16759cf626f3ab0f544ee54f6d37b8eedd25b72fa736648561d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24699','GHBC-REQ-024699','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.2','GHBC-C-006384','enclosures facing any car entrance shall, as far as practicable, form a smooth, continuous flush surface devoid of projections or recesses.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','edcc9da4b0527ccb7884e71ddcaf4cc436439615a6265ace9af03b3bc2b7ba79','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24700','GHBC-REQ-024700','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.2','GHBC-C-006384','Note – This requirement may be met in existing lift wells by filling any recesses or spaces between projections or alternatively by covering them with suitable sheet material.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3e26a67d8e0aae6a979b056662a2d250e1b6f0a6618a05e05cdf7128eeb43bf4','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
