('rowid-24702','GHBC-REQ-024702','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.2','GHBC-C-006384','Where a car-levelling device is operative with car door opening, such interior surfaces shall always form a smooth flush surface below each landing level for a depth to at least the depth of the car-levelling zone plus the distance through which the lift car may travel of its own momentum when the power is cutoff.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c00b45d45134d313aeb2c2b2d34d6330e5f342fc206e43871d193b638f4dbfe9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24703','GHBC-REQ-024703','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.3','GHBC-C-006385','increase the fire risk in a building, the lift well enclosure shall be of fire-resisting construction see Part 3 Use and Occupancy classification','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0d333e298e29e4a9d5f55499b69397e0e6a921295db93b4d7ac40de39c89aa3a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
