('rowid-24713','GHBC-REQ-024713','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'9.5.4.10.2.9','GHBC-C-006390','If the door is mechanically locked, means should be provided for opening the same by means of special key during emergency or inspection.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bd32cb0b00efa63df0ee16de6a7e6af97cdc6fe8199a4279000b6d132b1b78b9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24714','GHBC-REQ-024714','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.10','GHBC-C-006391','off power An efficient automatic device shall be provided and maintained in each lift whereby all powershall be cut off from the motor before the car or counterweight lands on buffer.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a258121d2a81bbb161a868534b1bc09e25df4d2aa3ee54c46df5609c5fdfe75','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24715','GHBC-REQ-024715','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.3.1','GHBC-C-006393','A lift pit shall be provided at the bottom of every lift.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fb7356c3ec5e3deccf91d73d2d9fe30fe1112bf1b26de548f979666c2e93adeb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24716','GHBC-REQ-024716','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.3.2','GHBC-C-006394','Pits shall be of sound construction and maintained in a dry and clean condition.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f8c88ee6cc07048f3e85f81e42de60ca8f2ebf31a8f2075e1752ab84d02c4fd8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24717','GHBC-REQ-024717','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.3.2','GHBC-C-006394','Where necessary, provision shall be made for permanent drainage and where the pit depth exceeds 1.5m, suitable descending arrangement shall be provided to reach the lift pit.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"d where the pit depth exceeds 1.5m, suitable descending arrangem"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f9ec26922cbcbc61e2a34438b62606a758a50533eab89b8dd01695dd1b7f8b8d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24718','GHBC-REQ-024718','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.3.2','GHBC-C-006394','And, a suitable fixed ladder or other descending facility in the form of permanent brackets grouted in the wall extending to a height of 0.75 m above the lowest floor level shall be provided.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.75,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"wall extending to a height of 0.75 m above the lowest floor level "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec9cc0b66a148a720a7840810f11f244b8a10218a82fb8f9b2656ef000ec1c42','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24719','GHBC-REQ-024719','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.3.2','GHBC-C-006394','A light point with a switch shall also be provided for facility of maintenance and repair work.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a0e300f99103d75afc2c3701a28c407347850f0b72b5eb1dc1f686c4b277d0e5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24720','GHBC-REQ-024720','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11','GHBC-C-006395','structures','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','adb0bb05cafae4a30651fa4ce2d43b5c9808cb9c581f5a07319cb773f909d15b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24721','GHBC-REQ-024721','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.1','GHBC-C-006396','other apparatus and equipment of a lift installation, excepting such apparatus and equipment as function in the lift well or other positions, shall be placed in the machine room which shall be adequately lighted and rendered fire-proof and weather-proof.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a26a615201730bbfca3620bf1b0b39d486dd6779c833d21a41773509072ec29a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24722','GHBC-REQ-024722','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.2','GHBC-C-006397','The motor generator controlling the speed of multi-voltage or variable voltage machines, secondary sheaves, pulleys, governors and floor selecting equipment may be placed in a place other than the machine room, but such position shall be adequately lighted, ventilated and rendered fire-proof and weather proof.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b39372047e3ec9d8a4092a74ba7cc17103e1b861f90d35566743738469892f8f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24723','GHBC-REQ-024723','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.3','GHBC-C-006398','The machine room shall have sufficient floor area as well as permit free access to all parts of the machines and equipment located therein for purposes of inspection, maintenance or repair.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a886506de95bc77b449e85ebd9a897f71ee118bae3549dd70ede395edd758015','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24724','GHBC-REQ-024724','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.4','GHBC-C-006399','The room shall be kept closed, except to those who are concerned with the operation and maintenance of the equipment.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','268f14f7ec6b6b3b963455be0e815a36b3e233415f7d0970366f1bdb7b51d419','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24725','GHBC-REQ-024725','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.4','GHBC-C-006399','When the electrical voltage exceeds 220/230V ac, a danger notice plate shall be displayed permanently on the outside of the door and on or near the machinery.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9ecc3344dce8ca0e7aa21124f7cc953f696fa3e32269cc91cb61d30230e951a9','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24726','GHBC-REQ-024726','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.4','GHBC-C-006399','Where standby generator is provided, it is necessary to connect fireman lift to the standby generator.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','58744bc29b23a4f03db477cc5e1460f07d99dee36819ecbf6d456a7fb700cae2','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24727','GHBC-REQ-024727','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.4','GHBC-C-006399','Depending upon the capacity of the standby generator one or more other lifts may also be connected to the supply.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f5d36f154d6a8c385b6acb72d64a8869a53f4cdd197a4ae2452bc98920451461','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24728','GHBC-REQ-024728','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.4','GHBC-C-006399','Rescue instruction with required tools and tackles if any, shall be made available in the machine room.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8a13a051f545665d1fab5a470bbd1ed3680b562136f137fe1f3a3929beff8975','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24729','GHBC-REQ-024729','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.4','GHBC-C-006399','All lifts which do not have any automatic transfer facility to an alternate supply, such as generators, shall be equipped with Battery Operated Automatic Rescue Device to bring the lift to the nearest floor and open the door in the event of power failure.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e098343009cf3d90dd4281e81b33b05df6740377a8253207e8df0d332f14e7f3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24730','GHBC-REQ-024730','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.4','GHBC-C-006399','31.1.4.11.5 The machine room shall be equipped with an insulated portable hand lamp provided with flexible cord for examining the machinery.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a0f023deedc0556d8e0227731a6dad62fe20cbc47e2c3bd154a4042eb555d009','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24731','GHBC-REQ-024731','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.6','GHBC-C-006400','If any machine room floor or platform does not extend to the enclosing walls, the open sides shall be provided with hand rails or otherwise suitably guarded.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e393af45e6599058b6848a6bca845d8839ee0937d38ad7fec38a46a6a7aeb738','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24732','GHBC-REQ-024732','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.7','GHBC-C-006401','The machine room shall not be used as a store room or for any purpose other than housing the lift machinery and its associated apparatus and equipment.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','921139e1c3851a8afcd3c5e15ae920c36b15825eae92993a6a17008562007acb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24733','GHBC-REQ-024733','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.7','GHBC-C-006401','31.1.4.11.8 Machine room floor shall be provided with a trap door, if necessary.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":11.8,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"31.1.4.11.8 Machine room floor shall be pro"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','05f6ce2c60937975e2c5b085d96dcf003dc7b6afe9042d525cdf2552818d411c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24734','GHBC-REQ-024734','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.7','GHBC-C-006401','The size of the trap door shall be as per manufacturer‘s recommendation.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f0b835e2eb1ae7e7e7a4fd614d62ed848d4a68ad93556ea8aa727b392cd5ae06','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24735','GHBC-REQ-024735','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.9','GHBC-C-006402','shall be sufficient to allow any portion of equipment to be accessible and removable for repair and replacement and shall be not less than 2m clear from the floor or the platform of machine whichever is higher.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" and replacement and shall be not less than 2m clear from the floor or the "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"nt and shall be not less than 2m clear from the floor or the p"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c0a9249d10b92a12726cbefcb89fa7118d614dedb58a1bb634d601c6918ccd79','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24736','GHBC-REQ-024736','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.10','GHBC-C-006403','have machine rooms immediately over the lift well, and this should be arranged whenever possible without restricting the overhead distance required for normal safety precautions.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2fd281594b7d11c058ffc04277df0c9db89b5f73f2a36399191f2965486dade8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24737','GHBC-REQ-024737','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.10','GHBC-C-006403','In case where machine room provision on top is a limitation, either machine room less lift or basement drive or side drive lift can be considered.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2adfd2cb1601805a3b7bb690da08f4da313d999096360022b4ced4b6f466635a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24738','GHBC-REQ-024738','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.11','GHBC-C-006404','nomenclature of floors and storeys, reference may be made to good practice.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3548aa7121b03d6eab42ee95f5ff99c4724173022d3004c62a9a56435cf79555','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24739','GHBC-REQ-024739','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.12','GHBC-C-006405','planned for approach to the machine room taking into account the need for maintenance personnel to access the machine room at all times of day and night and also the need to take heavy equipment.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','19867b58f46a8213e53103099ae40da466ec7404530305c316fcb7e95ce9e1ef','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24740','GHBC-REQ-024740','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.12','GHBC-C-006405','Any fixture such as a ladder provided should be secured permanently to the structure and should have railings to reduce the risk of falling.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cbd09c92939d282eef725b159958da1b1ad4f7b00a3a87d9cc54abfa16ca2597','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24741','GHBC-REQ-024741','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.13','GHBC-C-006406','be provided in case of large machine rooms having four or more lifts.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','805f62d9ac4484eb56d7c436e1e2f82dd12db3b4ceeb4fc056e717dd03ff1d77','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24742','GHBC-REQ-024742','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.14','GHBC-C-006407','a prominent position on the roof of a building, provision should be made for lightening protection in accordance with good practice.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7e509eb0723eb9af59393afe6b871fb90d2341a45010c2bf8b341baeb492acdb','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24743','GHBC-REQ-024743','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.15','GHBC-C-006408','placed, it should be properly ventilated.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','04c8335fc300b54b4c052c6a48e6c61ca1e555dbadc71fa23287a5323f1fbe70','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24744','GHBC-REQ-024744','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.15','GHBC-C-006408','The ambient temperature of machine room shall be maintained between + 50C and + 400C.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8e15857cd96b0cea7b244f7248999fbe3849de1a7e800645ee7036749eac9823','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24745','GHBC-REQ-024745','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.11.16','GHBC-C-006409','be separated from the lift well by a separation wall.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2f40fe8e06487f5cda5d401cdac04bcf826f5b4d5c43e4f73e08f29064cb6d42','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24746','GHBC-REQ-024746','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.12.1','GHBC-C-006411','Power operated car doors on automatically operated lifts shall be so designed that their closing and opening is not likely to injure a person.','performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','34d9559a2d628295d80e17b5899774a4642d2269b62801f95cc8ef78eba1b7ca','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24747','GHBC-REQ-024747','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.12.1','GHBC-C-006411','The power operated car door shall be provided with a sensitive device which shall automatically initiate reopening of the door in the event of a passenger being struck or is about to be struck by the door, while crossing the entrance during closing movement.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8c776d38972b7f9276e699b5cec27d81089a9c3915b4db8b58d79819c0986e90','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24748','GHBC-REQ-024748','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.12.1','GHBC-C-006411','The effect of the device may be neutralized;','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b1565ce671aa0e570d556f6370ef2af3cd9dab7b742dec2433a513adee7fa861','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24749','GHBC-REQ-024749','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.12.1','GHBC-C-006411','a) during the last 58 mm of travel of door panel in case of side opening doors; b) when panels are within 58 mm of each other in case of centre opening doors.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":58,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"a) during the last 58 mm of travel of door panel in ca"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":58,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"rs; b) when panels are within 58 mm of each other in case of cent"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1d074ef367ec03a6dce2d48cff9004da9ccf23461adc3bc82261cf1c10edb1b1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24750','GHBC-REQ-024750','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.12.1','GHBC-C-006411','The force needed to prevent the door from closing shall not exceed 150N and this measurement shall not be made in the first third of the travel of the door.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4703192a930d4a4c15d4609e3f050314fe124a337970a7d3e91d469cf2ddce6b','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24751','GHBC-REQ-024751','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.12.1','GHBC-C-006411','In order to achieve this it is desirable that all power operated doors have a full length (covering at least 80 percent of the car door height from the bottom) infra red light curtain safety to retract the door in the event of coming across any obstacle during closing of the door.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":80,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":" have a full length (covering at least 80 percent of the car door heigh"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":80,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"ull length (covering at least 80 percent of the car door height from t"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','919765658aa5048abe3ecc07c28859cfb1daee92368406c3a0cdfa3267d6c0ae','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24752','GHBC-REQ-024752','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.12.2','GHBC-C-006412','which are poor in leveling accuracy and energy consumption shall not be used for new lifts in view of availability of latest technology energy efficient Variable Voltage Variable Frequency drive systems with improved leveling accuracy.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8cca7f3bfb3ca5b712bcf159d4dee8aeca5477898b339f400a43eb529fe3a2a7','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24753','GHBC-REQ-024753','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.12.3','GHBC-C-006413','button control in car and with capacities of 16 passengers and above, it is recommended to have an additional car operating panel with call buttons on the opposite side to the main panel for ease of access to buttons.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cefd7643895ff0774321558c2786fa436811a95d082170e2fae5d60facbeb78b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24754','GHBC-REQ-024754','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.4.12.4','GHBC-C-006414','Passenger lifts shall be provided with power operated doors which are imperforate.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eb0f7957592b7b78861bcd5c6b819c570b352cf39a8abd3ba5bc1fc9cc468ccc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24755','GHBC-REQ-024755','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.1','GHBC-C-006416','Plan dimensions of lift wells given by the lift manufacturer represent the minimum clear plumb sizes.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8b2598ed92ec1c9c8f1e0005cf4be0786a4403935f41c5cef2662a5133cac83b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24756','GHBC-REQ-024756','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.1','GHBC-C-006416','The purchaser‘s representative, in conjunction with the manufcturer, should ensure that adequate tolerances are included in the building design so that the specified minimum plumb dimensions are obtained in the finished work.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','369fd914f9bd5fe1aa0e6449040105983d3c34e5801df4ed58d3f2a11e67ca50','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24757','GHBC-REQ-024757','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.1','GHBC-C-006416','Dimensions in excess of these minimum plumb dimensions for lift well and openings (but not less) can be accommodated by the lift manufacturer up to certain maximum values beyond which changes in design may be necessary involving additional expense or work by the manufacture.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','86bf0a0666f769c080e1a2bdaa2c2c97df86e896c19e0d6dad4ef075ab3a7781','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24758','GHBC-REQ-024758','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.1','GHBC-C-006416','The purchaser‘s representative should take these factors into account when specifying the lift well structural dimensions on the basis of the constructional tolerance appropriate to the building technique.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e32f5eff1160569c6d2f84c235808561f68d7000990aea6ccb1acdb8234927d5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24759','GHBC-REQ-024759','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.2','GHBC-C-006417','It is very important that finished landing openings should be accurate to design size and plumb one above the other for the full travel of the lift.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0830ff3fbd2f91ea81c11aaadfc6cbfd61e0ca888147e97c8625baed6fe2b5df','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24760','GHBC-REQ-024760','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.2','GHBC-C-006417','In constructing the structural openings in concrete walls of lift wells, it is not possible to achieve a degree of accuracy vertically which will allow doors and frames to be inserted in the opening without some form of masking or packing to overcome inaccuracies.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c97330467d1632d364672eef3b55778e81e5cb713a3ca088f0f32b3e3f2c76dd','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24761','GHBC-REQ-024761','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.2','GHBC-C-006417','Provisions should therefore be made in design by increasing the nominal height from design finished floor level and width of openings to each jamb and head.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f42e9a662bb2007f423a28d4f3672277a9467dd387c73b174e555e80bce0cfc6','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24762','GHBC-REQ-024762','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.2','GHBC-C-006417','In addition, the alignment of the outer face of the front wall of the lift well is of importance when architrave of fixed dimensions are called for, and in this case the alignment of the outer face from floor to floor should not vary to a greater extent than can be accommodated by the subsequent front wall finish, the architrave being set accurately plumb.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','15046590ca02eda06d05b46f54bbe175e8dc268137bcb6ae30697301fb806b7a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24763','GHBC-REQ-024763','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.2','GHBC-C-006417','To facilitate accurate alignment of landing sills it is common practice to provide at each landing,','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','86d50aec19b8bf5d7b3897686d3764dc66b2d0e549fc082f25e72af624679aab','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24764','GHBC-REQ-024764','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.2','GHBC-C-006417','an independent threshold, the position of which can be adjusted.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db573cef8cb3904aa81640d32c0cba6b52cdc0d02ee4555bee6cba4dc987106b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24765','GHBC-REQ-024765','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.3','GHBC-C-006418','level If the net plumb well (dimensions A and B of Fig. 2) and the nominal structural entrance openings (dimensions C and D of Fig. 2) are defined by plumb lines, the actual wall should not encroach on these dimensions.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9819235fe43c76462da4883a0bf98456c3276b456e956ed396f732453d9891b5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24766','GHBC-REQ-024766','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.3','GHBC-C-006418','Dimension K (inside face of wall of Fig.2) should fall within the following limits: For wells up to 30 m 0.25mm For wells up to 60 m 0.35mm For wells up to 90 m 0.50mm','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":30,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"e following limits: For wells up to 30 m 0.25mm For wells up to 60 m"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":60,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"s up to 30 m 0.25mm For wells up to 60 m 0.35mm For wells up to 90 m"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":90,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"s up to 60 m 0.35mm For wells up to 90 m 0.50mm"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"owing limits: For wells up to 30 m 0.25mm For wells up to 60 m 0"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.25,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" limits: For wells up to 30 m 0.25mm For wells up to 60 m 0.35mm F"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":60,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"o 30 m 0.25mm For wells up to 60 m 0.35mm For wells up to 90 m 0"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.35,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"m 0.25mm For wells up to 60 m 0.35mm For wells up to 90 m 0.50mm"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":90,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"o 60 m 0.35mm For wells up to 90 m 0.50mm"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.5,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"m 0.35mm For wells up to 90 m 0.50mm"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c28c0fc217a0b3554c349470322e07cd89cef81ca8155e2f097e6dcef6ebed90','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24767','GHBC-REQ-024767','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.3','GHBC-C-006418','When architraves are to be supplied by the lift manufacturer, dimension L (side of structural opening of Fig. 2) should fall within the limits of 0 and 25 mm and dimension M (outer face of the front wall of Fig. 2) should not vary to a greater extent than can be accommodated by the subsequent front wall finish, the architrave being set accurately plumb.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":25,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ll within the limits of 0 and 25 mm and dimension M (outer face o"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a2b112d80898e9807846f43825860f030372389847a39c5d07620e96e283a45d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24768','GHBC-REQ-024768','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.5.3','GHBC-C-006418','When the entrance linings are supplied by the manufacture, corresponding provision should be made for the finished openings to be accurately plumb one above the other for the full travel of the lift end to design size.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','46c792fb206620774a9c2c0b33d671d444e2efd5d24d74bacb7f0b3d1f9baa9c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24769','GHBC-REQ-024769','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006421','the quantity of service required and the quality of service desired, determine the type of lifts to be provided in a particular building.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c424d885294fe65197e6fc69cda4b51868d135cfe29ff27b165018effe7f103f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24770','GHBC-REQ-024770','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006421','Quantity of service gives the passenger handling capacity of the lifts during the peak periods and the quality of service is measured in terms of waiting time of passengers at various floors.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e357bf869774499716c8b65f5aa2756a9e2702adb66a413487e4dbdf4924b759','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24771','GHBC-REQ-024771','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006421','Both these basic factors require proper study into the character of the building, extend and duration of peak periods, frequency of service required, type and method of control, type of landing doors etc. In busy cities, patience coefficient being low, satisfaction cannot be obtained if lifts with adequate capacities and speeds are not','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b360fdaa96b7ae430c1214fcb4c44532927b0f5f6de37025966c562805a1f892','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24772','GHBC-REQ-024772','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006421','provided.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','181988546f347960873626309d913e63b4bb985892c3f6b848f4be45d24f4016','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24773','GHBC-REQ-024773','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006421','In view of many variables, no simple formula is possible for determining the most suitable lifts.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e357c37a874907abec58ed96438ca09d0a20faa8e3020677f3780dae0615cedf','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24774','GHBC-REQ-024774','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006421','Note: It is recommended to do a Traffic Analysis Study to ensure optimum provision of lifts for the building in consultation with lift manufacturers.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d713172806a8aeaba3bb2e540e65d04c887dacd8f8c9b242db68e2ef2b818863','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24775','GHBC-REQ-024775','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.1','GHBC-C-006421','In view of the dynamic situation it is recommended that a computerized software is used for the Traffic Analysis Study.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','eb7d17063d7759ad504dc925ae2ae5887bdcd44485e5c3f00425956c72f9d02a','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24776','GHBC-REQ-024776','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.2','GHBC-C-006422','The number of passenger lifts and their capacities, that is load and speed, required for a given building depend on the characteristics of the building.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c52b3210d5c5fc415939cfd950abe91c28a5a0558ecd551e5abe276854b2e4a3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24777','GHBC-REQ-024777','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.2','GHBC-C-006422','The most important of these are:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','33818ddc202c5ef746bc5b72860a16f428003dfc695c454cc49b478968782b88','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24778','GHBC-REQ-024778','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.2','GHBC-C-006422','a) number of floors to be served by the lift; b) floor to floor distance; c) population of each floor to be served; and d) maximum peak demand; this demand may be unidirectional, as in up and down peak periods, or a two-way traffic movement.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4f95dfd93796ae8678ee036b0957338f4b88667ed1ce940265a20b7263f67b2c','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24779','GHBC-REQ-024779','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.2','GHBC-C-006422','It should be appreciated that all calculations on the traffic handling capabilities of lifts are dependent on a number of factors which vary according to the design of lift and the assumptions made on passenger actions.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','94b432eb8f33b49934b18233267686038a4340561f6d5a5d25b4f2d5d2469990','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24780','GHBC-REQ-024780','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.2','GHBC-C-006422','It follows, therefore, that the result of such calculations can only be put to limited use of a comparative nature.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','818aabbce330708fd2afeae91e1cf4bc969c4efaa404353eee7642bfc5a4b52d','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24781','GHBC-REQ-024781','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.2','GHBC-C-006422','For instance, they can with advantage be used to compare the capabilities of lifts in a bank with different loads and speeds provided the same set of factors are used for all cases.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c6482c18630e0ebdb33e72c63f36e92ee7cfe103678836370d890a542f0ef54f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24782','GHBC-REQ-024782','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.2','GHBC-C-006422','On the other hand, they cannot be used to compare the capabilities of different makes of lift used for a given bank of lifts.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','43380862a9d74f076261ef53d0c01c684e9d92c99c69c0462f699441eb293ef4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24783','GHBC-REQ-024783','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.2','GHBC-C-006422','Different authorities and manufacturers differ widely in their methods of calculation, due to the variations in lift performance, especially with regard to rates of acceleration and deceleration and door operation times which form the components of performance time.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','921693651911d249f5fa8cdf6b067a55be36c0580640e9cf61ab63d6f765e312','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24784','GHBC-REQ-024784','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.1.2','GHBC-C-006422','Therefore, the calculations made by different organizations will not necessarily agree.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3dc8fc05d35eb6a8e44b059c7873fc0850ecb76dcf4d02f9690536fdafd342e0','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24785','GHBC-REQ-024785','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.1','GHBC-C-006424','altering the basic principles.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a4d30ce56e69e020328f59e311bff4ef1f728d772efba4cdfad1e24c56a97f3f','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24786','GHBC-REQ-024786','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.1','GHBC-C-006424','The application to office buildings is still the most frequently used.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','96cfaff2dfc963ba0030ad30436b87cf651cb1fa978dc1fb6a3068bd8aece1bc','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24787','GHBC-REQ-024787','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.1','GHBC-C-006424','Therefore, the following method may be used as general guidance on preliminary lift planning for offices, bearing in mind the differences set out in Clause 31.1.6.1.2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','568b7b7b1f69ff1b60c38b96e3b69d11877c0b50cbae700c5c8ea65b319cf82d','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24788','GHBC-REQ-024788','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.1','GHBC-C-006424','A lift installation for an office building is normally designed to populate the building at a given rate and the three main factors to be considered are:','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fb4f856e9c626bbe57e7088792093b2fa997305cdaefda10c84da2adbe04f2c3','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24789','GHBC-REQ-024789','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.1','GHBC-C-006424','a) population or the number of people who require lift service; b) handling capacity of the maximum flow rate required by these people; c) interval or the quality of service required.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','19ff705a6b64bee7b42c2bf1ab86fa04d504e21b38d57b4b1ea02bcceb235c16','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24790','GHBC-REQ-024790','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.2','GHBC-C-006425','The first point to be ascertained from the eventual occupier is the total building population and whether this is likely to increase in the future.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dda5e613d156bc0f4427c17ede4b541caa878d4e6b120aab5071c8b1ac564dcf','2026-08-15 13:56:13');
