('rowid-24792','GHBC-REQ-024792','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.2','GHBC-C-006425','Average population density can vary from about one person per 4 m2 to one person per 20 m2.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"ary from about one person per 4 m2 to one person per 20 m2."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":20,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":"on per 4 m2 to one person per 20 m2."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c4bc9c83698beddbf3ecb2358a7360cd26613f61c8515dd25562ff93e118dd86','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24793','GHBC-REQ-024793','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.2','GHBC-C-006425','It is essential, therefore, that some indication of the probable population density should be obtained from the building owner.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fec89ccc1156b906f5e4918bf6b6d5291667e9e9c9d62b82a20d7d560c772793','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24794','GHBC-REQ-024794','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.2','GHBC-C-006425','If no indication is possible (a speculative development for example) population in the region of 5 m2 per person for general office buildings is usually assumed.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":") population in the region of 5 m2 per person for general office"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3e26098063ad1ee189ef972910ff8d0d76a02fbfbd57654beab6d3d9216961b1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24795','GHBC-REQ-024795','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.3','GHBC-C-006426','The quantity of service is a measure of the passenger handling capacity of a vertical transportation system.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4adde67a287cdfa05b93d75f6827c7997d0f197ae9d652fd509528c9d260f10b','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24796','GHBC-REQ-024796','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.3','GHBC-C-006426','It is measured in terms of the total number of passengers handled during each five-minute peak period of the day.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cb03db7564ac39e036f6e1b9bc9f07875d59250a5d42a9d022f6a0126fded1b4','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24797','GHBC-REQ-024797','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.3','GHBC-C-006426','A five-minute base period is used as this is the most practical time over which the traffic can be averaged.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c4ab2e136831aa54caea242485d0629233c4a09f1f9e259f19005822500d72a1','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24798','GHBC-REQ-024798','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.3','GHBC-C-006426','The recommended passenger handling capacity for various buildings is as follows:','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d3f9e9115d46c52c309f50ad69509c43bda40580523b01de1b5d8278eaa08141','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
