('rowid-24806','GHBC-REQ-024806','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.5','GHBC-C-006427','The maximum traffic flow during the up peak period is usually used as a measure of the vertical transportation requirement in an office building.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','685b79818b659f1ca63f5da13c609718ddcb3c1652169217e9187cc97f2e4af5','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
