('rowid-24829','GHBC-REQ-024829','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.6.2.9','GHBC-C-006431','T = Waiting interval in seconds, N = Number of lifts, and RTT = Round trip time, that is, the average time required by each lift in taking one full load of passengers from ground floor, discharging them in various upper floors and coming back to ground floor for taking fresh passengers for the next trip.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 1000","is 2000"]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0765b5d14b180343e1157d103c637699e16bb8b2072c66a0e1473a719f59ba01','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
