('rowid-24857','GHBC-REQ-024857','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3','GHBC-C-006433','The insulation of the lift machine and any motor generator from the floor by rubber cushions or by a precast concrete slab with rubber cushions, prevents transmission of most of the noise.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a4c3a4e2bc175a69a3f53af1b63de81d1ea03c1c8346a8dd434d6a35b8b7d222','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24858','GHBC-REQ-024858','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3','GHBC-C-006433','In this connection, see also good practice and Part 29 Mechanical systems (Acoustics, sound Insulation and Noise Control) for some useful recommendations.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":29,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"e also good practice and Part 29 Mechanical systems (Acoustics, "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae3d7eaec130067a4bb3e6318b58386d38b70672f1ae171c90d8426bad983c60','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
