('rowid-24892','GHBC-REQ-024892','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.3.3','GHBC-C-006446','The inherent high cost is enhanced due to the very small demand for such equipment, much of which is custom made.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5f08c0cd653ad0fd6cc381ae982de74fed9581781de1225f2be9068b60607ca8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24893','GHBC-REQ-024893','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.3.3','GHBC-C-006446','The high capital cost of the lift, building work and electrical supply equipment usually shows a much smaller return as an investment than more normal sizes of lifts.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e83a8e51b4c0fb052e89a98bd7cb9850d2f976a8d8d8da26f24b6b0ff77a9264','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
('rowid-24894','GHBC-REQ-024894','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4','GHBC-C-006447','Hospital bed lifts should be situated conveniently near the ward and operating theatre entrances.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be3c62b045eeb928312849fcd39bdb96dfbb0a19c5b8beeb8dc47e5eea6290b8','2026-08-15 13:56:13'),
