('rowid-24897','GHBC-REQ-024897','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.5','GHBC-C-006448','Personnel and material hoists shall be designed utilizing an approved method that accounts for the conditions imposed during the intended operation of the hoist device.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0d38816fc39f493a9502d494747c310b4d55497e1e5314a61ac74fdbb8123f25','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
