('rowid-24977','GHBC-REQ-024977','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.1.3','GHBC-C-006480','This should only be used when it is impossible otherwise to achieve the required leveling tolerances or on long travel lifts to maintain the required leveling tolerances during loading and unloading.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','23f2794b9648fc60b7f98a02f0b227fb99e0f3b731677c95ccb69383ae4a1b13','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24978','GHBC-REQ-024978','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.1.4','GHBC-C-006481','A variable voltage system is one using continuous regulation which minimizes speed differences due to load variation.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e630d1a05c2ff9f3ef2662143e71644a3870fdc7272dc3bb3833310c959df08c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24979','GHBC-REQ-024979','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.1.4','GHBC-C-006481','Therefore, the actual leveling speed is of less importance than the general refinement of its regulation control.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','af0f2cba11552f1c24ab55b09f92c39c47586da325057f953f706cf399a32913','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24980','GHBC-REQ-024980','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.1.4','GHBC-C-006481','In fact, no leveling speed as such may be identifiable.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9f4ad21a1c0338930344a983b0a8387e0dfc79afcaf31e217c6bace35dad580f','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24981','GHBC-REQ-024981','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.1.5','GHBC-C-006482','A lift is designed to operate and transport the contract load at the required duty cycle, and should not by intention or habitually be used to carry overloads.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5106972c923140cec2ad88c3e87cf59f6cb2dfe83e2903706022a02a2ddaa259','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24982','GHBC-REQ-024982','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.1.5','GHBC-C-006482','During test as a safeguard to cover variable supply and temperature conditions, a lift is checked for the car to complete one round trip with contract load plus 10 percent at nominal supply voltage and nominal ambient temperature.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":" trip with contract load plus 10 percent at nominal supply voltage and"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0db9d5712e48953f5126c2cd5773501c11c76d091dc34858323b432c1c094bb7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24983','GHBC-REQ-024983','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.1.5','GHBC-C-006482','There is also a static test with contract load plus 35 percent to check that the brake will sustain the car.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":35,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":" test with contract load plus 35 percent to check that the brake will "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','168dc3349f90d8cbb16e21b6dd32ea03db6d626b2052c34a6ac2c76fd065ea62','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24984','GHBC-REQ-024984','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.1.5','GHBC-C-006482','It is unnecessary to specify an additional overload test or capacity and in fact it is detrimental to the normal running efficiency and safety of the lift to do so.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f24dcfa6dddcdce0c92cae2270ad5f9f4d35d03f69952484008a7a23d23af105','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24985','GHBC-REQ-024985','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.1.6','GHBC-C-006483','It is not good practice to request that a lift should be designed to carry an occasional extra load.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','25642ba26981d75c51f74cb5c9a40350426d820e53e0435850695716d0d2bc1e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24986','GHBC-REQ-024986','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.1.6','GHBC-C-006483','It is tantamount to specifying an excessive overload test which is detrimental to the normal running efficiency and safety of the lift.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7cb01d69ff4a5d52a360c2740b9f966f28038dcb7b716552f0eda1442c62480d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24987','GHBC-REQ-024987','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.1','GHBC-C-006485','The methods of control systems are as follows: a) collective control (see Clause 31.1.7.2.3);','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9d036e73e1ca920cbc5d006fcbd9685a86fea42b098fd6ed7bc46469240f1fca','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24988','GHBC-REQ-024988','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.1','GHBC-C-006485','b) single push button collective control (see Clause 31.1.7.2.4);','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e6e98efec3994a92da536f65d4ebeb3a656bf14d5d970c6a34047922bc8672ca','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24989','GHBC-REQ-024989','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.1','GHBC-C-006485','c) down collective control (see Clause 31.1.7.2.5);','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','accbd39f5a26c134bbb17821883e4f0c6a56adb8b98df5b2d794eb5332d7f84b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24990','GHBC-REQ-024990','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.1','GHBC-C-006485','d) directional collective control for one car (see Clause 31.1.7.2.6);','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c655cb6e30e275dd3e608cf5d35387f4e4ce0e3755cdacd1fb487fff96e73694','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-24991','GHBC-REQ-024991','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.1','GHBC-C-006485','e) directional collective control for two or three cars (see Clause 31.1.7.2.7);','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','11aa106a008e3e0ce27962df1bfcadc00b5dc14a019b0dd0acd313269e162351','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24992','GHBC-REQ-024992','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.1','GHBC-C-006485','f) group supervisory control (see Clause 31.1.7.2.8).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','86f7271c7f2f4551f1af348ce52ce3dd8c03890d6d39fd31e84977a4c4a5946b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24993','GHBC-REQ-024993','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.1','GHBC-C-006485','Features of control systems are described in Clause 31.1.7.3.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','595eaafacc8f034fa39461931c73d7085b268cc74cb6c0537912655b870c33cc','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24994','GHBC-REQ-024994','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','Automatic control is a method of operation by which a momentary pressure on a push button sets the car in motion and causes it to stop automatically at any required lift landing.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc99d423ccab7434c0fed4265dd0d13e2945ddba6f9eb2f95c4b61b412a2f3da','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24995','GHBC-REQ-024995','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','This is the simplest control system and it is sometimes referred to as push button control.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','73f2393434a21a3b765785ca7b0f8293594d9b6d2286724fcfb5fd3c10bf7d6c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24996','GHBC-REQ-024996','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','A car answers a landing or car call whichever is actuated first by momentary pressure provided the lift is not in use.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0979fd7c1978e58a22b9f90b643d0905c322fb1a0b90492b68eee1fcb2784ae5','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24997','GHBC-REQ-024997','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','Momentary pressure of a car push button will send the car to the designated floor.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ba5bb1b593f0a73c92a80e216e55d3f397614efdc29e43677930cdf1961cc35c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24998','GHBC-REQ-024998','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','The car always responds to a car push button in preference to a landing push button.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','06bd9ad72dda65acae44e2749b4a0c1cfef89c655fb481a8a892d421b62629e2','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-24999','GHBC-REQ-024999','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','With this type of control, a RED landing signal light or direction arrow indicates that the car is in use that is the lift is travelling.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a0dde89abe4406be51812dce55668b78f82320e0c9ce999570382cd151e9f137','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25000','GHBC-REQ-025000','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','This type of control is recommended for the following applications:','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','418485af6d9caf1dad1766e822f85d93505c1a74cd1166fd341a61e4d7659210','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25001','GHBC-REQ-025001','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','a) a single passenger lift serving up to 4 floors;','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":4,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"single passenger lift serving up to 4 floors;"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ce279896a329837504a4e73613430e6c62d6f6f4062a5dbe45653604ba4c7032','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25002','GHBC-REQ-025002','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','b) good lifts serving any number of floors where it is usually the most suitable form of control.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aceee4168c27f0ea217c2cb3131b38d7fe62e28fcd78a3c2efec0d16a9be8e39','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25003','GHBC-REQ-025003','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','For special purposes, the following two systems may be considered: a) Dispatch from landings as an additional feature for a goods lift with manually operated doors.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d96bce9514b1a9b9e4d7f221e76700df26b2ebffe02f2c0ea990fd46a7de90cc','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25004','GHBC-REQ-025004','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','The call is registered by pressing the car push button and when the doors are closed the car will travel to the designated floor.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5642ee5b953164b0acc78caf00152995a30c8f7914a57dad242b1f7600fb8175','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25005','GHBC-REQ-025005','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','b) Automatic with attendant control as an additional feature on goods lifts with a key operated switch in the car to transfer the control from normal automatic to attendant operation.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bb4f8e9e9961c5576a8782cd69c60b632d1dd8b9b7cfc69fba7dc58b1ffa1cf8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25006','GHBC-REQ-025006','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006486','There is also a visual call indicator with buzzer in the car to indicate to the attendant the landing floors at which push buttons have been pressed when the car is under attendant control.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c0e1b15f5ee1c510dc3bed779e442a999cfbfece92026ee2aba09bc5b264302c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25007','GHBC-REQ-025007','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.3','GHBC-C-006487','Collective control is a generic term for those methods of automatic operation by which calls made by pressing push buttons in the car and at lift landings are registered and answered by the car stopping in floor sequence at each lift landing for which calls have been registered irrespective of the order in which the calls have been made, and until all calls have had attention.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b786945f24bb9cf13eec73d7e690c0837bc7cc85bee21e76f553d2974cf9a63f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25008','GHBC-REQ-025008','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.3','GHBC-C-006487','Collective control of any form is usually not suitable for goods lifts except where loading is not expected to fill the car and additional loads can be taken at other stops','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d5af92d9d2b51370e2557da9012a9aa4379cc7fc3fead69424a36cca29765b59','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25009','GHBC-REQ-025009','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.4','GHBC-C-006488','control Single push button collective control has a single push button at each landing.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','06a0b46f2af86346c18d70d8ea1f97bf0d0df1d8178b5c1ef24a43e5bf15bcd3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25010','GHBC-REQ-025010','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.4','GHBC-C-006488','It is recommended, as the direction in which it is desired to travel cannot be registered by the intending passenger.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','76b38577c1c7ab82714451f7b385da2716ee67a1c54062bd3d2da828b96aadd5','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25011','GHBC-REQ-025011','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.5','GHBC-C-006489','Down collective is a control system where landing calls are registered from a single push button, irrespective of the car being in motion or the landing door being open and calls are stored until answered.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','df59214ce42351b8e6819c67a36b816b8f4fd5c22b17e7b6c726114d6f909761','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25012','GHBC-REQ-025012','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.5','GHBC-C-006489','Any number of car calls can be registered and the car will stop in sequence in the down direction at each of the designated floors.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8e2c7afff91a47c0ebba8d066ba45d05a8c668c7b591eb5a9c9cf90daa3d66b1','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25013','GHBC-REQ-025013','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.5','GHBC-C-006489','The car will travel in the up direction to the highest call registered stopping only in response to car calls.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ecc6a5825dd63a2592c1a79c97bc267d44aa17bb5b72fa26394dc8ba6e944548','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25014','GHBC-REQ-025014','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.5','GHBC-C-006489','It will then travel downwards answering calls in floor sequence.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b481ebf9064837cce8a549467bd6b409478b454a9fc962fa4c8d25c8cd459d6b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25015','GHBC-REQ-025015','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.5','GHBC-C-006489','If only one call has been registered the car travels to the floor of call.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cf8d4c0147dfaf4ed6771201e85d736d455f9234b9d4f9b4d382b84c2ad6e0f3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25016','GHBC-REQ-025016','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.5','GHBC-C-006489','The system is suitable where there is traffic between the ground and upper floors only and no inter floor traffic.Two or three car banks have interconnected control.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','66aef971418b9ae1ce28444d5d4dcd90637e4e1f2599deaa921da25de988c240','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25017','GHBC-REQ-025017','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.5','GHBC-C-006489','With this type of control the following signals are included: a) a landing signal light indicates that the call has been registered and will be answered; b) illuminated car position indicator above car entrance.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b7fa777707dde512e7fbf083df2c4df9e6dd27558d024d03269fc13045f32454','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25018','GHBC-REQ-025018','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.6','GHBC-C-006490','Directional collective control for one car Directional collective control for one car is a control system having UP and DOWN push buttons at intermediate landings whereby the call is registered for the intended direction of travel.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b1c19aab57b3fc9fa6179ce32379d36d3aa16b0c9e12f45915e8b2562518613','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25019','GHBC-REQ-025019','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.6','GHBC-C-006490','Calls from the car or landing push buttons are registered and stored until answered.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b7f76f8e4a2a12e0ea54c6036edb19e88d03c6926eb8c86f14f264cff37aa56b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25020','GHBC-REQ-025020','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.6','GHBC-C-006490','The car will answer calls in floor sequence in one direction of travel.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','633c2b4acd39bfd15bde93bcfbf75b3e86470d8da7a85966275d71b670aa18f7','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25021','GHBC-REQ-025021','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.6','GHBC-C-006490','Calls for the opposite direction of travel are answered when the direction of travel is reversed.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f3b987ad268d64a27b8961f0bc8de7a48082febfcc8eae577326be3f46e8b909','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25022','GHBC-REQ-025022','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.6','GHBC-C-006490','This system is suitable for single lifts serving 4 or more floors with interfloor traffic, such as small office blocks, hotels and blocks of flats.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bcecbe8696499e5d54fa004b04f57b0ee50d6d86cf6f97627d4c1ca70d8a09b8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25023','GHBC-REQ-025023','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.6','GHBC-C-006490','With this type of control the following signals are included: a) a landing signal light for each landing push button indicates that the call has been registered and will be answered; b) illuminated car position indicator above the entrance in the car;','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6c31fa619f91bea40fc2af017605a0b0810070ff6a5dbc43d8b9cf0105cf14cd','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25024','GHBC-REQ-025024','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.6','GHBC-C-006490','c) arrow shaped signal lights in the back of the car or on the landing to indicate to the entering person in which direction the car is going to depart.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d7709d3e07193a92ae0abb7a69d2f68254b17632a60184de02708d5372fb9923','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25025','GHBC-REQ-025025','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','Directional collective control for two or three cars Directional collective control for two or three cars is a system covering a control in which the two or three cars in a bank are interconnected.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','270e0664619106bb771a6726d9dde5a8191f78595b2a45ce146a21c677c4bafd','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25026','GHBC-REQ-025026','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','One push button unit with UP and DOWN push buttons or floor buttons (in case of car control from floor) is required at each landing and the call system is common to all lifts.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0c83934a0d477e1532822dfb05cc2e03b9a7961a73f2417ab5c3e4340493528f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25027','GHBC-REQ-025027','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','If for architectural balance, in the case of a three- car bank, extra push button units are required, these should be specified.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','15ad67b39739654b85dcc35a286415746a6c3b1a7575f7014913e2fa533761da','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25028','GHBC-REQ-025028','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','Each landing call is automatically allocated to the best placed car.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','afab81650307f00f50644937bbc8449cb48f5a164ef22af4527ec8f35880dd6a','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25029','GHBC-REQ-025029','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','The control is designed so that cars are effectively spaced and thus give even service.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','1db66071147b18eece3f6a87e98cf2bbf2471eb37a1ae63af0ef843028805a8d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25030','GHBC-REQ-025030','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','When a car reaches the highest floor to which there is a call, its direction of travel is automatically reversed when it next starts.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','23809a775470b8b93ce60a16c2587a7e5c30454c0eb66c66a13bd177e0d87e3d','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25031','GHBC-REQ-025031','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','One or more cars will return to the parking floor.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','640f2896d151137f0051a244bc26d9df37991040d761791f6810078548c51a1f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25032','GHBC-REQ-025032','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','Automatically bypassing of landing calls when a car is fully loaded is an essential feature for three-car banks.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','86bfd4711d76c6e76c36077b3418aa6ef215d392c629538f6b03e472b25dbbe2','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25033','GHBC-REQ-025033','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','It is also necessary for two-car banks in offices.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6364957557cb55d9a7e17620a3664b8e36544cab6c7748d7475ac0c1a6d287a6','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25034','GHBC-REQ-025034','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','Other cars will continue to provide service to all floors.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','be4b8579a32fcfa15c4e13d1a7c93dca780b9b6fd196d33126a507672acbbf04','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25035','GHBC-REQ-025035','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','When three-car banks serve 7 or 8 floors and over, some form of automatic supervisory control (see Clause 31.1.7.2.8) a generally necessary in the interest of efficiency.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d3bc501a8c0274729e0b35c0a2b5bf2f0e9128f47ee79191f2153de2ad45554e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25036','GHBC-REQ-025036','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.7','GHBC-C-006491','With this type of control the following signals are included: a) a landing signal light for each landing push button to indicate that the call has been registered and will be answered; b) illuminated car position indicator above the entrance in the car; c) arrow-shaped single lights in conjunction with an audible single stroke gong or an indication on the landing call push button station above each landing entrance to indicate to the waiting person(s) which car is going to stop and in which direction it will continue its course.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','16d28adcae16ae6a6a08201d9f831b5fd8b766e602efe907b55090b17162ca2d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25037','GHBC-REQ-025037','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.8','GHBC-C-006492','A bank or group of intensive traffic passengers lifts requires a supervisory system to co-ordinate the operation of individual lifts which are all on collective control and are interconnected.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','268c7823a51a766c47b603a1852467ab7e5a4cc1585f4b3615ae1ca7e7123786','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25038','GHBC-REQ-025038','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.8','GHBC-C-006492','The very nature of intensive service calls for a sophisticated automatic supervisory control system so as to match the speed capacity of these lifts.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','554deca5bb587dbe01d0d89edc3f5a6735e31183614dad6466e77d062f37e42b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25039','GHBC-REQ-025039','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.8','GHBC-C-006492','The supervisory system regulates the dispatching of individual cars and provides service to all floors as different traffic conditions arise minimizing such unproductive factors as idle cars, uneven service and excessive waiting time.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','601c405b011de05a6c5d79034d5d018ce1a249c05ecf42b65842fdd743c685c3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25040','GHBC-REQ-025040','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.8','GHBC-C-006492','The system will respond automatically to traffic conditions such as UP and DOWN peaks, balanced or light traffic and provides for other specialized features.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f71a5d0859e1378eb25b7126fb0ad70341a74bdda1525fae437bd2700f8d5dfa','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25041','GHBC-REQ-025041','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.8','GHBC-C-006492','If desired, a master station can be provided in the lift lobby which gives by indicators, visual information regarding the pattern under which the system is operating.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','761c2619d15383cde74204afe784fc8209d4e948dc3794d539f28a8a0227b94a','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25042','GHBC-REQ-025042','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.8','GHBC-C-006492','Where the system is based on a definite programme, control means are provided for altering the type of traffic programme.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','adcded9e869d4a3d0789bbcba74ec86205a2a7eed56abe5452b04428c9a1d9b7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25043','GHBC-REQ-025043','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.2.8','GHBC-C-006492','There are other facilities, such as the removal of any lift from service.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','21e222643f289c9a29214eab33228c4a6a32500bb69f6cff1462ed509d6fa978','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25044','GHBC-REQ-025044','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.1','GHBC-C-006494','Sometimes it is necessary to give a special personal service or a house service.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','99c2c8aa7cb8800ab31b81bbb25af2273a48b584938aa07bf0ccf1aa7c9d1049','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25045','GHBC-REQ-025045','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.1','GHBC-C-006494','When this service is required and for whatever purpose, it should be specified as ‗car preference‘  by a key operated switch in the car.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d4a12180e3f44c5af464cbc09747eea3db281d14c6693c7a64b69b27e2a7747a','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25046','GHBC-REQ-025046','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.1','GHBC-C-006494','The operation is then from the car only and the doors remain open until a car call is registered for a floor destination.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','707d89162a4442e20f8e6052b6cca53e5382da9715bdb34570e9eab9adcffd41','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25047','GHBC-REQ-025047','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.1','GHBC-C-006494','All landing calls are bypassed and car position indicators on the landing for this lift are not illuminated.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','00829b90367378367025260db29837d16d0b8ebddd18a70ce94cc8df9bfe1282','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25048','GHBC-REQ-025048','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.1','GHBC-C-006494','The removal of the key when the special operation is completed restores the control to normal service.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','300c192280058d8f8ca063bbaacba2cc26d1b2af1cc8526d02e15842848ce0c5','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25049','GHBC-REQ-025049','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.2','GHBC-C-006495','For collective operation, automatic bypassing of landing calls can be provided.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9e29cc085cc19a290147b396898b2d194a3a36c6748abe4052044bb7de0378ef','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25050','GHBC-REQ-025050','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.2','GHBC-C-006495','This device will bypass landing calls when a car is fully loaded but the calls are not cancelled.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7548d6f589b115a3aa080e8b686c18bd5b633f666ebd4d29e275c64a832ddd74','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25051','GHBC-REQ-025051','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.3','GHBC-C-006496','Lifts controlled by variable voltage system automatically shut down when subject to an over-riding control which puts them out of service under certain conditions; for example, no demand for lift service.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','38c0b0853471e8f22710e5209fe490dadf776ad1abb97e4437781048dcf058a9','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25052','GHBC-REQ-025052','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.3','GHBC-C-006496','They are automatically put back into service as required.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a0a14bff83a12715a4b28f0700394a520472f412dfa8d67cbc42078b10c3edbb','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25053','GHBC-REQ-025053','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.4','GHBC-C-006497','For lifts with collective control when service is required below the main parking floor, which is usually the ground floor, to a basement and/or a sub-basement, the lift manufacturer should be informed of the type of service required, as special technical considerations are then usually necessary.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ab3b1deffd1c36ea4d107d6f41b32fdbdedf2f9fb8196e9cba5c002106c48676','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25054','GHBC-REQ-025054','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.5','GHBC-C-006498','Lifts for carrying beds and stretchers require a car preference switch so that an attendant can have complete control of the car when required.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','dcc671fcf6ed08643b71ce16533356377046c1f99270948dd2f9195085f1335b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25055','GHBC-REQ-025055','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.5','GHBC-C-006498','This requirement should be specified as ‗car preference‘ and it will function as described in Clause 31.1.7.3.1.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4cf0bd97e389e7c4e58b463d27f2561a749fd5df589874d051fe203dcc118b74','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25056','GHBC-REQ-025056','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.5','GHBC-C-006498','Otherwise such lifts can have the same control systems as for normal passenger lifts, the choice depending on the number of floors served, the service required and the number of lifts.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7c3f9a2ec367fde148206f979e7afb916ec91e2dd532ad5722c3d179cca081f1','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25057','GHBC-REQ-025057','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.6','GHBC-C-006499','closers) A ‗door open‘ alarm should be provided to draw attention to a car or landing door which has been left open.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','72c5f4ee9504a0cb3bf45d6c94cd8ca5877eb4bf7ae54a7dd26d1badfef3c92f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25058','GHBC-REQ-025058','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.7','GHBC-C-006500','For passenger operation when the car arrives at a landing the doors will automatically open and then close after lapse of a time interval.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3a9d827d1536a75100b5ae31f0666fe53f64193eb8336f771506484e313108b1','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25059','GHBC-REQ-025059','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.7','GHBC-C-006500','This time interval can be overruled by the pressure of a push button in the car to give instant door closing.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','bd45f8f8002524e4e8a180d4faba81f79761b644c7875092476065031b1d9676','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25060','GHBC-REQ-025060','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.7','GHBC-C-006500','An ‗open door‘ push button is provided in the car to reverse closing motion of the doors or hold them open.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bfddff3569c28482cc1ce5aabf8203cf780ce8d9a7ea2acab2c68120f87b0d04','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25061','GHBC-REQ-025061','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.8','GHBC-C-006501','When there are conditions that particularly affect the safety of passengers or damage to vehicles or trucks, the closing of the doors should only be','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7bee3e6f8e450b57cd98779b6948bad0e56d3ff4695ec3cdcef3d2c1172dde05','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25062','GHBC-REQ-025062','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.8','GHBC-C-006501','made by the continuous pressure of push buttons in the car or on landings.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fcbac1caa7f076928e31bf6fab6890c0be1fbcf9966ec535502f6908d0c9905f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25063','GHBC-REQ-025063','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.8','GHBC-C-006501','A ‗door open‘ alarm should be provided to draw attention to a car or landing door which has been left open.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2516f21c32ccb08ed56654d5be780da5822e2dea0c716e781d43adc1a9e8684a','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25064','GHBC-REQ-025064','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.8','GHBC-C-006501','This means of operation is required for some forms of goods lifts.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','55c150ba1e53e01fa7dde9b0cba39830d298e92a29d9e70bc2fd3092abd2a29b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25065','GHBC-REQ-025065','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.9','GHBC-C-006502','The safety of passengers passing through lift entrances is fully covered by the provision of good practice.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0784fd50fa052c01845bf0c3962f2be99bcc4c8baaa3553f1e5caba6b90f9779','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25066','GHBC-REQ-025066','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.9','GHBC-C-006502','No modification of these provisions should be specified.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','062d0021b38c18dcb49758b7547a720f3f1282f87851222adfd75b4d876e23bf','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25067','GHBC-REQ-025067','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.10','GHBC-C-006503','There are many forms of giving special service for individuals, but they should always be avoided.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed12f5fb14e2fee4c7d2abbfd7413aa3b652fe2a381c306234dc163b4c17462c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25068','GHBC-REQ-025068','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.10','GHBC-C-006503','They range from key operated switches at preferred landings to the complete segregation of one out of a bank of lifts.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c21bcc0d0f0fda447b5e4f898e1316699ebc04fdbe978b94d630f94eb1355167','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25069','GHBC-REQ-025069','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.10','GHBC-C-006503','It is obvious that any preferential treatment of this nature can seriously jeopardize the efficiency of the service as a whole.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec73443e957b507344da0776b7cbc7160303bbe9f081137a360d4228ef48d9a7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25070','GHBC-REQ-025070','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.10','GHBC-C-006503','When a bank of say three lifts is installed to meet the anticipated traffic requirements and then, when the building is occupied, one lift is detached permanently for directors‘ service, the traffic handling can be reduced by a half rather than a third.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ccc243dcc8d09541db88ceb428b3e8056b7783466473ef3b4d56c6db73421f2d','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25071','GHBC-REQ-025071','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.10','GHBC-C-006503','When preferential service is imperative, then the car preference feature should be available.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3aa1cda32db7095cc842a25c3980cb69ccc162607dd60d7b95e27b9ab5520ad8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25072','GHBC-REQ-025072','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.11','GHBC-C-006504','As all lift cars are illuminated when available (in service).','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','295e48844b8f98e609b362312f4176b1f6cb051cd22e3658d39758283dd179b3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25073','GHBC-REQ-025073','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.11','GHBC-C-006504','It is recommended that this illumination be used to signal the arrival of a car at a landing in preference to special signals such as ‗LIFT HERE‘ signs since signal lamps can fail when the lift is still operating satisfactorily.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','39e6052e3f4d2dc1f1b34ab0a957569b0feae28d42b6f240f475e55521b64940','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25074','GHBC-REQ-025074','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.11','GHBC-C-006504','The following is the practice adopted for vision panels in doors: a) for lifts with manually operated car and landing doors, vision panels are provided in all doors; b) for lifts with power operated car doors and manually operated landing doors, vision panels are provided in the landing doors only; c) for lifts with automatically opened car and landing doors, no vision panels are required; and','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','098c767b0bb2c015e6fe91d967d956f7d8140139e5317b215977c4d0d39b63d7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25075','GHBC-REQ-025075','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.11','GHBC-C-006504','d) when vision panels are provided they should comply with the requirements of good practice.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','815433580ef52e80b5882cd628704cdc1127636ccab0b98618576cf44ff54512','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25076','GHBC-REQ-025076','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.12','GHBC-C-006505','When switches are provided to take cars out of service, that is because the remaining cars in the group can cater for the required passenger traffic, it is essential that such switches should not stop the fireman‘s control from being operative in the event of the lift being designated as a fireman‘s lift.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c2b84b1a211cbd5a122ce64430139d55342d7f07ed613565e9a7f39ba7271fe2','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25077','GHBC-REQ-025077','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.12','GHBC-C-006505','Service switches should not be confused with maintenance switches which are only used when it is dangerous to attempt to operate the lift because maintenance work is actually in progress.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c6ce6438502a46ac7665e7c29fc52ff4169b512d152a9aa3d8144d62b11dd86c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25078','GHBC-REQ-025078','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.12','GHBC-C-006505','A control station fitted on top of the car is regarded as a maintenance switch.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','19e0da74ee9ce40461dbb470544afc573bbae17b7f041b1580bfd3dc7aa3c608','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25079','GHBC-REQ-025079','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.13','GHBC-C-006506','When required by the Ghana National Fire Service, a fire switch has to be provided; the function of which is to enable the fire authority to take over the complete control of one or more lifts in an installation.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','78b0bdbbeb3e344bebf0a99b6ea7736e8d1e43691f087b0450b81a3027c1e903','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25080','GHBC-REQ-025080','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.14','GHBC-C-006507','It is most important that the purpose of every push button and signal should be clearly understood by all passengers.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cb9b3d3f08fabd9aae6bd606a3cf5cbd510da773cad40c9761d4486377c3c844','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25081','GHBC-REQ-025081','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.3.15','GHBC-C-006508','are expected to use the lifts it is recommended to provide Braille buttons.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','762ed816e504eeb1241b1dea7e9e480bea69d4098514ce1aaed674b9d2a3af3e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25082','GHBC-REQ-025082','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','Good practice states the requirements for main switches and wiring with reference to relevant regulations.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','011879b9f447f6097387cd8fe8aaf1c566ae1c541e71bf94774189fae74a3062','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25083','GHBC-REQ-025083','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','The lift manufacture should specify, on a schedule, particulars of full load current, starting current, maximum permissible voltage drop, size of switches and other details to suit requirements.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a3bf5ca6fa1b3a744a71e4ab3f02241fa22ddcd0416a0eda1506e42eb0dae7d7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25084','GHBC-REQ-025084','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','For multiple lifts, a diversity factor may be used to determine the cable size and should be stated by the lift manufacturer.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','30754666bdc2b078bb4bce1a6a90297eccaba7040e52b9d55b958056020b4077','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25085','GHBC-REQ-025085','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','It is important that the switches at the intake and in the machine room which are provided by the electrical contractor are the correct size, so that correctly rated HRC fuses can be fitted.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8e17f7b0f69ebc521f90d608adcd56bba445684a188f5075fd6bcaaed30f3641','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25086','GHBC-REQ-025086','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','No form','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9d19b1935c217c7d4e15197593d80779eb09d2ebc71f7788c9f86c1efe7d3167','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25087','GHBC-REQ-025087','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','of ‗NO VOLT‘ trip relay should be included anywhere in the power supply of the lift.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c9ecd29ebb5688f6d71a84eca79a38db8d034126f003d4902f76efaa02ed8780','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25088','GHBC-REQ-025088','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','a) Power supply mains – The lift sub-circuit from the intake room should be separate from other buildings.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','16e7e1c85adb1f0172f47584c0b179d09795ead240d909b35988b15e53248263','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25089','GHBC-REQ-025089','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','Each lift should be capable of being isolated from the mains supply.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','440fa033b4ac4c0cb4e19b3bea7011720055c283d304fa883faa1ece658155b5','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25090','GHBC-REQ-025090','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','This means of isolation should be lockable. b) For banks of interconnected lifts, a separate sub-circuit is required for the common supervisory system.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','09278e3fad682cc35d72110f5f8cdafb7869b326546bd5e4d7281910f96126bc','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25091','GHBC-REQ-025091','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','In order that any car may be shut down without isolating the supervisory control of remainder.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3cf90dcd1315f3358af040d818fb051326fe57c3cfd93236ec9012cc98403209','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25092','GHBC-REQ-025092','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','c) Lighting – Machine rooms and all other rooms containing lift equipment should be provided with adequate illumination and with a switch fixed adjacent to the entrance.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8bf63c64492a4751be6b60856476533493c5884796261bddc1a4c61ca4a54467','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25093','GHBC-REQ-025093','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','At least one socket outlet, suitable for lamps or tools, should be provided in each room.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','db68db2019722b268b98d6efff7bdf1489f35920130ec08d89e6760d2c0cbde3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25094','GHBC-REQ-025094','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','The supply to the car light should be from a separate circuit, and controlled by a switch in the machine room.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','44bc33aa374c223f24cf81ea27e3aedbac8b139f6d6208ed8d2e363021782778','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25095','GHBC-REQ-025095','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','For multiple lifts with a common machine room, a separate supply should be provided for each car.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8765e57ceefcbeb6644448222a4a0f6bd985dc71fb00242367e8833d3816dce5','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25096','GHBC-REQ-025096','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','The car lighting supply should be independent of the power supply mains.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fea9a00d63b66395be12bd5bdce6ef00cca489856fcd6f9d63376133a5635b67','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25097','GHBC-REQ-025097','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','Any plug should be provided with a light, the switch for which should be in the lift well, and accessible from the lower terminal floor entrance.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','662536b96cfde304197018492e591bdccf29aaeba45c036c522b8f7940cd75a3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25098','GHBC-REQ-025098','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.1','GHBC-C-006510','When the alarm system is connected to a transformer or trickle charger, the supply should be taken from the machine room lighting.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a73dc7eb8c0e3a6436010ac13296f1d51c4e9801392bdf52f671d83f210bcb0f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25099','GHBC-REQ-025099','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.2.1','GHBC-C-006512','All electrical supply lines and apparatus in connection with the lift installation shall be so constructed and shall be so installed, protected, worked and maintained that there may be no danger to persons therefrom.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','44b76493ba154ee8dbd3b24a7b150dc9e2968cc1f1839062a0640a6a8f11343d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25100','GHBC-REQ-025100','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.2.2','GHBC-C-006513','coverings containing or protecting any electric supply lines of apparatus shall be efficiently earthed.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f5f9fa96a50135e0bc3c6473418c161cbd59afacecaa617c6243cd74bea2f7c3','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25101','GHBC-REQ-025101','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.2.3','GHBC-C-006514','No bare conductor shall be used in any lift car as may cause danger to persons.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8342c5d0f5fec3dd3ce37fc6771714be42189a7c19ebb2f1ce61954132cb58a7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25102','GHBC-REQ-025102','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.2.4','GHBC-C-006515','All cables and other wiring in connection with the lift installation shall be of suitable grade for the voltage at which these are intended to be worked and if metallic covering is used it shall be efficiently earthed.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d9a614d33a6022be69dbf98b3e677f68e726253d224708d0f2c41fb1eda552a5','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25103','GHBC-REQ-025103','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.2.5','GHBC-C-006516','Suitable caution notice shall be affixed near every motor or other apparatus in which energy is used at a pressure exceeding 250V.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','91be627e890c35e902dd8c247af1c71ca69e738cce09ff35401cf05719834766','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25104','GHBC-REQ-025104','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.2.6','GHBC-C-006517','Circuits which supply current to the motor shall not be included in any twin or multicore trailing cable used in connection with the control and safety devices.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','de7238841a16511834bf6fd68a484dbceb7664d25fbb22f10c2c8409ddc2ab76','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25105','GHBC-REQ-025105','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.2.7','GHBC-C-006518','control and signal circuit shall be permitted, if all the conductors of this trailing cable are insulated for maximum voltage running through any one conductor of this cable.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae7953d5cb43205b640ab5a147063cf704a34c9ef334ff38bb6a4217100f7ffd','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25106','GHBC-REQ-025106','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.3','GHBC-C-006519','It is recommended that the lift car be provided either with an emergency signal that is operative from the lift car and audible outside the lift well or with a telephone.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc6b21da9a0a8a724e6fd03cd5e860fecba7fe902a3b68e28ab7ba5286730da9','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25107','GHBC-REQ-025107','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.3','GHBC-C-006519','When an alarm bell is to be provided each car is fitted with an alarm push which is wired to a terminal box in the lift well at the ground floor by the lift manufacturer.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cf001dab2ff3eb4526c82d331d16b15d0c7885d69056c0a9207cbfa5b9939256','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25108','GHBC-REQ-025108','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.3','GHBC-C-006519','This alarm bell, to be supplied by the lift manufacturer (with indicator for more than one lift) should be fixed in an agreed position and wired to the lift well.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','180b8db82301849bf511646ebf88a967d85692f406a03c60c47ad2bf3c71d548','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25109','GHBC-REQ-025109','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.3','GHBC-C-006519','The supply may be from a battery (or transformer) fixed in the machine room or, when available, from the building fire alarm supply.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ff82dfca1c0b4384fa7c277683bb1e34ad8604ca14a72afd347cefddf95c65a2','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25110','GHBC-REQ-025110','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.3','GHBC-C-006519','The type of telephone should be stated in the enquiry.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','262048caf11571afe5ffa0480965a883a68d3f260dc17eeaa919271c7a31353b','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25111','GHBC-REQ-025111','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4.1','GHBC-C-006521','The terminal for the earthing of the frame of the motor, the winding machine, the frame of the control panel, the cases and covers of the tappet switch and similar electric appliances which normally carry the main current shall be at least equivalent to a 5mm diameter bolt, stud or screw.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"l be at least equivalent to a 5mm diameter bolt, stud or screw."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12a01b18f45cbd18dcae81f585c25a1c1c2fa512f186eb41c250adf61286581f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25112','GHBC-REQ-025112','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4.1','GHBC-C-006521','The cross-clauseal area of the copper earthing conductor shall be not smaller than half that of the largest currentcarrying conductor subject to an upper limit of 65 mm2.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":65,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" subject to an upper limit of 65 mm2."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','484a3e276959701e59e41e67ae021b33ae6936bac639ae47ec15957da49bedf4','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25113','GHBC-REQ-025113','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4.2','GHBC-C-006522','The terminal for the earthing of the metallic cases and covers of door interlocks, door contacts, call and control buttons, stop buttons, car switches, limit switches, junction boxes and similar electrical fittings which normally carry only the control current (such terminal being one specially provided for this purpose), and the earth conductor should be appropriately sized in accordance with good practice.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','933555ee557cc16b994e29b879e2630069e4d02c3bd89832a7dc9ed2fd184072','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25114','GHBC-REQ-025114','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4.2','GHBC-C-006522','The size of earthing conductor shall be in accordance with Part 28 Electrical Systems and Allied Installations.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c95374d7cd244f3f4923a8e9900af0a282db5152e430d091abdaa51fc9a43f20','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25115','GHBC-REQ-025115','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4.3','GHBC-C-006523','The earthing conductor shall be secured to the earthing terminal in accordance with the recommendations made in good practice and also in conformity with the latest provisions of ECG Act and Rules indicated thereunder from time to time.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','56bf3ef282a7dee4bbc2da5814077f8ea0128cef142d027b2248093aa9f011bf','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25116','GHBC-REQ-025116','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4.4','GHBC-C-006524','The exposed metal parts of electrical apparatus installed on a lift shall be sufficiently bonded and earthed.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','939e156f0e9b119e68e20ab3e98cf9b4bf2cec7e6e431a2d5e283911290a86f0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25117','GHBC-REQ-025117','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4.5','GHBC-C-006525','into electric fittings carrying control current making the case and cover electrically continuous with the conduit, the earthing of the conduit may be considered to earth the fitting.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c7cc0aeadddd7161ecca668c66feeb10452e9dfc06585e9bf8fb47a4e1566221','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25118','GHBC-REQ-025118','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4.5','GHBC-C-006525','Where flexible conduit is used for leading into a fitting, the fitting and such length of flexible conduit shall be effectively earthed.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7a0ad424b3dc7dc0bf9294350daf02b25e4c59e59065ec1686780704446cd925','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25119','GHBC-REQ-025119','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4.6','GHBC-C-006526','of bell transformers and their cases shall be earthed.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8ce3149ee43fb13e37145aecff3841e2130c75092108e68af1ea670e157c6724','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25120','GHBC-REQ-025120','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.4.4.7','GHBC-C-006527','in a building, there should be a separate earth pit for the lifts.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e7b50f8a068132fd0f48200ae2ebb1dfaaac8769209667b488b8745dad8ef927','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25121','GHBC-REQ-025121','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5','GHBC-C-006528','interface for lifts','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','72722abb29bb7a8b1364236c3afb8f9aa321ea6cdcf25dccc8581a4518beaefa','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25122','GHBC-REQ-025122','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.1','GHBC-C-006529','provided in a building and especially when these are provided at different locations in the building, a form of central monitoring may be provided.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a74dc0eef6a42a680c23703527ac12d19e031719859115f90594f6f2dc580777','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25123','GHBC-REQ-025123','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.1','GHBC-C-006529','Such central monitoring may be through a Building Management Systems, if provided in the building or through a display panel.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ccae785bccddec8a2a501b4e842c774df443eeaec9687eb15682a7627c7343c1','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25124','GHBC-REQ-025124','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.2','GHBC-C-006530','to the building management interface from each lift: a)  alarm button in car; b)  door moving information; c)  power on information; and d)  lift position information.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f35b58e80281bfd65e2676618f259a636fbb7a033ab50cf2427de8ca0e66bb77','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25125','GHBC-REQ-025125','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.3','GHBC-C-006531','Each of these signals shall be provided through a potential free contact located in the lift machine room.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0b70e7f3afbf14d821d02e4a64346bb71a2eb4a9e72265ef6fa7e726b9736b7e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25126','GHBC-REQ-025126','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.3','GHBC-C-006531','The contacts shall be rated for 230V ac/1A or 24V dc/1A.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e00ff964361d1e2bc9883ed95f4b1a91ae637dc5de632d672e0d8675e520e4f3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25127','GHBC-REQ-025127','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.3','GHBC-C-006531','A pair of wires should be used for each potential contact.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f82e6506ce8431ec1530b7a80c2218b90f121c7248164f02a95f6b8d9a25b1c4','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25128','GHBC-REQ-025128','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.4','GHBC-C-006532','to Building Management Systems shall be planned and carried out by the builder along with other wiring in the building.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c34a29658fcd8c6d860fb5ae1d8e4aeeb2614e1d3736223a32dd359c1cc729ac','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25129','GHBC-REQ-025129','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.5','GHBC-C-006533','should ensure that any position information is read only when the lift is not moving (lift moving information) or is capable of reading several times to detect a stable state.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','39737046fc14cc3dcf293fb34b59d3b8eae53393c876016a1d1dce66088d4fca','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25130','GHBC-REQ-025130','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.5','GHBC-C-006533','In addition to the signals above the following signals may be added if required for the benefit of monitoring the lift performance:','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3602e9499aeaeedaedfd879ba25600c7de29963604eea3773615f89d21de174f','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25131','GHBC-REQ-025131','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.5','GHBC-C-006533','a) A summary fault output to indicate a lift in fault condition, which prevents the lift from providing service.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a1971a9bcf9642bc08a2a7b6c699c670ada18364cabda6c2d665a5007b6cea89','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25132','GHBC-REQ-025132','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.5','GHBC-C-006533','This summary fault condition shall include the most common faults such as safety circuit open. b) Service or inspection mode. c) Attendant mode. d) Fire mode. e) Doors opening. f) Doors closing. g) Lift moving up.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a9795ebb6350e7d77502c1d2310c16903777c714aa33b84bde057636e63d56ef','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25133','GHBC-REQ-025133','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.5','GHBC-C-006533','(In combination with lift moving and lift moving up information, lift moving down information can be sensed by the Building Management Systems). h) Door reopen request (summary of door open, light curtain, photocell, safety edge signals).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','02b0835972fb57b4f30bde4063563363a1bbe506f531509a58355ba70a52dcb7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25134','GHBC-REQ-025134','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.6','GHBC-C-006534','possible to control the lift from Building','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','edfad0d9d4e447b35b2e317ff3682773ddcbee68865ec98f9d0b74abb4adabeb','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25135','GHBC-REQ-025135','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.6','GHBC-C-006534','Management Systems, the following control signals can be provided:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5a22546fdf01937fe6798854bee86921cad43f6ab31efc0ba2603fde417cb3d3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25136','GHBC-REQ-025136','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.6','GHBC-C-006534','a) normal to service/inspection mode change over; b) fault accept/rest input (using this input, the lift controller may be allowed to clear an existing fault if this is otherwise safe.  it will be decided by the lift manufacturer as to what faults can be cleared); c) car call to top most floor and bottom','inspection',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3b0b164a6531adbd5d81d5cfd73ab4c642be665e1fe95558b58521a38f4af9aa','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25137','GHBC-REQ-025137','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.6','GHBC-C-006534','most floor of each lift.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d35d7157bc77a5d47d167f51f1bb28cb743932cd62f7d91154c10357d528ef4f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25138','GHBC-REQ-025138','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.6','GHBC-C-006534','Where such control inputs are provided, it should be with a pass word and log -in feature that allows one to determine who has used these inputs and at what time.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0c599cd2a1ac967b023d51efcd06d6e8c9024e681f65865b6942cd6846baf972','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25139','GHBC-REQ-025139','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.6','GHBC-C-006534','Always such inputs should be through authorized persons only.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c0e915c0daf18700db053cc5872c311dbf2b3d56756603b177d6319a43b21160','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25140','GHBC-REQ-025140','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.6','GHBC-C-006534','The Building Management Systems should make all changeovers effective only when the lift is not moving.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7f4a43166a00a4b845f3ca757be2eef0b882ed7fdf3a17817e5eb39850f33e4a','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25141','GHBC-REQ-025141','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.6','GHBC-C-006534','31.1.7.5.7 Control inputs from Building Management Systems should be through a potential free contact capable of carrying 24V dc/1A or 230V ac/1A.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','863aea60d8e8952e30029d03147e2e535fa7e99363d1e71288c572a26d2c874f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25142','GHBC-REQ-025142','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.7.5.6','GHBC-C-006534','The wiring should be terminated in each lift machine room.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3bea5e6d7eabd998b152eed8b4d0ae5ba2283ef8edeae4ed39e0129432dfb438','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25143','GHBC-REQ-025143','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.1.1','GHBC-C-006537','Every lift journey involves two horizontal movements, in and out of the car, to one vertical movement.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5b82c8b1acee4caad22ae27b3eb33497e9415680ae30411fc72deb4a48f61129','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25144','GHBC-REQ-025144','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.1.1','GHBC-C-006537','The type of door, and the operation of the doors, play a main part in the service given, and should receive careful consideration.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','85b9f6c4031324c107b8717d07b7e7eb6494cd4375eaac5c0f66dc1466e1e3b8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25145','GHBC-REQ-025145','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.1.2','GHBC-C-006538','Most types of goods traffic require relatively longer loading and unloading times and manual doors are frequently used for economy and simplicity.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12fa9f406822e2a138b9d7fd378cecae6337f94724236625542d65f28191faf0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25146','GHBC-REQ-025146','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.1.2','GHBC-C-006538','Power operation can be applied, especially for large entrances, to give automatic opening: the doors then always open fully, reducing the risk of damage.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c6fce8acef00c18f6186247baf6f092653cbed149a30ec40559bee4c9da305f8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25147','GHBC-REQ-025147','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.1.2','GHBC-C-006538','For many types of goods traffic, it is preferable for closing though powered, to be controlled by continuous pressure button, rather than being automatically imitated.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d5ec1e44a40554e9d6ab8614bc95e9607f87619fbe19f439a908faa750f99541','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25148','GHBC-REQ-025148','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.1.2','GHBC-C-006538','For heavy duty lifts, a power operated vertically sliding door is preferred, this can be made extremely robust, and is capable of extension to very large entrances.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','788b07cb3576d92316030ce4734d519f4dbd0c1d90188e90c9851a2ec7654b99','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25149','GHBC-REQ-025149','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.2','GHBC-C-006539','Lift equipment will normally receive a protective coat of paint at works before dispatch to site.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4b4637e8e0cf3d9b3c7ae974e1160d3a42ee38b733d523b6d59e500d0e15c728','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25150','GHBC-REQ-025150','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.2','GHBC-C-006539','Further painting of lift may be necessary and is normally in the form of a finishing coat and can take place on site.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','791f5004d78f3eec269179c005141f24f20cb48184c70925e3241c82b58ec73b','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25151','GHBC-REQ-025151','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.2','GHBC-C-006539','Alternatively, the further painting of the equipment may be carried out at works as a finishing coat with normal touching up after site erection as may be necessary.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6dade2ce99f6744289798620c9c7e582b1aa0ce510ec72b2715b8823c25f6198','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25152','GHBC-REQ-025152','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.2','GHBC-C-006539','Any additional painting, due to site conditions during erection and/or final operating conditions in the premises, is subject to negotiation between the lift manufacturer and the purchaser.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b145edeb2c49742b7580ff86d2062cab0d5c0491fd407b24e848d8e156cbc6b1','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25153','GHBC-REQ-025153','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.2','GHBC-C-006539','Decorative finishes are a subject for separate negotiation.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','af5e15b7d1ebe32bdd0a72033ea078194a097db765535d718608d52d4e9adab0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25154','GHBC-REQ-025154','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.3','GHBC-C-006540','Standard equipment is suitable for use inside normal residential, commercial and industrial buildings but when unusual environments are likely to be encountered, the advice of the lift manufacturer should be sought at the earliest possible stage to enable the most economically satisfactory solution to be found.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93d6eb379e809fdee2ded87fd75e8778af26420b6c986dbbad70c15c7d4634ea','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25155','GHBC-REQ-025155','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.3','GHBC-C-006540','Special mechanical protection and/or electrical enclosures may be necessary as well as compliance with statutory or other regulations and with the purchaser‘s particular requirements, which should be fully considered at the time of enquiry.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','154ead824464250ce7f2265fb33c30d60492c09deea9ea6bf5ecaba4620ea75f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25156','GHBC-REQ-025156','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.3','GHBC-C-006540','Examples of situations which necessitate special consideration are: a) exposure to weather, for example, car parks; b) low temperatures, for example, cold stores; c) high temperatures, for example, boiler plant; d) hosing-down for example, for hygiene or decontamination; e) corrosive atmosphere, for example, chemical works; f) dusty atmospheres, for example, gas plant; g) explosive and inflammable atmosphere, for example gas plants, and petroleum and polyester industries.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f3ed288f87d588dade46c82a9df1cfcda0a3cd60c3dc901e819787d166854bd8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25157','GHBC-REQ-025157','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.4','GHBC-C-006541','Machine rooms shall be ventilated.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','862690825a0a01997a1700b56db6f86526d06091c1eb3353c03ea72a9380cf59','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25158','GHBC-REQ-025158','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.4','GHBC-C-006541','They shall be such that the motors and equipment as well as electric cables etc. are protected as far as possible from dust, harmful dusts and humidity.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9a4ce42cd9323640fb3d52c369621d003415b12c35e19c4e7ba45663de8f74c7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25159','GHBC-REQ-025159','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.4','GHBC-C-006541','The ambient temperature in the machine room shall be maintained between 50C and 400C.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5d6eebc4169b421b1ac81eb016a061749f0ff8dbdfec5cc21d20bd85ace30c76','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25160','GHBC-REQ-025160','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.5','GHBC-C-006542','floors, etc. 31.1.8.5.1 All machine rooms should be considered as plant space, and conditions provided to permit reliable operation of electrical switchgear and rotating machinery, and be conducive to good maintenance.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','236df7998371b50af19faa187aa726344c5af9c78a338249686954158df62add','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25161','GHBC-REQ-025161','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.5','GHBC-C-006542','Lighting should be provided to give at least 200 lux around the controller and machine.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":200,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"ng should be provided to give at least 200 lux around the controller and"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":200,"unit":"l","operator":null,"context":" be provided to give at least 200 lux around the controller and m"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cbf86e4874cb482acc182924722e84b76e67c08afddaa1138da5a07a6a09ac0a','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25162','GHBC-REQ-025162','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.5','GHBC-C-006542','The machine room walls, ceiling and floor should be faced in dust-resisting materials, tiles, etc. or painted as a minimum to stop dust circulation which otherwise could damage rotating machinery and cause failure of switchgear.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4b7ddc34e1f8c1407c10fe26fdd95d17762da8be477921020f1aac7693e3f5d4','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25163','GHBC-REQ-025163','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.5','GHBC-C-006542','Machine rooms should also be weatherproof and if ventilation louvers are provided they should be designed and sited to prevent storm water being driven through or to the apparatus.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d86cc11c1f9211e76ab8a819da017f3667b11dd90999131515649b35e331b2d3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25164','GHBC-REQ-025164','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.5.2','GHBC-C-006543','weatherproof and of a dust free surface material or should be painted to minimize dust circulation on to moving apparatus and from being pumped by the car movement into machine rooms or on to landings.','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e64979453218b7f1114953b2a3f2aa8f7f0f9489e92085a5f809c198aa2ad252','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25165','GHBC-REQ-025165','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.5.2','GHBC-C-006543','Sufficient number of light points should be provided in the lift shaft for proper illumination.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12bb75fd6a4f831656e6489578105a8b00fe628bd5a2871efe5af86aba607a07','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25166','GHBC-REQ-025166','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.5.3','GHBC-C-006544','Should a lift entrance open out into an area exposed to the weather, the entrance should be protected by a suitable canopy and the ground level sloped up to the entrance to prevent  rain or surface drainage from entering the lift well through the clearances around the landing doors.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5d5d940dce9efe6f7c4ee2f73709891404b5482d0f89d4d3728269e66bed1328','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25167','GHBC-REQ-025167','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.5.3','GHBC-C-006544','Any push buttons so enclosed should be of weatherproof type.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0e9a51f5a875e9faa3867af5ed19c835f02a3ab2c1496d367cae3b8f157e1026','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25168','GHBC-REQ-025168','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.6','GHBC-C-006545','The location of lifts in stairwells is not recommended.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3fe2653f1cdf7c45ac759d9d27fa731d796741c0307308873fc85b9dcca0d0fb','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25169','GHBC-REQ-025169','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.6','GHBC-C-006545','The use of stair stringers for fixing of guides normally involves extensive site measurement in order to fabricate purpose-made brackets.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8c993aedb21aae45d54562a36f7b49aa7d9aa2fe211aaa472373afb778d9b892','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25170','GHBC-REQ-025170','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.6','GHBC-C-006545','The resulting attachments are often unreliable and lacking in robustness.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','22daeb1989f3dd4ccbbc9f9efa23b398b8cb94eda985bdd25c080704e2182d4f','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25171','GHBC-REQ-025171','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.6','GHBC-C-006545','For stairwells of normal width, the span required for the lift machine support beams is excessive and unless uneconomic clauses are used, the deflections under varying load adversely affect the motor of the lift.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3ded395454da6d760deb232838aab9cf5cdd2711e1f8a527f1f7957c228b6731','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25172','GHBC-REQ-025172','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.6','GHBC-C-006545','The necessary provision of suitable continuous enclosures can be very expensive.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e0f57e0edee429f6fcb8850f0203cdd7cb00e8affc0e3c4ec2a6ff386dd95361','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25173','GHBC-REQ-025173','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','Hand-winding release procedure and indication The release procedure by hand-winding should only be carried out in an emergency and by authorized persons who have received the necessary instruction because it is dangerous for any other persons to attempt to do so.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0ecaf8816c9390aaefbe667b1f5eeee92a57c8068d85370210d321e44346c6aa','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25174','GHBC-REQ-025174','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','Before attempting to move the car, it is imperative that any person in the car be warned of the intention to move the car and that they do not attempt to leave the car until they are advised that it is safe to do so.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c56e83c2c1ee031d28d438336b775baaca5634688735b4ce43ed2be562c2cab1','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25175','GHBC-REQ-025175','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','Any failure to carry out this precaution may render the person concerned guilty of negligence should an accident occur.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','d44d041413721550628aad7ad3ed46b6a635edafc55fc6c5f831d9c391e6984d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25176','GHBC-REQ-025176','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','Before attempting to hand-wind the lift machine, it is vital that the supply is switched off at the main switch.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ea1efea465d5f0a4a0d6e1502671893be0b5575d4b1a8140fb6a4a156be956d0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25177','GHBC-REQ-025177','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','It is usually necessary to have two persons in the machine room; one to operate the brake release and the other to carry out the handwinding.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3d71cd59a5240d76cc58bbc52aa968c7dc112a0300b0a2b371fd4bfa3ce095c4','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25178','GHBC-REQ-025178','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','The exceptions are small lift machines where the hand-winding can be easily controlled by one man and larger machines which need two men to operate the hand-winding alone, with an additional man to control the brake release.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','15bcb6cbf533abddbbb4b279323b441165f0841359e48e990c63323ba2c488dc','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25179','GHBC-REQ-025179','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','If the car is stuck in the lift well and cannot be moved when an attempt is made to move it in a downward direction, then no attempt at handwinding should be made because the car safety gear may have set.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','58fe05cc8fe66fc6a034c17b06d95292b80445c1fbfed7ab1a52ddec92949d35','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25180','GHBC-REQ-025180','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','Any further procedure','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12a6c2eec050c907a25360f97ed7e04610f7daa34e5862dfa47728af63118827','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25181','GHBC-REQ-025181','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','should be carried out under the instruction of a qualified lift mechanic.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','37d58778f05de649857b2d73755542c01e068b3e062e61e80c24d3a2dc76f1ac','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25182','GHBC-REQ-025182','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','Provided the car is free to be moved in the downward direction, then it should be hand wound to the nearest floor.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a721dcc196818a2b76ebbd83dff05d5a983ea2eb11e04b7bdf901fafd629d210','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25183','GHBC-REQ-025183','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','There is a preference to move the car in a downward direction.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','46bec3a58e282db9c52be8feaa63f4ac638e7066c5427a1bdc9a3fd81dfddc7e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25184','GHBC-REQ-025184','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','However, this may not always be practical owing to the distance involved and the time taken to complete the movement.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3e604f1aeb689cdb539aa9da8c39e34be1a8eba078b8a38a39dc13b95da66a02','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25185','GHBC-REQ-025185','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','In addition the amount of out of balance load on the counterweight side, due to the size of car and the small number of persons inside it, it may make it necessary to wind the car upwards.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fbb2d776ced40e24b2db541db9af6c94edb5b825d72d1a85c9c53b92d2964f56','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25186','GHBC-REQ-025186','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','In the case of higher speed lifts, the direction of hand-winding will usually be governed by the effort required to move the car because of the absence of a large gear reduction ratio.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','b545c6ed9728c96a1ed7e96b67cf97c89b2fdf46325d7b54d8a5cd738122151a','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25187','GHBC-REQ-025187','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.8.7','GHBC-C-006546','It is essential that all detail operations be carried out according to the manufacturer‘s instructions for the lift concerned and these should be clearly stated and permanently displayed in the form of a notice in the machine room.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6f72cf76524ee91030cde08f2047d7a8e1c2c4308b40c0924367edd7ea6732ad','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25188','GHBC-REQ-025188','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.1','GHBC-C-006548','the movement of people, in large numbers at a controlled rate in the minimum of space, is involved, for example, railway stations, airports, etc. In exhibitions, big departmental stores and the like, escalators encourage people to circulate freely and conveniently.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','03641f948f98710fed48d81e45012d628bbc18b48fa26357083049f58fcdea1e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25189','GHBC-REQ-025189','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.1.1','GHBC-C-006549','As the escalators operate at a constant speed, serve only two levels and have a known maximum capacity, the traffic study is rather easy.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a6c1aad331a0ddc3bcf2bf25e00ea16efe5e0a3131a7d16e67d303869cdfeba1','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25190','GHBC-REQ-025190','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.1.1','GHBC-C-006549','Provided the population to be handled in a given time is known, it is easy to predict the rate at which the population can be handed.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d1e84c9b9a0842911843a9cd8fb4a62d9055cf6c5a43f221d6825c0810e709bc','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25191','GHBC-REQ-025191','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.1.1','GHBC-C-006549','For normal peak periods, the recommended handing capacities for design purposes should be taken as 3200 to 6400 persons per hour depending upon the width of the escalator.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','bcc057ee0530102909ee4ceb2a50b7cbf227380c2d48e2fd605521a4f394e530','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25192','GHBC-REQ-025192','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.1.1','GHBC-C-006549','The number of person that may be theoretically carried by the escalator in 1hour can be calculated as follows:','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"h","operator":null,"context":"y carried by the escalator in 1hour can be calculated as follo"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','af7611e2ccf225ab7f845b09fa65df55813feaae4a8e402e05eda009af5bfd81','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25193','GHBC-REQ-025193','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.1.1','GHBC-C-006549','a) For determination of theoretical capacity it is assumed that one step with an average depth of 0.4m can carry 1 person for a step width of 0.6m, 1.5 persons for a step width of 0.8m and 2 persons for a step width of 1.0m.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.4,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"step with an average depth of 0.4m can carry 1 person for a step"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" 1 person for a step width of 0.6m, 1.5 persons for a step width"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.8,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"5 persons for a step width of 0.8m and 2 persons for a step widt"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"2 persons for a step width of 1.0m."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fa62cd47a33e284b88d2970949af63843945bc5c7c6fddeae809c040e5160e54','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25194','GHBC-REQ-025194','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.1.1','GHBC-C-006549','b) The theoretical capacity then is:','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','5834f3f7fc328ddcf46bfa202b7824f1e9bc586261dd8eab3c055b286f6937bb','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25195','GHBC-REQ-025195','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.1.1','GHBC-C-006549','3600 x (rated speed in m/s x K)/0.4 where K = 1, 1.5, or 2 for 0.6, 0.8 ad 1.0m','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" 1, 1.5, or 2 for 0.6, 0.8 ad 1.0m"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','24dd308dec48b00e044e6a1a2380e215906932a2264aacf6b8680aae28ea6954','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25196','GHBC-REQ-025196','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.1.1','GHBC-C-006549','step widths. c) Some values calculated as per the above are:','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7597765cef208a0c4107e06c99c28425f180d10058dd32a8af18717b83f2e348','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25197','GHBC-REQ-025197','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.1','GHBC-C-006551','from the horizontal shall not exceed 300, but for rises not exceeding 6 m and rated speed not exceeding 0.5 m/s the angle of inclination is permitted to be increased up to 350.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":6,"unit":null,"operator":"not exceeding","context":"not exceed 300, but for rises not exceeding 6 m and rated speed not exceedi"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.5,"unit":null,"operator":"not exceeding","context":"exceeding 6 m and rated speed not exceeding 0.5 m/s the angle of inclination "},{"parameter":"comparison","value":350,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":" is permitted to be increased up to 350."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":", but for rises not exceeding 6 m and rated speed not exceeding"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"and rated speed not exceeding 0.5 m/s the angle of inclination is"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','434526c132737948a98967667fd527df18b56f0ab48c669c6e10d6aa79122afd','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25198','GHBC-REQ-025198','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.1.1','GHBC-C-006552','shall not exceed 0.75 m/s for an angle of inclination up to 300 and 0.5 m/s for an escalator with an angle of inclination of more than 300 but within 350.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":300,"unit":null,"operator":"up to","context":"s for an angle of inclination up to 300 and 0.5 m/s for an escalator "},{"parameter":"comparison","value":300,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"th an angle of inclination of more than 300 but within 350."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.75,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"shall not exceed 0.75 m/s for an angle of inclination"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" of inclination up to 300 and 0.5 m/s for an escalator with an an"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3577f1982053cf7be3a3e1fd8b1bb2f65c9c4609072cf7fe5d1c9d5e4b5b67b7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25199','GHBC-REQ-025199','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.2','GHBC-C-006553','at right angles to the direction of travel) between the balustrade interior paneling at lower points shall be equal to or less than the horizontal distance measured at points higher up.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f174c0bebacbd8a8cbaeeb386c11261b040bdfc0a246775b2971de0e61bae025','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25200','GHBC-REQ-025200','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.2','GHBC-C-006553','The maximum distance between the balustrade interior paneling at any point shall be smaller than the distance between handrails.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','acf2a136234ce1d587c0c49512feaa938fa9cacda610b483610733a06ef29b8f','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25201','GHBC-REQ-025201','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','The parts of the balustrade facing the steps shall be smooth.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','727dd7d18a8fbd1e044e9ef4d41c923c10d100829fb1e41705a9c50c576b5f1c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25202','GHBC-REQ-025202','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','Covers or strips not in the direction of travel shall not project more than 3 mm.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":3,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"n of travel shall not project more than 3 mm."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"l shall not project more than 3 mm."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6eaa0e8c846381bae780ba7d91a84638c9f295b1ef2fbdb1a1ca64259a9ffbfa','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25203','GHBC-REQ-025203','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','They shall be sufficiently rigid and have rounded or beveled edges.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ea07dc8450b5b7170eafc02b41f0b74b972c24c8c989c9167aa41179dc0b04ee','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25204','GHBC-REQ-025204','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','Cover or strips of such nature are not permitted at the skirting.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','20e5829e8053f843d4fe0e82746e06355f74ad0e1c76178a112d0ada5d57dc72','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25205','GHBC-REQ-025205','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','Cover joints in the direction of travel (in particular between the skirting and balustrade interior paneling) shall be arranged and formed in such a manner that the risk of trapping is reduced to a minimum.','plumbing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a3c3e8c4293f78dcc838045c2f53717bdb01442bbea92d210792a067b8021f9c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25206','GHBC-REQ-025206','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','Gaps between interior panels of the balustrade shall not be wider than 4 mm.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"trade shall not be wider than 4 mm."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','47849a82d7a454382a0760636313e4315afa887c87b60478d11dd9e409416296','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25207','GHBC-REQ-025207','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','The edges shall be rounded off or beveled.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','66d90e03a3f59d119e374b53da86ed4f820413b26e18a5baf76551b19fd93e1b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25208','GHBC-REQ-025208','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','The balustrade interior paneling shall have adequate mechanical strength and rigidity.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0c417da793e514be5778e5c92b41d64a9a7339ff4bee474d6da6509a2717088f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25209','GHBC-REQ-025209','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','When a force of 500N is applied at any point of the paneling at right angles on a area of 2500 mm2, there shall be no gap greater than 4 mm and no permanent deformation (setting tolerances are permitted). the width between the balustrades on the two sides of the escalator.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2500,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" at right angles on a area of 2500 mm2, there shall be no gap great"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" shall be no gap greater than 4 mm and no permanent deformation "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4055cf499e715ad41c8321f6695db3d7c98f5bbb493a240f9cceb29573c81b2e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25210','GHBC-REQ-025210','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','Where a change in width is unavoidable, such change shall not exceed 8 percent of the greatest width.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":8,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":" such change shall not exceed 8 percent of the greatest width."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4f9ab26592adec77f657c4c89b657d075ea6fe863b64ddeb667e3d102e796865','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25211','GHBC-REQ-025211','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3','GHBC-C-006554','In changing the direction of the balustrades resulting from a reduction in width, the maximum allowable angle of change in balustrade shall not exceed 150 from the line of the escalator travel.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','fa0aa861a45dd593d0e064c532c9e0472fc6e5b516896a838de7f07cde1b455d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25212','GHBC-REQ-025212','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3.2','GHBC-C-006555','is placed beside the steps, the horizontal clearance shall not exceed 4 mm at either side and 7 mm for the sum of the clearances measured at both sides at two directly opposite points.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"al clearance shall not exceed 4 mm at either side and 7 mm for t"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":7,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"xceed 4 mm at either side and 7 mm for the sum of the clearances"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','890bfb1ca3218be65c5c0fe5a9df10a279f54132703d65945ee8a68497410b98','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25213','GHBC-REQ-025213','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3.3','GHBC-C-006556','cause injuries appropriate preventive measures shall be taken.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','47c0ce86f5b49f51ceb094adda5743adaba7b5ae8b0db4c2e5f2080968759468','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25214','GHBC-REQ-025214','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3.3','GHBC-C-006556','In particular, at floor interclauses and on criss-cross escalators, a vertical obstruction of not less than 0.3 m in height (not presenting any sharp cutting edge, for example as an imperforate triangle) shall be placed above the balustrade decking.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.3,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"rs, a vertical obstruction of not less than 0.3 m in height (not presenting a"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" obstruction of not less than 0.3 m in height (not presenting any"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0ebc2776ffad9923159e4a016e6395032666dcc969c0080a383ef235a6c8c966','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25215','GHBC-REQ-025215','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3.3','GHBC-C-006556','It is not necessary to comply with this requirement when the distance between the centerline of the handrail and any obstacle in equal to or greater than 0.5m.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"e in equal to or greater than 0.5m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','480451ebea261281e59ba904625af1dfa3eae92012025abfc5192a5db945e961','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25216','GHBC-REQ-025216','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.3.3','GHBC-C-006556','For escalators arranged adjacent to one another either parallel or criss-cross, the distance between the edges of the handrails shall not be less than 120 mm.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":120,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"of the handrails shall not be less than 120 mm."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":120,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"drails shall not be less than 120 mm."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','86023982807b10d5bffe53fb25e9a46bf4ef5539dd6babd710d3fc688e1b2a0f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25217','GHBC-REQ-025217','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.4.1','GHBC-C-006558','Each balustrade shall be provided with a handrail moving in the same direction and at substantially the same speed as the steps.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','294911d7392a1c6b480a839462f4d0a8db325a72e489aed366f977bf5f5c9568','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25218','GHBC-REQ-025218','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.4.2','GHBC-C-006559','Each moving handrail shall extend at normal handrail height not less than 300 mm beyond the line of points of comb-plate teeth at the upper and lower landings.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":300,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"end at normal handrail height not less than 300 mm beyond the line of points "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"handrail height not less than 300 mm beyond the line of points of "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c6508754f5b98b8b0d309a066e5066803090deffb0c827a5237f95818b43a98e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25219','GHBC-REQ-025219','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.4.3','GHBC-C-006560','Hand or finger guards shall be provided at the points where the handrail enters the balustrade.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ab605ce3311894aa5bc3a5394145427e5edcadb02823c1ab75d7934f035a96c6','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25220','GHBC-REQ-025220','GS 1207:2018',31,NULL,'31.1.9.2.4.4','GHBC-C-006561','The width of the handrail shall be between 70 mm and 120 mm.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":70,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"the handrail shall be between 70 mm and 120 mm."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":120,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"il shall be between 70 mm and 120 mm."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8b9c47b7a2ef6383ebb2c85256d110027bdb05c74b8ee482154dfd909f681296','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
