('rowid-25493','GHBC-REQ-025493','GS 1207:2018',32,'32.13','32.14.3','GHBC-C-006658','Where pivoted or side-hinged doors are permitted without a fire protection rating, foam plastic insulation, having a flame spread index of 75 or less and a smoke-developed index of not more than 450, shall be permitted as a core material where the door facing is of metal having a minimum thickness of 0.8 mm (0.032inch) aluminum or steel having a base metal thickness of not less than 0.4 mm (0.016 inch) at any point.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":450,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"nd a smoke-developed index of not more than 450, shall be permitted as a core "},{"parameter":"comparison","value":0.4,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"ing a base metal thickness of not less than 0.4 mm (0.016 inch) at any point."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":450,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"eloped index of not more than 450, shall be permitted as a core ma"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.8,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"having a minimum thickness of 0.8 mm (0.032inch) aluminum or steel"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.032,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" minimum thickness of 0.8 mm (0.032inch) aluminum or steel having a"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.4,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"al thickness of not less than 0.4 mm (0.016 inch) at any point."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.016,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"ness of not less than 0.4 mm (0.016 inch) at any point."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2375160af785d4c7fdbebadde77da45d60b6d076d6796bec46c6449162115ac6','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25494','GHBC-REQ-025494','GS 1207:2018',32,'32.13','32.14.4','GHBC-C-006659','Exterior doors in buildings of Group R-2 or R-3.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','71530d6957e7e277abddfab91aec68ec0f0a515a229b6e680775f6ce6962b702','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25495','GHBC-REQ-025495','GS 1207:2018',32,'32.13','32.14.4','GHBC-C-006659','In occupancies classified as Group R-2 or R-3, foam-filled exterior entrance doors to individual dwelling units that do not require a fireresistance rating shall be faced with aluminum, steel, fiberglass, wood or other approved materials.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7a90879779652ef38d0ca45030f8bdca76a4a8e373e1781d514e51e53c833051','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25496','GHBC-REQ-025496','GS 1207:2018',32,'32.13','32.14.4','GHBC-C-006660','Where garage doors are permitted without a fire-resistance rating and foam plastic is used as a core material, the door facing shall be metal having a minimum thickness of 0.8 mm (0.032-inch) aluminum or 0.25 mm (0.010inch) steel or the facing shall be minimum 3.2 mm (0.125-inch-thick) wood.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Garage doors using foam plastic insulation complying with this Code in detached and attached garages associated with one- and two-family dwellings need not be provided with a thermal barrier."]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.8,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"having a minimum thickness of 0.8 mm (0.032-inch) aluminum or 0.25"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.25,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"8 mm (0.032-inch) aluminum or 0.25 mm (0.010inch) steel or the faci"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":0.01,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"32-inch) aluminum or 0.25 mm (0.010inch) steel or the facing shall "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3.2,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"r the facing shall be minimum 3.2 mm (0.125-inch-thick) wood."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6ae28618bccfe64dfb470cb3f04996ec5a503b08e964b4524b835c5a44712bf0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25497','GHBC-REQ-025497','GS 1207:2018',32,'32.13','32.14.4','GHBC-C-006660','EXCEPTIONS: Garage doors using foam plastic insulation complying with this Code in detached and attached garages associated with one- and two-family dwellings need not be provided with a thermal barrier.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Garage doors using foam plastic insulation complying with this Code in detached and attached garages associated with one- and two-family dwellings need not be provided with a thermal barrier."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','da8fc8eda41b57ddd959b93a48cb1b5b1588c2d66b9a6dfd03223d306ec42d70','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25498','GHBC-REQ-025498','GS 1207:2018',32,'32.13','32.14.5','GHBC-C-006661','Foam plastic insulation of not more than 2,000 British thermal units per square feet (Btu/sq. ft.) (22.7 mJ/m2 ) as determined by NFPA 259 shall be permitted as a siding backer board with a maximum thickness of 12.7 mm (1 /','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2000,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"Foam plastic insulation of not more than 2,000 British thermal units per squ"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":22.7,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"er square feet (Btu/sq. ft.) (22.7 mJ/m2 ) as determined by NFPA 2"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":259,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"mJ/m2 ) as determined by NFPA 259 shall be permitted as a siding "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":12.7,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"d with a maximum thickness of 12.7 mm (1 /"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','bec3d6a6e3325d2b1ee9fd730aee5e130b1f2205466785720cffca08012862eb','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25499','GHBC-REQ-025499','GS 1207:2018',32,'32.13','32.14.5','GHBC-C-006661','inch), provided that it is separated from the2 interior of the building by not less than 51 mm (2 inches) of mineral fiber insulation or equivalent or where applied as insulation with re-siding over existing wall construction.','energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":51,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"2 interior of the building by not less than 51 mm (2 inches) of mineral fibe"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" that it is separated from the2 interior of the building by not "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":51,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"the building by not less than 51 mm (2 inches) of mineral fiber i"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"lding by not less than 51 mm (2 inches) of mineral fiber insulat"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0bafe2101276e1415fd774c93a8043877d209dbf19a58b80f44c0087cce25fc7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25500','GHBC-REQ-025500','GS 1207:2018',32,'32.13','32.14.5','GHBC-C-006661','DGS 1207: 2018','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','44aa1a41cdd3908d30b6d2b7337b889efefc5fb9d634453aa866f924b19e6525','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25501','GHBC-REQ-025501','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.1','33.1.1','GHBC-C-006662','The provisions of this part shall govern the encroachment of structures into the public right-of-way.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','14e3ca0905e1b3c12e749764488c2e40b971ff1bb33fe71849e5c0cd6ce83774','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25502','GHBC-REQ-025502','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.1','33.1.1','GHBC-C-006662','General Rule (1) No part of a building, including any portico, verandah or other projections (except for the eaves), shall be constructed as to extend beyond the building line of any street upon which the building may front, abut or adjoin unless otherwise authorized by the District Planning Authority.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','6698a2696ffe18ec8123c8b3cd162cf3f76b53bfafb2180a986ff0110e2b71cc','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25503','GHBC-REQ-025503','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.1','33.1.1','GHBC-C-006662','(2) The eaves of any building which abuts upon any street shall not project into the street more than 600mm beyond the face of the wall of the building and shall be at a height level of not less than 3 metres above ground.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":600,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"l not project into the street more than 600mm beyond the face of the wall"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":3,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"shall be at a height level of not less than 3 metres above ground."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":600,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ect into the street more than 600mm beyond the face of the wall o"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"height level of not less than 3 metres above ground."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','89fa3f14fb038d2405c21a348b1472d30ddab4b0e5703be5207e1eab248ebeee','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25504','GHBC-REQ-025504','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.1','33.1.1','GHBC-C-006662','(3) Entrance gates, doors, windows and shutters shall be so hung that they open entirely on to the owner''s property and in no case shall they be hung to open beyond a building line or fence line, if the building line or fence line abuts upon any street or any public road, lane or foot path.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7e5fed5c212f420494534cff4893cda68a1c574fd859ddf44434776f20f505a8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25505','GHBC-REQ-025505','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.1','33.1.1','GHBC-C-006662','(4) No building shall be constructed such that any part of it cuts and projects above an imaginary line from the building line on the opposite side of the street at ground level so as to produce an angle of 45 degrees to the horizontal, except in accordance with permission granted by the District Planning Authority.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7d1eb19a1336f32cbb17cd94dfae33a5e092f15bcccbc7ef197ccbd3102768f9','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25506','GHBC-REQ-025506','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.1','33.1.1','GHBC-C-006662','(5) No building shall be allowed to intrude into areas reserved for improvement lines.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','71296c2338ffa8e58ce9a2a470dbfbd3241064afb5b316d82bd69db23fa5986d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25507','GHBC-REQ-025507','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.2','33.2.1','GHBC-C-006663','The projection of any structure or portion thereof shall be the distance measured horizontally from the pplot line to the outermost point of the projection.','planning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0265b163a42e9517f286d0c2d317c195c8df0e3cedb8852e9f5c81560e509709','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25508','GHBC-REQ-025508','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.2','33.2.3','GHBC-C-006664','The provisions of this clause shall not be construed to permit the violation of other lEN 310 or ordinances regulating the use and occupancy of public property.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f7e2cdde0636b7ffc5de39f5cc94ac8888892889b461b0e4dc71fa79410d6e0b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25509','GHBC-REQ-025509','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.2','33.2.4','GHBC-C-006665','Drainage water collected from a roof, awning, canopy or marquee, and condensate from mechanical equipment shall not flow over a public walking surface.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','7f0da90a848f9fee4e001d96f4327f7b583f72b9ce0a2ebdb1292323cb31ad57','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25510','GHBC-REQ-025510','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.2','33.2.4','GHBC-C-006665','DGS 1207: 2018','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','03ea415341c24a6b8d904f067deda283a0ae83a1132a03a81e6209bc4ef07273','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
