('rowid-25512','GHBC-REQ-025512','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.2','33.2.5.1','GHBC-C-006667','A part of a building erected below grade that is necessary for structural support of the building or structure shall not project beyond the pplot lines, except that the footings of street walls or their supports that are located not less than 2438 mm (8 feet) below grade shall not project more than 305 mm (12 inches) beyond the street pplot line.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2438,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"eir supports that are located not less than 2438 mm (8 feet) below grade shall"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":305,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"below grade shall not project more than 305 mm (12 inches) beyond the str"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2438,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"hat are located not less than 2438 mm (8 feet) below grade shall no"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":8,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"ocated not less than 2438 mm (8 feet) below grade shall not projec"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":305,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"e shall not project more than 305 mm (12 inches) beyond the street"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":12,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"not project more than 305 mm (12 inches) beyond the street pplot "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ec4422a901c6f4b43726bbd2de74dee038096f96583047da0eb9535572546f8b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25513','GHBC-REQ-025513','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.2','33.2.5.2','GHBC-C-006668','The construction and utilization of vaults and other enclosed spaces below grade shall be subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable governing authority.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2f1baf44d60edca10556824cd74016cf23313832caa753a65f37c7f1fd0d5fef','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25514','GHBC-REQ-025514','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.2','33.2.5.3','GHBC-C-006669','Areaways shall be protected by grates, guards or other approved means.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fe1042675e50e6deba092b276cb9af417e90e07e21841082accffbfe4c8bdafa','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25515','GHBC-REQ-025515','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.2','33.2.6','GHBC-C-006670','Encroachments above grade and below 8 feet in height.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":8,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"chments above grade and below 8 feet in height."}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','68c106377b9f3361a39f5147fd9dc986ec6e29f04209280f0241b731d5d4ab23','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25516','GHBC-REQ-025516','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.2','33.2.6','GHBC-C-006670','Encroachments into the public right-of-way above grade and below 2438 mm (8 feet) in height shall be prohibited except as provided for in Clauses 33.2.2.1 through 33.2.6.3.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2438,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"-of-way above grade and below 2438 mm (8 feet) in height shall be p"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":8,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"bove grade and below 2438 mm (8 feet) in height shall be prohibite"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f60afc64804baa7b2fee0a3871d53ab6cf81031f09432813868cda80a3b23e48','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25517','GHBC-REQ-025517','GS 1207:2018',33,'33.2','33.2.6','GHBC-C-006670','Doors and windows shall not open or project into the public right-of-way.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f554ef05cadf634aa88725734988c52a4ffc2b957fef55aca3d24a645057064b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
