('rowid-25592','GHBC-REQ-025592','GS 1207:2018',34,NULL,'34.6.9','GHBC-C-006705','Where located more than 1524 mm (5 feet) from the street boundary line, a barrier shall be erected where required by the Head of works department.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1524,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"Where located more than 1524 mm (5 feet) from the street b"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1524,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"Where located more than 1524 mm (5 feet) from the street boun"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":5,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"re located more than 1524 mm (5 feet) from the street boundary lin"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2865ef71665aaa047f15985f417fc69e44bef63f57061508353c170387e2e6a2','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25593','GHBC-REQ-025593','GS 1207:2018',34,NULL,'34.6.9','GHBC-C-006705','Barriers shall be of adequate strength to resist wind pressure as specified in Part 17 (Stuctural loads and design).','material',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','01ba8c1404eb0232bfdc97257cfd5bd73e6c6fbc77b08397622e1e25093b7f5f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25594','GHBC-REQ-025594','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.7','33.7.1','GHBC-C-006706','Adjoining public and private property shall be protected from damage during construction, remodeling and demolition work.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ec8713e5ea829fbd16ba9dd7cc73fdd01aaa90101aa8eac137591e688dc2916b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25595','GHBC-REQ-025595','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.7','33.7.1','GHBC-C-006706','Protection shall be provided for footings, foundations, party walls, chimneys, skylights and roofs.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e0d6dfb736cc5bc5bf6459fd5ea1465a25ebcf1e542c7fc95277960ee05752cc','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25596','GHBC-REQ-025596','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.7','33.7.1','GHBC-C-006706','Provisions shall be made to control water runoff and erosion during construction or demolition activities.','environmental',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','520a81fa7c8acff3e720f65976aa49c4a376498f7f81884c1c7026e53d0e0064','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25597','GHBC-REQ-025597','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.7','33.7.1','GHBC-C-006706','The person making or causing an excavation to be made shall provide written notice to the owners of adjoining buildings advising them that the excavation is to be made and that the adjoining buildings should be protected.','procedural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9cdc58e7b6d68a6084feb7d0059b8bf57815b096eaf15829af30a574d924bb16','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25598','GHBC-REQ-025598','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.7','33.7.1','GHBC-C-006706','Said notification shall be delivered not less than 10 days prior to the scheduled starting date of the excavation.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":10,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"tification shall be delivered not less than 10 days prior to the scheduled s"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":10,"unit":"days","operator":null,"context":"ll be delivered not less than 10 days prior to the scheduled starti"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ae093d31dd411fde5458c0d3ea4fe8b1b593c507ef9398638956feea6217855c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25599','GHBC-REQ-025599','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.8','34.8.1','GHBC-C-006707','The temporary use of streets or public property for the storage or handling of materials or of equipment required for construction or demolition, and the protection provided to the public shall comply with the','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f034ad8671940f287786eb728f5ec9bce0b26ba2c206451e5334f29fddc15167','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
