('rowid-25619','GHBC-REQ-025619','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.11','34.11.1','GHBC-C-006714','Such stand- pipes shall be installed prior to construction exceeding 12 192mm (40 feet) in height above the lowest level of fire department vehicle access.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":192,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" to construction exceeding 12 192mm (40 feet) in height above the"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":40,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"struction exceeding 12 192mm (40 feet) in height above the lowest l"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5b9e43fd62ea677d1cb0075021d46d8634355a91c338fb3469dab51c5a4f719a','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25620','GHBC-REQ-025620','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.11','34.11.1','GHBC-C-006714','Such standpipes shall be provided with fire department hose connections at locations adjacent to stairways complying with Clause 3310.1.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0daf78ccf6515f13257c74bc413a0ac2aacfd8eff178820847bf62020f9b998e','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25621','GHBC-REQ-025621','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.11','34.11.1','GHBC-C-006714','As construction progresses, such standpipes shall be extended to within one floor of the highest point of construction having secured decking or flooring.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','11f8d32a22c62c3bc1f1ab71dcb78644db5a045f64387481528f7a95194cd2c7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25622','GHBC-REQ-025622','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.11','34.11.2','GHBC-C-006715','Where a building is being demolished and a Fire hydrantexists within such a build- ing, such Fire hydrantshall be maintained in an operable condi- tion so as to be available for use by the fire department.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','84f3ce909a86a11303830632f6ea180f77209ad33ca69b2834b1e36b49a393ac','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25623','GHBC-REQ-025623','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.11','34.11.2','GHBC-C-006715','Such Fire hydrantshall be demolished with the building but shall not be demolished more than one floor below the floor being demolished.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d753200d7d423f68ec4a639fa1c65ffcb57f7af9e8f446f95695bf2ad608b2bf','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25624','GHBC-REQ-025624','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.11','34.11.3','GHBC-C-006716','Standpipes shall be installed in accordance with the provisions of Part 10.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[" Standpipes shall be either temporary or permanent in nature, and with or without a water supply, provided that such standpipes conform to the requirements of Clause 10.5 as to capacity, outlets and materials."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e3844ed097d214d63f5074e2ce71c20bac45920aed719352af675883d83e2e31','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25625','GHBC-REQ-025625','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.11','34.11.3','GHBC-C-006716','EXCEPTIONS:  Standpipes shall be either temporary or permanent in nature, and with or without a water supply, provided that such standpipes conform to the requirements of Clause 10.5 as to capacity, outlets and materials.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[" Standpipes shall be either temporary or permanent in nature, and with or without a water supply, provided that such standpipes conform to the requirements of Clause 10.5 as to capacity, outlets and materials."]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','56adc5daa80a9b463d9af88850fe053fdb09ac897c236cb1591afabdbcc5238f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25626','GHBC-REQ-025626','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.12','34.12.1','GHBC-C-006717','In buildings where an automatic sprinkler system is required by this Code, it shall be unlawful to occupy any portion of a building or structure until the automatic sprinkler system installation has been tested and approved, except as provided in Clause 10.3.','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','93360cce4feaf3f0e8e2a039d6361f4a41aa93f3610ae48b4098502d6f7db3d0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25627','GHBC-REQ-025627','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.12','34.12.2','GHBC-C-006718','Operation of sprinkler control valves shall be permitted only by properly authorized personnel and shall be accompanied by notification of duly designated parties.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cc7e5e13ba60c6a6a7f1b7a9ac603b4a3df4b647a9eda6906fcfa0a1f3a0592c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25628','GHBC-REQ-025628','GS 1207:2018',34,'34.12','34.12.2','GHBC-C-006718','When the sprinkler protection is being regularly turned off and on to facilitate connection of newly completed segments, the sprinkler control valves shall be checked at the end of each work period to ascertain that protection is in service.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e9b4352ff6ce86ce5879d9f2065ed7122a7f754fa485aa88736d73a5985c9b57','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
