('rowid-25722','GHBC-REQ-025722','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.1.3','GHBC-C-006791','‗Private stairway‘ means an internal or external stairway of steps with straight nosings on plan which forms part of a building and is either within a dwelling or intended for use solely in connection with one dwelling. ‗Tapered steps‘ means a step, the nosing of which is not parallel to the nosing of a step or landing next above it.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','590936e6d579a54cb242987b5e3f8840f778eaf3a13bc916b082f3925c5fb5f7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25723','GHBC-REQ-025723','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.1.3','GHBC-C-006791','(2)(a) The going of a step shall be measured on plan between the nosing of its tread and the nosing of the tread of step or landing next above it (Fig. 35.7.2C)','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e34ec83e3036557cdac022883e93e60d011e591049fdc5ffcc8e9b820bc9f962','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25724','GHBC-REQ-025724','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.1.3','GHBC-C-006791','(b)   Except as provided in (c) the width of a stairway shall be measured between the centre line of the handrail on the one side and on the other side the centre line of the handrail, or, if there is no handrail the surface of the wall, screen or balustrade facing the stairway or railing (Fig. 35.7.2D)','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','427c004586686e92141dca6ff90fc9af60822a5bdcc3f5add30594a537b94ce8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25725','GHBC-REQ-025725','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.1.3','GHBC-C-006791','(c)   If a stairway contains consecutive tapered steps of differing widths, all such tapered steps shall be deemed to have a notional width equal to the width of the narrowest part of those tapered steps, measured from the side of the stairway where the steps are narrower (Fig. 35.7.2E).','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','722950be5de98bd4feee799ba9e6e116dfe7c45af354d8e95f41a27b2b1857d7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25726','GHBC-REQ-025726','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.2.2','GHBC-C-006792','Treads and risers shall have uniform rise and goings in any one flight for every parallel step.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c9b8b9475d258ec3011800633ba33aa2f2db81213303d4694fd64f82b3e3f94a','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
