('rowid-25752','GHBC-REQ-025752','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.5.8','GHBC-C-006815','stairway shall have the width of the nosing of the lowest of any consecutive tapered steps equal to the width of the nosing of the parallel step or landing next above such tapered steps (Fig. 35.7.5C).','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3cc36e1fbffa892b261611abd75024cfa19fbafda094a6a010e8a6ef4325a257','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25753','GHBC-REQ-025753','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.6.1','GHBC-C-006817','Landings shall be at least as wide and as long as the width of stairs in which they occur, except that the length of landing for exterior stairs serving not more than one dwelling unit shall not be less than 900mm and the length of landing for all other stairs in a straight run shall not be less than 1.2m','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":900,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"ne dwelling unit shall not be less than 900mm and the length of landing f"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":1.2,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"n a straight run shall not be less than 1.2m"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":900,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"g unit shall not be less than 900mm and the length of landing for"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"ht run shall not be less than 1.2m"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','747dd3f45ff65081a49f30a011dd1ddff2ad78dbbd564f0f443c78c3d091de55','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25754','GHBC-REQ-025754','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.6.1','GHBC-C-006817','DGS 1207: 2018','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','23dc0089257fd3161b2a45529d746c1b820c693be00fc5f1dd14fabe42f10656','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25755','GHBC-REQ-025755','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.6.2','GHBC-C-006818','Where a door swings towards a stair, the full arc of its swing shall be over a landing.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ef83f7ade501abf5be18b6d8d3a4647f36ea4dddb3cdec8dce44ebc108db4f17','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25756','GHBC-REQ-025756','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.6.2','GHBC-C-006818','Except as provided in Article 35.7.6.3, a landing shall be provided at the top and bottom of each flight of interior stairs and, where a doorway occurs, in a stairway.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7f92bc0c48356210c2b09ce07e48b881b00299742455a5844ab5fbc436646b51','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25757','GHBC-REQ-025757','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.6.3','GHBC-C-006819','Where a door occurs at the top of the stair in a dwelling unit, no landing is required between the doorway and stairs.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','000e4542c468560a1cd65bc27156549b01d3e15c67e9912fc88ee40e3d0e82b6','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25758','GHBC-REQ-025758','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.6.4','GHBC-C-006820','A landing shall be provided at the top of all exterior stairs, except that a landing may be omitted at a secondary entrance to a building containing a single dwelling unit provided the stair does not contain more than 3 risers.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":3,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"ed the stair does not contain more than 3 risers."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','0465034a8519a5293831dc5012ca6e9f560104fa7821533ba2e429024c8d120d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25759','GHBC-REQ-025759','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.6.5','GHBC-C-006821','The clear height over landings shall be at least 2m.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"height over landings shall be at least 2m."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"er landings shall be at least 2m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','800dc32c045fe22e95c471af77490f889aa805a3091359f00f0f79ac790fc56e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25760','GHBC-REQ-025760','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.7.1','GHBC-C-006823','The maximum gradient for pedestrian ramps shall be 1 in 5 for mercantile or industrial occupancies and 1 in 8 for all other occupancies.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"for pedestrian ramps shall be 1 in 5 for mercantile or industria"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":"or industrial occupancies and 1 in 8 for all other occupancies."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','af1d7ea8c7893a6ed9c0285d026621862aa3db2f5b9765b191475841cadd34fb','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
