('rowid-25762','GHBC-REQ-025762','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.7.1','GHBC-C-006823','Maximum gradient of ramps for disabled persons are as given in in this Code.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','00089527ab4294ebb86f54cfda00f482aef3fb5e87e305beca4749be76188670','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25763','GHBC-REQ-025763','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.7.2','GHBC-C-006824','Where a doorway or stairway opens onto the side of a ramp there shall be a level area extending across the full width of the ramp and for a distance of at least 300mm on either side of the opening.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":300,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"he ramp and for a distance of at least 300mm on either side of the openi"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"nd for a distance of at least 300mm on either side of the opening"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7a3a027cfb4aafacf9870a1e1ebc28cd8c4b763605a24eb48de8e4d6d791463d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25764','GHBC-REQ-025764','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.7.3','GHBC-C-006825','onto the end of a ramp, there shall be level area extending across the full width of the ramp and along the ramp for at least 610mm.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":610,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"e ramp and along the ramp for at least 610mm."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":610,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"d along the ramp for at least 610mm."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fb98c5915354c1778c94a64a9aa852ddbde25d802532856d773566affb4fdda2','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25765','GHBC-REQ-025765','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.8.1','GHBC-C-006827','Any flight of steps in a private or common stairway with an aggregate rise of more than 600mm shall have a continuous handrail fixed securely at a height of not less than 900mm nor more than 1m measured vertically above the pitch line: -','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":600,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"way with an aggregate rise of more than 600mm shall have a continuous han"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":900,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"fixed securely at a height of not less than 900mm nor more than 1m measured v"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":1,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"ht of not less than 900mm nor more than 1m measured vertically above th"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":600,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"n aggregate rise of more than 600mm shall have a continuous handr"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":900,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" at a height of not less than 900mm nor more than 1m measured ver"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"less than 900mm nor more than 1m measured vertically above the"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fa3abbdf0e6070354580639d4eaecb85b80e8b52b6ec932e6062f37862837b3a','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25766','GHBC-REQ-025766','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.8.1','GHBC-C-006827','a) on each side of the stairway, if the least width of the stairway is 1m or more; or','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"east width of the stairway is 1m or more; or"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2b5d0444888e4e0d40d29aa92a0c917ed2c5c9d8ac7879777a9c0e2c2621f5ab','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25767','GHBC-REQ-025767','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.8.1','GHBC-C-006827','b) on one side of the stairway, in any other case (Fig. 35.7.8A).','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','fe66d03d477a5f43cc9495974257bf280f75c4fbf448c581562ad6bc478d442d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25768','GHBC-REQ-025768','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.8.2','GHBC-C-006828','A clearance of at least 30mm shall be provided between each handrail and the wall to which it is fastened.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":30,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"A clearance of at least 30mm shall be provided between e"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"A clearance of at least 30mm shall be provided between eac"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','64074c6ee297e4bc0240c89bd03995670cdd090c808d5aa947fc98d8118416c6','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25769','GHBC-REQ-025769','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.7','35.7.8.3','GHBC-C-006829','Handrails shall be so constructed that there will be no obstruction on or above them to break a handhold.','accessibility',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4712353b352119344e0870d6592766aaad8774e7ba8c291b6f0976af2bd2cdc4','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
