('rowid-25793','GHBC-REQ-025793','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.1','GHBC-C-006849','means of escape except exits that serve not more than one (1) dwelling unit and access to exits within dwelling units.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4f145fe5d9d5e56ca046821784c223b7dd7596398dde31893173d84b345b602e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25794','GHBC-REQ-025794','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.1','GHBC-C-006849','DGS 1207: 2018','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','53ac3f8aa9780ff8ae44b40cefb303ba8caac1ca4272f25031a816544aa681d9','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25795','GHBC-REQ-025795','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.2','GHBC-C-006850','The occupant load of floor areas or part of floor areas used in determining the minimum required width of a means of escape shall be the number of persons for which such areas are designed but not fewer than that determined from Table 35.8.3A.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','01a0fc8b04121affeea795e77d08877b504d1c241a72b8e219269fdfcaa412b1','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25796','GHBC-REQ-025796','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.3','GHBC-C-006851','Except as provided in Subclause 35.8.5, the width of an exit corridor shall be at least 1.12m and width of other exits at least 915mm unless greater widths are required because of the occupant load.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1.12,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":" of an exit corridor shall be at least 1.12m and width of other exits at "},{"parameter":"comparison","value":915,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":".12m and width of other exits at least 915mm unless greater widths are r"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.12,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"it corridor shall be at least 1.12m and width of other exits at l"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":915,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"width of other exits at least 915mm unless greater widths are req"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','89b8aa2878b8e2bdb290a57ed2908d1c1d5eef03ae39c53b2a2244b54b98d1c8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25797','GHBC-REQ-025797','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.3','GHBC-C-006851','In computing the exit width on the basis of occupant load, the minimum aggregate width of exterior exit doors shall be 1 unit (see Article 35.8.3.6) per 90 persons, and the minimum aggregate width of other exits shall be 1 unit per 30 persons for residential occupancies and 1 unit per 60 persons for other occupancies.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5ec16db2ef444e41e674f55b3471afe80cc69c162664fea87bc1effc05b9affb','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25798','GHBC-REQ-025798','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.4','GHBC-C-006852','Except as provided in Subclause 35.8.5 the minimum width of a doorway corridor or passageway in an access to exit shall be 1 unit (see Article 35.8.3.6) per 90 persons but in no case shall the minimum width of a public means of escape be less than 1.20 m.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1.2,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"f a public means of escape be less than 1.20 m."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" means of escape be less than 1.20 m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','160e5c6b65f8c79a61cd6df32d3a2be5d158c3ffa9115fa6f0100d60f7ef9d15','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25799','GHBC-REQ-025799','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.4','GHBC-C-006852','Forming part of Article 35.8.3.2 Maximum area per person to be assumed in calculating occupant load','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":3.2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"Forming part of Article 35.8.3.2 Maximum area per person to be a"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','2812054b2ab6a74951cce16b47853b0dde302125396263611e66aa50389adaa7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25800','GHBC-REQ-025800','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.4','GHBC-C-006852','Note to Table 7.8.3.A (1) Occupant load shall be based on two (2) persons per bedroom or sleeping area.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','9526e71a638b9ad587e0746e8f8990ad233e2f048469955ced50f366fa7524e9','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25801','GHBC-REQ-025801','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.5','GHBC-C-006853','35.8.5, the minimum width of a stairway or ramp in an access to exit shall be 1 unit, as specified under Article 35.8.3.6, per 60 persons.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aac72b68ff641ba099099680cb98f82a91221caf34b8b7326148f0cadaabc1a0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25802','GHBC-REQ-025802','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.6','GHBC-C-006854','The units or exit width in Articles 35.8.3.3 to 35.8.3.5 shall be determined be dividing the width (in mm) of exit by 560.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":3.5,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":" in Articles 35.8.3.3 to 35.8.3.5 shall be determined be dividing"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','aaed1fc1c2c20786a5edc84514840de52f20a0032f1e1d1b9d5cd8bd52d557ce','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25803','GHBC-REQ-025803','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.6','GHBC-C-006854','Where the remainder is less than 300mm, it shall not be considered as contributing to the number of units.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":300,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"Where the remainder is less than 300mm, it shall not be considered"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"re the remainder is less than 300mm, it shall not be considered a"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c9a5971f9db93e77183376fcbd45e2ca5f0251b0d165b7d1646e894316b49d4f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25804','GHBC-REQ-025804','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.6','GHBC-C-006854','Where the remainder is 300mm or more, it shall be considered as contributed ¼ unit of exit width in the case of stairs and ½ unit of exit in the case of other exit facilities.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"Where the remainder is 300mm or more, it shall be consider"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','47008a5548e6ff5e00f01caa063db25aa568d1770663613e5503580fd5ffd85b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25805','GHBC-REQ-025805','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.7','GHBC-C-006855','Where an exit serves more than 1(one) floor area, the aggregate width of such exit need not be cumulative from floor to floor except that where exits from above or below converge at an intermediate level, the width beyond the convergence in the direction of exit travel shall be not less than the aggregate required width of the converging exits.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"Where an exit serves more than 1(one) floor area, the aggregat"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','641221fe4002060fb36967bbff584d4fd733c8456499d047b6fc33f4a57effb8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25806','GHBC-REQ-025806','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.8','GHBC-C-006856','Except as provided in Subclause 35.8.5 and Article 35.8.3.7 the minimum height of exits and corridors which provide access to exits shall be 2.15m.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.15,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"vide access to exits shall be 2.15m."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','24fee70cfa0835d615e487292faed460d634fb45f36be7ed8f45f3870556de99','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25807','GHBC-REQ-025807','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.3.8','GHBC-C-006856','DGS 1207: 2018 construction shall project within the required width of exit.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f6b794c20dacbc55bc78d9eb97a4f5ed88db5b6bebb426f58f56e964dfa29bc3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
