('rowid-25812','GHBC-REQ-025812','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.1','GHBC-C-006862','This subclause applies to all doors in a means of escape except exterior doors serving not more than 1 dwelling unit unless otherwise stated herein.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"except exterior doors serving not more than 1 dwelling unit unless otherwis"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','953adae03bed0a98202a69fb25f840755bc09998d344a239722166fd35939f72','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25813','GHBC-REQ-025813','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.2','GHBC-C-006863','Exit doors shall not decrease the required exit width by more than 50mm for each full unit of exit width (560mm) and where such doors lead out of stairs or ramps in the direction of exit travel they shall not be less than ¾ of the width of such stairs or ramps.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"se the required exit width by more than 50mm for each full unit of exit "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"uired exit width by more than 50mm for each full unit of exit wi"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":560,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"each full unit of exit width (560mm) and where such doors lead ou"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4a0adac9f4bcff4c193d7fca082c5afaa571710493f60b977df6c48e7abba945','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25814','GHBC-REQ-025814','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.3','GHBC-C-006864','Doors in their swing shall not reduce the effective width of exit stairs or landings to less than 760mm nor shall they reduce the effective width of an exit passageway to less than the required width.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":760,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"of exit stairs or landings to less than 760mm nor shall they reduce the e"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":760,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"airs or landings to less than 760mm nor shall they reduce the eff"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f0dec3bfafe0e156c0ff683fc44294ebd6f2c8bd2cbe878d01948938b92e5560','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25815','GHBC-REQ-025815','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.4','GHBC-C-006865','No door closer or other device shall be installed in an exit in such a manner as to reduce the head room clearance to less than 1.98m.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":1.98,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"ce the head room clearance to less than 1.98m."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.98,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"d room clearance to less than 1.98m."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a5ff274613789f619b602daf522b74472a49fbaa8292a92f48c0f2fc2fca4bc1','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25816','GHBC-REQ-025816','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.5','GHBC-C-006866','An exit door or a door that opens to or is located in a public corridor or other facility providing access to exit from individually rented rooms, suites of rooms or dwelling units shall be not less than 2.05m in height.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2.05,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"ms or dwelling units shall be not less than 2.05m in height."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.05,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" units shall be not less than 2.05m in height."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6a4344a2f6daa1fab7438e15f3b39572ac5141422df6254bde094d6a8c659c10','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25817','GHBC-REQ-025817','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.5','GHBC-C-006866','Except as required in Articles 35.5.3.1 and 35.8.5.2, such doors shall be at least 815mm in width when only one (1) door leaf is installed in an opening and 610mm in width where more than one (1) door leaf is provided in the width of an opening.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":815,"unit":null,"operator":"at least","context":"35.8.5.2, such doors shall be at least 815mm in width when only one (1) "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":" Articles 35.5.3.1 and 35.8.5.2, such doors shall be at least 81"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":815,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" such doors shall be at least 815mm in width when only one (1) do"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":610,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"s installed in an opening and 610mm in width where more than one "}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f5fcacac9c5172ee77d7054e67fd995a96f33bdd23913eb05ae0b158a97e97eb','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25818','GHBC-REQ-025818','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.5','GHBC-C-006866','The width of an individual door leaf shall not exceed 1.22m in such opening.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":1.22,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"al door leaf shall not exceed 1.22m in such opening."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8321a2d15344abdd600e9f98cfde13b129c1fd069da506d61113628f8f4b35fd','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25819','GHBC-REQ-025819','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.6','GHBC-C-006867','Every door that opens onto a corridor or other facility that provides access to exit from a room or suite of rooms where such room or suite of rooms is used or intended for use by more than sixty (60) persons; and every door that is located within a corridor that is required to be separated from the remainder of the floor area by a fire separation, shall swing on a vertical axis in the direction of exit travel and shall not open onto a step.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c59ebebed14ee75f87821478f1631ab147a6231ae2b54cca7bdcb08afe867542','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25820','GHBC-REQ-025820','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.7','GHBC-C-006868','Where an exit door opens onto a landing, the landing shall be not less than 300mm wider and longer than the width of the door.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":300,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"landing, the landing shall be not less than 300mm wider and longer than the w"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"anding shall be not less than 300mm wider and longer than the wid"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','d1c7950ea0fa55594cc394f081ffb92dcd13e507c10e02b7cbf8b4ff6de24406','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25821','GHBC-REQ-025821','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.7','GHBC-C-006868','Such doors either in the open or closed position shall not be closer than 300mm to the nearest riser.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":300,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"tion shall not be closer than 300mm to the nearest riser."}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b43319b17cf8e11200d5ca4ede1493446e9f94bad97c90ed76cdfe2b5e7959c3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25822','GHBC-REQ-025822','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.8','GHBC-C-006869','Every required exit door including an exit door serving not more than one (1) dwelling unit shall swing on a vertical axis.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','4366a56af424c7b642bef9665d8f53e1398040dee5db4b678d66c157893ac7bf','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25823','GHBC-REQ-025823','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.8','GHBC-C-006869','Such door shall open in the direction of exit travel except that a door serving not more than one (1) dwelling unit is permitted to swing inward.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','751557a51208d2e5f9411ca16f3df371957c7fcb0a157e171ae1fd690fe24bd8','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25824','GHBC-REQ-025824','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.9','GHBC-C-006870','Revolving doors used as exits shall be of an approved collapsible type, and shall be permitted only at ground floor level away from the foot of any stairway.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a8f9b55249f63f096d00c3651668691ad6db8ed9d57e118087a965d44ba0caa0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25825','GHBC-REQ-025825','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.9','GHBC-C-006870','Not more than ½ unit of exit width may be assumed for such doors.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','bea1fde3ab1c453b4c3c4eee89965fa83f37ca97705afbd2e2f4885c411bae7e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25826','GHBC-REQ-025826','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.9','GHBC-C-006870','DGS 1207: 2018 Swing doors shall be provided adjacent to such doors.','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":2018,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"DGS 1207: 2018 Swing doors shall be provided a"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','ef0df438bb9eac4f1a0f1adc7ac44580383beb1d8749dbcd64a5c8b273760e33','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25827','GHBC-REQ-025827','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.5.10','GHBC-C-006871','Except for hotels and motels, a door opening into a public corridor which provides access to exit from individually owned or rented rooms, suites of rooms or dwelling units shall be designed not to lock automatically when such doors are equipped with automatic self-closing devices.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a08e7e28483a436d70fa28a9aac4ef9a021c0707131d49a0e66fe6e136ced2ca','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25828','GHBC-REQ-025828','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.1','GHBC-C-006873','Except as provided in Article 35.8.6.6 and 35.8.6.7, at least two (2) exits shall be provided from every storey space so that the travel distance to the nearest exit shall be not greater than 38.0m in the case of business and personal services occupancies and 30.5m for all other occupancies (see Article 35.8.6.2 for explanation of travel distance)','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":38,"unit":null,"operator":"not greater than","context":" to the nearest exit shall be not greater than 38.0m in the case of business and "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":38,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"xit shall be not greater than 38.0m in the case of business and p"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":30.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"onal services occupancies and 30.5m for all other occupancies (se"}]','[]',0.65,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','21fc350f0e1153c1c7ff1839500467bf95d93047b19ffa61f4e295b9b1fcdc32','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25829','GHBC-REQ-025829','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.2','GHBC-C-006874','For the purpose of this Subclause, travel distance means the distance from any point in the floor area to an exit measured along the path of exit travel, except that when a floor area is subdivided into individually owned or rented rooms, suites of rooms or dwelling units, and is served by a corridor required to provide a fire separation from such adjacent rooms, suites of rooms or dwelling units or by an exterior passageway, the travel distance shall be measured from the door of such rooms, suites of rooms or dwelling units to the nearest exit.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e8a8a9dd3efa3a235460dc732cdb6e62056395f5ee0c7c689c02f85f10261998','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25830','GHBC-REQ-025830','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.3','GHBC-C-006875','Not more than ½ the required exits from a floor area may be horizontal exits.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','579c25f07344211d769645a6890739ef5a09abcf95d0cace7f3dd2ee7e112a52','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "requirements" ("id", "requirement_id", "source_document", "part", "section", "clause", "clause_id", "source_text", "requirement_type", "subject", "condition", "action", "object", "exceptions", "parameters_json", "references_json", "confidence", "verification_status", "editorial_state", "effective_date", "content_hash", "created_at") VALUES ('rowid-25831','GHBC-REQ-025831','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.4','GHBC-C-006876','Where more than one (1) exit is required from an area, each exit shall be considered as contributing not more than ½ the required units of exit width.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','6ee3387b7a1b0c053bc5b00eefe6fdb4ba3190a539f700a288b06715996313c3','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25832','GHBC-REQ-025832','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.5','GHBC-C-006877','Where more than one (1) exit is required from a floor area, at least two (2) exits shall be independent of each other and be placed remote from each other along the path of travel between them.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','8da6ca06c7baa5cc6514947239a3f2287c68890322a8cc972d530a828164c7bb','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25833','GHBC-REQ-025833','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.6','GHBC-C-006878','In buildings one (1) and two (2) storeys in building height, a single exit is permitted from each storey provided the floor area and travel distance requirements conform to Table 35.8.6.A.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','1db57328fe208e53e1a4b0cd4eff84a26265a38ee43f8e2001473ee80988559d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25834','GHBC-REQ-025834','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.6','GHBC-C-006878','35.8.6.6)','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c3e7294bd98def73e9cece751b4a714d0d14a1a1615ae5f5fcf8faa6b044020e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25835','GHBC-REQ-025835','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.6','GHBC-C-006878','Single exits from floor areas','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','a28f48cb671776d5aea06ada6aa8a04d1ecd05828bd2e3b5c44ad7c5b020ae21','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25836','GHBC-REQ-025836','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.6','GHBC-C-006878','Notes to Table 7.8.6.A 1)  See Article 7.8.6.2 for explanation of travel distance','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','0f2134c96f70693e6880a303fe5e9f69f0a4096da3f02a59a12b6ce630340dac','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
