('rowid-25838','GHBC-REQ-025838','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.6','GHBC-C-006878','3) See Article 7.8.6.7 for dwelling units','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.62,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c98e8cd089023124961f7eaacc98db38942cd57211ed6ead1f48fd2c5505d1b6','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25839','GHBC-REQ-025839','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.7','GHBC-C-006879','A dwelling unit containing more than one storey shall have an exit or doorway onto a public access to exit from each of its top and bottom storeys except that a single exit is permitted from a dwelling unit provided the exit is an exterior door leading directly from a storey of the dwelling unit at or near grade.','fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7045edeb3b2a7d7cc30b6f5c31d8e38d766bb346a34d569f749d93474af3bcb5','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25840','GHBC-REQ-025840','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.8','35.8.6.7','GHBC-C-006879','The floor level of the uppermost storey of such dwelling unit shall not be more than 6.10m above the floor level of the storey containing the exit.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":6.1,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"ch dwelling unit shall not be more than 6.10m above the floor level of the"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":6.1,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"g unit shall not be more than 6.10m above the floor level of the "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','3c2535bdfd8d1873999bb1ac02accf249583fbc4fed0552cdc532ddecc1ce17a','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
