('rowid-25883','GHBC-REQ-025883','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.13','35.13.1','GHBC-C-006919','Where the foundation consists of other materials such as precast concrete, steel or wood, the foundation shall be designed in conformance with the appropriate provisions of Part 5 of this Code.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','3deed4e829adc6905e4289b7001af2a2b4ca059464234204df49d5a57eb4426c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
