('rowid-25892','GHBC-REQ-025892','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.13','35.13.2.5','GHBC-C-006924','Where pier type foundations are used, the piers shall be designed to support the applied loads from the superstructure in conformance with good engineering practice.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','72fd2bbaa95563f2067317599d3f557399fc25d498e9294879ec1969719e6b4b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25893','GHBC-REQ-025893','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.13','35.13.2.6','GHBC-C-006925','Where piers are used as a foundation system in a building of one storey in building height, the piers shall be installed to support the principal framing members and shall be spaced not more than 3.60m apart along the framing, unless the piers and their footings are designed for larger spacing.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":3.6,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"g members and shall be spaced not more than 3.60m apart along the framing, unl"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":3.6,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"shall be spaced not more than 3.60m apart along the framing, unle"}]','["is 4"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','33d81f13f5be95691b9e13978108fd15fd1b867cd7864330e4c59ec0eaffae6e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25894','GHBC-REQ-025894','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.13','35.13.2.6','GHBC-C-006925','The height of such piers shall not exceed three (3) times their least base dimension at the base of the pier.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','["is 4"]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','18659cfdc4e568eb5987fb5a4653d620bd74c8003daaf0e56e3828062fe2346b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25895','GHBC-REQ-025895','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.13','35.13.2.6','GHBC-C-006925','Where sandcrete block piers are used, and when the width of the building is 4.20m or less, they shall be laid with their longest dimension at right angles to the longest dimension of the building.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":4.2,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":" the width of the building is 4.20m or less, they shall be laid w"}]','["is 4"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','40a7e0193ee2930dcbd20ca301d6691882585ad8963cdcca6693bba5cda1f38d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25896','GHBC-REQ-025896','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.13','35.13.3.1','GHBC-C-006927','Footings shall be provided under walls, pilasters, columns, piers and chimneys that bear on soil or rock.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5aebd92bc5c65c51379377b8e32e563d623aeddd52344c5db622a46f71d84688','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25897','GHBC-REQ-025897','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.13','35.13.3.2','GHBC-C-006928','constructed as strip foundations of plain concrete situated centrally under the walls, the strip foundations shall rest on undisturbed soil or engineered fill or rock.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','f39df58385289bf2f77f1d5be89b991b900ee558eab24da9ff4421e6133d19e0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25898','GHBC-REQ-025898','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.13','35.13.3.2','GHBC-C-006928','There shall not be a wide variation in the type of subsoil within the loaded area and no weaker type of soil below the soil on which the foundations rest within such a depth as may impair the stability of the structure.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','386d3f470043236cda36f1c81bf6da290a4602d853e21d4e81793d1eb16bd64d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-25899','GHBC-REQ-025899','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.13','35.13.3.3','GHBC-C-006929','The width of the strip foundations shall not be less than the width specified in Table 35.13.3.A in accordance with the related particulars specified in the Table.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f74948187dcbb1f10e30a2447234db5335211e16fec7f85c522a40e13a60c352','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
