('rowid-26002','GHBC-REQ-026002','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.5.2','GHBC-C-007028','members may be notched provided the notch is located on the top of the member within ½ the joist depth from the edge of bearing and is not deeper than ⅓ the joist depth, unless the depth of the member is increased by the size of the notch.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','edd517d6520dce2bce47598d1b2e5472ac77e82354f0fa69fe0187dcbb33a05f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26003','GHBC-REQ-026003','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.5.3','GHBC-C-007029','Wall studs shall not be notched, drilled or otherwise damaged so that the undamaged portion of the stud is less than ⅔ the depth of the stud if the stud is loadbearing or 40mm if the stud is non-loadbearing, unless the weakened studs are suitably reinforced.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":40,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"if the stud is loadbearing or 40mm if the stud is non-loadbearin"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','aea12bfa321e4206a17ddd1d1d4718a672805ff31c3d69a271e83735dedbb332','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26004','GHBC-REQ-026004','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.5.4','GHBC-C-007030','and partitions shall not be notched, drilled or otherwise weakened to reduce the undamaged width to less than 50mm, unless the weakened plates are suitably reinforced.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":50,"unit":null,"operator":"less than","context":"reduce the undamaged width to less than 50mm, unless the weakened plates"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":" undamaged width to less than 50mm, unless the weakened plates a"}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','c68073b88a18b4f36aace4496c42c70b22e822e146b13c138146dca1d5782b2c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26005','GHBC-REQ-026005','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.5.5','GHBC-C-007031','Roof truss members shall not be notched, drilled or otherwise weakened unless such notching or drilling is allowed for in the design of the truss.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','da20d4100a7e0ae58693217bffa90f057251429209c20e5242e80ded2f3fdd56','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26006','GHBC-REQ-026006','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.6.1','GHBC-C-007033','Building frames shall be anchored to the foundation, unless a structural analysis of the wind and earth pressures shows anchorage is not required.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ddc2dec9f47b22c5b9e07c4a8f8299cb6bc239382d9fd7b49d2ef16366d40a5e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26007','GHBC-REQ-026007','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.6.2','GHBC-C-007034','Anchorage shall be provided by embedding the ends of the ground floor joists in concrete, or fastening the sill plate to the foundation with not less than 13mm diameter anchor bolts spaced not more than 2.5m centres.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":13,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":" plate to the foundation with not less than 13mm diameter anchor bolts space"},{"parameter":"comparison","value":2.5,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":" diameter anchor bolts spaced not more than 2.5m centres."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":13,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"foundation with not less than 13mm diameter anchor bolts spaced "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.5,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"or bolts spaced not more than 2.5m centres."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a8047ac3900c589d73bc3d5d42a1fadf44c05913378eac4d4777bc576c25351c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26008','GHBC-REQ-026008','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.6.2','GHBC-C-007034','Such anchor bolts shall be embedded no less than 100mm in the foundation and so designed that they may be tightened without withdrawing them from the foundation.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":100,"unit":null,"operator":"no less than","context":"nchor bolts shall be embedded no less than 100mm in the foundation and so de"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":100,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"hall be embedded no less than 100mm in the foundation and so desi"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','254a97521bf9768bbf392b1e9cbb42f4041d7f277368fdb36aab0ac21a235962','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26009','GHBC-REQ-026009','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.6.3','GHBC-C-007035','Exterior columns and posts shall be anchored to resist uplift and lateral movement.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','34539dc1db65b4b3a125332895b21151e2446460d2ffc7dc5906b1ecca95eaec','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
