('rowid-26013','GHBC-REQ-026013','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.8.1','GHBC-C-007040','Beams shall have even and level bearing to support floors.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','e411ff08f28b2943b3944a83bc23ec95a69bce0b2a99dfec1fe706f563a688ce','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26014','GHBC-REQ-026014','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.8.1','GHBC-C-007040','Beams shall have not less than 90mm length of bearing at end supports.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":90,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"Beams shall have not less than 90mm length of bearing at end su"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":90,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"eams shall have not less than 90mm length of bearing at end supp"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','755081292a40c6659d82869bd280459928a8127105e91b27825d43320edfe305','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26015','GHBC-REQ-026015','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.8.2','GHBC-C-007041','Where a beam is made up of individual pieces of timber that are nailed together, the individual members shall be 50mm or greater in thickness and installed on edge.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":50,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"e individual members shall be 50mm or greater in thickness and i"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','60034f8868c20b6e671579b2cbe1efcfc2c9d7fc5bafccdb677f08030562413f','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26016','GHBC-REQ-026016','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.8.3','GHBC-C-007042','Where the individual members of a beam described in Article 35.17.8.2 are butted together to form a joint, each such joint shall occur over a support or at or within 150mm of the end quarter points of the clear span of the beam.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":150,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ver a support or at or within 150mm of the end quarter points of "}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4240805f6a79892167b2fc0ba872af59e7f66f95a3e3869fac83e410f4e2dfa1','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26017','GHBC-REQ-026017','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.8.4','GHBC-C-007043','Joints in individual members of beams that are located at or near the end quarter points described in Article 35.17.8.3 shall not reduce the effective beam width by more than half.','prohibited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":8.3,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"ts described in Article 35.17.8.3 shall not reduce the effective "}]','[]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','118ae79dbea7754bf30a437205e9eaca8757245b021a8d42e86753ab08184761','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
