('rowid-26024','GHBC-REQ-026024','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.17','35.17.9.3','GHBC-C-007049','When framed into the sides of a wood beam, the joists shall be supported on','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a96c6f830f38cef111626149aa72e9f653dd7a6306a62d36bb75ec46bdf983a0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
