('rowid-26172','GHBC-REQ-026172','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.2.3','GHBC-C-007159','A habitable room opening into an enclosed verandah, conservatory or similar place shall be deemed to comply with the provisions of this regulation if such room and such enclosed place together have one or more ventilation openings which, if they ventilated a room having a floor area equal to the combined floor areas of such habitable room and such enclosed space would comply with the requirements of Article 35.23.2.1.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','02eab31c701a97342334c69339e473635d5b8542d32b2704d07913d692c8e7bf','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26173','GHBC-REQ-026173','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.3.1','GHBC-C-007161','in compliance with subclause 35.23.2 shall be so situated as to open on to a court enclosed on every side, unless the distance from the ventilation opening to the opposite wall of the court is either:','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":23.2,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":" compliance with subclause 35.23.2 shall be so situated as to open"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','2d18f60a816d295a2561c0d5de2d7259fef62050200979921110baa2de357e33','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26174','GHBC-REQ-026174','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.3.1','GHBC-C-007161','i.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','a616d00fec891037ea6c06d0405776f3d5af04dba2850bdd3eb333766a6e4235','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26175','GHBC-REQ-026175','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.3.1','GHBC-C-007161','15m or more; or','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"15m or more; or"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ff294bf03ad82847a345900d551f49019890d75195c5155a947fb994ed526891','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26176','GHBC-REQ-026176','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.3.1','GHBC-C-007161','ii. not less than ½ the vertical distance between the top of the wall containing the opening.','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','77f57962889649cdfad9bad85f5389cb08a2866ea5e4edd6bf49958b3d54224b','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26177','GHBC-REQ-026177','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.3.1','GHBC-C-007161','35.23.3.2 No ventilation opening constructed in compliance with requirements of Subclause 35.23.2 shall be so situated as to open onto a court which has one unobstructed side, exceeds twice the width, unless such ventilation opening:','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"measurement","value":23.2,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":" requirements of Subclause 35.23.2 shall be so situated as to open"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','34c62b6e4a3f67debd802fccec8250d89757cb3e688938ec20efba9ec3c427e7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26178','GHBC-REQ-026178','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.3.1','GHBC-C-007161','i. is in the side of the court opposite the unobstructed side; or','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ed0c97810c7f5b79b455304907ec57b69afd9c5de024c5d6ad51bc6705d8485c','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26179','GHBC-REQ-026179','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.3.1','GHBC-C-007161','ii.','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','878938789c4ce9ad148eafdf9eaf01f02a2a2119b424e03e320801819abe4e7e','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26180','GHBC-REQ-026180','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.3.1','GHBC-C-007161','(if it is situated in either of the long sides) is within a distance from the unobstructed side not exceeding twice the width of the court; or','dimensional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','e6df5aab738a4352cf90e083c09b6a03a6c599cd64f41f7b79c4892333b81949','2026-08-15 13:56:14');
