('rowid-26183','GHBC-REQ-026183','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.4.1','GHBC-C-007163','Any larder for the storage of perishable food (other than an enclosed space having means of refrigeration) shall, unless adequately ventilated by mechanical means be ventilated to the external air by means of one or more windows or two or more ventilations capable of being closed of which one is in the upper part and another in the lower part of the larder.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','ba4af0ede94ea28bb18348563d06031e81c57426817dd326d236d5b8127922c0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26184','GHBC-REQ-026184','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.4.2','GHBC-C-007164','Windows used for the ventilation of larders shall be fitted with durable fly-proof screen and be so constructed that a total area of not less than 85,000mm2 is capable of being opened.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":85000,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"structed that a total area of not less than 85,000mm2 is capable of being opened"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":85000,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"a total area of not less than 85,000mm2 is capable of being opened."}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','4be655dd63f064cac6943cc5334c27ae7c125a758d7a87de97a4c4e2959d21e6','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26185','GHBC-REQ-026185','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.4.2','GHBC-C-007164','35.23.4.3 Ventilators used for the ventilation of larders shall be:','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','48d3ec3fdbe040f8fa8ff9d50ba57753ed7686300bd5ac19f73cb283528a0151','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26186','GHBC-REQ-026186','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.4.2','GHBC-C-007164','i. fitted with a durable fly-proof screen; and','informational',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','17d36817574c76e3ee8a8c1cfd5b81ba5cf85b5aad8973c12896c9129549ed75','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26187','GHBC-REQ-026187','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.4.2','GHBC-C-007164','ii. so constructed as to permit (when open) the passage of air through an opening having an unobstructed area of not less than 45,000mm2; and','approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":45000,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"aving an unobstructed area of not less than 45,000mm2; and"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":45000,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"tructed area of not less than 45,000mm2; and"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','7fd401f412917820111c1ba5e6a22c47e277df113696de010b28237cab9626d7','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26188','GHBC-REQ-026188','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.23','35.23.4.2','GHBC-C-007164','iii. either situated in an external wall of the building or separately connected with the external air by a duct not less than 16,000mm2 in cross-clauseal area and having a smooth internal surface.','mechanical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":16000,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"th the external air by a duct not less than 16,000mm2 in cross-clauseal area and"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":16000,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"l air by a duct not less than 16,000mm2 in cross-clauseal area and h"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" a duct not less than 16,000mm2 in cross-clauseal area and havin"}]','[]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','8cf91c232c71e51c8730aea04f38e0f849d5cd23978491e922e461ad8beee118','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
