('rowid-26198','GHBC-REQ-026198','GS 1207:2018',35,'35.24','35.24.2.3','GHBC-C-007173','Where a receptacle controlled by a wall switch is provided in bedrooms or living rooms, such room need not conform to the requirements in Article 35.24.2.','electrical',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]',0.9,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','27eab65b7d1ba768b91a21bf0263e4be94b68fa315f22935e7341e47c1a58c99','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
