"sted in accordance with ASTM D635 shall be approved for use as th"}]','["GS 1009"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','12c0f9992397a85f6dd78ee4d8f98b588c8622a8de0408b110a409e754aca515','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
