('rowid-26588','GHBC-REQ-026588','GS 1207:2018',38,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-007199','Signs that contain moving clauses or ornaments shall have fail-safe provisions to prevent the clause or ornament from releasing and falling or shifting its center of gravity more than 381 mm (15 inches).','mandatory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Within flood hazard areas, historic structures that do not meet one or more of the following designations: 1. Listed or preliminarily determined to be eligible for listing in the National Register of Historic Places.","Where such equipment and appliances are designed and installed to prevent water from entering or accumulating within their components and the systems are constructed to resist hydrostatic and hydrodynamic loads and stresses, including the effects of buoyancy, during the occurrence of flooding up to the elevation required by this Code. The systems and equipment shall be permitted to be located below the elevation required by this Code. Electrical wiring systems shall be permitted below the design","Electrical systems, equipment and components; heating, ventilating, air conditioning and plumbing appliances; plumbing fixtures, duct systems and other service equipment shall be permitted to be","Signs on flat roofs with every part of the roof accessible. E.10.2 Bearing plates. The bearing plates of roof signs shall distribute the load directly to or on masonry walls, steel roof girders, columns or beams. The building shall be designed to avoid overstress of these members."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":381,"unit":null,"operator":"more than","context":"hifting its center of gravity more than 381 mm (15 inches)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":381,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"s center of gravity more than 381 mm (15 inches)."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":15,"unit":"in","operator":null,"context":" of gravity more than 381 mm (15 inches)."}]','["GS 1009"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','c3b057b5f616f09e52f1260e966