ement","value":75,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"exceed a height of 22 860 mm (75 feet) on buildings of Type 1 or Ty"}]','["GS 1009"]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','b50b9c7a20b44ce7a1e20ce5d76d70578bc951f5bce7e184da70a3b54a2050a0','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
