('rowid-26625','GHBC-REQ-026625','GS 1207:2018',38,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-007199','The dead load of projecting signs not parallel to the building or structure and the load due to wind pressure shall be supported with chains, guys or steel rods having net cross-clauseal dimension of not less than 9.5 mm (3 / inch) diameter.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Within flood hazard areas, historic structures that do not meet one or more of the following designations: 1. Listed or preliminarily determined to be eligible for listing in the National Register of Historic Places.","Where such equipment and appliances are designed and installed to prevent water from entering or accumulating within their components and the systems are constructed to resist hydrostatic and hydrodynamic loads and stresses, including the effects of buoyancy, during the occurrence of flooding up to the elevation required by this Code. The systems and equipment shall be permitted to be located below the elevation required by this Code. Electrical wiring systems shall be permitted below the design","Electrical systems, equipment and components; heating, ventilating, air conditioning and plumbing appliances; plumbing fixtures, duct systems and other service equipment shall be permitted to be","Signs on flat roofs with every part of the roof accessible. E.10.2 Bearing plates. The bearing plates of roof signs shall distribute the load directly to or on masonry walls, steel roof girders, columns or beams. The building shall be designed to avoid overstress of these members."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":9.5,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"t cross-clauseal dimension of not less than 9.5 mm (3 / inch) diameter."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":9.5,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"al dimension of not less than 9.5 mm (3 / inch) diameter."}]','["GS 1009"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','5dc3670f70ac549e5fdbd9215ed056dab532cf988c66c607259230f3ff77208d','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26626','GHBC-REQ-026626','GS 1207:2018',38,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-007199','Such supports shall be erected or8 maintained at an angle of not less than 45 percent (0.78 rad) with the horizontal to resist the dead load and at angle of 45 percent (0.78 rad) or more with the face of the sign to resist the specified wind pressure.','structural',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Within flood hazard areas, historic structures that do not meet one or more of the following designations: 1. Listed or preliminarily determined to be eligible for listing in the National Register of Historic Places.","Where such equipment and appliances are designed and installed to prevent water from entering or accumulating within their components and the systems are constructed to resist hydrostatic and hydrodynamic loads and stresses, including the effects of buoyancy, during the occurrence of flooding up to the elevation required by this Code. The systems and equipment shall be permitted to be located below the elevation required by this Code. Electrical wiring systems shall be permitted below the design","Electrical systems, equipment and components; heating, ventilating, air conditioning and plumbing appliances; plumbing fixtures, duct systems and other service equipment shall be permitted to be","Signs on flat roofs with every part of the roof accessible. E.10.2 Bearing plates. The bearing plates of roof signs shall distribute the load directly to or on masonry walls, steel roof girders, columns or beams. The building shall be designed to avoid overstress of these members."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":45,"unit":null,"operator":"not less than","context":"or8 maintained at an angle of not less than 45 percent (0.78 rad) with the h"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":8,"unit":"m","operator":null,"context":"h supports shall be erected or8 maintained at an angle of not l"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":45,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":" at an angle of not less than 45 percent (0.78 rad) with the horizonta"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":45,"unit":"percent","operator":null,"context":"the dead load and at angle of 45 percent (0.78 rad) or more with the f"}]','["GS 1009"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','39cf2cf1feb252ccd5f8ad09abfc29f8c548af2f11951439e8226d6aac93d972','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
('rowid-26627','GHBC-REQ-026627','GS 1207:2018',38,NULL,NULL,'GHBC-C-007199','If such projecting sign exceeds 2.8 m2 (30 square feet) in one facial area, there shall be provided not fewer than two such supports on each side not more than 2438 mm (8 feet) apart to resist the wind pressure.','conditional',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Within flood hazard areas, historic structures that do not meet one or more of the following designations: 1. Listed or preliminarily determined to be eligible for listing in the National Register of Historic Places.","Where such equipment and appliances are designed and installed to prevent water from entering or accumulating within their components and the systems are constructed to resist hydrostatic and hydrodynamic loads and stresses, including the effects of buoyancy, during the occurrence of flooding up to the elevation required by this Code. The systems and equipment shall be permitted to be located below the elevation required by this Code. Electrical wiring systems shall be permitted below the design","Electrical systems, equipment and components; heating, ventilating, air conditioning and plumbing appliances; plumbing fixtures, duct systems and other service equipment shall be permitted to be","Signs on flat roofs with every part of the roof accessible. E.10.2 Bearing plates. The bearing plates of roof signs shall distribute the load directly to or on masonry walls, steel roof girders, columns or beams. The building shall be designed to avoid overstress of these members."]','[{"parameter":"comparison","value":2438,"unit":null,"operator":"not more than","context":"wo such supports on each side not more than 2438 mm (8 feet) apart to resist t"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2.8,"unit":"m2","operator":null,"context":" such projecting sign exceeds 2.8 m2 (30 square feet) in one facia"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":30,"unit":"s","operator":null,"context":"ojecting sign exceeds 2.8 m2 (30 square feet) in one facial area"},{"parameter":"measurement","value":2438,"unit":"mm","operator":null,"context":"ts on each side not more than 2438 mm (8 feet) apart to resist the "},{"parameter":"measurement","value":8,"unit":"feet","operator":null,"context":"h side not more than 2438 mm (8 feet) apart to resist the wind pre"}]','["GS 1009"]',0.93,'extracted','VERIFIED','2018','cfee32cd1af6287298f3a4bf29f2767fa354a9df337bc1ffe439ac7d8d21b620','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
