 foot) below such marquee."},{"parameter":"measurement","value":1,"unit":"foot","operator":null,"context":"mm (6 feet) above, or 305 mm (1 foot) below such marquee."}]','["GS 1009"]',0.93,'requires_review','DRAFT','2018','f50dc43707a0585b6bc5f5684521121148be599b241595bbd52ae0993d36ce19','2026-08-15 13:56:14'),
